rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "A noncreature spell is a spell that isn\'t a creature at all. An artifact creature spell isn\'t a noncreature spell. Lands are never spells."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Kambal\'s ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Activated abilities contain a colon. They\'re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "An opponent affected by Dovin Baan\'s emblem chooses which two of their permanents to untap, not you."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Dovin Baan\'s first ability can target any creature, not just one with an activated ability. It can also be activated targeting no creature at all."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Activating Dukhara Peafowl\'s ability after it\'s been blocked by a creature without flying or reach won\'t cause it to become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Activating Key to the City\'s ability targeting a creature that has already been blocked won\'t cause it to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Key to the City\'s last ability triggers during your untap step, but it\'s put onto the stack at the same time as abilities that trigger at the beginning of your upkeep step. Even though Key to the City\'s ability triggered first, you may order it before or after other abilities you control that are put onto the stack at this time."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You can activate Key to the City\'s first ability without targeting any creature."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You can pay {2} only once each time Key to the City\'s triggered ability resolves. You can\'t pay more to draw additional cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Aetherflux Reservoir\'s first ability doesn\'t trigger when you cast Aetherflux Reservoir itself."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The first ability counts spells you cast earlier in the turn even if you didn\'t control Aetherflux Reservoir as you cast them, and even if those spells were countered."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'The first ability counts the spell that caused it to trigger plus any other spells you cast earlier in the turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The number of spells you\'ve cast is counted only as Aetherflux Reservoir\'s triggered ability resolves. For example, if you cast a spell, then respond to the triggered ability with a second spell, you\'ll gain 4 life total."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Aetherworks Marvel\'s first ability triggers whenever any permanent you control is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, including Aetherworks Marvel itself and other permanents put into a graveyard at the same time as it."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as emerge costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Incendiary Sabotage, you must pay those to cast the card."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The card cast with Aetherworks Marvel\'s second ability is cast from your library."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Tokens that are sacrificed or destroyed are put into their owner\'s graveyard before ceasing to exist. If you controlled the token, Aetherworks Marvel\'s first ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They\'re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)"}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters aren\'t mana. They don\'t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can\'t give you energy counters."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay more energy counters than you have."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "After the creature returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the creature that was exiled. It won\'t be in combat or have any additional abilities it may have had before it was exiled. Any +1/+1 counters on it or Auras attached to it are removed, and any Equipment will no longer be attached."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If a creature token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Although Trusty Companion can\'t attack alone, other attacking creatures don\'t have to attack the same player or planeswalker. For example, Trusty Companion could attack an opponent and another creature could attack a planeswalker that opponent controls."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If a creature that can\'t attack alone also must attack if able, its controller must attack with it and another creature if able."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you control more than one creature that can\'t attack alone, they can attack together, even if no other creatures attack."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Trusty Companion can attack along with a creature controlled by your teammate, even if no other creatures you control attack.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Trusty Companion can be declared as an attacker only if another creature is declared as an attacker at the same time. Once it\'s attacking, removing the other creature won\'t cause Trusty Companion to stop attacking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "An effect that instructs you to “cast” a card doesn\'t allow you to play lands. If the card exiled with Chandra\'s first ability is a land card, you can\'t play it and Chandra deals 2 damage to each opponent."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Chandra\'s emblem\'s ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you cast the exiled card, you do so as part of the resolution of Chandra\'s ability. You can\'t wait to cast it later in the turn. Timing permissions based on the card\'s type are ignored, but other restrictions (such as “Cast [this card] only during combat”) are not."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Chandra\'s first ability causes 4 damage total to be dealt to the opposing team."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Loyalty abilities can\'t be mana abilities. Chandra\'s second ability uses the stack and can be countered or otherwise responded to. Like all loyalty abilities, it can be activated only once per turn, during your main phase, when the stack is empty, and only if no other loyalty abilities of the planeswalker have been activated this turn."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The emblem created by Chandra\'s last ability is colorless. The damage it deals is from a colorless source."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You pay the costs for the exiled card if you cast it. You may pay alternative costs such as emerge rather than the card\'s mana cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Any abilities that trigger as the artifact enters the battlefield aren\'t put onto the stack until Madcap Experiment is done resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you don\'t reveal an artifact card, you\'ll randomize your library and be dealt damage equal to the number of cards in your library."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Once Madcap Experiment begins resolving, no player may take any actions other than those specified by Madcap Experiment until it\'s done resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'The number of cards revealed this way includes the artifact card you put onto the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Any abilities that trigger during the resolution of Saheeli\'s Artistry will wait to be put onto the stack until Saheeli\'s Artistry finishes resolving. An ability that triggers on the first token entering the battlefield may target the second token and vice versa."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied permanent will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen permanent will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If the copied permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If the copied permanent is a token, the token created with Saheeli\'s Artistry copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that that created that token."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If the copied permanent is copying something else (for example, if the copied permanent is an Altered Ego), then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that permanent copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you choose both modes, the tokens enter one at a time. Thus, if the token created by the second mode has an ability that triggers “whenever an artifact enters the battlefield,” the token created by the first mode will already be on the battlefield and won\'t cause that ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If you choose both modes, you may target a single artifact creature twice and get two copies of that artifact creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If you chose the second mode, the token is an artifact in addition to its other types. This is a copiable value of the token that other effects may copy.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what was printed on the original permanent and nothing else (unless that permanent is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that permanent is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Artifact tokens that are sacrificed or destroyed are put into their owner\'s graveyard before ceasing to exist. If you controlled the token, Marionette Master\'s last ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Fabricate doesn\'t cause the creature with the ability to enter the battlefield with +1/+1 counters already on it. For example, Weaponcraft Enthusiast will enter the battlefield as a 0/1 creature, then its fabricate ability goes on the stack. Players may take actions (such as casting instants) while the ability is waiting to resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If Marionette Master and an artifact you control are put into a graveyard at the same time, Marionette Master\'s ability triggers."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If Marionette Master\'s power is negative, the target opponent doesn\'t lose (or gain) life."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you can\'t put +1/+1 counters on the creature for any reason as fabricate resolves (for instance, if it\'s no longer on the battlefield), you just create Servo tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The amount of life lost is determined as Marionette Master\'s last ability resolves. If Marionette Master is no longer on the battlefield, use its power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how much life is lost."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'You choose whether to put +1/+1 counters on the creature or create Servo tokens as the fabricate ability is resolving. No player may take actions between the time you choose and the time that counters are added or tokens are created.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "As long as Cultivator\'s Caravan isn\'t an artifact creature, its {T} ability can be activated if it came under your control this turn."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'Any untapped creature you control can be tapped to pay a crew cost, even one that just came under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Creatures that crew a Vehicle aren\'t attached to it or related in any other way. Effects that affect the Vehicle, such as by destroying it or giving it a +1/+1 counter, don\'t affect the creatures that crewed it."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Each Vehicle is printed with a power and toughness, but it\'s not a creature. If it becomes a creature (most likely through its crew ability), it will have that power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'For a Vehicle to be able to attack, it must be a creature as the declare attackers step begins, so the latest you can activate its crew ability to attack with it is during the beginning of combat step. For a Vehicle to be able to block, it must be a creature as the declare blockers step begins, so the latest you can activate its crew ability to block with it is during the declare attackers step. In either case, players may take actions after the crew ability resolves but before the Vehicle has been declared as an attacking or blocking creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If a permanent becomes a copy of a Vehicle, the copy won\'t be a creature, even if the Vehicle it\'s copying has become an artifact creature."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If an effect causes a Vehicle to become an artifact creature with a specified power and toughness, that effect overwrites the Vehicle\'s printed power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Once a Vehicle becomes a creature, it behaves exactly like any other artifact creature. It can\'t attack unless you\'ve controlled it continuously since your turn began, it can block if it\'s untapped, it can be tapped to pay a Vehicle\'s crew cost, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Once a player announces that they are activating a crew ability, no player may take other actions until the ability has been paid for. Notably, players can\'t try to stop the ability by changing a creature\'s power or by removing or tapping a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Vehicle is an artifact type, not a creature type. A Vehicle that\'s crewed won\'t normally have any creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "When a Vehicle becomes a creature, that doesn\'t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. The permanent was already on the battlefield; it only changed its types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "You may activate a crew ability of a Vehicle even if it\'s already an artifact creature. Doing so has no effect on the Vehicle. It doesn\'t change its power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'You may tap more creatures than necessary to activate a crew ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "As you activate one of Multiform Wonder\'s two activated abilities, you must announce which one you\'re activating. However, you don\'t choose that ability\'s effect until it resolves. For example, you must announce that you\'re activating Multiform Wonder\'s middle ability specifically, but you don\'t choose which of the keywords it gains until the ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'Multiple instances of flying, vigilance, or lifelink on the same creature are redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They\'re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)"}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters aren\'t mana. They don\'t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can\'t give you energy counters."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay more energy counters than you have."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If Fairgrounds Warden leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the target creature won\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If a creature token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if Fairgrounds Warden\'s owner leaves the game, the exiled card will return to the battlefield. Because the one-shot effect that returns the card isn\'t an ability that goes on the stack, it won\'t cease to exist along with the leaving player\'s spells and abilities on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'The exiled card returns to the battlefield immediately after Fairgrounds Warden leaves the battlefield. Nothing happens between the two events, including state-based actions.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If a creature token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Wispweaver Angel\'s triggered ability can target another Wispweaver Angel. If so, the two Angels can loop in and out of exile as many times as you\'d like before you choose to target another creature or not to use the triggered ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Ballista Charger\'s triggered ability resolves before blockers are chosen. A creature dealt lethal damage this way won\'t be around to block."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'Any untapped creature you control can be tapped to pay a crew cost, even one that just came under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Creatures that crew a Vehicle aren\'t attached to it or related in any other way. Effects that affect the Vehicle, such as by destroying it or giving it a +1/+1 counter, don\'t affect the creatures that crewed it."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Each Vehicle is printed with a power and toughness, but it\'s not a creature. If it becomes a creature (most likely through its crew ability), it will have that power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'For a Vehicle to be able to attack, it must be a creature as the declare attackers step begins, so the latest you can activate its crew ability to attack with it is during the beginning of combat step. For a Vehicle to be able to block, it must be a creature as the declare blockers step begins, so the latest you can activate its crew ability to block with it is during the declare attackers step. In either case, players may take actions after the crew ability resolves but before the Vehicle has been declared as an attacking or blocking creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If a permanent becomes a copy of a Vehicle, the copy won\'t be a creature, even if the Vehicle it\'s copying has become an artifact creature."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If an effect causes a Vehicle to become an artifact creature with a specified power and toughness, that effect overwrites the Vehicle\'s printed power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Once a Vehicle becomes a creature, it behaves exactly like any other artifact creature. It can\'t attack unless you\'ve controlled it continuously since your turn began, it can block if it\'s untapped, it can be tapped to pay a Vehicle\'s crew cost, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Once a player announces that they are activating a crew ability, no player may take other actions until the ability has been paid for. Notably, players can\'t try to stop the ability by changing a creature\'s power or by removing or tapping a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Vehicle is an artifact type, not a creature type. A Vehicle that\'s crewed won\'t normally have any creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "When a Vehicle becomes a creature, that doesn\'t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. The permanent was already on the battlefield; it only changed its types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "You may activate a crew ability of a Vehicle even if it\'s already an artifact creature. Doing so has no effect on the Vehicle. It doesn\'t change its power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'You may tap more creatures than necessary to activate a crew ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Consulate Surveillance\'s second ability doesn\'t target anything. You choose a source of damage as it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If multiple prevention and/or replacement effects are trying to apply to the same damage, the player who would be dealt damage chooses the order in which to apply them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If the chosen source would deal damage to you and one or more other players or permanents, only the damage that would be dealt to you is prevented.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They\'re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)"}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters aren\'t mana. They don\'t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can\'t give you energy counters."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay more energy counters than you have."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Creatures destroyed this way count toward the life gained even if they\'re put into a zone other than a graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Creatures with indestructible aren\'t destroyed this way."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Demon of Dark Schemes\'s second triggered ability triggers whenever another creature dies for any reason, not just due to the first triggered ability."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If Demon of Dark Schemes dies at the same time as another creature, its second triggered ability triggers.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If a creature\'s owner leaves the game after you\'ve put that creature onto the battlefield with Demon of Dark Schemes\'s last ability, the creature leaves with that player. If you leave the game before that player, the creature is exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The set of creatures affected by Demon of Dark Schemes\'s first triggered ability is determined as the ability resolves. Creatures that enter the battlefield later in the turn and noncreature permanents that become creatures later in the turn won\'t get -2/-2."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They\'re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)"}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters aren\'t mana. They don\'t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can\'t give you energy counters."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay more energy counters than you have."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Depala, Pilot Exemplar\'s last ability is a triggered ability, not an activated ability. It doesn\'t allow you to tap Depala whenever you want; rather, you need some other way of tapping it, such as by attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "For the ability to trigger, Depala has to actually change from untapped to tapped. If an effect attempts to tap Depala, but it was already tapped at the time, this ability won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Dynavolt Tower\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They\'re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)"}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters aren\'t mana. They don\'t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can\'t give you energy counters."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay more energy counters than you have."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Each Bomat Courier you control has its own cache of cards. Bomat Courier\'s last ability only puts those cards into your hand, not those of any other Bomat Courier."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If Bomat Courier leaves the battlefield before you activate its last ability, any cards exiled by its triggered ability remain exiled face down for the rest of the game. If you somehow return the same Bomat Courier card to the battlefield, it will be a different object with no connection to those face-down cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'You can pay the cost of “discard your hand” even if your hand contains zero cards.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Fabricate doesn\'t cause the creature with the ability to enter the battlefield with +1/+1 counters already on it. For example, Weaponcraft Enthusiast will enter the battlefield as a 0/1 creature, then its fabricate ability goes on the stack. Players may take actions (such as casting instants) while the ability is waiting to resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you can\'t put +1/+1 counters on the creature for any reason as fabricate resolves (for instance, if it\'s no longer on the battlefield), you just create Servo tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Once a creature with power 3 or greater has blocked Elegant Edgecrafters, changing the power of the blocking creature won\'t cause Elegant Edgecrafters to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'You choose whether to put +1/+1 counters on the creature or create Servo tokens as the fabricate ability is resolving. No player may take actions between the time you choose and the time that counters are added or tokens are created.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Fabricate doesn\'t cause the creature with the ability to enter the battlefield with +1/+1 counters already on it. For example, Weaponcraft Enthusiast will enter the battlefield as a 0/1 creature, then its fabricate ability goes on the stack. Players may take actions (such as casting instants) while the ability is waiting to resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you can\'t put +1/+1 counters on the creature for any reason as fabricate resolves (for instance, if it\'s no longer on the battlefield), you just create Servo tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined as Cultivator of Blades\'s last ability resolves. It won\'t change later, even if its power changes. If Cultivator of Blades is no longer on the battlefield, use its power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine the value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You choose whether or not to have your other attacking creatures get +X/+X as Cultivator of Blades\'s triggered ability resolves, not as you put it onto the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'You choose whether to put +1/+1 counters on the creature or create Servo tokens as the fabricate ability is resolving. No player may take actions between the time you choose and the time that counters are added or tokens are created.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If this creature\'s power is negative as its ability resolves, X is considered to be 0. (This is a change from previous rulings.)"}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Fabricate doesn\'t cause the creature with the ability to enter the battlefield with +1/+1 counters already on it. For example, Weaponcraft Enthusiast will enter the battlefield as a 0/1 creature, then its fabricate ability goes on the stack. Players may take actions (such as casting instants) while the ability is waiting to resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you can\'t put +1/+1 counters on the creature for any reason as fabricate resolves (for instance, if it\'s no longer on the battlefield), you just create Servo tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'You choose whether to put +1/+1 counters on the creature or create Servo tokens as the fabricate ability is resolving. No player may take actions between the time you choose and the time that counters are added or tokens are created.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Fairgrounds Trumpeter\'s ability triggers if, at any point during this turn, a +1/+1 counter was placed on a permanent that you controlled as the counter was placed. It doesn\'t matter whether you still control the permanent or whether it still has a counter."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If a +1/+1 counter hasn\'t been placed yet at the moment an end step begins, Fairgrounds Trumpeter\'s ability doesn\'t trigger at all. If another ability triggers during the end step and puts a +1/+1 counter on a permanent you control, you won\'t put an additional +1/+1 counter on Fairgrounds Trumpeter."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "For a spell with {X} in its mana cost, use the value chosen for X to determine its mana value. For example, Clash of Wills is an instant spell with mana cost {X}{U}. If you chose 2 as the value of X, then Clash of Wills has mana value 3, and Metallurgic Summonings\'s ability will create a 3/3 token."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If Metallurgic Summonings\'s first ability resolves and the spell that caused it to trigger has been countered, use that spell\'s mana value as it last existed on the stack to determine the value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Metallurgic Summonings\'s first ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The number of artifacts you control is checked only as you activate Metallurgic Summonings\'s last ability. It\'s not checked again as it resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "For spells with {X} in their mana costs, use the value chosen for X to determine the spell\'s mana value. For cards in your library with {X} in their mana costs, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If Rashmi\'s ability resolves and the spell that caused it to trigger has been countered, use that spell\'s mana value as it last existed on the stack to determine whether or not you may cast the top card of your library."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If the revealed card is a land card, you put it into your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as emerge costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Cathartic Reunion, those must be paid to cast the card."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you cast the top card of your library, you do so as part of the resolution of Rashmi\'s ability. You can\'t wait to cast it later in the turn. Timing permissions based on the card\'s type are ignored, but other restrictions (such as “Cast [this card] only during combat”) are not."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Rashmi has to be on the battlefield at the moment you cast your first spell. If that spell is Rashmi itself, Rashmi\'s ability can\'t trigger. If that spell causes Rashmi to leave the battlefield as an additional cost to cast it, Rashmi\'s ability can\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Rashmi\'s ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. If you cast a spell using the ability, it will also resolve before the initial spell."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Rashmi\'s ability triggers when you cast your first spell each turn, not just on your turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "For the ability to trigger, Night Market Lookout has to actually change from untapped to tapped. If an effect attempts to tap it, but it was already tapped at the time, this ability won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Night Market Lookout\'s ability causes the opposing team to lose a total of 2 life."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "This is a triggered ability, not an activated ability. It doesn\'t allow you to tap Night Market Lookout whenever you want; rather, you need some other way of tapping it, such as by attacking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "For the ability to trigger, Spireside Infiltrator has to actually change from untapped to tapped. If an effect attempts to tap it, but it was already tapped at the time, this ability won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "This is a triggered ability, not an activated ability. It doesn\'t allow you to tap Spireside Infiltrator whenever you want; rather, you need some other way of tapping it, such as by attacking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Gaining control of an Equipment doesn\'t cause it to move, though it will allow you to activate its equip ability later to attach it to a creature you control."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If one of the target permanents is an illegal target as Shrewd Negotiation resolves, the exchange won\'t happen."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well, and any effects that give the player control of permanents immediately end.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Gearseeker Serpent\'s first ability can\'t reduce the total cost to cast the spell below {U}{U}."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Once Gearseeker Serpent has been blocked, activating its last ability won\'t cause it to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Once a player has announced that they are casting Gearseeker Serpent, no player may take actions to try to change the number of artifacts its controller controls before the spell\'s cost is locked in."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'The total cost to cast Gearseeker Serpent is locked in before you pay that cost. For example, if you control three artifacts, including one you can sacrifice to add {C} to your mana pool, the total cost of Gearseeker Serpent is {2}{U}{U}. Then you can sacrifice the artifact when you activate mana abilities just before paying the cost.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Gearshift Ace\'s triggered ability triggers when it becomes tapped to activate a crew ability. Even if Gearshift Ace leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, that Vehicle still gains first strike until end of turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Ghirapur Orrery\'s first ability allows a player to play an additional land during their main phase. Doing so follows the normal timing rules for playing lands."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Ghirapur Orrery\'s first ability is cumulative if more than one is on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If the player has any cards in hand as Ghirapur Orrery\'s second ability resolves, the ability does nothing. Notably, a second Ghirapur Orrery won\'t have a player draw another three cards unless the player empties their hand after resolving the first one\'s trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Ghirapur Orrery\'s second ability triggers for each player on a team separately. If one player has cards in hand, it can still trigger for the other player."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "No player may take actions in a turn before Ghirapur Orrery\'s second ability checks to see if it should trigger. If the player whose turn it is has any cards in hand, it won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The draw step is after the upkeep step, so drawing a card as a turn-based action won\'t affect whether Ghirapur Orrery\'s second ability triggers."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Hazardous Conditions doesn\'t care what kind of counter a creature has on it. Whether +1/+1, -1/-1, charge, or fate, any kind of counter causes a creature to be unaffected."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The set of creatures affected by Hazardous Conditions is determined as the spell resolves. Creatures that get a counter later in the turn will continue to get -2/-2. Creatures that enter the battlefield or lose their counters later in the turn and noncreature permanents that become creatures later in the turn won\'t get -2/-2."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If Fateful Showdown\'s target becomes an illegal target, you won\'t discard your hand or draw any cards."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The number of cards in your hand is counted only as Fateful Showdown resolves. Fateful Showdown is on the stack at this time, so it\'s not counted."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'There are many important moments in the story, but the most crucial—called “story spotlights”—are shown on cards. These cards have the Planeswalker symbol in their text box; this symbol has no effect on gameplay. You can read more about these events in the official Magic fiction at http://www.mtgstory.com.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If Midnight Oil has no hour counters on it, its first triggered ability will continue to trigger and have you draw an additional card, even though you can\'t remove any counters from it."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If Midnight Oil has only one hour counter on it, its first triggered ability will remove that one counter.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If multiple effects try to set your maximum hand size to a certain number or state that you have no maximum hand size, the one created latest is the one that applies.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you discard a card during your cleanup step while you control Midnight Oil, its last ability will trigger, and players will get priority in your cleanup step. You\'ll have another cleanup step after that one before continuing to the next player\'s turn."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'Your maximum hand size is only checked during the cleanup step of your turn. At other times, you may have more cards in hand than your maximum hand size.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If a creature that is both an artifact and an Artificer enters the battlefield under your control, Era of Innovation\'s triggered ability triggers only once."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You can pay {1} only once each time Era of Innovation\'s first ability resolves. You can\'t pay more to get more than {E}{E}."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They\'re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)"}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters aren\'t mana. They don\'t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can\'t give you energy counters."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay more energy counters than you have."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If a spell has multiple targets, it doesn\'t have a single target even if the same object is chosen for each of those targets."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If the spell can\'t target the enchanted creature, its target remains unchanged."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If there is more than one Captured by the Consulate on the battlefield, the triggered ability of each one will change the target if able. The last one to resolve determines what that spell finally targets. If one player controls more than one Capture by the Consulate, they choose the order in which they resolve. If multiple players control those Auras, the first player among them in turn order (starting with the player whose turn it is now) is the one whose triggered ability resolves last.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "When a player casts an Aura spell, it targets the creature that it will enchant and may cause Captured by the Consulate\'s last ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "When you attach Captured by the Consulate to an opponent\'s creature, you still control Captured by the Consulate. Its last ability triggers whenever your opponents cast a spell with a single target, not when an opponent of the creature\'s controller casts a spell with a single target."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'There are many important moments in the story, but the most crucial—called “story spotlights”—are shown on cards. These cards have the Planeswalker symbol in their text box; this symbol has no effect on gameplay. You can read more about these events in the official Magic fiction at http://www.mtgstory.com.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If each target card is an illegal target as Wildest Dreams resolves, Wildest Dreams doesn\'t resolve and is put into its owner\'s graveyard. It\'s not exiled."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If either target is an illegal target as Nature\'s Way resolves, no damage will be dealt."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If the creature you don\'t control is an illegal target as Nature\'s Way tries to resolve, the creature you control will still gain vigilance and trample."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Trample only applies to the assignment of combat damage, not the damage Nature\'s Way has the creature deal."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast Nature\'s Way unless you choose both a creature you control and a creature you don\'t control as targets."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If multiple artifacts enter the battlefield simultaneously, you\'ll scry 1 that many times. You won\'t look at more than one card from your library at once."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If one of the target creatures becomes an illegal target in response to Verdurous Gearhulk\'s triggered ability, the +1/+1 counters that would have been put on that creature are lost. They can\'t be put on another legal target."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'Verdurous Gearhulk can be the target of its own triggered ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You choose how the counters will be distributed as you put Verdurous Gearhulk\'s triggered ability onto the stack. Each target creature must be assigned at least one counter."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If one of these lands enters the battlefield at the same time as one or more other lands (due to Oblivion Sower or Warp World, perhaps), it doesn\'t take those lands into consideration when determining how many other lands you control."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If one of these lands is your first, second, or third land, it enters the battlefield untapped. If you control three or more other lands, however, it enters the battlefield tapped.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If one target permanent becomes an illegal target, the other will be returned to its owner\'s hand. If both targets become illegal, Aether Tradewinds won\'t resolve."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If the Artificer that entered the battlefield leaves the battlefield before Inventor\'s Goggles becomes attached, Inventor\'s Goggles stays as it was. If it\'s already attached to another creature, it remains attached to that creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If the spell has damage divided as it was cast (like Chandra\'s Pyrohelix), the division can\'t be changed (although the targets receiving that damage still can)."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If the spell that\'s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Eliminate the Competition does), the copy will have the same value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If the spell that\'s copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. A different mode cannot be chosen."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If you choose new targets for the target spell or for the copy, the new targets must be legal.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If you copy a spell, you control the copy.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The controller of a copy can\'t choose to pay any alternative or additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any alternative or additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The copy is created on the stack, so it\'s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The copy will have the same targets as the spell it\'s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'The third mode can copy any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If the target creature becomes an illegal target before Tidy Conclusion resolves, the spell doesn\'t resolve. You don\'t gain any life."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'The number of artifacts you control is counted only as Tidy Conclusion resolves, after the creature is destroyed. For example, if you destroy a Fairgrounds Warden that exiled your artifact creature, the artifact creature will return and then be counted when determining how many artifacts you control.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If the target creature becomes an illegal target for Liberating Combustion, the spell won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t search for Chandra, Pyrogenius."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If the target creature becomes an illegal target, Die Young doesn\'t resolve and none of its effects happen. You won\'t get {E}{E} or be able to pay any {E}."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You choose the target creature as you cast Die Young. You don\'t choose how much {E} to pay until Die Young is resolving. No player may take actions between the time you choose how much {E} to pay and the time the creature gets -1/-1 for each {E} paid this way."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They\'re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)"}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters aren\'t mana. They don\'t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can\'t give you energy counters."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay more energy counters than you have."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If the target creature becomes an illegal target, Essence Extraction doesn\'t resolve and you don\'t gain life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If the target creature becomes an illegal target, Harnessed Lightning doesn\'t resolve and none of its effects happen. You won\'t get {E}{E}{E} or be able to pay any {E}."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You choose the target creature as you cast Harnessed Lightning. You don\'t choose how much {E} to pay until Harnessed Lightning is resolving. No player may take actions between the time you choose how much {E} to pay and the time the creature takes damage equal to the {E} paid this way."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They\'re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)"}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters aren\'t mana. They don\'t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can\'t give you energy counters."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay more energy counters than you have."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If the target creature becomes untapped or otherwise becomes an illegal target before Select for Inspection resolves, the spell doesn\'t resolve. The creature remains on the battlefield and you won\'t scry 1."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If the target creature has indestructible, it isn\'t destroyed this way and you won\'t gain life. If it is destroyed but put into a zone other than a graveyard, you\'ll gain life."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'Use the toughness of the creature as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how much life to gain.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If the target creature or Vehicle becomes an illegal target while Aether Meltdown is on the stack, Aether Meltdown won\'t resolve. It won\'t enter the battlefield and you won\'t get {E}{E}."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They\'re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)"}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters aren\'t mana. They don\'t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can\'t give you energy counters."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay more energy counters than you have."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you control no artifacts as your combat phase begins, Toolcraft Exemplar\'s triggered ability doesn\'t trigger at all. If you control no artifacts as the triggered ability resolves, it has no effect."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'Whether or not you control three or more artifacts is checked only as the triggered ability resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you control three artifacts as the ability resolves, you gain 1 life. The artifacts you control as the ability resolves don\'t have to be the same ones you controlled as it triggered. If you don\'t control three artifacts at that time, you won\'t gain life."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "No player may take actions in a turn before Inventors\' Fair\'s triggered ability checks to see if it should trigger. If you don\'t control three or more artifacts, it won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "When using Inventors\' Fair\'s activated ability, the number of artifacts you control is checked only as you activate it. It\'s not checked again as the ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'There are many important moments in the story, but the most crucial—called “story spotlights”—are shown on cards. These cards have the Planeswalker symbol in their text box; this symbol has no effect on gameplay. You can read more about these events in the official Magic fiction at http://www.mtgstory.com.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you get multiple {E} at once, you only put one +1/+1 counter on a creature, not one counter for each {E}. If you get multiple {E} at different times, Fabrication Module\'s ability triggers once each time."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They\'re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)"}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters aren\'t mana. They don\'t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can\'t give you energy counters."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay more energy counters than you have."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you somehow cast Eliminate the Competition without paying its mana cost, you\'ll still choose a value for X and sacrifice X creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Once you announce that you\'re casting Eliminate the Competition, players can\'t try to remove creatures you\'d like to sacrifice."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Chandra\'s first ability causes 4 damage total to be dealt to the opposing team."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The last ability of Chandra, Pyrogenius doesn\'t target the creatures. A creature with hexproof the target player (or controller of the target planeswalker) controls will be dealt damage this way."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Reckless Fireweaver\'s ability causes 2 damage total to be dealt to the opposing team."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Underhanded Designs\'s first ability causes the opposing team to lose a total of 2 life. You still gain only 1 life."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The number of artifacts you control is checked only as you activate Underhanded Designs\'s last ability. It\'s not checked again as it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You can pay {1} only once each time Underhanded Designs\'s triggered ability resolves. You can\'t pay more to cause your opponents to lose more life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "No player may take actions between the time you draw three cards and the time you discard. Notably, you can\'t try to get an artifact onto the battlefield using the three cards you drew to avoid discarding."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Once Bastion Mastodon is tapped and attacking, gaining vigilance won\'t cause it to become untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Once a creature has blocked Embraal Bruiser, gaining menace won\'t cause Embraal Bruiser to become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Once a creature has blocked an attacking creature, activating Pia Nalaar\'s last ability won\'t cause the attacking creature to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'The “legend rule” cares about legendary permanents with the exact same English name. The Kaladesh™ card Pia Nalaar and the Magic Origins™ card Pia and Kiran Nalaar have different names, so you can control both at the same time.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Once a creature with power 3 or greater has blocked Demolition Stomper, changing the power of the blocking creature won\'t cause Demolition Stomper to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'Any untapped creature you control can be tapped to pay a crew cost, even one that just came under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Creatures that crew a Vehicle aren\'t attached to it or related in any other way. Effects that affect the Vehicle, such as by destroying it or giving it a +1/+1 counter, don\'t affect the creatures that crewed it."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Each Vehicle is printed with a power and toughness, but it\'s not a creature. If it becomes a creature (most likely through its crew ability), it will have that power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'For a Vehicle to be able to attack, it must be a creature as the declare attackers step begins, so the latest you can activate its crew ability to attack with it is during the beginning of combat step. For a Vehicle to be able to block, it must be a creature as the declare blockers step begins, so the latest you can activate its crew ability to block with it is during the declare attackers step. In either case, players may take actions after the crew ability resolves but before the Vehicle has been declared as an attacking or blocking creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If a permanent becomes a copy of a Vehicle, the copy won\'t be a creature, even if the Vehicle it\'s copying has become an artifact creature."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If an effect causes a Vehicle to become an artifact creature with a specified power and toughness, that effect overwrites the Vehicle\'s printed power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Once a Vehicle becomes a creature, it behaves exactly like any other artifact creature. It can\'t attack unless you\'ve controlled it continuously since your turn began, it can block if it\'s untapped, it can be tapped to pay a Vehicle\'s crew cost, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Once a player announces that they are activating a crew ability, no player may take other actions until the ability has been paid for. Notably, players can\'t try to stop the ability by changing a creature\'s power or by removing or tapping a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Vehicle is an artifact type, not a creature type. A Vehicle that\'s crewed won\'t normally have any creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "When a Vehicle becomes a creature, that doesn\'t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. The permanent was already on the battlefield; it only changed its types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "You may activate a crew ability of a Vehicle even if it\'s already an artifact creature. Doing so has no effect on the Vehicle. It doesn\'t change its power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'You may tap more creatures than necessary to activate a crew ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Sequestered Stash\'s ability doesn\'t target the artifact card in your graveyard. You may choose one of the five cards you put there from your library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Speedway Fanatic\'s triggered ability triggers when it becomes tapped to activate a crew ability. Even if Speedway Fanatic leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, that Vehicle still gains haste until end of turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The Construct token you\'re creating doesn\'t count towards X for the ability that creates it."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined only as Oviya Pashiri\'s last ability resolves. The token\'s power and toughness won\'t change as the number of creatures you control changes."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The set of Vehicles and creatures affected by Start Your Engines is determined as the spell resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t get +2/+0, and Vehicles you begin to control later in the turn won\'t automatically become creatures and won\'t get +2/+0."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'Vehicles you control become artifact creatures and then also get +2/+0.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The set of creatures affected by Engineered Might\'s second mode is determined as the spell resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn and noncreature permanents that become creatures later in the turn won\'t get +2/+2 or gain vigilance."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The set of creatures affected by Inspired Charge is determined as the spell resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn and noncreature permanents that become creatures later in the turn won\'t get +2/+1."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The set of creatures affected by Make Obsolete is determined as the spell resolves. Creatures your opponents begin to control later in the turn and noncreature permanents that become creatures later in the turn won\'t get -1/-1."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The set of creatures affected by Nissa\'s last ability is determined as the ability resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn and noncreature permanents that become creatures later in the turn won\'t get +5/+5 or gain trample."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The target creature can\'t block any creatures this turn. The effect isn\'t restricted to just whether the creature can block Maulfist Doorbuster."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They\'re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)"}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters aren\'t mana. They don\'t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can\'t give you energy counters."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If a triggered ability with one or more targets states that you “may pay” some amount of {E}, and each permanent that it targets has become an illegal target, the ability doesn\'t resolve. You can\'t pay {E} even if you want to."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Some triggered abilities state that you “may pay” a certain amount of {E}. You can\'t pay that amount multiple times to multiply the effect. You simply choose whether or not to pay that amount of {E} as the ability resolves, and no player may take actions to try to stop the ability\'s effect after you make your choice."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay more energy counters than you have."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined as Electrostatic Pummeler\'s last ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They\'re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)"}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters aren\'t mana. They don\'t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can\'t give you energy counters."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay more energy counters than you have."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If this creature\'s power is negative as its ability resolves, X is considered to be 0. (This is a change from previous rulings.)"}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "This card\'s printing in Nissa\'s Kaladesh Planeswalker Deck has an incorrect artist credit. The correct artist is Christine Choi."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "This card\'s printing in Nissa\'s Kaladesh Planeswalker Deck has an incorrect artist credit. The correct artist is Magali Villeneuve."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Veteran Motorist\'s last ability resolves before the crew ability that it was tapped to activate. The +1/+1 bonus will be in effect as the Vehicle becomes an artifact creature."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Veteran Motorist\'s last ability triggers when it becomes tapped to activate a crew ability. Even if Veteran Motorist leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, that Vehicle still gets +1/+1 until end of turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You can activate Perpetual Timepiece\'s second ability with no targets just to shuffle your library. If you choose any targets and they all become illegal targets, the ability won\'t resolve and you won\'t shuffle your library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You can pay {1} only once each time Durable Handicraft\'s triggered ability resolves. You can\'t pay more to put multiple +1/+1 counters on a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You don\'t choose whether to pay {1} until Durable Handicraft\'s triggered ability is resolving. No player may take actions between the time you choose to pay and the time the creature gets a +1/+1 counter."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You can\'t target the same permanent or player twice to have one recipient be dealt 4 damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You lose 1 life even if you can\'t put a +1/+1 counter on Fretwork Colony, perhaps because it left the battlefield in response to its triggered ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'A creature entering the battlefield at the same time as Aetherstorm Roc causes its first triggered ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Aetherstorm Roc\'s second triggered ability resolves before blockers are chosen. A creature tapped this way won\'t be able to block."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to target a creature with Aetherstorm Roc\'s last ability. If you do choose a target, and that target becomes illegal, the ability doesn\'t resolve and you won\'t be able to pay {E}{E} to put a counter on Aetherstorm Roc."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They\'re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)"}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters aren\'t mana. They don\'t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can\'t give you energy counters."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If a triggered ability with one or more targets states that you “may pay” some amount of {E}, and each permanent that it targets has become an illegal target, the ability doesn\'t resolve. You can\'t pay {E} even if you want to."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Some triggered abilities state that you “may pay” a certain amount of {E}. You can\'t pay that amount multiple times to multiply the effect. You simply choose whether or not to pay that amount of {E} as the ability resolves, and no player may take actions to try to stop the ability\'s effect after you make your choice."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay more energy counters than you have."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.\'}]', "[{'date': '2016-09-20', 'text': 'A creature that is both a Servo and a Thopter gets +1/+1, not +2/+2.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "After resolving Nissa\'s first ability, the target land still has any abilities it had before it became a creature and any other types it had."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You can activate Nissa\'s first ability targeting a land that\'s already untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'A permanent with more than one type may be chosen as either of the types or both. For example, an artifact creature may be chosen as the artifact, the creature, or both. Choosing the same permanent twice this way has the same result as choosing it once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Cataclysmic Gearhulk will be sacrificed to its own ability if you don\'t choose it as your artifact or your creature."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'First the player whose turn it is chooses permanents they control, then each other player in turn order does the same. Each player will know the choices made by players who chose before them. All of the unchosen nonland permanents are then sacrificed simultaneously.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control any permanents of one of the types, you\'ll still choose the permanents of the types you do control."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Lands can\'t be chosen and won\'t be sacrificed, even if they have other types (such as an artifact land)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'A tapped planeswalker can be attacked or dealt damage as normal.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Activated abilities contain a colon. They\'re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "After a planeswalker enters the battlefield, the active player receives priority and may activate an ability of that planeswalker before any player can activate Deadlock Trap\'s last ability."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If the tapped creature somehow becomes untapped, it can attack and block as normal, but its abilities still can\'t be activated this turn."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Once a player has announced an ability, Deadlock Trap can\'t be used to undo it. The last ability must be activated before that player activates that ability."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Players may respond to Deadlock Trap\'s last ability by activating an ability of the target permanent if that ability\'s timing permissions allow it."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They\'re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)"}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters aren\'t mana. They don\'t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can\'t give you energy counters."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay more energy counters than you have."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'There are many important moments in the story, but the most crucial—called “story spotlights”—are shown on cards. These cards have the Planeswalker symbol in their text box; this symbol has no effect on gameplay. You can read more about these events in the official Magic fiction at http://www.mtgstory.com.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'Abilities that trigger when counters are put on a permanent trigger when a permanent enters the battlefield with counters and when a player puts counters on a permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If +1/+1 counters are put on more than one permanent you control at the same time, Animation Module\'s first ability triggers once for each of those permanents."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You can pay {1} only once each time Animation Module\'s first ability resolves. You can\'t pay more to create extra Servo tokens."}]', "[{'date': '2016-09-20', 'text': 'An artifact creature gains indestructible in addition to getting +2/+2, not instead of it.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-09-20', 'text': 'An artifact creature gains trample in addition to getting +3/+3, not instead of it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'An effect that instructs you to "cast" a card doesn\\\'t allow you to play lands.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Casting the card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Gonti doesn\'t change when you can cast the exiled card. For example, if you exile a creature card without flash, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If you leave the game, the card remains exiled face down indefinitely. No player may look at it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You may look at and cast that card (and spend mana as though it were mana of any type to do so) even if Gonti leaves the battlefield. If another player gains control of Gonti, that player can\'t look at or cast the card, and you still can."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You pay the costs for the exiled card if you cast it. You may pay alternative costs such as emerge rather than the card\'s mana cost."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "The six types of mana are white, blue, black, red, green, and colorless. Snow mana is not a type of mana. Gonti, Lord of Luxury won\'t let you pay a snow cost using mana produced by a nonsnow source."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied permanent will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen permanent will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "As Saheeli\'s last ability resolves, all three artifacts enter the battlefield at the same time. Triggered abilities of any of those artifacts will see all three entering the battlefield. Replacement effects, such as that of Sculpting Steel, won\'t see the others on the battlefield as they are being applied."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If the copied permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If the copied permanent is a token, the token created with Saheeli copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created that token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If the copied permanent is copying something else (for example, if the copied permanent is an Altered Ego), then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that permanent copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Saheeli\'s first ability causes 2 damage total to be dealt to the opposing team."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what was printed on the original permanent and nothing else (unless that permanent is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that permanent is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The token is an artifact in addition to its other types. This is a copiable value of the token that other effects may copy. Haste and the ability\'s delayed triggered ability aren\'t copiable."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If a card in exile has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If a land card is exiled this way, you can play that land card until end of turn if you have any available land plays.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Spark of Creativity doesn\'t change when you can play the exiled card. For example, if you exile a creature card without flash, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast Spark of Creativity without targeting a creature. If the creature becomes an illegal target for Spark of Creativity, none of its effects happen. You don\'t exile the top card of your library."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'You must pay all costs to play the exiled card. You may pay alternative or additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If a creature has been dealt damage, that damage remains marked on it until the cleanup step. If Aetherborn Marauder takes counters from a creature that has been dealt damage, that creature will be destroyed if the damage is now lethal.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You choose which counters to move as Aetherborn Marauder\'s triggered ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'You may choose to move zero +1/+1 counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'You may move +1/+1 counters from any number of other permanents you control, not just from one.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If an effect copies Morbid Curiosity, the controller of the copy will draw the same number of cards as determined by the original. Its controller can\'t and doesn\'t have to sacrifice a permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'To determine how many cards to draw, use the mana value of the permanent immediately before you sacrificed it.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The mana value of a token that isn\'t a copy of another object is 0. A token that is a copy of another object has the same mana cost as that object."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If the target artifact or creature has a mana value of 0, you may choose to pay zero energy and gain control of it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if a permanent\'s owner leaves the game after you\'ve gained control of it, the permanent leaves with that player. If you leave the game before that player, the control-change effect ends."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The mana value of a token that isn\'t a copy of another object is 0. A token that is a copy of another object has the same mana cost as that object."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You choose the target artifact or creature as you cast Confiscation Coup. You don\'t choose whether or not to pay an amount of {E} until Confiscation Coup resolves. If the target becomes an illegal target, Confiscation Coup won\'t resolve and you won\'t get {E}{E}{E}{E}."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They\'re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)"}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters aren\'t mana. They don\'t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can\'t give you energy counters."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay more energy counters than you have."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'There are many important moments in the story, but the most crucial—called “story spotlights”—are shown on cards. These cards have the Planeswalker symbol in their text box; this symbol has no effect on gameplay. You can read more about these events in the official Magic fiction at http://www.mtgstory.com.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If the total mana value of noncreature artifacts you control is 11 or greater, Metalwork Colossus costs {0} to cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Metalwork Colossus\'s last ability can be activated only if it is in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Once a player has announced that they are casting Metalwork Colossus, no player may take actions to try to change the number of artifacts its controller controls before that spell\'s cost is locked in."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'The total cost to cast Metalwork Colossus is locked in before you pay that cost. For example, if you control three noncreature artifacts each with mana value 2, including one you can sacrifice to add {C} to your mana pool, the total cost of Metalwork Colossus is {5}. Then you can sacrifice the artifact when you activate mana abilities just before paying the cost.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If an artifact has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control an artifact with the highest mana value as your upkeep begins, Padeem\'s second ability won\'t trigger. You can\'t cast an instant to destroy an opponent\'s artifact during your turn before your upkeep begins."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you no longer control an artifact with the highest mana value as Padeem\'s triggered ability resolves, you don\'t draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'The artifact you control has to have the highest mana value only among artifacts on the battlefield, not among all permanents on the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If an artifact spell has {X} in its mana cost, choose the value for X first, and then reduce the cost by {1}. For example, an artifact that costs {X} with X chosen as 4 costs {3} to cast if you control Foundry Inspector.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Once a player has announced an artifact spell, no player may take actions to try to remove Foundry Inspector from the battlefield before that spell\'s cost is locked in."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If any of the cards put into your graveyard have {X} in their mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you have fewer than three cards in your library, the opponent may choose to have you draw three cards. If so, you\'ll lose the game as state-based actions are performed."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "While Combustible Gearhulk\'s triggered ability is resolving, no player may take any actions other than those specified by the Gearhulk. Once the opponent makes a choice, players can\'t cast spells or activate abilities until after the cards are drawn or put into the graveyard and damage has been dealt (if applicable)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as emerge costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Incendiary Sabotage, you must pay those to cast the card."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you cast the card, you do so as part of the resolution of Torrential Gearhulk\'s triggered ability. You can\'t wait to cast it later in the turn. Timing restrictions (such as “Cast [this card] only during combat”) still apply."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If you get multiple {E} at once, Territorial Gorger only gets +2/+2 once, not +2/+2 per {E}. If you get multiple {E} at different times, it triggers once each time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They\'re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)"}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters aren\'t mana. They don\'t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can\'t give you energy counters."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay more energy counters than you have."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'In a multiplayer game, you must choose the target opponent before you look at your top ten cards and decide what to exile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The cards that you look at but don\'t exile never leave your library. They\'re shuffled along with the rest of your library."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'The creature cards you exile are face up. Your opponent can see them while deciding whether to take one and which to take.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'You may choose to exile no creature cards, even if there are one or more among the top ten cards of your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'You may choose to exile only one creature card. If you do, the target opponent chooses who gets the card.\'}]', "[{'date': '2016-09-20', 'text': 'Kujar Seedsculptor can be the target of its own triggered ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'Multiple instances of menace on the same creature are redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Once a creature has blocked Weldfast Monitor, gaining menace won\'t cause Weldfast Monitor to become unblocked."}]', "[{'date': '2016-09-20', 'text': 'You can cast Ornamental Courage targeting an untapped creature. It will still get +1/+3 until end of turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-09-20', 'text': 'You scry 1 even if that player has no creature card to discard.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-09-20', 'text': 'multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They\'re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)"}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters aren\'t mana. They don\'t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can\'t give you energy counters."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If a triggered ability with one or more targets states that you “may pay” some amount of {E}, and each permanent that it targets has become an illegal target, the ability doesn\'t resolve. You can\'t pay {E} even if you want to."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Some triggered abilities state that you “may pay” a certain amount of {E}. You can\'t pay that amount multiple times to multiply the effect. You simply choose whether or not to pay that amount of {E} as the ability resolves, and no player may take actions to try to stop the ability\'s effect after you make your choice."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay more energy counters than you have."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They\'re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)"}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters aren\'t mana. They don\'t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can\'t give you energy counters."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Some triggered abilities state that you “may pay” a certain amount of {E}. You can\'t pay that amount multiple times to multiply the effect. You simply choose whether or not to pay that amount of {E} as the ability resolves, and no player may take actions to try to stop the ability\'s effect after you make your choice."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay more energy counters than you have."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They\'re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)"}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters aren\'t mana. They don\'t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can\'t give you energy counters."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay more energy counters than you have."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They\'re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)"}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Energy counters aren\\\'t mana. They don\\\'t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana "of any type" to your mana pool can\\\'t give you energy counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay more energy counters than you have."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'Any untapped creature you control can be tapped to pay a crew cost, even one that just came under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Creatures that crew a Vehicle aren\'t attached to it or related in any other way. Effects that affect the Vehicle, such as by destroying it or giving it a +1/+1 counter, don\'t affect the creatures that crewed it."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Each Vehicle is printed with a power and toughness, but it\'s not a creature. If it becomes a creature (most likely through its crew ability), it will have that power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'For a Vehicle to be able to attack, it must be a creature as the declare attackers step begins, so the latest you can activate its crew ability to attack with it is during the beginning of combat step. For a Vehicle to be able to block, it must be a creature as the declare blockers step begins, so the latest you can activate its crew ability to block with it is during the declare attackers step. In either case, players may take actions after the crew ability resolves but before the Vehicle has been declared as an attacking or blocking creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If a permanent becomes a copy of a Vehicle, the copy won\'t be a creature, even if the Vehicle it\'s copying has become an artifact creature."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If an effect causes a Vehicle to become an artifact creature with a specified power and toughness, that effect overwrites the Vehicle\'s printed power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Once a Vehicle becomes a creature, it behaves exactly like any other artifact creature. It can\'t attack unless you\'ve controlled it continuously since your turn began, it can block if it\'s untapped, it can be tapped to pay a Vehicle\'s crew cost, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Once a player announces that they are activating a crew ability, no player may take other actions until the ability has been paid for. Notably, players can\'t try to stop the ability by changing a creature\'s power or by removing or tapping a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Vehicle is an artifact type, not a creature type. A Vehicle that\'s crewed won\'t normally have any creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "When a Vehicle becomes a creature, that doesn\'t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. The permanent was already on the battlefield; it only changed its types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "You may activate a crew ability of a Vehicle even if it\'s already an artifact creature. Doing so has no effect on the Vehicle. It doesn\'t change its power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'You may tap more creatures than necessary to activate a crew ability.\'}]', "[{'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'You can target and gain control of an untapped artifact or creature this way. You can also untap an artifact or creature you already control and give it haste.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'If either target is an illegal target as Hunt the Weak resolves, neither creature will deal or be dealt damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "If the creature you control is an illegal target as Hunt the Weak tries to resolve, you won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on it. If that creature is a legal target but the other creature isn\'t, you\'ll still put the counter on the creature you control."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast Hunt the Weak unless you choose both a creature you control and a creature you don\'t control as targets."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Self-Assembler\'s ability can find any creature card with the Assembly-Worker subtype, not only creature cards named Assembly-Worker. Notably, it can\'t find Mishra\'s Factory."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Once a creature with power 2 or less has blocked a creature, activating Ghirapur Guide\'s ability won\'t change or undo that block."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Once a creature with power 3 or greater has blocked the target creature, changing the power of the blocking creature won\'t change or undo that block."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If Chandra\'s Pyrohelix targets two creatures and one becomes an illegal target, the remaining target is dealt 1 damage, not 2."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "You divide the damage as you cast Chandra\'s Pyrohelix, not as it resolves. Each target must be assigned at least 1 damage. In other words, as you cast Chandra\'s Pyrohelix, you choose whether to have it deal 2 damage to a single target, or deal 1 damage to each of two targets."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Because discarding two cards is an additional cost, you can\'t cast Cathartic Reunion if you don\'t have at least two other cards in hand."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If multiple players are instructed to scry at once, such as while resolving Eager Construct\'s triggered ability, those players each look at the top card of their library at the same time, then they choose in turn order whether to put those cards on the top or bottom of their library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Unlicensed Disintegration tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. It won\'t deal damage to any player. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller is dealt 3 damage."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Whether or not you control an artifact is checked only after the creature is destroyed while Unlicensed Disintegration is resolving. For example, if you destroy a Fairgrounds Warden that exiled your artifact creature, Unlicensed Disintegration deals 3 damage to Fairgrounds Warden\'s controller."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Ovalchase Daredevil\'s ability triggers only if it\'s already in your graveyard as an artifact enters the battlefield under your control."}]', "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to an artifact creature you control may become lethal if Chief of the Foundry leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Pressure Point tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. You don\'t draw a card. If the target is legal but doesn\'t become tapped (most likely because it\'s already tapped), you do draw a card."}]', "[{'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'If you choose both modes and one target becomes illegal before Subtle Strike resolves, the other target is affected as appropriate.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Armorcraft Judge\'s ability counts the number of creatures, not the number of counters. A creature with more than one +1/+1 counter won\'t cause you to draw more than one card."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The number of creatures you control with +1/+1 counters on them is counted only as Armorcraft Judge\'s triggered ability resolves. Players may respond to the triggered ability by trying to change that number."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Ninth Bridge Patrol is dealt lethal damage at the same time as another creature you control, it won\'t receive a counter from its ability in time to save it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Ninth Bridge Patrol\'s ability doesn\'t care where the creature went or whether it\'s a creature in its new zone. It may have died, been exiled, returned to your hand, and so on. It won\'t trigger if an object remains on the battlefield but ceases to be a creature. It won\'t trigger if a creature phases out."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If another artifact card is put into your graveyard at the same time as Workshop Assistant, you can target it with Workshop Assistant\'s triggered ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Renegade Tactics tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. You don\'t draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Skywhaler\'s Shot tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. You don\'t scry 1."}]', "[{'date': '2020-11-10', 'text': 'If you control zero artifacts, Welding Sparks deals 3 damage to the target creature.'}, {'date': '2020-11-10', 'text': 'The number of artifacts you control is counted only as Welding Sparks resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a melded or merged permanent is returned to your hand this way, you\'ll draw a card for each of its components that are cards."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you control but don\'t own some of the target permanents, they won\'t count when determining how many cards you draw."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Abilities that apply "as [this artifact or creature] enters the battlefield," such as choosing a color with Gauntlet of Power, are also unaffected.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If a triggered ability is linked to a second ability, additional instances of that triggered ability are also linked to that second ability. If the second ability refers to "the exiled card," it refers to all cards exiled by instances of the triggered ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If an artifact or creature entering the battlefield at the same time as Panharmonicon (including Panharmonicon itself) causes a triggered ability of a permanent you control to trigger, that ability triggers an additional time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If you control two Panharmonicons, an artifact or creature entering the battlefield causes abilities to trigger three times, not four. A third Panharmonicon causes abilities to trigger four times, a fourth causes abilities to trigger five times, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'In some cases involving linked abilities, an ability requires information about "the exiled card." When this happens, the ability gets multiple answers. If these answers are being used to determine the value of a variable, the sum is used. For example, if Elite Arcanist\\\'s enters-the-battlefield ability triggers twice, two cards are exiled. The value of X in the activation cost of Elite Arcanist\\\'s other ability is the sum of the two cards\\\' mana values. As the ability resolves, you create copies of both cards and can cast none, one, or both of the copies in any order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Panharmonicon affects a permanent\\\'s own enters-the-battlefield triggered abilities as well as other triggered abilities that trigger when that permanent enters the battlefield. Such triggered abilities start with "when" or "whenever."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Panharmonicon\'s effect doesn\'t copy the triggered ability; it just causes the ability to trigger twice. Any choices made as you put the ability onto the stack, such as modes and targets, are made separately for each instance of the ability. Any choices made on resolution, such as whether to put counters on a permanent, are also made individually."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Replacement effects are unaffected by Panharmonicon\'s ability. For example, a creature that enters the battlefield with one +1/+1 counter on it won\'t receive an additional +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You don\'t need to control the permanent entering the battlefield, only the permanent that has the triggered ability."}]']
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Abriss-Stampfer\', \'text\': \'Der Abriss-Stampfer kann von Kreaturen mit Stärke 2 oder weniger nicht geblockt werden.\\nBemannen 5 (Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 5 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418571&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52714a05-8d33-4156-b927-7d5b46ef5812\', \'multiverseId\': 418571}, \'multiverseid\': 418571}, {\'name\': \'Aplastador de demolición\', \'text\': \'El Aplastador de demolición no puede ser bloqueado por criaturas con fuerza de 2 o menos.\\nTripular 5. (Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 5 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe6cdde3-2d8d-487f-bb06-ff186f205664\', \'multiverseId\': 420419}, \'multiverseid\': 420419}, {\'name\': \'Piétineur de démolition\', \'text\': "Le Piétineur de démolition ne peut pas être bloqué par les créatures de force inférieure ou égale à 2.\\nPilotage 5 (Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 5 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : véhicule\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418835&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b34567bc-957d-4cf4-9e3f-51fee624114c\', \'multiverseId\': 418835}, \'multiverseid\': 418835}, {\'name\': \'Demolitore Calcante\', \'text\': \'Il Demolitore Calcante non può essere bloccato da creature con forza pari o inferiore a 2.\\nManovrare 5 (TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 5: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e010514-2835-4051-8cd4-c0aa7d3a3127\', \'multiverseId\': 419099}, \'multiverseid\': 419099}, {\'name\': \'破砕踏歩機\', \'text\': \'破砕踏歩機は、パワーが２以下のクリーチャーによってはブロックされない。\\n搭乗５（あなたがコントロールする望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が５以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18d3fef2-85c5-46ec-b78c-df730fa3c0b6\', \'multiverseId\': 419363}, \'multiverseid\': 419363}, {\'name\': \'밟아부수는 전투보행자\', \'text\': \'밟아부수는 전투보행자는 공격력이 2 이하인 생물에게 방어될 수 없다.\\n탑승 5 (당신이 조종하는 생물을 공격력 총합이 5 이상이 되도록 원하는 수만큼 탭한다: 이 탑승물은 턴종료까지 마법물체 생물이 된다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 탑승물\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4961558-93af-49a1-a164-1ea2ec7d6502\', \'multiverseId\': 419627}, \'multiverseid\': 419627}, {\'name\': \'Pisoteador de Demolição\', \'text\': \'Pisoteador de Demolição não pode ser bloqueado por criaturas com poder igual ou inferior a 2.\\nTripular 5 (Vire qualquer número de criaturas que você controla com total de poder igual ou superior a 5: Este Veículo se torna uma criatura artefato até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Veículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22314b66-0daa-4d15-b0fd-8394f2977709\', \'multiverseId\': 419891}, \'multiverseid\': 419891}, {\'name\': \'Разрушительный Тяжелоступ\', \'text\': \'Разрушительный Тяжелоступ не может быть заблокирован существами с силой 2 или меньше.\\nЭкипаж 5 (Поверните любое количество существ под вашим контролем с суммарной силой 5 или более: эта Машина становится артефактом существом до конца хода.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Машина\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01accb5d-0e6f-4ca1-8dc0-0712ccc579b1\', \'multiverseId\': 420155}, \'multiverseid\': 420155}, {\'name\': \'毁坏跺地械\', \'text\': \'毁坏跺地械不能被力量等于或小于2的生物阻挡。\\n搭载5（横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于5的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'神器～载具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e57b5493-ffd6-4095-b8c0-6e26014c0228\', \'multiverseId\': 418043}, \'multiverseid\': 418043}, {\'name\': \'毀壞跺地械\', \'text\': \'毀壞跺地械不能被力量等於或小於2的生物阻擋。\\n搭載5（橫置任意數量由你操控且力量總和等於或大於5的生物：此載具成為神器生物直到回合結束。）\', \'type\': \'神器～載具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72394a02-ee1f-430e-9d0a-5430c64771cd\', \'multiverseId\': 418307}, \'multiverseid\': 418307}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akrobatisches Manöver\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil und bringe ihre Karte dann unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Renegaten finden immer ausgefallenere Wege, die Ätherbestimmungen des Konsulats zu umgehen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418366&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'663c93bb-ebc9-403c-9d5d-546a796dc6ce\', \'multiverseId\': 418366}, \'multiverseid\': 418366}, {\'name\': \'Maniobra acrobática\', \'text\': \'Exilia la criatura objetivo que controlas, luego regresa esa carta al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los renegados encuentran formas cada vez más creativas de esquivar las regulaciones del Consulado respecto al éter .\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ad38fdc-2585-4ff0-8d03-6a875395ef56\', \'multiverseId\': 420214}, \'multiverseid\': 420214}, {\'name\': \'Manœuvre acrobatique\', \'text\': \'Exilez une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez, puis renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire.\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les renégats trouvent toujours de nouveaux moyens de contourner les réglementations en matière d\'Éther du Consulat.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418630&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98442f87-36c2-4ce0-a9dc-cc50d687ba94\', \'multiverseId\': 418630}, \'multiverseid\': 418630}, {\'name\': \'Manovra Acrobatica\', \'text\': \'Esilia una creatura bersaglio che controlli, poi rimetti quella carta sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "I rinnegati escogitano stratagemmi sempre più originali per aggirare le restrizioni consolari sull\'etere.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bcf8900-c582-4274-8db5-2e752cc0bf05\', \'multiverseId\': 418894}, \'multiverseid\': 418894}, {\'name\': \'軽業の妙技\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。その後そのカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\\nカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'改革派は領事府の霊気規制を出し抜く独創的な方法を発見した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1916dcd6-5df9-415a-aff9-f5a64c74f6ac\', \'multiverseId\': 419158}, \'multiverseid\': 419158}, {\'name\': \'곡예 기동\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 추방한 후, 소유자의 조종하에 전장으로 되돌린다.\\n카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'무법자들은 영사관의 에테르 규정을 피하기 위해 더욱 교묘한 수법을 찾아낸다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c11c52d0-5029-4e93-a739-9ed932a92778\', \'multiverseId\': 419422}, \'multiverseid\': 419422}, {\'name\': \'Manobra Acrobática\', \'text\': \'Exile a criatura alvo que você controla e, depois, devolva aquele card ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Os renegados encontram formas sempre mais criativas de contornar a regulação do éter pelo Consulado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e29ff23c-fb4e-4893-99ef-eb1195d4115f\', \'multiverseId\': 419686}, \'multiverseid\': 419686}, {\'name\': \'Акробатический Маневр\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевое существо под вашим контролем, затем верните ту карту на поле битвы под контролем ее владельца.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Отступники находят все более изобретательные способы обойти ограничения на использование эфира, установленные Консульством.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de19dd26-c53a-4666-be9d-87011ac90082\', \'multiverseId\': 419950}, \'multiverseid\': 419950}, {\'name\': \'杂耍计略\', \'text\': \'放逐目标由你操控的生物，然后将该牌在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'乱匠迭出奇招以规避执政院的乙太法规。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7193263-73ef-48db-9a7b-7056a05392a9\', \'multiverseId\': 417838}, \'multiverseid\': 417838}, {\'name\': \'雜耍計略\', \'text\': \'放逐目標由你操控的生物，然後將該牌在其擁有者的操控下移回戰場。\\n抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'亂匠迭出奇招以規避執政院的乙太法規。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f67d3a7-3917-4b48-872f-8cdb296a8553\', \'multiverseId\': 418102}, \'multiverseid\': 418102}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ambitionierter Äthergeborener\', \'text\': \'Fabrizieren 1 (Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie oder erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Servo-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Äthergeborener, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'Äthergeborene, die die Zersetzung ihres Körpers nicht akzeptieren wollen, finden Wege, ihn zu erhalten und zu verbessern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418437&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bb25ee7-8fde-4cc8-a7f8-bc993f388ee2\', \'multiverseId\': 418437}, \'multiverseid\': 418437}, {\'name\': \'Etergénito ambicioso\', \'text\': \'Fabricar 1. (Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella o crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Servo incolora 1/1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice etergénito\', \'flavor\': \'Los etergénitos que no quieren aceptar la descomposición de su cuerpo se inventan formas de preservarse y mejorarse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8395626f-cc18-43e6-a546-f41b03f16cfd\', \'multiverseId\': 420285}, \'multiverseid\': 420285}, {\'name\': \'Présomptueux éthérien\', \'text\': \'Fabrication 1 (Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle ou créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Servo.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : éthérien et artificier\', \'flavor\': "Les éthériens refusant d\'accepter la décomposition de leur corps inventent des moyens de se préserver et de s\'améliorer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418701&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24148706-26c5-48de-9866-f316314af80b\', \'multiverseId\': 418701}, \'multiverseid\': 418701}, {\'name\': \'Eteride Ambizioso\', \'text\': \'Fabbrica 1 (Quando questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa o crea una pedina creatura artefatto Servomeccanismo 1/1 incolore.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Eteride\', \'flavor\': \'Gli eteridi che non si rassegnano alla decomposizione dei loro corpi inventano modi per conservarsi e potenziarsi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418965&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32f3ac53-6e8f-47e6-bbec-a17c48acdd43\', \'multiverseId\': 418965}, \'multiverseid\': 418965}, {\'name\': \'霊基体の野心家\', \'text\': \'製造１（このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置くか、無色の１/１の霊気装置・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 霊基体・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'自身の体が崩壊することを受け入れたくなかった霊基体が、自分を維持し延命する方法を発明した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51de9b7d-12bc-4f01-9dbf-647109452baf\', \'multiverseId\': 419229}, \'multiverseid\': 419229}, {\'name\': \'야심만만한 에테르붙이\', \'text\': \'제작 1 (이 생물이 전장에 들어올 때, 이 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓거나 1/1 무색 서보 마법물체 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 에테르붙이 기능공\', \'flavor\': \'육신의 부패를 받아들일 수 없는 에테르붙이는 자신들을 보존하고 개량하는 방법을 개발한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'505ebb73-6b54-4579-bde8-c260f126fc22\', \'multiverseId\': 419493}, \'multiverseid\': 419493}, {\'name\': \'Etergênito Ambicioso\', \'text\': \'Fabricar 1 (Quando esta criatura entrar no campo de batalha, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nela ou crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Servus.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Etergênito Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'Os etergênitos que se recusam a aceitar a decomposição de seus corpos inventam formas de conservá-los e melhorá-los.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f588f6b1-2c8d-49d2-9207-fa08292cea9b\', \'multiverseId\': 419757}, \'multiverseid\': 419757}, {\'name\': \'Честолюбивый Эфирид\', \'text\': \'Производство 1 (Когда это существо выходит на поле битвы, положите на него один жетон +1/+1 или создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Сервотрон.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эфирид Механик\', \'flavor\': \'Эфириды, не желающие мириться с разложением своих тел, изобретают способы сохранить и укрепить их.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1bccc0e-1313-4e9b-b6b6-40cec7571880\', \'multiverseId\': 420021}, \'multiverseid\': 420021}, {\'name\': \'雄心乙太种\', \'text\': \'装配1（当此生物进战场时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物或派出一个1/1无色自动机衍生神器生物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～乙太种／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'不愿让身体消散的乙太种发明了保全并增强自身的方法。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e102cd2-a0e7-4cb1-94d1-8f42d597762f\', \'multiverseId\': 417909}, \'multiverseid\': 417909}, {\'name\': \'雄心乙太種\', \'text\': \'裝配1（當此生物進戰場時，在其上放置一個+1/+1指示物或派出一個1/1無色自動機衍生神器生物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～乙太種／神器師\', \'flavor\': \'不願讓身體消散的乙太種發明了保全並增強自身的方法。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d912d3c2-3502-4128-9431-be2d5db1a22e\', \'multiverseId\': 418173}, \'multiverseid\': 418173}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anflug von Genialität\', \'text\': \'Hellsicht 2, ziehe dann zwei Karten. Du erhältst {E}{E} (zwei Energiemarken).\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Schöpfer leben für den Moment der Inspiration: so kostbar, tiefgehend und perfekt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418414&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ace2ceba-030c-4372-a80e-1c5f1f40c69b\', \'multiverseId\': 418414}, \'multiverseid\': 418414}, {\'name\': \'Atisbo de genio\', \'text\': \'Adivina 2, luego roba dos cartas. Obtienes {E}{E} (dos contadores de energía).\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los creadores viven para ese momento de inspiración: precioso, profundo, perfecto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f72a7b9-8330-40ce-8350-6d89cebf8083\', \'multiverseId\': 420262}, \'multiverseid\': 420262}, {\'name\': \'Lueur de génie\', \'text\': \'Regard 2, puis piochez deux cartes. Vous gagnez {E}{E} (deux marqueurs « énergie »).\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les créateurs vivent pour cet instant d\'inspiration : précieux, profond, parfait.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418678&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cb19d91-2ef8-42f3-9aa7-11b2e6b3e048\', \'multiverseId\': 418678}, \'multiverseid\': 418678}, {\'name\': \'Barlume di Genialità\', \'text\': \'Profetizza 2, poi pesca due carte. Ottieni {E}{E} (due segnalini energia).\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Gli inventori vivono per il momento dell\'ispirazione, prezioso, profondo e perfetto.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66a98b5d-fb02-4c65-a352-7799223fe758\', \'multiverseId\': 418942}, \'multiverseid\': 418942}, {\'name\': \'天才の片鱗\', \'text\': \'占術２を行い、その後カードを２枚引く。あなたは{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター２個）を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'制作者は着想を得る瞬間のために生きている。それは貴重で、玄妙で、感無量の時だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ff1145a-ab05-47e3-9024-527649206410\', \'multiverseId\': 419206}, \'multiverseid\': 419206}, {\'name\': \'천재성 발휘\', \'text\': \'점술 2를 하고 카드 두 장을 뽑는다. 당신은 {E}{E}(에너지 카운터 두 개)를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'발명가는 귀중하고 심오하며 완벽한 영감의 순간을 위해 산다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4859eb8-f2a1-46b9-9545-957228c4fe69\', \'multiverseId\': 419470}, \'multiverseid\': 419470}, {\'name\': \'Lampejo de Genialidade\', \'text\': \'Use vidência 2 e depois compre dois cards. Você recebe {E}{E} (dois marcadores de energia).\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Os criadores vivem para aquele momento de inspiração: precioso, profundo, perfeito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acb5b520-362a-4a54-abc0-88650b7899cc\', \'multiverseId\': 419734}, \'multiverseid\': 419734}, {\'name\': \'Проблеск Гениальности\', \'text\': \'Предскажите 2, затем возьмите две карты. Вы получаете {E}{E} (два жетона энергии).\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Творцы живут ради этого момента вдохновения — драгоценного, изумительного, безупречного...\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e5bb0fe-de47-45b2-ada3-eecae9604585\', \'multiverseId\': 419998}, \'multiverseid\': 419998}, {\'name\': \'灵光一闪\', \'text\': \'占卜2，然后抓两张牌。你得到{E}{E}（两个能量指示物）。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'创造者追求的，正是这一灵感涌现的奇妙瞬间：宝贵，深刻、完美。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7638718e-6f0b-4cff-a9ab-4512009dd040\', \'multiverseId\': 417886}, \'multiverseid\': 417886}, {\'name\': \'靈光一閃\', \'text\': \'占卜2，然後抽兩張牌。你得到{E}{E}（兩個能量指示物）。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'創造者追求的，正是這一靈感湧現的奇妙瞬間：寶貴，深刻，完美。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b90f96d-f402-4e39-933d-70f13d746966\', \'multiverseId\': 418150}, \'multiverseid\': 418150}]', '[{\'name\': \'Animationsmodul\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine oder mehrere +1/+1-Marken auf eine bleibende Karte, die du kontrollierst, gelegt werden, kannst du {1} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Servo-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\\n{3}, {T}: Bestimme eine Marke auf einer bleibenden Karte oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl. Gib dieser bleibenden Karte oder diesem Spieler eine weitere Marke dieser Sorte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Design führt zu Fortschritt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418559&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9758993-c0f4-4bf0-91e0-e17bf12d4b06\', \'multiverseId\': 418559}, \'multiverseid\': 418559}, {\'name\': \'Módulo de animación\', \'text\': \'Siempre que se pongan uno o más contadores +1/+1 sobre un permanente que controlas, puedes pagar {1}. Si lo haces, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Servo incolora 1/1.\\n{3}, {T}: Elige un contador sobre el permanente o el jugador objetivo. Ese permanente o jugador obtiene otro contador del mismo tipo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El diseño lleva al progreso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78c0e073-f7f3-4ddb-a136-2ce70ba040c4\', \'multiverseId\': 420407}, \'multiverseid\': 420407}, {\'name\': "Module d\'animation", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'au moins un marqueur +1/+1 est mis sur un permanent que vous contrôlez, vous pouvez payer {1}. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Servo.\\n{3}, {T} : Choisissez un marqueur sur un permanent ciblé ou un joueur ciblé. Donnez à ce permanent ou à ce joueur un autre marqueur de ce type.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'La conception mène au progrès.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418823&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb75305e-15c9-43f2-9efa-6dc3912b2b66\', \'multiverseId\': 418823}, \'multiverseid\': 418823}, {\'name\': \'Modulo di Animazione\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta vengono messi uno o più segnalini +1/+1 su un permanente che controlli, puoi pagare {1}. Se lo fai, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Servomeccanismo 1/1 incolore.\\n{3}, {T}: Scegli un segnalino su un permanente o un giocatore bersaglio. Quel permanente o giocatore riceve un altro segnalino di quel tipo.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'La creatività conduce al progresso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4a9963b-d4f5-4b84-87d8-1215fa3620b3\', \'multiverseId\': 419087}, \'multiverseid\': 419087}, {\'name\': \'活性機構\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするパーマネント１つの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが１個以上置かれるたび、あなたは{1}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、無色の１/１の霊気装置・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n{3}, {T}：パーマネント１つかプレイヤー１人を対象とし、そのパーマネントの上に置かれているかそのプレイヤーが持つカウンター１個を選ぶ。それと同じ種類のカウンターを１個、そのパーマネントの上に置くか、そのプレイヤーに与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'様式は進歩を生む。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d84e76e-099f-4616-938d-db0694b5fd18\', \'multiverseId\': 419351}, \'multiverseid\': 419351}, {\'name\': \'자동동작 모듈\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 지속물에 +1/+1 카운터가 한 개 이상 놓일 때마다, 당신은 {1}을 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 1/1 무색 서보 마법물체 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n{3}, {T}: 지속물 또는 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 목표가 가진 카운터를 선택한다. 그 목표에게 같은 종류의 카운터 한 개를 추가한다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'디자인이 진보를 낳는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ffe158d-a5a1-498b-8e30-c7e777ec9e30\', \'multiverseId\': 419615}, \'multiverseid\': 419615}, {\'name\': \'Módulo de Animação\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um ou mais marcadores +1/+1 são colocados em uma permanente que você controla, você pode pagar {1}. Se fizer isso, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Servus.\\n{3}, {T}: Escolha um marcador em uma permanente ou jogador alvo. Dê àquela permanente ou jogador outro marcador daquele tipo.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'O projeto leva ao progresso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af0d3fa2-e3e8-4088-be3e-986f167e345b\', \'multiverseId\': 419879}, \'multiverseid\': 419879}, {\'name\': \'Модуль Оживления\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда на перманент под вашим контролем помещается один или более жетонов +1/+1, вы можете заплатить {1}. Если вы это делаете, создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Сервотрон.\\n{3}, {T}: выберите жетон на целевом перманенте или игроке. Дайте тому перманенту или игроку еще один жетон того же типа.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Разработка ведет к прогрессу.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'579f8bf1-1e87-4865-a3b1-afb0ffb0db02\', \'multiverseId\': 420143}, \'multiverseid\': 420143}, {\'name\': \'活化模块\', \'text\': \'每当在一个由你操控的永久物上放置一个或数个+1/+1指示物时，你可以支付{1}。若你如此作，则派出一个1/1无色自动机衍生神器生物。\\n{3}，{T}：选择目标永久物或牌手上的一个指示物。该永久物或牌手得到另一个该种类的指示物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'设计推进展。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58675257-6b96-4728-8975-732cd13f0a59\', \'multiverseId\': 418031}, \'multiverseid\': 418031}, {\'name\': \'活化模塊\', \'text\': \'每當在一個由你操控的永久物上放置一個或數個+1/+1指示物時，你可以支付{1}。若你如此作，則派出一個1/1無色自動機衍生神器生物。\\n{3}，{T}：選擇目標永久物或玩家上的一個指示物。該永久物或玩家得到另一個該種類的指示物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'設計推進展。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d29eb29-b8e2-47ea-8521-ae4c70300e6f\', \'multiverseId\': 418295}, \'multiverseid\': 418295}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anstürmende Balliste\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Anstürmende Balliste angreift, fügt sie einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\nBemannen 3 (Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 3 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418561&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d440121b-3cd7-4498-ad34-673799509270\', \'multiverseId\': 418561}, \'multiverseid\': 418561}, {\'name\': \'Balista de guerra\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la Balista de guerra ataque, hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\\nTripular 3. (Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 3 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'315c2ccf-41a0-4e39-850c-418dbbfc6c7e\', \'multiverseId\': 420409}, \'multiverseid\': 420409}, {\'name\': \'Chargeur à baliste\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Chargeur à baliste attaque, il inflige 1 blessure à une cible, créature ou joueur.\\nPilotage 3 (Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 3 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : véhicule\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418825&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b90b0326-3b5e-44bd-a1de-7a2546769c70\', \'multiverseId\': 418825}, \'multiverseid\': 418825}, {\'name\': "Balista d\'Assalto", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta la Balista d\'Assalto attacca, infligge 1 danno a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\\nManovrare 3 (TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 3: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.)", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'117f74b4-e88b-49ec-938d-ecd20f14ebd3\', \'multiverseId\': 419089}, \'multiverseid\': 419089}, {\'name\': \'バリスタ突撃車\', \'text\': \'バリスタ突撃車が攻撃するたび、クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。バリスタ突撃車はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\\n搭乗３（あなたがコントロールする望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が３以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7213eb99-128e-4600-95c5-9a201b6199cf\', \'multiverseId\': 419353}, \'multiverseid\': 419353}, {\'name\': \'노포 돌격차\', \'text\': \'노포 돌격차가 공격할 때마다, 생물이나 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 노포 돌격차는 그 목표에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\\n탑승 3 (당신이 조종하는 생물을 공격력 총합이 3 이상이 되도록 원하는 수만큼 탭한다: 이 탑승물은 턴종료까지 마법물체 생물이 된다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 탑승물\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb1f8b49-1445-4cd4-a6c5-a7286897246a\', \'multiverseId\': 419617}, \'multiverseid\': 419617}, {\'name\': \'Balista de Ataque\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Balista de Ataque ataca, ela causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.\\nTripular 3 (Vire qualquer número de criaturas que você controla com total de poder igual ou superior a 3: Este Veículo se torna uma criatura artefato até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Veículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fa215d9-a212-425d-be8f-e537ef5aae25\', \'multiverseId\': 419881}, \'multiverseid\': 419881}, {\'name\': \'Штурмовая Баллиста\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Штурмовая Баллиста атакует, она наносит 1 повреждение целевому существу или игроку.\\nЭкипаж 3 (Поверните любое количество существ под вашим контролем с суммарной силой 3 или более: эта Машина становится артефактом существом до конца хода.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Машина\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'901843f5-362f-4305-9879-19a0658beeaf\', \'multiverseId\': 420145}, \'multiverseid\': 420145}, {\'name\': \'巨弩冲锋车\', \'text\': \'每当巨弩冲锋车攻击时，它对目标生物或牌手造成1点伤害。\\n搭载3（横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于3的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'神器～载具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d426fb00-66aa-4f4e-8baf-1bbaa63ba6cd\', \'multiverseId\': 418033}, \'multiverseid\': 418033}, {\'name\': \'巨弩衝鋒車\', \'text\': \'每當巨弩衝鋒車攻擊時，它對目標生物或玩家造成1點傷害。\\n搭載3（橫置任意數量由你操控且力量總和等於或大於3的生物：此載具成為神器生物直到回合結束。）\', \'type\': \'神器～載具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5a3ff06-e254-453e-ae45-166afd28be5a\', \'multiverseId\': 418297}, \'multiverseid\': 418297}]', '[{\'name\': \'Appetit auf Unnatürliches\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl. Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich an deiner Stelle würde es dem Affen überlassen. Dein Apparat ist ersetzbar, was man von deinen Fingern nicht behaupten kann." —Turni, Grünviertel-Landbewahrer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418506&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f0ea605-7603-4de4-ac0a-84922dfb9b5e\', \'multiverseId\': 418506}, \'multiverseid\': 418506}, {\'name\': \'Apetito por lo artificial\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo. Ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Yo que tú, dejaría que el mono se lo comiese. Siempre puedes fabricar otro, pero no se puede decir lo mismo de tus dedos". —Turni, cuidador de Discoverde\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc0372d3-63f9-4e2f-950f-c21e5189c48b\', \'multiverseId\': 420354}, \'multiverseid\': 420354}, {\'name\': "Envie d\'artificiel", \'text\': "Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé ou l\'enchantement ciblé. Vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« À votre place, je laisserais le singe le manger. Vous pourrez toujours en fabriquer un autre, mais remplacer vos doigts ne sera pas si aisé. » —Turni, gardien des terres de la Roue Verdoyante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418770&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e2e4491-4c78-4b15-8684-4540444ed6aa\', \'multiverseId\': 418770}, \'multiverseid\': 418770}, {\'name\': "Appetito per l\'Innaturale", \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio. Guadagni 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se fossi in te, lo lascerei alla scimmia. Può sempre essere ricostruito, a differenza delle tue dita." —Thurny, guardiano di Verderuota\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29659fb1-2b21-4dc0-b810-0abc8a68329b\', \'multiverseId\': 419034}, \'multiverseid\': 419034}, {\'name\': \'人工物への興味\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「私なら、あれは猿にやっちまうね。あれをもう一つ作るのは簡単でも、あんたの指はそうじゃない。」 ――緑輪地区の番人、ターニ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b54ec5ad-e58f-465e-b335-ed7bb0fa8b8f\', \'multiverseId\': 419298}, \'multiverseid\': 419298}, {\'name\': \'기이한 식욕\', \'text\': \'마법물체 또는 부여마법을 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 파괴한다. 당신은 생명 2점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"제가 당신이라면 원숭이가 그걸 가지도록 두겠습니다. 다른 것을 또 만들면 되지만, 당신 손가락은 다시 만들 수 없으니까요." —녹림지구 대지수호자 투르니\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40389089-9878-4db9-b3fa-3887e6041ed8\', \'multiverseId\': 419562}, \'multiverseid\': 419562}, {\'name\': \'Apetite pelo Antinatural\', \'text\': \'Destrua o artefato ou encantamento alvo. Você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu simplesmente deixaria o macaco ficar com isso se eu fosse você. Você pode fazer outro, mas não se pode dizer o mesmo dos seus dedos." — Turni, zelador da Rodaverde\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7412d8b8-4fd2-4cec-a5cc-ea6bbf3fdc43\', \'multiverseId\': 419826}, \'multiverseid\': 419826}, {\'name\': \'Вкус к Неестественному\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевой артефакт или чары. Вы получаете 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«На твоем месте я бы отдал это мартышке. Диковинок ты еще наделаешь, а вот пальцы — вряд ли». — Тарни, сторож Зеленого Круга\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10017971-2d8e-466d-99ea-b638d0d90970\', \'multiverseId\': 420090}, \'multiverseid\': 420090}, {\'name\': \'违天胃口\', \'text\': \'消灭目标神器或结界。你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「换作我，就会任那猴子抢去。东西能重做，但手指不会重生。」 ～绿环区管理员图尼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffd35816-a753-4670-8064-9de01eb824a3\', \'multiverseId\': 417978}, \'multiverseid\': 417978}, {\'name\': \'違天胃口\', \'text\': \'消滅目標神器或結界。你獲得2點生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「換作我，就會任那猴子搶去。東西能重做，但手指不會重生。」 ～綠環區管理員圖尼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38538605-f5d3-49b6-a1f9-cbe76b35d141\', \'multiverseId\': 418242}, \'multiverseid\': 418242}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aradara-Express\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\nBemannen 4 (Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 4 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': \'Er gleitet durch die Stadt, eine erhabene Kombination aus Eleganz und Nutzen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418560&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4d11e1e-236d-4a29-9fad-d5ea424c57da\', \'multiverseId\': 418560}, \'multiverseid\': 418560}, {\'name\': \'Exprés de Aradara\', \'text\': \'Amenaza.\\nTripular 4. (Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 4 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': \'Se desliza por toda la ciudad en una combinación sublime de elegancia y utilidad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d16ba4f7-5f52-4c9a-975b-0ac85fccf773\', \'multiverseId\': 420408}, \'multiverseid\': 420408}, {\'name\': "Express d\'Aradara", \'text\': "Menace\\nPilotage 4 (Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 4 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : véhicule\', \'flavor\': \'Il parcourt la ville, alliant merveilleusement élégance et praticité.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418824&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08ec7578-addc-4447-98c5-cdc8f7c63a60\', \'multiverseId\': 418824}, \'multiverseid\': 418824}, {\'name\': \'Espresso di Aradara\', \'text\': \'Minacciare\\nManovrare 4 (TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 4: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': \'Scivola sinuoso intorno alla città, sublime combinazione di eleganza e funzionalità.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bd8d8ff-5fb2-4d3c-8190-a6f17e401b84\', \'multiverseId\': 419088}, \'multiverseid\': 419088}, {\'name\': \'アラダラ急行\', \'text\': \'威迫\\n搭乗４（あなたがコントロールする望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が４以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': \'市内を滑るように走る。気品と利便性の見事な融合である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb79da33-9505-4f82-bd79-0ffd8ad7a91e\', \'multiverseId\': 419352}, \'multiverseid\': 419352}, {\'name\': \'아라다라 고속열차\', \'text\': \'호전적\\n탑승 4 (당신이 조종하는 생물을 공격력 총합이 4 이상이 되도록 원하는 수만큼 탭한다: 이 탑승물은 턴종료까지 마법물체 생물이 된다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 탑승물\', \'flavor\': \'도시를 누비는 이 열차는 우아함과 유용성의 절묘한 조화를 이루고 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99d6d544-a2f4-4cdf-a8cc-9afd1842ac62\', \'multiverseId\': 419616}, \'multiverseid\': 419616}, {\'name\': \'Expresso de Aradara\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar\\nTripular 4 (Vire qualquer número de criaturas que você controla com total de poder igual ou superior a 4: Este Veículo torna-se uma criatura artefato até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Veículo\', \'flavor\': \'Ele flutua pela cidade, uma combinação sublime de elegância e utilidade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419880&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e26cd718-3064-439d-9ed4-e43174b1ac2f\', \'multiverseId\': 419880}, \'multiverseid\': 419880}, {\'name\': \'Арадарский Экспресс\', \'text\': \'Угроза\\nЭкипаж 4 (Поверните любое количество существ под вашим контролем с суммарной силой 4 или более: эта Машина становится артефактом существом до конца хода.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Машина\', \'flavor\': \'Он скользит по городским улицам — безупречное сочетание изящества и практичности.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90ef6769-6f23-44d3-99fd-c3f30587781c\', \'multiverseId\': 420144}, \'multiverseid\': 420144}, {\'name\': \'厄勒德拉特快\', \'text\': \'威慑\\n搭载4（横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于4的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'神器～载具\', \'flavor\': \'特快列车在城市中飞速穿行，华美车身典雅外观与实用设计兼具。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62f2d9b6-09c5-45fc-8ba6-bfd01bd3a129\', \'multiverseId\': 418032}, \'multiverseid\': 418032}, {\'name\': \'厄勒德拉特快\', \'text\': \'威懾\\n搭載4（橫置任意數量由你操控且力量總和等於或大於4的生物：此載具成為神器生物直到回合結束。）\', \'type\': \'神器～載具\', \'flavor\': \'特快列車在城市中飛速穿行，華美車身典雅外觀與實用設計兼具。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b4212e0-dd82-4ca0-b6e5-234f7f89fbcb\', \'multiverseId\': 418296}, \'multiverseid\': 418296}]', '[{\'name\': \'Architektin der Ungezähmten\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E} (eine Energiemarke).\\nBezahle {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}: Erzeuge einen 6/6 farblosen Bestie-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Handwerker, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'Verglichen mit ihren Schöpfungen sieht das Leben wie eine billige Kopie aus.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418508&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3a77812-4aef-424d-84e2-9d894d13e574\', \'multiverseId\': 418508}, \'multiverseid\': 418508}, {\'name\': \'Arquitecta de lo indomable\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, obtienes {E} (un contador de energía).\\nPagar {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}: Crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Bestia incolora 6/6.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida artífice elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Comparada con sus diseños, la vida parece una pálida imitación.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82f38024-d92f-4428-816e-debc9363d899\', \'multiverseId\': 420356}, \'multiverseid\': 420356}, {\'name\': \'Architecte de la sauvagerie\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous gagnez {E} (un marqueur « énergie »).\\nPayez {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E} : Créez un jeton de créature-artefact 6/6 incolore Bête.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et artificier et druide\', \'flavor\': "La vie n\'est qu\'une pâle copie de son travail.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418772&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf436758-7c33-4178-aae3-1a9368e085af\', \'multiverseId\': 418772}, \'multiverseid\': 418772}, {\'name\': \'Architetta degli Indomabili\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, ottieni {E} (un segnalino energia).\\nPaga {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}: Crea una pedina creatura artefatto Bestia 6/6 incolore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Artefice Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Paragonata alle sue creazioni, la vita stessa sembra una banale imitazione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4991118d-5c4c-44ea-b424-a37d27d33eb5\', \'multiverseId\': 419036}, \'multiverseid\': 419036}, {\'name\': \'獣性を築く者\', \'text\': \'土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは{E}（エネルギー・カウンター１個）を得る。\\n{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}を支払う：無色の６/６のビースト・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・工匠・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'彼女の生み出したものに比べれば、生命など出来の悪い模倣品にしか見えない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0ec59e5-ee09-4372-9c4d-feddf7f324d6\', \'multiverseId\': 419300}, \'multiverseid\': 419300}, {\'name\': \'야생의 건축가\', \'text\': \'대지가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신은 {E}(에너지 카운터 한 개)를 얻는다.\\n{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}를 지불한다: 6/6 무색 야수 마법물체 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 기능공 드루이드\', \'flavor\': \'그녀의 디자인 앞에서는 생명체가 조잡한 모조품처럼 느껴진다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'059bb9ff-9969-465e-bca5-61c2ec87fed7\', \'multiverseId\': 419564}, \'multiverseid\': 419564}, {\'name\': \'Arquiteta dos Indomados\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você recebe {E} (um marcador de energia).\\nPague {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}: Crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 6/6 do tipo Besta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Artesão Druida\', \'flavor\': \'Perto de seus projetos, a vida parece uma pálida imitação.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad4ff2e5-dd93-495a-98d7-06d52ff46696\', \'multiverseId\': 419828}, \'multiverseid\': 419828}, {\'name\': \'Архитектор Неукрощенных\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы получаете {E} (один жетон энергии).\\nЗаплатите {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}: создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 6/6 бесцветный Зверь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Механик Друид\', \'flavor\': \'Рядом с ее произведениями жизнь кажется жалкой имитацией.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df9b0483-d321-4890-9f61-e45e5c0566ee\', \'multiverseId\': 420092}, \'multiverseid\': 420092}, {\'name\': \'野地筑师\', \'text\': \'每当一个地在你操控下进战场时，你得到{E}（一个能量指示物）。\\n支付{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}：派出一个6/6无色野兽衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／神器师／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'与她的设计品相比，活物也相形见绌。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'400e24a6-b0ef-4614-bdc2-4c5dde982e62\', \'multiverseId\': 417980}, \'multiverseid\': 417980}, {\'name\': \'野地築師\', \'text\': \'每當一個地在你的操控下進戰場時，你得到{E}（一個能量指示物）。\\n支付{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}：派出一個6/6無色野獸衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／神器師／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'與她的設計品相比，活物也相形見絀。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14060e17-92b0-4334-918d-61e5dc553f9b\', \'multiverseId\': 418244}, \'multiverseid\': 418244}]', '[{\'name\': \'Asservatenkammer\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {C}.\\n{4}, {T}, opfere die Asservatenkammer: Lege die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof. Dann kannst du eine Artefaktkarte aus deinem Friedhof oben auf deine Bibliothek legen.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418613&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91c3d954-1a5c-454e-9d10-063b2e691a91\', \'multiverseId\': 418613}, \'multiverseid\': 418613}, {\'name\': \'Alijo abandonado\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{4}, {T}, sacrificar el Alijo abandonado: Pon las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio. Luego puedes poner una carta de artefacto de tu cementerio en la parte superior de tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce4472cd-157b-45e5-87d8-16645afbad4e\', \'multiverseId\': 420461}, \'multiverseid\': 420461}, {\'name\': \'Réserve séquestrée\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C} à votre réserve.\\n{4}, {T}, sacrifiez la Réserve séquestrée : Mettez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière. Vous pouvez ensuite mettre une carte d\'artefact depuis votre cimetière au-dessus de votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418877&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b72065f-d670-4f88-9f94-83ebdadd0034\', \'multiverseId\': 418877}, \'multiverseid\': 418877}, {\'name\': \'Scorta Sequestrata\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{4}, {T}, Sacrifica la Scorta Sequestrata: Metti nel tuo cimitero le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio. Poi puoi mettere una carta artefatto dal tuo cimitero in cima al tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e08dbbc-6d13-4600-bfc2-b5f721498edb\', \'multiverseId\': 419141}, \'multiverseid\': 419141}, {\'name\': \'隔絶した隠し場所\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{C}を加える。\\n{4}, {T}, 隔絶した隠し場所を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを５枚あなたの墓地に置く。その後あなたはあなたの墓地からアーティファクト・カード１枚をあなたのライブラリーの一番上に置いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30470ad6-7165-4956-9c78-707bcc7a5f1f\', \'multiverseId\': 419405}, \'multiverseid\': 419405}, {\'name\': \'숨겨진 보관고\', \'text\': \'{T}: {C}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\\n{4}, {T}, 숨겨진 보관고를 희생한다: 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 다섯 장을 당신의 무덤에 넣는다. 그 후 당신은 당신의 무덤에 있는 마법물체 카드 한 장을 당신의 서고 맨 위에 올려놓을 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b5fda13-a472-4d3e-8219-e662e873ebb5\', \'multiverseId\': 419669}, \'multiverseid\': 419669}, {\'name\': \'Estoque Confiscado\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C} à sua reserva de mana.\\n{4}, {T}, Sacrifique Estoque Confiscado: Coloque os cinco cards do topo de seu grimório em seu cemitério. Em seguida, você pode colocar um card de artefato de seu cemitério no topo de seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f533956-8815-4ef7-af63-c739bb628bd3\', \'multiverseId\': 419933}, \'multiverseid\': 419933}, {\'name\': \'Запрятанный Тайник\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C} в ваше хранилище маны.\\n{4}, {T}, пожертвуйте Запрятанный Тайник: положите пять верхних карт вашей библиотеки на ваше кладбище. Затем вы можете положить карту артефакта с вашего кладбища на верх вашей библиотеки.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a86daac-7a2a-4e80-94f9-7f9b6b8c70bb\', \'multiverseId\': 420197}, \'multiverseid\': 420197}, {\'name\': \'僻静匿所\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}到你的法术力池中。\\n{4}，{T}，牺牲僻静匿所：将你牌库顶的五张牌置入你的坟墓场。然后你可以将一张神器牌从你的坟墓场置于你的牌库顶。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09760b42-2a1b-4918-9f39-6ae269aae87b\', \'multiverseId\': 418085}, \'multiverseid\': 418085}, {\'name\': \'僻靜匿所\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}到你的魔法力池中。\\n{4}，{T}，犧牲僻靜匿所：將你牌庫頂的五張牌置入你的墳墓場。然後你可以將一張神器牌從你的墳墓場置於你的牌庫頂。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f924b06-8984-48b7-9663-29eccff7708d\', \'multiverseId\': 418349}, \'multiverseid\': 418349}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auenwaldtiger\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn der Auenwaldtiger ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E}{E} (zwei Energiemarken).\\nImmer wenn der Auenwaldtiger angreift, kannst du {E}{E} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erhält er +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418532&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66e5c617-bb9f-43b8-ada9-dc94ce89c932\', \'multiverseId\': 418532}, \'multiverseid\': 418532}, {\'name\': \'Tigre ribereño\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nCuando el Tigre ribereño entre al campo de batalla, obtienes {E}{E} (dos contadores de energía).\\nSiempre que el Tigre ribereño ataque, puedes pagar {E}{E}. Si lo haces, obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b4b1180-cc94-4cfc-b44d-a4bda3bf68f9\', \'multiverseId\': 420380}, \'multiverseid\': 420380}, {\'name\': \'Tigre riverain\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nQuand le Tigre riverain arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez {E}{E} (deux marqueurs « énergie »).\\nÀ chaque fois que le Tigre riverain attaque, vous pouvez payer {E}{E}. Si vous faites ainsi, il gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418796&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'134b5da0-f51f-4ee7-a5b6-74bf21bb3b4b\', \'multiverseId\': 418796}, \'multiverseid\': 418796}, {\'name\': \'Tigre delle Rive\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nQuando la Tigre delle Rive entra nel campo di battaglia, ottieni {E}{E} (due segnalini energia).\\nOgniqualvolta la Tigre delle Rive attacca, puoi pagare {E}{E}. Se lo fai, prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65a99b93-38aa-435b-8b94-c863c3fb39cf\', \'multiverseId\': 419060}, \'multiverseid\': 419060}, {\'name\': \'水辺の虎\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n水辺の虎が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター２個）を得る。\\n水辺の虎が攻撃するたび、あなたは{E}{E}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、ターン終了時まで、これは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1191b80f-e01b-4df8-8c89-d087c22ad1f9\', \'multiverseId\': 419324}, \'multiverseid\': 419324}, {\'name\': \'물가의 호랑이\', \'text\': \'돌진\\n물가의 호랑이가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 {E}{E}(에너지 카운터 두 개)를 얻는다.\\n물가의 호랑이가 공격할 때마다, 당신은 {E}{E}를 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 물가의 호랑이는 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8842f54-df38-4a79-8cf9-d5acfdc35f89\', \'multiverseId\': 419588}, \'multiverseid\': 419588}, {\'name\': \'Tigre Ripariano\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nQuando Tigre Ripariano entra no campo de batalha, você recebe {E}{E} (dois marcadores de energia).\\nToda vez que Tigre Ripariano ataca, você pode pagar {E}{E}. Se fizer isso, ele receberá +2/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'759d1904-e2cc-4a39-bffc-6641ee8620c1\', \'multiverseId\': 419852}, \'multiverseid\': 419852}, {\'name\': \'Береговой Тигр\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nКогда Береговой Тигр выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете {E}{E} (два жетона энергии).\\nКаждый раз, когда Береговой Тигр атакует, вы можете заплатить {E}{E}. Если вы это делаете, он получает +2/+2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c0faaff-bfe6-48d2-95d6-ff6dee4c79a0\', \'multiverseId\': 420116}, \'multiverseid\': 420116}, {\'name\': \'水滨虎\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n当水滨虎进战场时，你得到{E}{E}（两个能量指示物）。\\n每当水滨虎攻击时，你可以支付{E}{E}。若你如此作，则它得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～猫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5cf7a6d-683c-43a4-a646-fcc0a0430e26\', \'multiverseId\': 418004}, \'multiverseid\': 418004}, {\'name\': \'水濱虎\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n當水濱虎進戰場時，你得到{E}{E}（兩個能量指示物）。\\n每當水濱虎攻擊時，你可以支付{E}{E}。若你如此作，它得+2/+2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～貓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a015d379-65ab-4f75-98aa-d8c98129ec89\', \'multiverseId\': 418268}, \'multiverseid\': 418268}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufblühende Verteidigung\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält +2/+2 und Fluchsicherheit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Diejenigen, die eins mit dem Ätherfluss sind, vermögen die Macht der Natur zu kanalisieren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418511&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b672bc6b-829f-4d61-a8a8-b0c01bc6de5f\', \'multiverseId\': 418511}, \'multiverseid\': 418511}, {\'name\': \'Defensa floreciente\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +2/+2 y gana la habilidad de antimaleficio hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Aquellos que se desplazan en armonía con las estelas de éter pueden canalizar el poder del mundo natural.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4168da72-a78a-4356-b9a9-1a54f96d3bd3\', \'multiverseId\': 420359}, \'multiverseid\': 420359}, {\'name\': \'Défense en essor\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +2/+2 et acquiert la défense talismanique jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Ceux qui se déplacent en toute harmonie avec le flux de l\'Éther peuvent canaliser le pouvoir du monde naturel.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418775&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a2f28b7-f3c1-4026-9840-2fed75128b77\', \'multiverseId\': 418775}, \'multiverseid\': 418775}, {\'name\': \'Difesa Sbocciata\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +2/+2 e ha anti-malocchio fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Chi si muove in armonia con i flussi dell\'etere può imbrigliare la forza del mondo naturale.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95608b7d-583d-4530-9bd0-d061690d0da2\', \'multiverseId\': 419039}, \'multiverseid\': 419039}, {\'name\': \'顕在的防御\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋２の修整を受けるとともに呪禁を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'霊気の流れと調和して動く者は自然界の力を呼び寄せる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f48f727-2c13-4f26-9077-2e4cb53c9bfa\', \'multiverseId\': 419303}, \'multiverseid\': 419303}, {\'name\': \'화려한 방어\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받고 방호를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'에테르의 흐름과 조화를 이루면서 이동하는 자들은 자연계의 힘을 사용할 수 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c7b398d-9e5e-464a-b7a8-ef9e2340b86f\', \'multiverseId\': 419567}, \'multiverseid\': 419567}, {\'name\': \'Defesa Florescente\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo que você controla recebe +2/+2 e ganha resistência a magia até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Os que se movem em harmonia com o fluxo do éter podem canalizar o poder do mundo natural.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa3ea86c-3d4a-4c94-abd7-39986011a664\', \'multiverseId\': 419831}, \'multiverseid\': 419831}, {\'name\': \'Расцвет Обороны\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо под вашим контролем получает +2/+2 и Порчеустойчивость до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Те, кто движется в гармонии с потоком эфира, могут черпать силы самой природы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72333bb9-fe3c-4273-bc23-8bb71eed8e7a\', \'multiverseId\': 420095}, \'multiverseid\': 420095}, {\'name\': \'防御全开\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标由你操控的生物得+2/+2且获得辟邪异能。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'在乙太流中自在行动的人能够引导自然界的力量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ca424dc-b0bd-43eb-afc6-55aa88dfa0e5\', \'multiverseId\': 417983}, \'multiverseid\': 417983}, {\'name\': \'防禦全開\', \'text\': \'直到回合結束，目標由你操控的生物得+2/+2且獲得辟邪異能。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'在乙太流中自在行動的人能夠引導自然界的力量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b387a1e9-7748-45e1-89ce-818e716d29ab\', \'multiverseId\': 418247}, \'multiverseid\': 418247}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgewählt zur Inspektion\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine getappte Kreatur deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück. Hellsicht 1. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418428&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12389e1e-011e-4852-b64c-3505822a2993\', \'multiverseId\': 418428}, \'multiverseid\': 418428}, {\'name\': \'Seleccionar para inspección\', \'text\': \'Regresa la criatura objetivo girada a la mano de su propietario. Adivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd580c6f-6659-450e-b766-79899bdec78e\', \'multiverseId\': 420276}, \'multiverseid\': 420276}, {\'name\': "Sélection pour l\'inspection", \'text\': \'Renvoyez une créature engagée ciblée dans la main de son propriétaire. Regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la mettre au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418692&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a6351d1-4319-4de5-9794-0fee6a85eb25\', \'multiverseId\': 418692}, \'multiverseid\': 418692}, {\'name\': "Selezionare per l\'Ispezione", \'text\': \'Fai tornare una creatura TAPpata bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario. Profetizza 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere quella carta in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c6c4419-3023-41bb-bea0-2c3475a38aae\', \'multiverseId\': 418956}, \'multiverseid\': 418956}, {\'name\': \'抜き取り検査\', \'text\': \'タップ状態のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'903b23a3-f4f6-4661-b996-05230daae834\', \'multiverseId\': 419220}, \'multiverseid\': 419220}, {\'name\': \'검사 대상 선택\', \'text\': \'탭된 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다. 점술 1을 한다. (당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 한 장을 본다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0eec0610-1719-4614-99a5-da29927b1dd0\', \'multiverseId\': 419484}, \'multiverseid\': 419484}, {\'name\': \'Selecionar para Inspeção\', \'text\': \'Devolva a criatura virada alvo para a mão de seu dono. Vidência 1. (Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar aquele card no fundo de seu grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8acd8931-6596-46de-ad28-4b6a2abb4142\', \'multiverseId\': 419748}, \'multiverseid\': 419748}, {\'name\': \'Выборочная Проверка\', \'text\': \'Верните целевое повернутое существо в руку его владельца. Предскажите 1. (Посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить ту карту в низ вашей библиотеки.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03dc99e9-771f-4d8d-b6b3-0ead16324f30\', \'multiverseId\': 420012}, \'multiverseid\': 420012}, {\'name\': \'挑出检验\', \'text\': \'将目标已横置的生物移回其拥有者手上。占卜1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83878386-4d21-4f2c-8e38-bb74ec82a7b7\', \'multiverseId\': 417900}, \'multiverseid\': 417900}, {\'name\': \'挑出檢驗\', \'text\': \'將目標已橫置的生物移回其擁有者手上。占卜1。（檢視你牌庫頂的牌。你可以將該牌置於你的牌庫底。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fed4616-5e76-44ac-9ba0-45a34923caf7\', \'multiverseId\': 418164}, \'multiverseid\': 418164}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausräuchern\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen. Du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt für jede auf diese Weise zerstörte Kreatur dazu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ghirapurs Gremlin-Population stellt eine Gefahr für die Infrastruktur des Messeplatzes dar. Gefahren müssen eliminiert werden." —Sram, Leitender Konstrukteur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418380&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5e6f6f7-e383-4d89-b755-8d0c15808c13\', \'multiverseId\': 418380}, \'multiverseid\': 418380}, {\'name\': \'Fumigar\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas. Ganas 1 vida por cada criatura destruida de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"La población de gremlins de Ghirapur supone una amenaza para la infraestructura de la feria. Y las amenazas deben ser erradicadas". —Sram, edificador experto\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4a83364-9e34-42ef-95b7-6d806f2d5eba\', \'multiverseId\': 420228}, \'multiverseid\': 420228}, {\'name\': \'Fumigation\', \'text\': \'Détruisez toutes les créatures. Vous gagnez 1 point de vie pour chaque créature détruite de cette manière.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« La population de gremlins de Ghirapur menace les infrastructures de la foire. Et les menaces doivent être éliminées. » —Sram, chef édificateur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418644&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62af7d2c-65cd-433d-992c-29d77a91d452\', \'multiverseId\': 418644}, \'multiverseid\': 418644}, {\'name\': \'Fumigare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature. Guadagni 1 punto vita per ogni creatura distrutta in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"La popolazione di gremlin di Ghirapur costituisce un fattore di rischio per le infrastrutture della Fiera. Ogni rischio deve essere eliminato." —Sram, edificatore capo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b11248f-a570-4204-9d22-da7c42d90cd2\', \'multiverseId\': 418908}, \'multiverseid\': 418908}, {\'name\': \'燻蒸\', \'text\': \'すべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。これにより破壊されたクリーチャー１体につき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「ギラプールのグレムリン個体数は博覧会場の基盤に対する脅威となる。脅威は取り除くべきだ。」 ――上級建設官、スラム\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfff6013-d4b7-4413-ad83-2785313d537f\', \'multiverseId\': 419172}, \'multiverseid\': 419172}, {\'name\': \'소독\', \'text\': \'모든 생물을 파괴한다. 당신은 이렇게 파괴된 생물 한 개당 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"기라푸르의 그렘린들이 박람회장의 기반 시설들을 위협하고 있어. 이 위협은 반드시 제거되어야 하네." —수석 건축가 스람\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ffeadc4-fc82-4076-a696-43d7cd35f08f\', \'multiverseId\': 419436}, \'multiverseid\': 419436}, {\'name\': \'Fumigar\', \'text\': \'Destrua todas as criaturas. Você ganha 1 ponto de vida para cada criatura destruída dessa forma.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"A população de gremlins de Ghirapur representa uma ameaça à infraestrutura do parque da Feira. As ameaças devem ser eliminadas." — Sram, edificador sênior\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5eb4b188-950f-4b23-900c-b2e206178715\', \'multiverseId\': 419700}, \'multiverseid\': 419700}, {\'name\': \'Фумигация\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте все существа. Вы получаете 1 жизнь за каждое существо, уничтоженное таким образом.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Популяция гремлинов в Гирапуре угрожает безопасности инфраструктуры Ярмарки. А угрозы необходимо устранять». — старший градостроитель Эсрам\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'600bef3f-1f8d-4a93-ad2d-f1017a260546\', \'multiverseId\': 419964}, \'multiverseid\': 419964}, {\'name\': \'熏灭\', \'text\': \'消灭所有生物。每以此法消灭一个生物，你便获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「吉拉波的怪灵数量已对展区的基础建设造成威胁。而威胁必得消灭。」 ～资深建筑师斯勒姆\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9e573bb-00f3-4d7e-80d5-8ab5973e4157\', \'multiverseId\': 417852}, \'multiverseid\': 417852}, {\'name\': \'熏滅\', \'text\': \'消滅所有生物。每以此法消滅一個生物，你便獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「吉拉波的怪靈數量已對展區的基礎建設造成威脅。而威脅必得消滅。」 ～資深建築師斯勒姆\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60a74e65-2e85-40f3-9516-a6862c493854\', \'multiverseId\': 418116}, \'multiverseid\': 418116}]', '[{\'name\': \'Autorität der Konsuln\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, kommen getappt ins Spiel.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur unter der Kontrolle eines Gegners ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Die Einwohner können tun, wie es ihnen beliebt, solange sie die Gesetze des Konsulats nicht übertreten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418370&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eddd869f-3a27-4767-bd68-8d0cf71fcffa\', \'multiverseId\': 418370}, \'multiverseid\': 418370}, {\'name\': \'Autoridad de los cónsules\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlan tus oponentes entran al campo de batalla giradas.\\nSiempre que una criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo el control de un oponente, ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Los ciudadanos pueden hacer lo que deseen... dentro de lo estipulado por las leyes del Consulado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a2dfc2c-381b-4c8f-a3f7-cbce0f3315e6\', \'multiverseId\': 420218}, \'multiverseid\': 420218}, {\'name\': \'Autorité des consuls\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle d\'un adversaire, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Les citoyens sont libres d\'agir comme bon leur semble, dans les limites de la loi du Consulat.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418634&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b148af94-1c12-4bb3-b5ea-5432fb7d5838\', \'multiverseId\': 418634}, \'multiverseid\': 418634}, {\'name\': \'Autorità dei Consoli\', \'text\': \'Le creature controllate dai tuoi avversari entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il controllo di un avversario, guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'I cittadini sono liberi di agire come credono, purché entro i limiti dettati dalle leggi consolari.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d7bfcc5-3b43-4676-bd52-e0b098e280cd\', \'multiverseId\': 418898}, \'multiverseid\': 418898}, {\'name\': \'領事の権限\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャーはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nクリーチャーが１体対戦相手のコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'市民にはしたいことをする自由がある。領事府の法が許す範囲で、だが。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6a8a336-23c2-4c19-8103-ba2821da8966\', \'multiverseId\': 419162}, \'multiverseid\': 419162}, {\'name\': \'영사의 권위\', \'text\': \'당신의 상대가 조종하는 생물들은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n생물이 상대의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'시민들은 영사관에서 정한 법 한도 내에서 무엇이든 할 수 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5954071-9943-461b-9e5b-cc26a9f3bd5a\', \'multiverseId\': 419426}, \'multiverseid\': 419426}, {\'name\': \'Autoridade dos Cônsules\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que seus oponentes controlam entram no campo de batalha viradas.\\nToda vez que uma criatura entra no campo de batalha sob o controle de um oponente, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Os cidadãos são livres para fazer o que quiserem, desde que respeitem os limites das leis do Consulado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d794863-863f-4978-ada7-248e69bab1ec\', \'multiverseId\': 419690}, \'multiverseid\': 419690}, {\'name\': \'Власть Консулов\', \'text\': \'Существа под контролем ваших оппонентов выходят на поле битвы повернутыми.\\nКаждый раз, когда существо выходит на поле битвы под контролем оппонента, вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Горожане вольны поступать, как им вздумается, — в рамках установленных Консульством законов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50f6eb06-09aa-4441-84c7-03bc77eb3d90\', \'multiverseId\': 419954}, \'multiverseid\': 419954}, {\'name\': \'执政官威权\', \'text\': \'由对手操控的生物须横置进战场。\\n每当一个生物在对手的操控下进战场时，你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'市民充分享有执政院法令范围内的各项自由。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c7e21df-bee3-409e-9a20-b6a47932d936\', \'multiverseId\': 417842}, \'multiverseid\': 417842}, {\'name\': \'執政官威權\', \'text\': \'由對手操控的生物須橫置進戰場。\\n每當一個生物在對手的操控下進戰場時，你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'市民充分享有執政院法令範圍內的各項自由。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5806a3c-edb8-40ed-a2a2-5e3dfc029d7c\', \'multiverseId\': 418106}, \'multiverseid\': 418106}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bastion-Mastodon\', \'text\': \'{W}: Das Bastion-Mastodon erhält Wachsamkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Elefant\', \'flavor\': \'Das Maschinenarsenal des Konsulats verfügt ausschließlich über die beeindruckendsten Exemplare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418562&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b391a60d-fcaf-4c4e-99fb-5fa8f8dddca3\', \'multiverseId\': 418562}, \'multiverseid\': 418562}, {\'name\': \'Mastodonte fortificado\', \'text\': \'{W}: El Mastodonte fortificado gana la habilidad de vigilancia hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Elefante\', \'flavor\': \'La reserva de autómatas del Consulado solo contiene los especímenes más impresionantes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71cc8f13-8741-4c60-9d39-c24ffaa0df2f\', \'multiverseId\': 420410}, \'multiverseid\': 420410}, {\'name\': \'Mastodonte du bastion\', \'text\': "{W} : Le Mastodonte du bastion acquiert la vigilance jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : éléphant\', \'flavor\': "La banque d\'automates du Consulat ne contient que les spécimens les plus étonnants.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418826&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c054a1e-1bdf-4b10-8853-fa6df23dbd49\', \'multiverseId\': 418826}, \'multiverseid\': 418826}, {\'name\': \'Mastodonte del Baluardo\', \'text\': \'{W}: Il Mastodonte del Baluardo ha cautela fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Elefante\', \'flavor\': \'Il deposito di automi del Consolato contiene solo gli esemplari più straordinari.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eade93e7-861b-4d30-8170-44d95343fc6a\', \'multiverseId\': 419090}, \'multiverseid\': 419090}, {\'name\': \'砦のマストドン\', \'text\': \'{W}：ターン終了時まで、砦のマストドンは警戒を得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 象\', \'flavor\': \'領事府の機械塁城にあるものは、どれも非常に印象的である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'852ae756-01db-4693-b166-44704dea5d96\', \'multiverseId\': 419354}, \'multiverseid\': 419354}, {\'name\': \'요새 마스토돈\', \'text\': \'{W}: 요새 마스토돈은 턴종료까지 경계를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 코끼리\', \'flavor\': \'영사관의 자동장치 저장고에는 가장 중요한 표본들만 보관되어 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f9899a8-a8b6-4dd5-88b3-a9854c5f420e\', \'multiverseId\': 419618}, \'multiverseid\': 419618}, {\'name\': \'Mastodonte do Bastião\', \'text\': \'{W}: Mastodonte do Bastião ganha vigilância até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Elefante\', \'flavor\': \'O banco de autômatos do Consulado contém apenas os exemplares mais impressionantes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f7e947b-a9c6-46f1-ba89-2aab5c853fe0\', \'multiverseId\': 419882}, \'multiverseid\': 419882}, {\'name\': \'Мастодонт Бастиона\', \'text\': \'{W}: Мастодонт Бастиона получает Бдительность до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Слон\', \'flavor\': \'Для хранилища автоматов Консульства отобраны лишь самые удивительные экземпляры.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd5763ff-e483-4160-bc1e-63b6fb771f5e\', \'multiverseId\': 420146}, \'multiverseid\': 420146}, {\'name\': \'堡垒乳齿象\', \'text\': \'{W}：堡垒乳齿象获得警戒异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～象\', \'flavor\': \'只有给人留下印象最深的自动机械，才能入选执政院的样本库。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffaf4850-3c81-4f4e-9792-e1c5988fc64b\', \'multiverseId\': 418034}, \'multiverseid\': 418034}, {\'name\': \'堡壘乳齒象\', \'text\': \'{W}：堡壘乳齒象獲得警戒異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～象\', \'flavor\': \'只有給人留下印象最深的自動機械，才能入選執政院的樣本庫。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b694246-8914-46b0-8ee3-454d220f5533\', \'multiverseId\': 418298}, \'multiverseid\': 418298}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baumrücken-Stampfer\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn der Baumrücken-Stampfer ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 5 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Die Macht des Äthers zieht Kreaturen wie Magnete an. Jene, die davon berührt werden, sind für immer verändert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418507&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11b341b1-a104-4521-8db5-0ed84e24a0da\', \'multiverseId\': 418507}, \'multiverseid\': 418507}, {\'name\': \'Aplastador lomofronda\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nCuando el Aplastador lomofronda entre al campo de batalla, ganas 5 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'El poder del éter atrae a las criaturas hacia sí como una fuerza magnética, y aquellos que lo rozan cambian para siempre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53b90b88-4cd3-4618-8e10-0fdae1c67894\', \'multiverseId\': 420355}, \'multiverseid\': 420355}, {\'name\': \'Piétineur à dos arboré\', \'text\': \'Piétinement\\nQuand le Piétineur à dos arboré arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 5 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "Le pouvoir de l\'Éther attire les créatures comme un aimant, et celles qu\'il touche sont altérées à jamais.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418771&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27a402c7-620b-47e4-85e6-f45788639479\', \'multiverseId\': 418771}, \'multiverseid\': 418771}, {\'name\': \'Gropparbusto Calcante\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nQuando il Gropparbusto Calcante entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 5 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': "Il potere dell\'etere esercita una forza quasi magnetica sulle creature, che ne sono attratte e trasformate irreversibilmente al contatto.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d23840a9-190f-4b2a-8367-23f65f186748\', \'multiverseId\': 419035}, \'multiverseid\': 419035}, {\'name\': \'高木背の踏みつけ\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n高木背の踏みつけが戦場に出たとき、あなたは５点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'霊気力は磁力のように生き物を引き寄せる。それに触れたものは、永久に変わってしまう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26f2899f-5521-4c11-946c-8e7f5c91a1a5\', \'multiverseId\': 419299}, \'multiverseid\': 419299}, {\'name\': \'수풀등짝 야수\', \'text\': \'돌진\\n수풀등짝 야수가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 생명 5점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 야수\', \'flavor\': \'에테르의 힘은 마치 자력처럼 생물들을 끌어 당기고, 에테르에 닿은 생물들은 영원히 바뀐다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f66850e-a226-47c3-9225-7d545b10368c\', \'multiverseId\': 419563}, \'multiverseid\': 419563}, {\'name\': \'Pisoteador Dorsoverde\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nQuando Pisoteador Dorsoverde entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 5 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'O poder do éter atrai criaturas como uma força magnética, e aquelas tocadas por ele são alteradas para sempre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98aea40e-74c3-4dc7-9622-d65cba98d021\', \'multiverseId\': 419827}, \'multiverseid\': 419827}, {\'name\': \'Древоспинный Топтун\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nКогда Древоспинный Топтун выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете 5 жизней.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'Сила эфира словно магнитом манит к себе живых существ, и те, кого она касается, преображаются навсегда.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d59c4820-12d8-40d4-88fd-70ac89cb9691\', \'multiverseId\': 420091}, \'multiverseid\': 420091}, {\'name\': \'树背跺地兽\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n当树背跺地兽进战场时，你获得5点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'乙太的力量如磁场般吸引着生物，而被触碰者会彻底变换一新。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84d69e03-c789-41ac-9ce2-b58fd79c2429\', \'multiverseId\': 417979}, \'multiverseid\': 417979}, {\'name\': \'樹背跺地獸\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n當樹背跺地獸進戰場時，你獲得5點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～野獸\', \'flavor\': \'乙太的力量如磁場般吸引著生物，而被觸碰者會徹底變換一新。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47b686c7-019f-47e3-95b6-c89220e7d897\', \'multiverseId\': 418243}, \'multiverseid\': 418243}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beeindruckendes Panorama\', \'text\': \'Das Beeindruckende Panorama kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder weniger andere Länder.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {R} oder {W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Ghirapur ist ein Leuchtfeuer der Inspiration und zieht die hellsten Geister von ganz Kaladesh an.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418611&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'302fc3ef-3e22-46ca-a518-9d96c89fba39\', \'multiverseId\': 418611}, \'multiverseid\': 418611}, {\'name\': \'Atalaya inspiradora\', \'text\': \'La Atalaya inspiradora entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles otras dos o menos tierras.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {W} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Ghirapur es un faro de inspiración que atrae a las mentes más brillantes de Kaladesh.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22cb7b82-68ed-4faa-8072-2266bed7fa90\', \'multiverseId\': 420459}, \'multiverseid\': 420459}, {\'name\': \'Point de vue exaltant\', \'text\': \'Le Point de vue exaltant arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez deux autres terrains ou moins.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W} à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Ghirapur est une lueur d\'inspiration qui attire les esprits les plus brillants de Kaladesh.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418875&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c793bcf0-b628-44c8-9a7a-08e87a24f87a\', \'multiverseId\': 418875}, \'multiverseid\': 418875}, {\'name\': \'Prospettiva Ispiratrice\', \'text\': \'La Prospettiva Ispiratrice entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli al massimo altre due terre.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {W} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Ghirapur è un faro splendente di ispirazione che attrae le menti più brillanti di Kaladesh.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76340455-1356-4679-943e-ffa1e9b76aba\', \'multiverseId\': 419139}, \'multiverseid\': 419139}, {\'name\': \'感動的な眺望所\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている他の土地が３つ以上であるかぎり、感動的な眺望所はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{R}か{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'ギラプールは発想の誘導灯である。それはカラデシュ最高の精神をひきつける。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'767084e2-dfc1-465a-aa0d-f634fc569e7c\', \'multiverseId\': 419403}, \'multiverseid\': 419403}, {\'name\': \'감동적인 전망대\', \'text\': \'감동적인 전망대는 당신이 다른 대지를 두 개 이하로 조종하지 않는 한 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{T}: {R} 또는 {W}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': \'기라푸르는 영감의 원천이며, 칼라데시의 뛰어난 발명가들을 끌어들인다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5835814-8153-473a-8583-15536ab37878\', \'multiverseId\': 419667}, \'multiverseid\': 419667}, {\'name\': \'Vantagem Inspiradora\', \'text\': \'Vantagem Inspiradora entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle dois outros terrenos ou menos.\\n{T}: Adicione {R} ou {W} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Ghirapur é um farol de inspiração, atraindo as mentes mais brilhantes de Kaladesh.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a4db480-acc2-4444-9728-0fad8c6128ee\', \'multiverseId\': 419931}, \'multiverseid\': 419931}, {\'name\': \'Вдохновляющая Высота\', \'text\': \'Вдохновляющая Высота выходит на поле битвы повернутой, если под вашим контролем есть не менее трех других земель.\\n{T}: добавьте {R} или {W} в ваше хранилище маны.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Гирапур — маяк вдохновения, зовущий к себе самые яркие умы Каладеша.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d418319f-9e30-4dde-a60a-d5fac1391bc5\', \'multiverseId\': 420195}, \'multiverseid\': 420195}, {\'name\': \'启迪胜地\', \'text\': \'除非由你操控的其他地数量为两个或更少，否则启迪胜地须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{R}或{W}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'吉拉波就是一处启迪信标，不断吸引卡拉德许最富天资的人们前来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b335fee3-9121-490e-8b2a-1a8ac6835535\', \'multiverseId\': 418083}, \'multiverseid\': 418083}, {\'name\': \'啟迪勝地\', \'text\': \'除非由你操控的其他地數量為兩個或更少，否則啟迪勝地須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{R}或{W}到你的魔法力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'吉拉波就是一處啟迪信標，不斷吸引卡拉德許最富天資的人們前來。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7b3b7ee-fbec-4f2a-82e8-7da933213788\', \'multiverseId\': 418347}, \'multiverseid\': 418347}]', "[{'name': 'Befreiende Verbrennung', 'text': 'Die Befreiende Verbrennung fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 6 Schadenspunkte zu. Du kannst deine Bibliothek und/oder deinen Friedhof nach einer Karte namens Chandra, Pyrogenie, durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Falls du auf diese Weise deine Bibliothek durchsuchst, mische sie danach.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420510&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1811280-654f-44bf-bfc7-9efc32a26b76', 'multiverseId': 420510}, 'multiverseid': 420510}, {'name': 'Combustión liberadora', 'text': 'Combustión liberadora hace 6 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo. Puedes buscar en tu biblioteca y/o cementerio una carta llamada Chandra, pirogenia, mostrarla y ponerla en tu mano. Si buscas en tu biblioteca de esta manera, barájala.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420580&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9d7693b7-8bff-46de-b47e-81bd27699da8', 'multiverseId': 420580}, 'multiverseid': 420580}, {'name': 'Combustion libératrice', 'text': 'La Combustion libératrice inflige 6 blessures à une créature ciblée. Vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque et/ou votre cimetière une carte appelée Chandra, pyrogénie, la révéler et la mettre dans votre main. Si vous avez cherché dans votre bibliothèque de cette manière, mélangez-la.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420520&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca9bea32-619e-4a57-9e92-e1dfe8b48810', 'multiverseId': 420520}, 'multiverseid': 420520}, {'name': 'Combustione Liberatrice', 'text': 'La Combustione Liberatrice infligge 6 danni a una creatura bersaglio. Puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio e/o il tuo cimitero per una carta chiamata Chandra, Pirogenio, rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Se passi in rassegna il tuo grimorio in questo modo, rimescolalo.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420530&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9438f54f-77a7-406e-927c-53f1f80d56c9', 'multiverseId': 420530}, 'multiverseid': 420530}, {'name': '解き放たれた焔', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。解き放たれた焔はそれに６点のダメージを与える。あなたはあなたのライブラリーやあなたの墓地から「紅蓮の俊英、チャンドラ」という名前のカード１枚を探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。あなたがこれによりあなたのライブラリーからカードを探したなら、それを切り直す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420540&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '979980c2-ad86-427a-861e-e68539c78461', 'multiverseId': 420540}, 'multiverseid': 420540}, {'name': '해방의 발화', 'text': '생물을 목표로 정한다. 해방의 발화는 그 생물에 피해 6점을 입힌다. 당신은 당신의 서고 그리고/또는 무덤에서 이름이 화염술의 천재 찬드라인 카드 한 장을 찾아 공개한 후 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 당신이 이런 식으로 서고를 찾아보았다면, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.', 'type': '집중마법', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420550&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e06833d-b484-4e70-ad7c-aa6014660141', 'multiverseId': 420550}, 'multiverseid': 420550}, {'name': 'Combustão Liberadora', 'text': 'Combustão Liberadora causa 6 pontos de dano à criatura alvo. Você pode procurar um card com o nome Chandra, Pirogênia, em seu grimório e/ou cemitério, revelá-lo e colocá-lo em sua mão. Se procurar em seu grimório desta maneira, embaralhe-o.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420560&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2878ca0f-b7bd-4a2e-9d21-9cfd1636a8c4', 'multiverseId': 420560}, 'multiverseid': 420560}, {'name': 'Освобождающее Пламя', 'text': 'Освобождающее Пламя наносит 6 повреждений целевому существу. Вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке и (или) на вашем кладбище карту с именем Чандра, Пирогений, показать ее и положить в вашу руку. Если вы ищете таким образом в вашей библиотеке, перетасуйте ее.', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420570&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c056e8ad-2785-4fdb-9bbf-68c5af91439b', 'multiverseId': 420570}, 'multiverseid': 420570}, {'name': '放纵烧燃', 'text': '放纵烧燃对目标生物造成6点伤害。你可以从你的牌库和／或坟墓场中搜寻一张名称为烈焰奇才茜卓的牌，展示该牌，并将它置于你手上。如果你以此法搜寻你的牌库，则将它洗牌。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420490&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c16a2dfc-e836-4d66-a801-568fecc2fc36', 'multiverseId': 420490}, 'multiverseid': 420490}, {'name': '放縱燒燃', 'text': '放縱燒燃對目標生物造成6點傷害。你可以從你的牌庫和／或墳墓場中搜尋一張名稱為烈焰奇才茜卓的牌，展示該牌，並將它置於你手上。如果你以此法搜尋你的牌庫，則將它洗牌。', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420500&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b7e67839-a032-443c-82c2-c1f7aab6b4fe', 'multiverseId': 420500}, 'multiverseid': 420500}]", "[{'name': 'Blockierende Falle', 'text': 'Die Blockierende Falle kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Blockierende Falle ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E}{E} (zwei Energiemarken).\\n{T}, bezahle {E}: Tappe eine Kreatur oder einen Planeswalker deiner Wahl. Ihre bzw. seine aktivierten Fähigkeiten können in diesem Zug nicht aktiviert werden.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418569&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f2cace6d-e484-4e62-b02c-4314fb827270', 'multiverseId': 418569}, 'multiverseid': 418569}, {'name': 'Trampa opresiva', 'text': 'La Trampa opresiva entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Trampa opresiva entre al campo de batalla, obtienes {E}{E} (dos contadores de energía).\\n{T}, pagar {E}: Gira la criatura o el planeswalker objetivo. No pueden activarse sus habilidades activadas este turno.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420417&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '68629d7e-23f5-464f-aa89-1a5d2fb97db7', 'multiverseId': 420417}, 'multiverseid': 420417}, {'name': 'Piège sans issue', 'text': 'Le Piège sans issue arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Piège sans issue arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez {E}{E} (deux marqueurs « énergie »).\\n{T}, payez {E} : Engagez la créature ciblée ou le planeswalker ciblé. Ses capacités activées ne peuvent pas être activées ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418833&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3578794b-c8c3-4247-8ffc-b2909ff1db6c', 'multiverseId': 418833}, 'multiverseid': 418833}, {'name': 'Trappola Ermetica', 'text': 'La Trappola Ermetica entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Trappola Ermetica entra nel campo di battaglia, ottieni {E}{E} (due segnalini energia).\\n{T}, Paga {E}: TAPpa una creatura o un planeswalker bersaglio. Le sue abilità attivate non possono essere attivate in questo turno.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419097&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd7073e3-4f54-4d3c-a936-d98e1023dc09', 'multiverseId': 419097}, 'multiverseid': 419097}, {'name': '行き詰まりの罠', 'text': '行き詰まりの罠はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n行き詰まりの罠が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター２個）を得る。\\n{T}, {E}を支払う：クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。このターン、それの起動型能力は起動できない。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419361&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d535057-dee4-49f4-8332-2e0a49a998d1', 'multiverseId': 419361}, 'multiverseid': 419361}, {'name': '감금 장치', 'text': '감금 장치는 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n감금 장치가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 {E}{E}(에너지 카운터 두 개)를 얻는다.\\n{T}, {E}를 지불한다: 생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 탭한다. 그 목표의 활성화능력은 이 턴에 활성화될 수 없다.', 'type': '마법물체', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419625&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '06273113-3243-4d09-9da4-753b4cf570c7', 'multiverseId': 419625}, 'multiverseid': 419625}, {'name': 'Armadilha Inescapável', 'text': 'Armadilha Inescapável entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Armadilha Inescapável entra no campo de batalha, você recebe {E}{E} (dois marcadores de energia).\\n{T}, Pague {E}: Vire a criatura ou o planeswalker alvo. Suas habilidades ativadas não podem ser ativadas neste turno.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419889&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5222d005-9d01-4cbf-9208-90984bec70df', 'multiverseId': 419889}, 'multiverseid': 419889}, {'name': 'Обездвиживающая Ловушка', 'text': 'Обездвиживающая Ловушка выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\nКогда Обездвиживающая Ловушка выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете {E}{E} (два жетона энергии).\\n{T}, заплатите {E}: поверните целевое существо или planeswalker-а. Его активируемые способности не могут быть активированы в этом ходу.', 'type': 'Артефакт', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420153&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a7dfc87-36f5-4b83-8dbd-f43e30a76bd8', 'multiverseId': 420153}, 'multiverseid': 420153}, {'name': '死锁陷阱', 'text': '死锁陷阱须横置进战场。\\n当死锁陷阱进战场时，你得到{E}{E}（两个能量指示物）。\\n{T}，支付{E}：横置目标生物或鹏洛客。本回合中其起动式异能不能起动。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418041&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd2bf0f25-ef9d-4e2a-97a8-02eaccd382ee', 'multiverseId': 418041}, 'multiverseid': 418041}, {'name': '死鎖陷阱', 'text': '死鎖陷阱須橫置進戰場。\\n當死鎖陷阱進戰場時，你得到{E}{E}（兩個能量指示物）。\\n{T}，支付{E}：橫置目標生物或鵬洛客。本回合中其起動式異能不能起動。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418305&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a64d309-4103-480d-8a59-0a7e7ede03de', 'multiverseId': 418305}, 'multiverseid': 418305}]", '[{\'name\': \'Blühendes Marschland\', \'text\': \'Das Blühende Marschland kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder weniger andere Länder.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {B} oder {G}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Ein vorübergehender Rückzug in die Natur inspiriert sogar den müdesten Erfinder.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418608&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a0cb14a-6124-4c53-8fe6-7639a05f2967\', \'multiverseId\': 418608}, \'multiverseid\': 418608}, {\'name\': \'Cenagal floreciente\', \'text\': \'El Cenagal floreciente entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles otras dos o menos tierras.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {G} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Refugiarse en la naturaleza puede inspirar al inventor más hastiado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420456&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'382b2a5d-5efd-4dea-8c25-4e8cb57dd52b\', \'multiverseId\': 420456}, \'multiverseid\': 420456}, {\'name\': \'Marécage bourgeonnant\', \'text\': \'Le Marécage bourgeonnant arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez deux autres terrains ou moins.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {G} à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Se retirer dans la nature peut inspirer même l\'inventeur le plus désabusé.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418872&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5916e8ae-baf5-436a-b12f-14b0613073e4\', \'multiverseId\': 418872}, \'multiverseid\': 418872}, {\'name\': \'Palude Fiorente\', \'text\': \'La Palude Fiorente entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli al massimo altre due terre.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {G} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Un ritiro nella natura può ispirare persino gli inventori più inariditi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c78bf14e-a691-4d4d-9fd1-c45b35659f1d\', \'multiverseId\': 419136}, \'multiverseid\': 419136}, {\'name\': \'花盛りの湿地\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている他の土地が３つ以上であるかぎり、花盛りの湿地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{B}か{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'自然の中で静養すれば、疲れ切った発明者でも着想が得られる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b182488-be9a-4356-870d-a23128d32147\', \'multiverseId\': 419400}, \'multiverseid\': 419400}, {\'name\': \'만발하는 늪지\', \'text\': \'만발하는 늪지는 당신이 다른 대지를 두 개 이하로 조종하지 않는 한 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{T}: {B} 또는 {G}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': \'자연으로 돌아가면 슬럼프에 빠진 발명가도 영감을 얻을 수 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'889e8cdf-4fe5-406c-9a83-7366a63619c4\', \'multiverseId\': 419664}, \'multiverseid\': 419664}, {\'name\': \'Charco Florescente\', \'text\': \'Charco Florescente entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle dois outros terrenos ou menos.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {G} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Um retiro na natureza pode inspirar até mesmo o inventor mais esgotado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6df8e143-6250-48a6-a905-746d863e5d06\', \'multiverseId\': 419928}, \'multiverseid\': 419928}, {\'name\': \'Цветущая Трясина\', \'text\': \'Цветущая Трясина выходит на поле битвы повернутой, если под вашим контролем есть не менее трех других земель.\\n{T}: добавьте {B} или {G} в ваше хранилище маны.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Уединение на лоне природы может вдохновить даже самого пресыщенного изобретателя.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9167e21f-b20c-46ee-8548-6e1c5c2c7b63\', \'multiverseId\': 420192}, \'multiverseid\': 420192}, {\'name\': \'花开沼地\', \'text\': \'除非由你操控的其他地数量为两个或更少，否则花开沼地须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{B}或{G}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'回归自然，能让最倦怠的发明家重拾源源灵感。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2fce6f2-ee49-4472-b21d-0323bb4350c3\', \'multiverseId\': 418080}, \'multiverseid\': 418080}, {\'name\': \'花開沼地\', \'text\': \'除非由你操控的其他地數量為兩個或更少，否則花開沼地須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{B}或{G}到你的魔法力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'回歸自然，能讓最倦怠的發明家重拾源源靈感。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e32d8445-c538-4335-b6bf-c2a8d72ed10b\', \'multiverseId\': 418344}, \'multiverseid\': 418344}]', "[{'name': 'Bomat-Kurier', 'text': 'Eile\\nImmer wenn der Bomat-Kurier angreift, schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek verdeckt ins Exil. (Du darfst sie nicht anschauen.)\\n{R}, wirf alle Karten aus deiner Hand ab, opfere den Bomat-Kurier: Bringe alle durch den Bomat-Kurier ins Exil geschickten Karten auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418564&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cf871e6d-e0a9-493f-ba27-a6b0606b213a', 'multiverseId': 418564}, 'multiverseid': 418564}, {'name': 'Mensajero de Bomat', 'text': 'Prisa.\\nSiempre que el Mensajero de Bomat ataque, exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca boca abajo. (No puedes mirarla.)\\n{R}, descartar tu mano, sacrificar el Mensajero de Bomat: Pon todas las cartas exiliadas con el Mensajero de Bomat en las manos de sus propietarios.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Constructo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420412&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fc35c685-b62d-45a8-a6c0-0c433f4eafcb', 'multiverseId': 420412}, 'multiverseid': 420412}, {'name': 'Messager de Bomat', 'text': 'Célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que le Messager de Bomat attaque, exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque, face cachée. (Vous ne pouvez pas la regarder.)\\n{R}, défaussez-vous de votre main, sacrifiez le Messager de Bomat : Mettez toutes les cartes exilées par le Messager de Bomat dans les mains de leurs propriétaires.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : construction', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418828&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9319bbb7-5b05-4047-af1e-22238d60ef4d', 'multiverseId': 418828}, 'multiverseid': 418828}, {'name': 'Corriere di Bomat', 'text': 'Rapidità\\nOgniqualvolta il Corriere di Bomat attacca, esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio a faccia in giù. (Non puoi guardarla.)\\n{R}, Scarta la tua mano, Sacrifica il Corriere di Bomat: Fai tornare in mano ai rispettivi proprietari tutte le carte esiliate dal Corriere di Bomat.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419092&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d9a2f9a-deec-4b8a-adfa-1221a13cffde', 'multiverseId': 419092}, 'multiverseid': 419092}, {'name': 'ボーマットの急使', 'text': '速攻\\nボーマットの急使が攻撃するたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを裏向きに追放する。（あなたはそれを見ることができない。）\\n{R}, あなたの手札を捨てる, ボーマットの急使を生け贄に捧げる：ボーマットの急使により追放されたすべてのカードをオーナーの手札に加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419356&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '91c4e94a-9cc1-41c8-b188-310cc5a0bce9', 'multiverseId': 419356}, 'multiverseid': 419356}, {'name': '보맷 배달기계', 'text': '신속\\n보맷 배달기계가 공격할 때마다, 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 뒷면 상태로 추방한다. (당신은 그 카드를 볼 수 없다.)\\n{R}, 당신의 손을 버린다, 보맷 배달기계를 희생한다: 보맷 배달기계로 추방된 모든 카드를 소유자의 손으로 가져온다.', 'type': '마법물체 생물 — 자동기계', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419620&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3c4f1999-e1fe-411a-be33-88054d6a6841', 'multiverseId': 419620}, 'multiverseid': 419620}, {'name': 'Mensageiro de Bomat', 'text': 'Ímpeto\\nToda vez que Mensageiro de Bomat atacar, exile o card do topo de seu grimório com a face voltada para baixo. (Você não pode olhá-lo.)\\n{R}, Descarte sua mão, sacrifique Mensageiro de Bomat: Coloque todos os cards exilados com Mensageiro de Bomat nas mãos de seus donos.', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Constructo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419884&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd52cde1e-9eec-4e53-8a10-dff666a3b575', 'multiverseId': 419884}, 'multiverseid': 419884}, {'name': 'Боматский Посыльный', 'text': 'Ускорение\\nКаждый раз, когда Боматский Посыльный атакует, изгоните верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки рубашкой вверх. (Вы не можете ее смотреть.)\\n{R}, сбросьте вашу руку, пожертвуйте Боматского Посыльного: положите все изгнанные Боматским Посыльным карты в руки их владельцев.', 'type': 'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420148&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ab1775b-f566-4bdf-b014-24daf3d1babd', 'multiverseId': 420148}, 'multiverseid': 420148}, {'name': '博默区讯使', 'text': '敏捷\\n每当博默区讯使攻击时，牌面朝下地放逐你的牌库顶牌。（你不能检视它。）\\n{R}，弃掉你的手牌，牺牲博默区讯使：将所有以博默区讯使放逐的牌移回其拥有者手上。', 'type': '神器生物～组构体', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418036&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b3a269f8-4732-490d-b754-fb2a8739e43e', 'multiverseId': 418036}, 'multiverseid': 418036}, {'name': '博默區訊使', 'text': '敏捷\\n每當博默區訊使攻擊時，牌面朝下地放逐你的牌庫頂牌。（你不能檢視它。）\\n{R}，棄掉你的手牌，犧牲博默區訊使：將所有以博默區訊使放逐的牌移回其擁有者手上。', 'type': '神器生物～組構體', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418300&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '39b74809-8d50-4a4a-ad1f-2ed086fb2e36', 'multiverseId': 418300}, 'multiverseid': 418300}]", '[{\'name\': \'Borstige Hydra\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Borstige Hydra ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E}{E}{E} (drei Energiemarken).\\nBezahle {E}{E}{E}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Borstige Hydra. Sie erhält Fluchsicherheit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hydra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418512&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7086fe79-b263-4904-a463-a380945d3eff\', \'multiverseId\': 418512}, \'multiverseid\': 418512}, {\'name\': \'Hidra encrespada\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Hidra encrespada entre al campo de batalla, obtienes {E}{E}{E} (tres contadores de energía).\\nPagar {E}{E}{E}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Hidra encrespada. Gana la habilidad de antimaleficio hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f19a3acc-248e-4de8-918c-6b302f58abad\', \'multiverseId\': 420360}, \'multiverseid\': 420360}, {\'name\': \'Hydre hérissée\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Hydre hérissée arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez {E}{E}{E} (trois marqueurs « énergie »).\\nPayez {E}{E}{E} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Hydre hérissée. Elle acquiert la défense talismanique jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : hydre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418776&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99cd16d0-6850-4e2a-a8f8-7dc3ef15eeb7\', \'multiverseId\': 418776}, \'multiverseid\': 418776}, {\'name\': \'Idra Irsuta\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Idra Irsuta entra nel campo di battaglia, ottieni {E}{E}{E} (tre segnalini energia).\\nPaga {E}{E}{E}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Idra Irsuta. Ha anti-malocchio fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Idra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40d54429-df4a-4700-9f6f-143156d40ef2\', \'multiverseId\': 419040}, \'multiverseid\': 419040}, {\'name\': \'逆毛ハイドラ\', \'text\': \'逆毛ハイドラが戦場に出たとき、あなたは{E}{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター３個）を得る。\\n{E}{E}{E}を支払う：逆毛ハイドラの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。ターン終了時まで、これは呪禁を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハイドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7855d2b1-71eb-44e2-a91b-1fc76384641c\', \'multiverseId\': 419304}, \'multiverseid\': 419304}, {\'name\': \'성난 히드라\', \'text\': \'성난 히드라가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 {E}{E}{E}(에너지 카운터 세 개)를 얻는다.\\n{E}{E}{E}를 지불한다: 성난 히드라에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 성난 히드라는 턴종료까지 방호를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 히드라\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'892439f9-e2c6-4040-b99b-7031dea1a084\', \'multiverseId\': 419568}, \'multiverseid\': 419568}, {\'name\': \'Hidra Eriçada\', \'text\': \'Quando Hidra Eriçada entra no campo de batalha, você recebe {E}{E}{E} (três marcadores de energia).\\nPague {E}{E}{E}: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Hidra Eriçada. Ela ganha resistência a magia até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af1ae961-b65d-4260-b923-09c1218a9c18\', \'multiverseId\': 419832}, \'multiverseid\': 419832}, {\'name\': \'Щетинистая Гидра\', \'text\': \'Когда Щетинистая Гидра выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете {E}{E}{E} (три жетона энергии).\\nЗаплатите {E}{E}{E}: положите один жетон +1/+1 на Щетинистую Гидру. Она получает Порчеустойчивость до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гидра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f73a1545-e89d-48c6-ae49-17a9511e4583\', \'multiverseId\': 420096}, \'multiverseid\': 420096}, {\'name\': \'棘毛多头龙\', \'text\': \'当棘毛多头龙进战场时，你得到{E}{E}{E}（三个能量指示物）。\\n支付{E}{E}{E}：在棘毛多头龙上放置一个+1/+1指示物。它获得辟邪异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～多头龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2d11428-f91a-4753-91aa-ab13a031d369\', \'multiverseId\': 417984}, \'multiverseid\': 417984}, {\'name\': \'棘毛多頭龍\', \'text\': \'當棘毛多頭龍進戰場時，你得到{E}{E}{E}（三個能量指示物）。\\n支付{E}{E}{E}：在棘毛多頭龍上放置一個+1/+1指示物。它獲得辟邪異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～多頭龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85639768-eb55-4dee-9fcb-0e58f08c8da5\', \'multiverseId\': 418248}, \'multiverseid\': 418248}]', "[{'name': 'Botanisches Refugium', 'text': 'Das Botanische Refugium kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder weniger andere Länder.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {G} oder {U}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Leben inspiriert die Technologie, die wiederum den Lebensraum erweitert.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418609&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '96be3c0d-6f0e-4b78-99d9-c8b2f58a0e49', 'multiverseId': 418609}, 'multiverseid': 418609}, {'name': 'Santuario botánico', 'text': 'El Santuario botánico entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles otras dos o menos tierras.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {U} a tu reserva de maná.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'La vida inspira la tecnología, que a su vez expande la vida.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420457&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3373e2e2-c128-4a1f-9703-bdc86b0291f1', 'multiverseId': 420457}, 'multiverseid': 420457}, {'name': 'Sanctuaire botanique', 'text': 'Le Sanctuaire botanique arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez deux autres terrains ou moins.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U} à votre réserve.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'La vie inspire la technologie, qui étend le domaine de la vie.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418873&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8b33a59f-3a29-4202-916a-b509f0f216e6', 'multiverseId': 418873}, 'multiverseid': 418873}, {'name': 'Santuario Botanico', 'text': 'Il Santuario Botanico entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato a meno che tu non controlli al massimo altre due terre.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {U} alla tua riserva di mana.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'La vita ispira la tecnologia, che a sua volta espande il regno della vita.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419137&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '04585ee4-3f7a-499a-ae45-34ff1d20bd5e', 'multiverseId': 419137}, 'multiverseid': 419137}, {'name': '植物の聖域', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしている他の土地が３つ以上であるかぎり、植物の聖域はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}か{U}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '生命は技術に刺激を与える。それがまた生命の領域を拡げる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419401&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd7be99de-3ab3-4e42-bfc8-3c346cc637b2', 'multiverseId': 419401}, 'multiverseid': 419401}, {'name': '식물학 성소', 'text': '식물학 성소는 당신이 다른 대지를 두 개 이하로 조종하지 않는 한 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{T}: {G} 또는 {U}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.', 'type': '대지', 'flavor': '삶은 기술에 영감을 주며, 이를 통해 삶의 영역이 확장된다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419665&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8f012f4c-bd01-4352-ab33-f10055f4c063', 'multiverseId': 419665}, 'multiverseid': 419665}, {'name': 'Santuário Botânico', 'text': 'Santuário Botânico entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle dois outros terrenos ou menos.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {U} à sua reserva de mana.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'A vida inspira a tecnologia, que expande o domínio da vida.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419929&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e5533d6f-a66b-40a7-aea3-8c6b0cdaa2df', 'multiverseId': 419929}, 'multiverseid': 419929}, {'name': 'Растительное Святилище', 'text': 'Растительное Святилище выходит на поле битвы повернутым, если под вашим контролем есть не менее трех других земель.\\n{T}: добавьте {G} или {U} в ваше хранилище маны.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': 'Жизнь становится вдохновением для технологии, а та — расширяет владения жизни.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420193&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e2f695ca-e723-4240-9421-87e284ca3008', 'multiverseId': 420193}, 'multiverseid': 420193}, {'name': '植物圣所', 'text': '除非由你操控的其他地数量为两个或更少，否则植物圣所须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{G}或{U}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '生命启迪技术发展，技术拓展生命各域。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418081&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'db74a285-cd61-44d6-a330-792ae6c7f6cf', 'multiverseId': 418081}, 'multiverseid': 418081}, {'name': '植物聖所', 'text': '除非由你操控的其他地數量為兩個或更少，否則植物聖所須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{G}或{U}到你的魔法力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '生命啟迪技術發展，技術拓展生命各域。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418345&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c09d8025-3e12-46ef-9977-ef3d2b5cb4ec', 'multiverseId': 418345}, 'multiverseid': 418345}]", '[{\'name\': \'Brandgefährlicher Mechakoloss\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nWenn der Brandgefährliche Mechakoloss ins Spiel kommt, kann dich ein Gegner deiner Wahl drei Karten ziehen lassen. Falls er dies nicht tut, lege die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof. Dann fügt der Brandgefährliche Mechakoloss diesem Spieler Schadenspunkte in Höhe der Summe der umgewandelten Manakosten jener Karten zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418477&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fe309ca-a9ae-4a0f-87bf-d26f24c0020d\', \'multiverseId\': 418477}, \'multiverseid\': 418477}, {\'name\': \'Mecatitán combustible\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nCuando el Mecatitán combustible entre al campo de batalla, el oponente objetivo puede hacer que robes tres cartas. Si ese jugador no lo hace, pon las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio. Luego, el Mecatitán combustible hace una cantidad de daño a ese jugador igual al coste de maná convertido total de esas cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'726cd56b-67a7-4a4a-8ddd-05212d4723b0\', \'multiverseId\': 420325}, \'multiverseid\': 420325}, {\'name\': \'Carcasse mécanique combustible\', \'text\': "Initiative\\nQuand la Carcasse mécanique combustible arrive sur le champ de bataille, l\'adversaire ciblé peut vous faire piocher trois cartes. Si le joueur ne le fait pas, mettez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière, puis la Carcasse mécanique combustible inflige à ce joueur un nombre de blessures égal au coût converti de mana total de ces cartes.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418741&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adfe0866-5e40-4d34-ae6f-8a9f95ff32b8\', \'multiverseId\': 418741}, \'multiverseid\': 418741}, {\'name\': \'Meccatitano Combustibile\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso\\nQuando il Meccatitano Combustibile entra nel campo di battaglia, un avversario bersaglio può farti pescare tre carte. Se non lo fa, metti le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio nel tuo cimitero, poi il Meccatitano Combustibile infligge a quel giocatore danno pari al costo di mana convertito totale di quelle carte.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69e90ca5-3fc6-4774-bb94-44d02d4a83e9\', \'multiverseId\': 419005}, \'multiverseid\': 419005}, {\'name\': \'焼却の機械巨人\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n焼却の機械巨人が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは「あなたはカードを３枚引く。」を選んでもよい。そうしないなら、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚あなたの墓地に置き、その後焼却の機械巨人はそのプレイヤーに、それらのカードの点数で見たマナ・コストの合計に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a4ef31a-258b-4c2d-af77-926a9ecf9af3\', \'multiverseId\': 419269}, \'multiverseid\': 419269}, {\'name\': \'화염의 톱니거신병\', \'text\': \'선제공격\\n화염의 톱니거신병이 전장에 들어올 때, 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대는 당신에게 카드 세 장을 뽑게 할 수 있다. 그 플레이어가 그렇게 하지 않으면, 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 세 장을 당신의 무덤에 넣은 후, 화염의 톱니거신병은 그 카드들의 전환마나비용의 총합만큼 그 플레이어에게 피해를 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 자동기계\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'536aaa8e-f46c-4901-8c56-cf47473e9786\', \'multiverseId\': 419533}, \'multiverseid\': 419533}, {\'name\': \'Mecanotitã Combustível\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nQuando Mecanotitã Combustível entra no campo de batalha, o oponente alvo pode fazer com que você compre três cards. Se o jogador não fizer isso, coloque os três cards do topo de seu grimório em seu cemitério. Em seguida, Mecanotitã Combustível causa àquele jogador uma quantidade de dano igual ao custo de mana convertido daqueles cards.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d315653-24db-404d-9b0f-5fb7da257598\', \'multiverseId\': 419797}, \'multiverseid\': 419797}, {\'name\': \'Мехагигант Воспламенения\', \'text\': \'Первый удар\\nКогда Мехагигант Воспламенения выходит на поле битвы, целевой оппонент может заставить вас взять три карты. Если тот игрок не делает этого, положите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки на ваше кладбище, затем Мехагигант Воспламенения наносит тому игроку повреждения, равные суммарной конвертированной мана-стоимости тех карт.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50e4dac2-7654-4006-9c6e-f85bb44158d1\', \'multiverseId\': 420061}, \'multiverseid\': 420061}, {\'name\': \'易燃巨械\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n当易燃巨械进战场时，目标对手可以令你抓三张牌。若该牌手未如此作，则将你牌库顶的三张牌置入你的坟墓场，然后易燃巨械对该牌手造成伤害，其数量等同于这些牌总法术力费用的总和。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cf077ea-b5e7-497b-8b02-4c3f4e951478\', \'multiverseId\': 417949}, \'multiverseid\': 417949}, {\'name\': \'易燃巨械\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n當易燃巨械進戰場時，目標對手可以令你抽三張牌。若該玩家未如此作，則將你牌庫頂的三張牌置入你的墳墓場，然後易燃巨械對該玩家造成傷害，其數量等同於這些牌總魔法力費用的總和。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～組構體\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73d8019c-7161-4d31-af38-0c9a590799e9\', \'multiverseId\': 418213}, \'multiverseid\': 418213}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bronzeviertel-Schwingenschmied\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Artefakt unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält der Bronzeviertel-Schwingenschmied Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Luftschiffe engen zu sehr ein. Wenn ich in der Luft bin, will ich den Wind in meinem Haar spüren und den Äther schmecken."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418434&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b283f7ec-1c5d-45a8-8851-f6f1dc51a7a1\', \'multiverseId\': 418434}, \'multiverseid\': 418434}, {\'name\': \'Alaslabradas de Sueldafirme\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un artefacto entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, el Alaslabradas de Sueldafirme gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Las aeronaves me dan claustrofobia. Si surco el cielo, quiero sentir el viento en la cara y saborear el éter".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'313b2a68-b1cd-4864-821b-40c1d48e8cfa\', \'multiverseId\': 420282}, \'multiverseid\': 420282}, {\'name\': "Forgeur d\'ailes de Vive-Soudure", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un artefact arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, le Forgeur d\'ailes de Vive-Soudure acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': "« Les aéronefs sont trop exigus. Dans le ciel, je veux pouvoir sentir le vent dans mes cheveux et savourer le goût de l\'Éther. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418698&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f5ff3c7-fdca-4ae3-a8f5-dea4b80029b5\', \'multiverseId\': 418698}, \'multiverseid\': 418698}, {\'name\': "Artefice d\'Ali della Saldapoli", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un artefatto entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, l\'Artefice d\'Ali della Saldapoli ha volare fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Le aeronavi sono troppo claustrofobiche. Quando volo nel cielo, voglio sentire il vento tra i capelli e il sapore dell\\\'etere."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32c0dde5-f23f-4a3f-94c5-963d77c0bf31\', \'multiverseId\': 418962}, \'multiverseid\': 418962}, {\'name\': \'速接会の翼鍛冶\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、速接会の翼鍛冶は飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「飛行船は狭苦しいよ。空を飛ぶなら髪に風を感じて霊気を満喫したいな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71b6f165-b83b-4428-acc7-53a2e48d7385\', \'multiverseId\': 419226}, \'multiverseid\': 419226}, {\'name\': \'신속땜질지구 날개제작공\', \'text\': \'마법물체가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 신속땜질지구 날개제작공은 턴종료까지 비행을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기능공\', \'flavor\': \'"비행선 안은 너무 갑갑해. 하늘을 날며 머리카락에 흩날리는 바람을 느끼고 에테르를 맛보고 싶어."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e89ff238-202d-4bdf-9291-d3b0890b9820\', \'multiverseId\': 419490}, \'multiverseid\': 419490}, {\'name\': \'Aseiro de Soldafirme\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um artefato entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, Aseiro de Soldafirme ganha voar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'"As aeronaus são muito claustrofóbicas. Quando estou no céu, eu quero sentir o vento no cabelo e provar o éter."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71093853-e990-4ee9-9533-bfb7c725630d\', \'multiverseId\': 419754}, \'multiverseid\': 419754}, {\'name\': \'Летучий Кузнец Сварного Шва\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда артефакт выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, Летучий Кузнец Сварного Шва получает Полет до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Механик\', \'flavor\': \'«Воздушные корабли — словно клетки. А я в небе чувствую ветер в волосах и вкус эфира на языке».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2a72fa6-332c-44d2-9f51-83835186b5ca\', \'multiverseId\': 420018}, \'multiverseid\': 420018}, {\'name\': \'焊锢区翼匠\', \'text\': \'每当一个神器在你的操控下进战场时，焊锢区翼匠获得飞行异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'「飞船太拘束了。如果我在空中飞翔，我就要感受风吹发梢，体会乙太拂身。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48079f3a-ef4f-4a7a-973e-9e6885de6099\', \'multiverseId\': 417906}, \'multiverseid\': 417906}, {\'name\': \'焊錮區翼匠\', \'text\': \'每當一個神器在你的操控下進戰場時，焊錮區翼匠獲得飛行異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／神器師\', \'flavor\': \'「飛船太拘束了。如果我在空中飛翔，我就要感受風吹髮梢，體會乙太拂身。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e074855e-d58d-4703-9ce4-882654212532\', \'multiverseId\': 418170}, \'multiverseid\': 418170}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bronzeviertel-Überwacher\', \'text\': \'{R}: Der Bronzeviertel-Überwacher erhält Bedrohlichkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Eidechse\', \'flavor\': \'Die Avantgarde der Erfinder in Ghirapur missachtet die Sicherheitsstandards des Konsulats ganz und gar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418603&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18a22eee-0737-45d3-a495-b9ad38c74ba4\', \'multiverseId\': 418603}, \'multiverseid\': 418603}, {\'name\': \'Saurio de Sueldafirme\', \'text\': \'{R}: El Saurio de Sueldafirme gana la habilidad de amenaza hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Lagarto\', \'flavor\': \'Los inventores más vanguardistas de Ghirapur desobedecen completamente las normas de seguridad del Consulado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66eef674-b80b-494e-a8e1-c206bca924af\', \'multiverseId\': 420451}, \'multiverseid\': 420451}, {\'name\': \'Surveillant de Vive-soudure\', \'text\': "{R} : Le Surveillant de Vive-Soudure acquiert la menace jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : lézard\', \'flavor\': \'Les inventeurs avant-gardistes de Ghirapur se moquent complètement des normes de sécurité du Consulat.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418867&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5344d30-fbd8-431f-a4e0-441c587c370a\', \'multiverseId\': 418867}, \'multiverseid\': 418867}, {\'name\': \'Varano della Saldapoli\', \'text\': \'{R}: Il Varano della Saldapoli ha minacciare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Lucertola\', \'flavor\': "Gli inventori più all\'avanguardia di Ghirapur ignorano completamente gli standard di sicurezza del Consolato.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a906065f-1da9-4faf-81d7-7be162024652\', \'multiverseId\': 419131}, \'multiverseid\': 419131}, {\'name\': \'速接会のオオトカゲ\', \'text\': \'{R}：ターン終了時まで、速接会のオオトカゲは威迫を得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — トカゲ\', \'flavor\': \'ギラプールの前衛発明者は領事府の安全基準など眼中にない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85f953e7-7f6a-4599-b682-02a2ace3f71b\', \'multiverseId\': 419395}, \'multiverseid\': 419395}, {\'name\': \'신속땜질지구 왕도마뱀\', \'text\': \'{R}: 신속땜질지구 왕도마뱀은 턴종료까지 호전적을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 도마뱀\', \'flavor\': \'기라푸르의 전위 발명가들은 영사관의 안전 기준을 완전히 무시한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e676688a-45ce-4a9d-843a-6639055a2ac9\', \'multiverseId\': 419659}, \'multiverseid\': 419659}, {\'name\': \'Sáurio de Soldafirme\', \'text\': \'{R}: Sáurio de Soldafirme ganha ameaçar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Lagarto\', \'flavor\': \'A vanguarda dos inventores de Ghirapur desconsidera totalmente os padrões de segurança do Consulado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0db4431-912e-4b4e-8e81-f5122405b84c\', \'multiverseId\': 419923}, \'multiverseid\': 419923}, {\'name\': \'Варан Сварного Шва\', \'text\': \'{R}: Варан Сварного Шва получает Угрозу до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Ящер\', \'flavor\': \'Самые передовые из гирапурских изобретателей полностью игнорируют установленные Консульством стандарты безопасности.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7aff4852-a0a1-487d-98af-604f32f78a10\', \'multiverseId\': 420187}, \'multiverseid\': 420187}, {\'name\': \'焊锢区巨蜥\', \'text\': \'{R}：焊锢区巨蜥获得威慑异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～蜥蜴\', \'flavor\': \'吉拉波发明家中的创意先锋完全无视执政院的安全规范。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8487f68-a713-4862-b864-eb134e817633\', \'multiverseId\': 418075}, \'multiverseid\': 418075}, {\'name\': \'焊錮區巨蜥\', \'text\': \'{R}：焊錮區巨蜥獲得威懾異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～蜥蜴\', \'flavor\': \'吉拉波發明家中的創意先鋒完全無視執政院的安全規範。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9655e277-e390-41d1-be75-312e7a835595\', \'multiverseId\': 418339}, \'multiverseid\': 418339}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandra, Fackel des Widerstands\', \'text\': \'+1: Schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst diese Karte wirken. Falls du dies nicht tust, fügt Chandra, Fackel des Widerstands, jedem Gegner 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n+1: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {R}{R}.\\n-3: Chandra, Fackel des Widerstands, fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n-7: Du erhältst ein Emblem mit „Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, fügt dieses Emblem einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte zu."\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418475&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9903f120-bc47-432b-98ce-c7377fe45cad\', \'multiverseId\': 418475}, \'multiverseid\': 418475}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, aurora de la rebeldía\', \'text\': \'+1: Exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes lanzar esa carta. Si no lo haces, Chandra, aurora de la rebeldía hace 2 puntos de daño a cada oponente.\\n+1: Agrega {R}{R} a tu reserva de maná.\\n−3: Chandra, aurora de la rebeldía hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\n-7: Obtienes un emblema con "Siempre que lances un hechizo, este emblema hace 5 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo\\\'".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f7469c1-0152-4f15-8531-083b9af9925d\', \'multiverseId\': 420323}, \'multiverseid\': 420323}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, torche de la défiance\', \'text\': \'+1 : Exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez lancer cette carte. Si vous ne le faites pas, Chandra, torche de la défiance inflige 2 blessures à chaque adversaire.\\n+1 : Ajoutez {R}{R} à votre réserve.\\n-3 : Chandra, torche de la défiance inflige 4 blessures à une créature ciblée.\\n-7 : Vous gagnez un emblème avec « À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort, cet emblème inflige 5 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur. »\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker : Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418739&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e708d97-d521-4122-ab6f-5f8c7df88e01\', \'multiverseId\': 418739}, \'multiverseid\': 418739}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Fiamma di Sfida\', \'text\': \'+1: Esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi lanciarla. Se non lo fai, Chandra, Fiamma di Sfida infligge 2 danni a ogni avversario.\\n+1: Aggiungi {R}{R} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n-3: Chandra, Fiamma di Sfida infligge 4 danni a una creatura bersaglio.\\n-7: Ottieni un emblema con "Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia, questo emblema infligge 5 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'211c145a-005a-4c73-a6f6-1c10b53ade8f\', \'multiverseId\': 419003}, \'multiverseid\': 419003}, {\'name\': \'反逆の先導者、チャンドラ\', \'text\': \'+1：あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。あなたはそのカードを唱えてもよい。そうしないなら、反逆の先導者、チャンドラは各対戦相手にそれぞれ２点のダメージを与える。\\n+1：あなたのマナ・プールに{R}{R}を加える。\\n-3：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。反逆の先導者、チャンドラはそれに４点のダメージを与える。\\n-7：あなたは「あなたが呪文を１つ唱えるたび、クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。この紋章はそれに５点のダメージを与える。」を持つ紋章を得る。\', \'type\': \'プレインズウォーカー — チャンドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14e11989-6f26-4cc2-9ef4-ebb8a6aa96de\', \'multiverseId\': 419267}, \'multiverseid\': 419267}, {\'name\': \'저항의 횃불 찬드라\', \'text\': \'+1: 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 추방한다. 당신은 그 카드를 발동할 수 있다. 그러지 않으면, 저항의 횃불 찬드라는 각 상대에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\\n+1: {R}{R}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\\n−3: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 저항의 횃불 찬드라는 그 생물에 피해 4점을 입힌다.\\n−7: 당신은 "당신이 주문을 발동할 때마다, 생물 또는 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 이 휘장은 그 목표에게 피해 5점을 입힌다."를 가진 휘장을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'플레인즈워커 — 찬드라\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e3cc9f9-f6a4-4049-b5ca-641760febd3d\', \'multiverseId\': 419531}, \'multiverseid\': 419531}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Chama da Rebeldia\', \'text\': \'+1: Exile o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode conjurar aquele card. Se não fizer isso, Chandra, Chama da Rebeldia, causará 2 pontos de dano a cada oponente.\\n+1: Adicione {R}{R} a sua reserva de mana.\\n−3: Chandra, Chama da Rebeldia, causa 4 pontos de dano à criatura alvo.\\n−7: Você recebe um emblema com "Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica, este emblema causa 5 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo."\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0692bb8-c035-4570-97f0-2d94f81e9bd6\', \'multiverseId\': 419795}, \'multiverseid\': 419795}, {\'name\': \'Чандра, Факел Непокорности\', \'text\': \'+1: изгоните верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете разыграть ту карту, если она не является картой земли. Если вы этого не делаете, Чандра, Факел Непокорности наносит 2 повреждения каждому оппоненту.\\n+1: добавьте {R}{R} в ваше хранилище маны.\\n−3: Чандра, Факел Непокорности наносит 4 повреждения целевому существу.\\n−7: вы получаете эмблему со способностью «Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание, эта эмблема наносит 5 повреждений целевому существу или игроку».\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Чандра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'118cd262-d9d6-4e9f-b6a4-680a6ec64f89\', \'multiverseId\': 420059}, \'multiverseid\': 420059}, {\'name\': \'反抗烈炬茜卓\', \'text\': \'+1：放逐你的牌库顶牌。你可以施放该牌。如果你未如此作，则反抗烈炬茜卓向每位对手各造成2点伤害。\\n+1：加{R}{R}到你的法术力池中。\\n−3：反抗烈炬茜卓对目标生物造成4点伤害。\\n−7：你获得具有「每当你施放咒语时，此徽记对目标生物或牌手造成5点伤害」的徽记。\', \'type\': \'鹏洛客～茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5c82aa7-e8e3-45fe-83c3-4ba52ea380e2\', \'multiverseId\': 417947}, \'multiverseid\': 417947}, {\'name\': \'反抗烈炬茜卓\', \'text\': \'+1：放逐你的牌庫頂牌。你可以施放該牌。如果你未如此作，則反抗烈炬茜卓向每位對手各造成2點傷害。\\n+1：加{R}{R}到你的魔法力池中。\\n-3：反抗烈炬茜卓對目標生物造成4點傷害。\\n−7：你獲得具有「每當你施放咒語時，此徽記對目標生物或玩家造成5點傷害」的徽記。\', \'type\': \'鵬洛客～茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46c74359-57d7-439a-8897-1a405ef551c0\', \'multiverseId\': 418211}, \'multiverseid\': 418211}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandra, Pyrogenie\', \'text\': \'+2: Chandra, Pyrogenie, fügt jedem Gegner 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n−3: Chandra, Pyrogenie, fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n−10: Chandra, Pyrogenie, fügt einem Spieler deiner Wahl und jeder Kreatur, die er kontrolliert, 6 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420508&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4023eed-8fa2-479f-afd7-3435122c3352\', \'multiverseId\': 420508}, \'multiverseid\': 420508}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, pirogenia\', \'text\': \'+2: Chandra, pirogenia hace 2 puntos de daño a cada oponente.\\n−3: Chandra, pirogenia hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\n−10: Chandra, pirogenia hace 6 puntos de daño al jugador objetivo y a cada criatura que controla.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50eb1f82-a6c4-476f-b83d-a1ff0b33b63a\', \'multiverseId\': 420578}, \'multiverseid\': 420578}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, pyrogénie\', \'text\': "+2 : Chandra, pyrogénie inflige 2 blessures à chaque adversaire.\\n-3 : Chandra, pyrogénie inflige 4 blessures à une créature ciblée.\\n-10 : Chandra, pyrogénie inflige 6 blessures au joueur ciblé et à chaque créature qu\'il contrôle.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker : Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420518&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b32b80b3-299e-4013-8eef-c3dd57b80a77\', \'multiverseId\': 420518}, \'multiverseid\': 420518}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Pirogenio\', \'text\': \'+2: Chandra, Pirogenio infligge 2 danni a ogni avversario.\\n-3: Chandra, Pirogenio infligge 4 danni a una creatura bersaglio.\\n-10: Chandra, Pirogenio infligge 6 danni a un giocatore bersaglio e a ogni creatura controllata da quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d97ee2e5-ecf2-4e0a-9cd9-76578ea3360a\', \'multiverseId\': 420528}, \'multiverseid\': 420528}, {\'name\': \'紅蓮の俊英、チャンドラ\', \'text\': \'+2：紅蓮の俊英、チャンドラは各対戦相手にそれぞれ２点のダメージを与える。\\n-3：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。紅蓮の俊英、チャンドラはそれに４点のダメージを与える。\\n-10：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。紅蓮の俊英、チャンドラはそのプレイヤーとそのプレイヤーがコントロールする各クリーチャーにそれぞれ６点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'プレインズウォーカー — チャンドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00014127-a9d2-4e01-ae79-2349e8989793\', \'multiverseId\': 420538}, \'multiverseid\': 420538}, {\'name\': \'화염술의 천재 찬드라\', \'text\': \'+2: 화염술의 천재 찬드라는 각 상대에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\\n-3: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 화염술의 천재 찬드라는 그 생물에 피해 4점을 입힌다.\\n-10: 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 화염술의 천재 찬드라는 그 플레이어와 그가 조종하는 각 생물에게 피해 6점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'플레인즈워커 — 찬드라\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34eda744-0a17-4bd1-94f2-f1268910f2c7\', \'multiverseId\': 420548}, \'multiverseid\': 420548}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Pirogênia\', \'text\': \'+2: Chandra, Pirogênia, causa 2 pontos de dano a cada oponente.\\n−3: Chandra, Pirogênia, causa 4 pontos de dano à criatura alvo.\\n−10: Chandra, Pirogênia, causa 6 pontos de dano ao jogador alvo e a cada criatura que ele controla.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'442bc97c-0035-4c7b-af83-5a1e71f18dda\', \'multiverseId\': 420558}, \'multiverseid\': 420558}, {\'name\': \'Чандра, Пирогений\', \'text\': \'+2: Чандра, Пирогений наносит 2 повреждения каждому оппоненту.\\n—3: Чандра, Пирогений наносит 4 повреждения целевому существу.\\n—10: Чандра, Пирогений наносит 6 повреждений целевому игроку и каждому существу под его контролем.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Чандра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eeb585d4-dc64-4077-bf54-faac0aa6da9e\', \'multiverseId\': 420568}, \'multiverseid\': 420568}, {\'name\': \'烈焰奇才茜卓\', \'text\': \'+2：烈焰奇才茜卓向每位对手各造成2点伤害。\\n−3：烈焰奇才茜卓对目标生物造成4点伤害。\\n−10：烈焰奇才茜卓对目标牌手与每个由其操控的生物各造成6点伤害。\', \'type\': \'鹏洛客～茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63876206-c37b-480d-819a-17cb9fe30068\', \'multiverseId\': 420488}, \'multiverseid\': 420488}, {\'name\': \'烈焰奇才茜卓\', \'text\': \'+2：烈焰奇才茜卓向每位對手各造成2點傷害。\\n-3：烈焰奇才茜卓對目標生物造成4點傷害。\\n-10：烈焰奇才茜卓對目標玩家與每個由其操控的生物各造成6點傷害。\', \'type\': \'鵬洛客～茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00e55e19-9099-4528-8392-76ebf86ab2c7\', \'multiverseId\': 420498}, \'multiverseid\': 420498}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandras Pyrohelix\', \'text\': \'Chandras Pyrohelix fügt 2 Schadenspunkte zu, deren Aufteilung auf ein oder zwei Kreaturen und/oder Spieler deiner Wahl du bestimmst.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Das ist für meine Mutter und das ist für mich."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418476&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a163edf-dae1-46b1-bf70-031151bd038c\', \'multiverseId\': 418476}, \'multiverseid\': 418476}, {\'name\': \'Pirohélice de Chandra\', \'text\': \'La Pirohélice de Chandra hace 2 puntos de daño divididos como elijas entre una o dos criaturas y/o jugadores objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Esta es por mi madre, y esta, por mí".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'417dcc82-ebc2-4dcd-bd14-8d3270e5e360\', \'multiverseId\': 420324}, \'multiverseid\': 420324}, {\'name\': \'Pyrohélice de Chandra\', \'text\': \'La Pyrohélice de Chandra inflige 2 blessures réparties comme vous le désirez entre une ou deux cibles, créatures et/ou joueurs.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Ça, c\'est pour ma mère ! Et ça, c\'est pour moi ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418740&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3049271b-43b8-491a-af41-6a381eb6b3fe\', \'multiverseId\': 418740}, \'multiverseid\': 418740}, {\'name\': \'Piroelica di Chandra\', \'text\': \'La Piroelica di Chandra infligge 2 danni divisi a tua scelta tra una o due creature e/o giocatori bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Questo è per mia madre e quest\\\'altro è per me."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4539296-4f19-4d41-b348-e9c39b07ca64\', \'multiverseId\': 419004}, \'multiverseid\': 419004}, {\'name\': \'チャンドラの螺旋炎\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやプレイヤー、１つか２つを対象とする。チャンドラの螺旋炎はそれらに、２点のダメージを望むように分割して与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「これは母さんの分。こっちは私の分。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f68031e9-0d5f-44f0-a40b-e4678d8c5f56\', \'multiverseId\': 419268}, \'multiverseid\': 419268}, {\'name\': \'찬드라의 불꽃소용돌이\', \'text\': \'플레이어 그리고/또는 생물 한 개나 두 개를 목표로 정한다. 찬드라의 불꽃소용돌이는 그 목표들에게 피해 2점을 당신이 나눈 대로 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"이것은 내 어머니의 몫, 그리고 이것은 내 몫이다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1bcfba1-d765-4259-836a-2cf5c25bdc1b\', \'multiverseId\': 419532}, \'multiverseid\': 419532}, {\'name\': \'Piro-hélice de Chandra\', \'text\': \'Piro-hélice de Chandra causa 2 pontos de dano distribuídos a sua escolha entre uma ou duas criaturas e/ou jogadores alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Essa é pela minha mãe, e essa é por mim."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a17a3196-d217-401b-9285-846606aa2f58\', \'multiverseId\': 419796}, \'multiverseid\': 419796}, {\'name\': \'Пироспираль Чандры\', \'text\': \'Пироспираль Чандры наносит 2 повреждения, разделенные по вашему выбору между одним или двумя целевыми существами и (или) игроками.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Это за маму, а это за меня».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4796e12-2747-4bd5-866d-8ec7a97b9ba6\', \'multiverseId\': 420060}, \'multiverseid\': 420060}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的旋炎咒\', \'text\': \'茜卓的旋炎咒对一个或两个目标生物和／或牌手造成共2点伤害，你可以任意分配。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「这一道为母亲复仇，这一道为自己雪恨。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'351544fb-cadc-48c3-9e15-22a119471209\', \'multiverseId\': 417948}, \'multiverseid\': 417948}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的旋炎咒\', \'text\': \'茜卓的旋炎咒對一個或兩個目標生物和／或玩家造成共2點傷害，你可以任意分配。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「這一道為母親復仇，這一道為自己雪恨。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c655259-255e-47c8-b11b-6d9f04f3760d\', \'multiverseId\': 418212}, \'multiverseid\': 418212}]', '[{\'name\': \'Demolieren\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder ein Land deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Meisten kommen nach Ghirapur wegen der Messe. Die Gremlins kommen wegen des Festmahls.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418478&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0aa3ee7-b218-4911-98f1-79b5bb6a5cc2\', \'multiverseId\': 418478}, \'multiverseid\': 418478}, {\'name\': \'Demoler\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto o tierra objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La mayoría vino a Ghirapur por la Feria, pero los gremlins lo hicieron por el festín.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6026279b-07d5-4f90-a68a-49edfd90749a\', \'multiverseId\': 420326}, \'multiverseid\': 420326}, {\'name\': \'Démolition\', \'text\': "Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé ou le terrain ciblé.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'La plupart viennent à Ghirapur pour la Foire. Les gremlins viennent pour le festin.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418742&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'817983b6-c838-4c7a-97e5-7aefb11ff9d8\', \'multiverseId\': 418742}, \'multiverseid\': 418742}, {\'name\': \'Frantumare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto o una terra bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'In molti sono venuti a Ghirapur per la fama. I gremlin sono venuti per la fame.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de1dd584-950b-4073-8f32-0c23c3b445b5\', \'multiverseId\': 419006}, \'multiverseid\': 419006}, {\'name\': \'破砕\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つか土地１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'大勢の者が博覧会目当てでギラプールに来る。グレムリンはご馳走目当てで来る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8426858d-a05f-47e5-b082-bf2b71966c94\', \'multiverseId\': 419270}, \'multiverseid\': 419270}, {\'name\': \'철거\', \'text\': \'마법물체나 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'대부분은 박람회 때문에 기라푸르에 왔지만, 그렘린들은 만찬을 즐기러 왔다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f91ad10d-380f-4653-8096-862d8bd40cfb\', \'multiverseId\': 419534}, \'multiverseid\': 419534}, {\'name\': \'Demolir\', \'text\': \'Destrua o artefato ou terreno alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A maioria das pessoas veio a Ghirapur para a Feira. Os gremlins vieram para o banquete.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97c25ce3-5082-48c8-8144-92d2008d4b07\', \'multiverseId\': 419798}, \'multiverseid\': 419798}, {\'name\': \'Разрушение\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевой артефакт или землю.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Большинство прибывает в Гирапур на Ярмарку. Гремлины прибыли на пир.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ef086c6-9193-42b4-a457-d33b9d275134\', \'multiverseId\': 420062}, \'multiverseid\': 420062}, {\'name\': \'毁坏\', \'text\': \'消灭目标神器或地。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'大多数的人前来吉拉波是为博览会。怪灵则是为了大吃一顿。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d694974-5736-4317-a839-1d641ecced90\', \'multiverseId\': 417950}, \'multiverseid\': 417950}, {\'name\': \'毀壞\', \'text\': \'消滅目標神器或地。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'大多數的人前來吉拉波是為博覽會。怪靈則是為了大吃一頓。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4515939-424c-4dbf-9e5c-cb514d4f0d28\', \'multiverseId\': 418214}, \'multiverseid\': 418214}]', '[{\'name\': \'Depala, vorbildliche Pilotin\', \'text\': \'Andere Zwerge, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\nJedes Fahrzeug, das du kontrollierst, erhält +1/+1, solange es eine Kreatur ist.\\nImmer wenn Depala, vorbildliche Pilotin, getappt wird, kannst du {X} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, decke die obersten X Karten deiner Bibliothek auf und nimm davon alle Zwerg- und Fahrzeug-Karten auf deine Hand. Lege dann den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Zwerg, Pilot\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418543&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ccbf4ee-7a17-4239-83ab-a778f4763ef3\', \'multiverseId\': 418543}, \'multiverseid\': 418543}, {\'name\': \'Depala, piloto ejemplar\', \'text\': \'Los otros Enanos que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\nCada Vehículo que controlas obtiene +1/+1 mientras sea una criatura.\\nSiempre que Depala, piloto ejemplar se gire, puedes pagar {X}. Si lo haces, muestra las X primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, pon todas las cartas de Enano y de Vehículo que se encuentren entre ellas en tu mano, y luego pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Enano piloto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f2fd5d0-fb86-44f7-9641-a06e4948cac4\', \'multiverseId\': 420391}, \'multiverseid\': 420391}, {\'name\': \'Dépala, archétype de pilote\', \'text\': "Les autres nains que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\nChaque véhicule que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+1 tant qu\'il est une créature.\\nÀ chaque fois que Dépala, archétype de pilote devient engagée, vous pouvez payer {X}. Si vous faites ainsi, révélez les X cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, mettez toutes les cartes de nain et de véhicule parmi elles dans votre main, puis mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : nain et pilote\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418807&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e3fdfa2-7478-4399-a989-5ae0c0235d18\', \'multiverseId\': 418807}, \'multiverseid\': 418807}, {\'name\': \'Depala, Pilota Esemplare\', \'text\': \'Gli altri Nani che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\nOgni Veicolo che controlli prende +1/+1 fintanto che è una creatura.\\nOgniqualvolta Depala, Pilota Esemplare viene TAPpata, puoi pagare {X}. Se lo fai, rivela le prime X carte del tuo grimorio, aggiungi alla tua mano tutte le carte Nano e Veicolo tra esse, poi metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Pilota Nano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf03391e-78a6-425a-a59a-084922d0c293\', \'multiverseId\': 419071}, \'multiverseid\': 419071}, {\'name\': \'模範操縦士、デパラ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールする他のドワーフは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nあなたがコントロールする各機体はそれぞれ、それがクリーチャーであるかぎり＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n模範操縦士、デパラがタップ状態になるたび、あなたは{X}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードをＸ枚公開し、その中からすべてのドワーフ・カードとすべての機体・カードをあなたの手札に加え、その後残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドワーフ・操縦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68a697bb-9623-45ff-8b32-63887c870188\', \'multiverseId\': 419335}, \'multiverseid\': 419335}, {\'name\': \'모범 조종사 데팔라\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 다른 드워프들은 +1/+1을 받는다.\\n당신이 조종하는 각 탑승물은 생물인 한 +1/+1를 받는다.\\n모범 조종사 데팔라가 탭될 때마다, 당신은 {X}를 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 X장을 공개하고, 그 중 모든 드워프와 탑승물 카드를 당신의 손으로 가져간 후, 나머지는 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 무작위로 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 드워프 조종사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e73250d2-4bbf-4376-a9e9-6fd046eda499\', \'multiverseId\': 419599}, \'multiverseid\': 419599}, {\'name\': \'Depala, Piloto Exemplar\', \'text\': \'Os outros Anões que você controla recebem +1/+1.\\nCada Veículo que você controla receberá +1/+1 enquanto for uma criatura.\\nToda vez que Depala, Piloto Exemplar, é virada, você pode pagar {X}. Se fizer isso, revele os X cards do topo de seu grimório, coloque todos os cards de Anão e Veículo dentre eles em sua mão e, em seguida, coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Anão Piloto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ea044d5-c3cb-4bb5-861f-922758119566\', \'multiverseId\': 419863}, \'multiverseid\': 419863}, {\'name\': \'Депала, Образцовая Гонщица\', \'text\': \'Другие Гномы под вашим контролем получают +1/+1.\\nКаждая Машина под вашим контролем получает +1/+1, пока она является существом.\\nКаждый раз, когда Депала, Образцовая Гонщица поворачивается, вы можете заплатить {X}. Если вы это делаете, покажите X верхних карт вашей библиотеки, положите все находящиеся среди них карты Гномов и Машин в вашу руку, затем положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Гном Пилот\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c33f7349-1527-43a9-9149-6b51eab54ed0\', \'multiverseId\': 420127}, \'multiverseid\': 420127}, {\'name\': \'驾手模范德珀拉\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他矮人得+1/+1。\\n对每个由你操控的载具而言，只要它是生物，便得+1/+1。\\n每当驾手模范德珀拉成为横置时，你可以支付{X}。若你如此作，展示你牌库顶的X张牌，将其中所有矮人和载具牌置于你手上，然后将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～矮人／驾手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e38db42b-fac6-4652-bd98-c2b7c8b525fe\', \'multiverseId\': 418015}, \'multiverseid\': 418015}, {\'name\': \'駕手模範德珀拉\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他矮人得+1/+1。\\n對每個由你操控的載具而言，只要它是生物，便得+1/+1。\\n每當駕手模範德珀拉成為橫置時，你可以支付{X}。若你如此作，展示你牌庫頂的X張牌，將其中所有矮人和載具牌置於你手上，然後將其餘的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物～矮人／駕手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fb49d3f-5397-41c0-8ca6-0297d6f48277\', \'multiverseId\': 418279}, \'multiverseid\': 418279}]', '[{\'name\': \'Destillationsmodul\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E} (eine Energiemarke).\\n{4}, {T}: Bringe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Fortschritt führt zu Inspiration.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418570&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbb0fb38-a8d2-4b70-8a91-355fbbd7b6bf\', \'multiverseId\': 418570}, \'multiverseid\': 418570}, {\'name\': \'Módulo de extracción\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, obtienes {E} (un contador de energía).\\n{4}, {T}: Regresa la criatura objetivo que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El progreso lleva a la inspiración.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99a373ce-c673-45d0-860d-2e6c6810bcfd\', \'multiverseId\': 420418}, \'multiverseid\': 420418}, {\'name\': \'Module de décoction\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous gagnez {E} (un marqueur « énergie »).\\n{4}, {T} : Renvoyez la créature ciblée que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Le progrès mène à l\'inspiration.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418834&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7b01767-a81c-4b47-afb9-d08096fada83\', \'multiverseId\': 418834}, \'multiverseid\': 418834}, {\'name\': \'Modulo di Decozione\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, ottieni {E} (un segnalino energia).\\n{4}, {T}: Fai tornare una creatura bersaglio che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Il progresso conduce all\'ispirazione.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d15d0f4-26d9-4700-95db-c4c76d8d3767\', \'multiverseId\': 419098}, \'multiverseid\': 419098}, {\'name\': \'抽出機構\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは{E}（エネルギー・カウンター１個）を得る。\\n{4}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'進歩は発想を生む。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a2f35b1-8041-4449-bad1-ce4f73a0e34e\', \'multiverseId\': 419362}, \'multiverseid\': 419362}, {\'name\': \'약물 제조 모듈\', \'text\': \'생물이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신은 {E}(에너지 카운터 한 개)를 얻는다.\\n{4}, {T}: 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'진보가 영감을 낳는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e45404f2-d906-4dfd-b00a-30e159420672\', \'multiverseId\': 419626}, \'multiverseid\': 419626}, {\'name\': \'Módulo de Decocção\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você recebe {E} (um marcador de energia).\\n{4}, {T}: Devolva a criatura alvo que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'O progresso leva à inspiração.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5493b4ef-d610-477d-aa2d-485221a36aff\', \'multiverseId\': 419890}, \'multiverseid\': 419890}, {\'name\': \'Модуль Вываривания\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда существо выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы получаете {E} (один жетон энергии).\\n{4}, {T}: верните целевое существо под вашим контролем в руку его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Прогресс ведет к вдохновению.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32e602e1-1b2d-4c23-bf22-fae786d118e5\', \'multiverseId\': 420154}, \'multiverseid\': 420154}, {\'name\': \'炼煮模块\', \'text\': \'每当一个生物在你的操控下进战场时，你得到{E}（一个能量指示物）。\\n{4}，{T}：将目标由你操控的生物移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'进展促灵感。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b4713a4-b3ea-48ce-b905-b91e841ae4d5\', \'multiverseId\': 418042}, \'multiverseid\': 418042}, {\'name\': \'煉煮模塊\', \'text\': \'每當一個生物在你的操控下進戰場時，你得到{E}（一個能量指示物）。\\n{4}，{T}：將目標由你操控的生物移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'進展促靈感。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28295f10-42e9-44e2-ad4f-92427e692169\', \'multiverseId\': 418306}, \'multiverseid\': 418306}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dhund-Agentin\', \'text\': \'Solange du ein Artefakt kontrollierst, erhält die Dhund-Agentin +1/+0 und hat Todesberührung. (Eine beliebige Menge Schadenspunkte, die sie einer Kreatur zufügt, ist ausreichend, um diese zu zerstören.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Barals Spione verfügen immer über die neuesten Technologien.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418439&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e614340e-753e-4120-a9e8-16bbbbc0b80a\', \'multiverseId\': 418439}, \'multiverseid\': 418439}, {\'name\': \'Agente de Dhund\', \'text\': \'Mientras controles un artefacto, el Agente de Dhund obtiene +1/+0 y tiene la habilidad de toque mortal. (Cualquier cantidad de daño que haga a una criatura es suficiente para destruirla.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los espías de Baral siempre cuentan con la última tecnología.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d20295e3-352c-4fa1-bd18-a0df5d28da6e\', \'multiverseId\': 420287}, \'multiverseid\': 420287}, {\'name\': \'Agent de Dhund\', \'text\': "Tant que vous contrôlez un artefact, l\'Agent de Dhund gagne +1/+0 et a le contact mortel. (Le nombre de blessures qu\'il inflige à une créature, quel qu\'il soit, est suffisant pour la détruire.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'Les espions de Baral disposent toujours de technologies de pointe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418703&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba7a9126-5f01-42ae-b8ee-ba6ba23cc1e1\', \'multiverseId\': 418703}, \'multiverseid\': 418703}, {\'name\': \'Agente Dhund\', \'text\': "Fintanto che controlli un artefatto, l\'Agente Dhund prende +1/+0 e ha tocco letale. (Qualsiasi danno che questa creatura infligge a una creatura è sufficiente a distruggerla.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Le spie di Baral sfoggiano sempre gli ultimi ritrovati tecnologici.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84526325-3ee4-4604-8a99-ac8709d89e6f\', \'multiverseId\': 418967}, \'multiverseid\': 418967}, {\'name\': \'ドゥーンドの調査員\', \'text\': \'あなたがアーティファクトをコントロールしているかぎり、ドゥーンドの調査員は＋１/＋０の修整を受けるとともに接死を持つ。（これが何らかのダメージをクリーチャーに与えたら、それだけで破壊する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'バラルの諜報員はいつでも最新技術を利用する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38bdcedd-d0fa-4afb-8fb0-5ef0269f57e9\', \'multiverseId\': 419231}, \'multiverseid\': 419231}, {\'name\': \'던드 첩보원\', \'text\': \'당신이 마법물체를 조종하는 한, 던드 첩보원은 +1/+0을 받고 치명타를 가진다. (이 생물에 피해를 입은 생물은 입은 피해의 양에 상관없이 파괴된다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 도적\', \'flavor\': \'바랄의 첩자는 늘 최신 기술을 보유하고 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c11fc911-3aa8-4827-9f25-5829161f8b03\', \'multiverseId\': 419495}, \'multiverseid\': 419495}, {\'name\': \'Agente da Dhund\', \'text\': \'Enquanto você controlar um artefato, Agente da Dhund receberá +1/+0 e terá toque mortífero. (Qualquer quantidade de dano que ela causa a uma criatura é suficiente para destruí-la.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'Os espiões de Baral têm sempre a tecnologia mais avançada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4969a58-d1b0-46c3-ac35-d7bea90e3c58\', \'multiverseId\': 419759}, \'multiverseid\': 419759}, {\'name\': \'Оперативница из Данда\', \'text\': \'Пока вы контролируете артефакт, Оперативница из Данда получает +1/+0 и имеет Смертельное касание. (Любого количества повреждений, которое она наносит существу, достаточно, чтобы уничтожить то существо.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'Шпионы Бараля всегда оснащены по последнему слову техники.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a9c43cf-273f-4003-af73-58ac3492602f\', \'multiverseId\': 420023}, \'multiverseid\': 420023}, {\'name\': \'敦德会特务\', \'text\': \'只要你操控神器，敦德会特务便得+1/+0且具有死触异能。（它对生物造成的任何数量伤害都足以消灭后者。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'巴罗的特务总是拥有最先进的科技。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73c1c3d1-833c-4d44-91ff-b015c4046a8f\', \'multiverseId\': 417911}, \'multiverseid\': 417911}, {\'name\': \'敦德會特務\', \'text\': \'只要你操控神器，敦德會特務便得+1/+0且具有死觸異能。（它對生物造成的任何數量傷害都足以消滅後者。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'巴羅的特務總是擁有最先進的科技。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79d7bcbf-2a7c-420d-a0b5-b5a01800c085\', \'multiverseId\': 418175}, \'multiverseid\': 418175}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Konkurrenz eliminieren\', \'text\': \'Opfere X Kreaturen als zusätzliche Kosten, um Die Konkurrenz eliminieren zu wirken.\\nZerstöre X Kreaturen deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Offene Feindseligkeiten sind bei der Erfindermesse streng verboten, aber „Unfälle" passieren eben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418443&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'924b0f8f-6b0e-48b5-aaaa-9ae312dc4ec7\', \'multiverseId\': 418443}, \'multiverseid\': 418443}, {\'name\': \'Deshacerse de la competencia\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar Deshacerse de la competencia, sacrifica X criaturas.\\nDestruye X criaturas objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Las hostilidades abiertas están totalmente prohibidas en la Feria de Inventores, pero los "accidentes" siguen teniendo lugar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2927fcc0-a5ae-4c9c-9bab-3aad52c859a3\', \'multiverseId\': 420291}, \'multiverseid\': 420291}, {\'name\': \'Éliminer la concurrence\', \'text\': \'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer Éliminer la concurrence, sacrifiez X créatures.\\nDétruisez X créatures ciblées.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Les hostilités sont strictement interdites dans le cadre de la Foire des inventeurs, mais un « accident » est vite arrivé.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418707&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3aa362c0-38e8-4055-a806-feb46a8522b8\', \'multiverseId\': 418707}, \'multiverseid\': 418707}, {\'name\': \'Eliminare la Concorrenza\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare Eliminare la Concorrenza, sacrifica X creature.\\nDistruggi X creature bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Le ostilità aperte sono severamente vietate durante la Fiera degli Inventori, ma gli "incidenti" capitano comunque.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5bce643-1905-4073-bd59-9786abd53755\', \'multiverseId\': 418971}, \'multiverseid\': 418971}, {\'name\': \'競争排除\', \'text\': \'競争排除を唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャーＸ体を生け贄に捧げる。\\nクリーチャーＸ体を対象とし、それらを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'発明博覧会ではあからさまな暴力は厳格に禁止されているが、それでも「事故」はある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bc3f1f7-0ca5-4e28-b2c1-81b27c6666fe\', \'multiverseId\': 419235}, \'multiverseid\': 419235}, {\'name\': \'경쟁자 제거\', \'text\': \'경쟁자 제거를 발동하기 위한 추가비용으로, 생물 X개를 희생한다.\\n생물 X개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'발명 박람회에서 노골적인 적대감 표출은 금지되어 있지만, "사고"는 늘 일어난다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cdba7ba-0a17-4be6-a1c6-bba4b48a945d\', \'multiverseId\': 419499}, \'multiverseid\': 419499}, {\'name\': \'Eliminar a Concorrência\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar Eliminar a Concorrência, sacrifique X criaturas.\\nDestrua X criaturas alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'As hostilidades abertas são estritamente proibidas na Feira dos Inventores, mas "acidentes" ainda acontecem.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f97911d-cb70-4b79-8a19-5c9e003f4360\', \'multiverseId\': 419763}, \'multiverseid\': 419763}, {\'name\': \'Устранение Соперников\', \'text\': \'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания Устранения Соперников пожертвуйте X существ.\\nУничтожьте X целевых существ.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Открытые проявления вражды на Ярмарке Изобретателей строго запрещены, но «несчастные случаи» все равно случаются.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bc47ff8-fc97-4db6-98de-075ac0cc20e6\', \'multiverseId\': 420027}, \'multiverseid\': 420027}, {\'name\': \'终结竞争\', \'text\': \'牺牲X个生物，以作为施放终结竞争的额外费用。\\n消灭X个目标生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'发明家博览会禁止公开的敌对行为，但「意外」总是难免。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7b4c3c6-7004-40cb-8aec-ec5df4d28434\', \'multiverseId\': 417915}, \'multiverseid\': 417915}, {\'name\': \'終結競爭\', \'text\': \'犧牲X個生物，以作為施放終結競爭的額外費用。\\n消滅X個目標生物。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'發明家博覽會禁止公開的敵對行為，但「意外」總是難免。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dba42cf0-a803-4782-a3f2-7dbf1a109351\', \'multiverseId\': 418179}, \'multiverseid\': 418179}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Schwachen jagen\', \'text\': \'Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Dann kämpft die Kreatur gegen eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst. (Jede dieser Kreaturen fügt der anderen Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Natürliche Evolution und industrieller Fortschritt beißen sich oft.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418523&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eb7969e-08d9-4ca1-94be-dcd722dde6e2\', \'multiverseId\': 418523}, \'multiverseid\': 418523}, {\'name\': \'Cazar a los débiles\', \'text\': \'Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo que controlas. Después, esa criatura lucha contra la criatura objetivo que no controlas. (Cada una hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a la otra.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La evolución natural no se suele llevar demasiado bien con el progreso industrial.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7055004e-5596-4746-bb16-04584efd2499\', \'multiverseId\': 420371}, \'multiverseid\': 420371}, {\'name\': \'Chasse aux plus faibles\', \'text\': "Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. Cette créature se bat ensuite contre une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas. (Chacune inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à l\'autre.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "L\'évolution naturelle est souvent en décalage avec les progrès industriels.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418787&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'088e124f-9b0e-4c70-b175-4df7b68d69bf\', \'multiverseId\': 418787}, \'multiverseid\': 418787}, {\'name\': \'Cacciare i Deboli\', \'text\': "Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Poi quella creatura lotta con una creatura bersaglio che non controlli. (Ogni creatura infligge all\'altra danno pari alla propria forza.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Il progresso industriale spesso si scontra con l\'evoluzione naturale.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d634a101-89e5-4e9d-b72c-2d4987121832\', \'multiverseId\': 419051}, \'multiverseid\': 419051}, {\'name\': \'弱者狩り\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体と、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。その後その前者はその後者と格闘を行う。（それぞれはもう一方に自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'自然の進化と産業の発達は往々にして折り合いが悪い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2920f43-56a1-469b-8a85-784723737d16\', \'multiverseId\': 419315}, \'multiverseid\': 419315}, {\'name\': \'약자는 먹이로\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 그 후 당신이 조종하지 않는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 두 생물은 서로 싸운다. (각 생물은 서로에게 각자의 공격력만큼의 피해를 입힌다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'자연적 진화는 종종 산업적 발전과 충돌한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62430f12-85f6-4190-ab61-4671bd668210\', \'multiverseId\': 419579}, \'multiverseid\': 419579}, {\'name\': \'Caçar os Fracos\', \'text\': \'Coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo que você controla. Depois, aquela criatura luta com a criatura alvo que você não controla. (Cada uma causa à outra uma quantidade de dano igual ao seu poder.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A evolução natural entra frequentemente em conflito com o progresso industrial.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2767f5f5-9c24-470e-8ffc-23944198ff16\', \'multiverseId\': 419843}, \'multiverseid\': 419843}, {\'name\': \'Охота на Слабых\', \'text\': \'Положите один жетон +1/+1 на целевое существо под вашим контролем. Затем то существо дерется с целевым существом не под вашим контролем. (Они наносят друг другу повреждения, равные своей силе.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Эволюция живой природы часто соперничает с техническим прогрессом.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17ed45bf-d8d8-432e-a19d-aa8017fdb9df\', \'multiverseId\': 420107}, \'multiverseid\': 420107}, {\'name\': \'猎捕弱者\', \'text\': \'在目标由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。然后该生物与目标不由你操控的生物互斗。（它们各向对方造成等同于本身力量的伤害。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'自然演化与工业进步经常互不相容。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'656674ca-6d97-40b7-b76c-924723ac9f11\', \'multiverseId\': 417995}, \'multiverseid\': 417995}, {\'name\': \'獵捕弱者\', \'text\': \'在目標由你操控的生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。然後該生物與目標不由你操控的生物互鬥。（它們各向對方造成等同於本身力量的傷害。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'自然演化與工業進步經常互不相容。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cc8d440-2fd2-4cfa-89a8-4152ff3bf1ea\', \'multiverseId\': 418259}, \'multiverseid\': 418259}]', '[{\'name\': \'Diener der Verbindung\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Diener der Verbindung ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E}{E} (zwei Energiemarken).\\n{T}, bezahle {E}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Schöpfung ohne Verbindung zur Natur ist nur Produktion."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418534&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47ae877f-71d4-49b6-ad64-2043df098bf8\', \'multiverseId\': 418534}, \'multiverseid\': 418534}, {\'name\': \'Servidor de la Panconexión\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Servidor de la Panconexión entre al campo de batalla, obtienes {E}{E} (dos contadores de energía).\\n{T}, pagar {E}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Una creación sin conexión con la naturaleza no es más que una manufactura".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c14a248d-3bd7-4aa1-a407-e05595aa1f72\', \'multiverseId\': 420382}, \'multiverseid\': 420382}, {\'name\': \'Servant du Conduit\', \'text\': \'Quand le Servant du Conduit arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez {E}{E} (deux marqueurs « énergie »).\\n{T}, payez {E} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': "« Une création déconnectée de la nature n\'est que pure fabrication. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418798&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b626854-a51d-424d-988c-a2a30c9ec9f0\', \'multiverseId\': 418798}, \'multiverseid\': 418798}, {\'name\': \'Servitore del Flusso\', \'text\': \'Quando il Servitore del Flusso entra nel campo di battaglia, ottieni {E}{E} (due segnalini energia).\\n{T}, Paga {E}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"La creazione, se priva di un legame con la natura, è mera manifattura."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28eee533-a0ca-4de7-b708-1d981bf4885e\', \'multiverseId\': 419062}, \'multiverseid\': 419062}, {\'name\': \'導路の召使い\', \'text\': \'導路の召使いが戦場に出たとき、あなたは{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター２個）を得る。\\n{T}, {E}を支払う：あなたのマナ・プールに、好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「自然との繋がりがない創造は、単なる製造に過ぎない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6ecf87e-8505-470e-972c-38ad7619c4f9\', \'multiverseId\': 419326}, \'multiverseid\': 419326}, {\'name\': \'수로의 하수인\', \'text\': \'수로의 하수인이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 {E}{E}(에너지 카운터 두 개)를 얻는다.\\n{T}, {E}를 지불한다: 당신의 마나풀에 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 담는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 드루이드\', \'flavor\': \'"자연과 연결되지 않은 창조는 그저 제작에 불과하다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22d31430-7a93-43bb-808e-832670c97156\', \'multiverseId\': 419590}, \'multiverseid\': 419590}, {\'name\': \'Serviçal do Conduíte\', \'text\': \'Quando Serviçal do Conduíte entra no campo de batalha, você recebe {E}{E} (dois marcadores de energia).\\n{T}, Pague {E}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"Uma criação sem conexão com a natureza não passa de manufatura."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'695428e4-4b89-443c-84b7-395cd4f6f95e\', \'multiverseId\': 419854}, \'multiverseid\': 419854}, {\'name\': \'Слуга Канала\', \'text\': \'Когда Слуга Канала выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете {E}{E} (два жетона энергии).\\n{T}, заплатите {E}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета в ваше хранилище маны.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Друид\', \'flavor\': \'«Творение без связи с природой — обычная штамповка».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b447868c-2fdc-4026-979f-821860939439\', \'multiverseId\': 420118}, \'multiverseid\': 420118}, {\'name\': \'大通联仆从\', \'text\': \'当大通联仆从进战场时，你得到{E}{E}（两个能量指示物）。\\n{T}，支付{E}：加一点任意颜色的法术力到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「未与自然联系的发明只能算作制造品。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa4b375a-602b-4fcb-913b-dec8a793c885\', \'multiverseId\': 418006}, \'multiverseid\': 418006}, {\'name\': \'大通聯僕從\', \'text\': \'當大通聯僕從進戰場時，你得到{E}{E}（兩個能量指示物）。\\n{T}，支付{E}：加一點任意顏色的魔法力到你的魔法力池中。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'「未與自然聯繫的發明只能算作製造品。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9985829-f83f-4c26-a98b-63c4ab8e34f0\', \'multiverseId\': 418270}, \'multiverseid\': 418270}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dovin Baan\', \'text\': \'+1: Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug erhält bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl -3/-0 und ihre aktivierten Fähigkeiten können nicht aktiviert werden.\\n—1: Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu und ziehst eine Karte.\\n—7: Du erhältst ein Emblem mit „Deine Gegner können während ihres Enttappsegments nicht mehr als zwei bleibende Karten enttappen."\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Dovin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418544&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5cc2be7-2887-412f-866a-1c29e2ec36cd\', \'multiverseId\': 418544}, \'multiverseid\': 418544}, {\'name\': \'Dovin Baan\', \'text\': \'+1: Hasta tu próximo turno, hasta una criatura objetivo obtiene -3/-0 y no se pueden activar sus habilidades activadas.\\n−1: Ganas 2 vidas y robas una carta.\\n−7: Obtienes un emblema con "Tus oponentes no pueden enderezar más de dos permanentes durante sus pasos de enderezar".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Dovin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7e4bf50-23a8-419e-a957-ac6d19eaf2c5\', \'multiverseId\': 420392}, \'multiverseid\': 420392}, {\'name\': \'Dovin Baàn\', \'text\': "+1 : Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, jusqu\'à une créature ciblée gagne -3/-0 et ses capacités activées ne peuvent pas être activées.\\n-1 : Vous gagnez 2 points de vie et vous piochez une carte.\\n-7 : Vous gagnez un emblème avec « Vos adversaires ne peuvent pas dégager plus de deux permanents pendant leurs étapes de dégagement. »", \'type\': \'Planeswalker : Dovin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418808&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff4a844c-f75e-4e13-a20e-5a00d9173e03\', \'multiverseId\': 418808}, \'multiverseid\': 418808}, {\'name\': \'Dovin Baan\', \'text\': \'+1: Fino al tuo prossimo turno, fino a una creatura bersaglio prende -3/-0 e le sue abilità attivate non possono essere attivate.\\n-1: Guadagni 2 punti vita e peschi una carta.\\n-7: Ottieni un emblema con "I tuoi avversari non possono STAPpare più di due permanenti durante i rispettivi STAP".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Dovin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0d6d53a-bcb3-49ce-a009-ea04697f056c\', \'multiverseId\': 419072}, \'multiverseid\': 419072}, {\'name\': \'ドビン・バーン\', \'text\': \'+1：クリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。あなたの次のターンまで、それは－３/－０の修整を受けるとともにそれの起動型能力は起動できない。\\n-1：あなたは２点のライフを得て、カードを１枚引く。\\n-7：あなたは「対戦相手は、自分のアンタップ・ステップ中に、パーマネントを最大２つしかアンタップできない。」を持つ紋章を得る。\', \'type\': \'プレインズウォーカー — ドビン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adae1a26-39d2-400a-87f1-147c869723f0\', \'multiverseId\': 419336}, \'multiverseid\': 419336}, {\'name\': \'도빈 반\', \'text\': \'+1: 생물을 최대 한 개까지 목표로 정한다. 당신의 다음 턴까지, 그 생물은 -3/-0을 받고 그 생물의 활성화능력은 활성화될 수 없다.\\n−1: 당신은 생명 2점을 얻고 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\\n−7: 당신은 "당신의 상대는 자신의 언탭단에 최대 두 개의 지속물만을 언탭할 수 있다."를 가진 휘장을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'플레인즈워커 — 도빈\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7826ae85-1ef2-45a6-ae43-214dd5787154\', \'multiverseId\': 419600}, \'multiverseid\': 419600}, {\'name\': \'Dovin Baan\', \'text\': \'+1: Até seu próximo turno, até uma criatura alvo recebe -3/-0 e suas habilidades ativadas não podem ser ativadas.\\n−1: Você ganha 2 pontos de vida e compra um card.\\n−7: Você recebe um emblema com "Seus oponentes não podem desvirar mais de duas permanentes durante suas etapas de desvirar".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Dovin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dbdc2f6-f9b1-4f61-920f-e6cf9066fd24\', \'multiverseId\': 419864}, \'multiverseid\': 419864}, {\'name\': \'Довин Баан\', \'text\': \'+1: до вашего следующего хода не более чем одно целевое существо получает -3/-0, и его активируемые способности не могут быть активированы.\\n−1: вы получаете 2 жизни и берете карту.\\n−7: вы получаете эмблему со способностью «Ваши оппоненты не могут разворачивать более двух перманентов во время своих шагов разворота».\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Довин\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'038055b0-9f68-4877-aae2-6cca53fbfcf6\', \'multiverseId\': 420128}, \'multiverseid\': 420128}, {\'name\': \'多温班恩\', \'text\': \'+1：直到你的下一个回合，至多一个目标生物得-3/-0，且其起动式异能也不能起动。\\n−1：你获得2点生命且抓一张牌。\\n−1：你获得具有「对手于其重置步骤中所重置的永久物不能多于两个」的徽记。\', \'type\': \'鹏洛客～多温\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ebf8d8d-06f4-4609-ac86-c2e92de00514\', \'multiverseId\': 418016}, \'multiverseid\': 418016}, {\'name\': \'多溫班恩\', \'text\': \'+1：直到你的下一個回合，至多一個目標生物得-3/-0，且其起動式異能也不能起動。\\n−1：你獲得2點生命且抽一張牌。\\n−7：你獲得具有「對手在其重置步驟所重置的永久物不能多於兩個」的徽記。\', \'type\': \'鵬洛客～多溫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26437e15-5037-460f-813f-c2546607c184\', \'multiverseId\': 418280}, \'multiverseid\': 418280}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dramatische Wendung\', \'text\': \'Enttappe alle bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst und die keine Länder sind.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Niemand hat dich gebeten, dich einzumischen, Jace. Danke trotzdem." —Chandra Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418409&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3a7251e-6b06-4538-8a39-6cf270b0b661\', \'multiverseId\': 418409}, \'multiverseid\': 418409}, {\'name\': \'Alteración radical\', \'text\': \'Endereza todos los permanentes que no sean tierra que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Nadie te pidió que te entrometieras, Jace. Pero gracias". —Chandra Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64b5075c-f4e8-4375-b383-70f534d13164\', \'multiverseId\': 420257}, \'multiverseid\': 420257}, {\'name\': \'Inversion dramatique\', \'text\': \'Dégagez tous les permanents non-terrain que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Personne ne t\'a demandé d\'intervenir, Jace. Mais merci. » —Chandra Nalaàr", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418673&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57481a0e-3e41-43df-b449-b8eb1327061c\', \'multiverseId\': 418673}, \'multiverseid\': 418673}, {\'name\': \'Inversione Spettacolare\', \'text\': \'STAPpa tutti i permanenti non terra che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Nessuno ti ha chiesto di intrometterti, Jace. Comunque, grazie." —Chandra Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e0b8e24-dc94-40af-89db-aa26690a653c\', \'multiverseId\': 418937}, \'multiverseid\': 418937}, {\'name\': \'劇的な逆転\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールする土地でないすべてのパーマネントをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「あんたたちの手助けなんて頼んでないわよ、ジェイス。でも、ありがと。」 ――チャンドラ・ナラー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebc5af8b-21a5-4f14-a3f9-b4ffa61d9207\', \'multiverseId\': 419201}, \'multiverseid\': 419201}, {\'name\': \'극적 반전\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 대지가 아닌 지속물을 모두 언탭한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"아무도 당신에게 끼어들어 달라고 하지 않았어, 제이스. 어쨌든 고맙군." —찬드라 날라르\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04f9e752-230a-402c-8185-48fa573e25ac\', \'multiverseId\': 419465}, \'multiverseid\': 419465}, {\'name\': \'Reversão Dramática\', \'text\': \'Desvire todas as permanentes que você controla que não sejam terrenos.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Ninguém pediu para você se meter, Jace. Mas obrigada." — Chandra Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1a26bac-ac10-417c-9979-fc6223e24aca\', \'multiverseId\': 419729}, \'multiverseid\': 419729}, {\'name\': \'Драматическая Перемена\', \'text\': \'Разверните все не являющиеся землями перманенты под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Никто не просил тебя вмешиваться, Джейс. Но спасибо». — Чандра Налаар\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab27cce8-32e8-42d5-bd23-5daef9cff7e3\', \'multiverseId\': 419993}, \'multiverseid\': 419993}, {\'name\': \'戏剧性逆转\', \'text\': \'重置所有由你操控的非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「没人求你插手，杰斯。不过还是谢了。」 ～茜卓纳拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e25d4e53-a640-4f69-aea5-633dddc2dab9\', \'multiverseId\': 417881}, \'multiverseid\': 417881}, {\'name\': \'戲劇性逆轉\', \'text\': \'重置所有由你操控的非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「沒人求你插手，傑斯。不過還是謝了。」 ～茜卓納拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34af7ec0-bdba-41ba-b849-9404740f070f\', \'multiverseId\': 418145}, \'multiverseid\': 418145}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dreiste Plagegeister\', \'text\': \'Eile\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Gremlin\', \'flavor\': \'Gremlins sind von einem unstillbaren Hunger getrieben und hören nie auf zu fressen. Sie können ein Lebenswerk innerhalb weniger Augenblicke zerstören.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418472&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c32abaa6-06ed-4967-a385-ff16b65efc39\', \'multiverseId\': 418472}, \'multiverseid\': 418472}, {\'name\': \'Plaga insolente\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gremlin\', \'flavor\': \'Llevados por un hambre insaciable, los gremlins nunca dejan de alimentarse. Pueden destruir el trabajo de toda una vida en pocos momentos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7be83d22-3274-4b11-b00c-2eca5b40037e\', \'multiverseId\': 420320}, \'multiverseid\': 420320}, {\'name\': \'Fléau intrépide\', \'text\': \'Célérité\', \'type\': \'Créature : gremlin\', \'flavor\': "Mus par une faim insatiable, les gremlins n\'arrêtent pas de manger. Ils peuvent détruire toute une vie de labeur en seulement quelques instants.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418736&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e676d1e2-5ef0-4488-8ce1-4f29826efbf5\', \'multiverseId\': 418736}, \'multiverseid\': 418736}, {\'name\': \'Flagello Sfrontato\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gremlin\', \'flavor\': \'Animati da una fame insaziabile, i gremlin non smettono mai di nutrirsi. Possono distruggere il lavoro di una vita in pochi istanti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8156fa30-f0fe-4283-9dde-6e9f6fd63912\', \'multiverseId\': 419000}, \'multiverseid\': 419000}, {\'name\': \'真鍮の災い魔\', \'text\': \'速攻\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — グレムリン\', \'flavor\': \'飽くことない飢えに駆られるグレムリンは決して食べることをやめない。生涯をかけた作品が数分で駄目になることもある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3907b1d-4dff-4ceb-927c-5cf395bd1684\', \'multiverseId\': 419264}, \'multiverseid\': 419264}, {\'name\': \'뻔뻔한 골칫거리\', \'text\': \'신속\', \'type\': \'생물 — 그렘린\', \'flavor\': \'채울 수 없는 굶주림을 가진 그렘린들은 먹는 것을 절대 중단하지 않는다. 그들은 평생을 바친 작품도 한순간에 파괴할 수 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'816d71cb-c342-45df-97eb-43fe17f4e331\', \'multiverseId\': 419528}, \'multiverseid\': 419528}, {\'name\': \'Praga Insolente\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gremlin\', \'flavor\': \'Movidos por uma fome insaciável, os gremlins jamais param de se alimentar. Eles podem destruir o trabalho de uma vida inteira em poucos instantes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73ea8b1c-dd81-4d89-be3c-2c5747e0d734\', \'multiverseId\': 419792}, \'multiverseid\': 419792}, {\'name\': \'Наглые Вредители\', \'text\': \'Ускорение\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гремлин\', \'flavor\': \'Подстегиваемые неутолимым голодом, гремлины ни на минуту не прекращают есть. Они способны уничтожить работу всей жизни за пару мгновений.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e25ae60a-4dd4-4191-ae4e-0e352605884c\', \'multiverseId\': 420056}, \'multiverseid\': 420056}, {\'name\': \'厚皮祸害\', \'text\': \'敏捷\', \'type\': \'生物～怪灵\', \'flavor\': \'在无法餍足的饥渴驱使下，怪灵总是吃个不停。它们能在眨眼间毁掉他人毕生心血。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40e587ec-ae2b-4adb-a23a-f1242d63ebff\', \'multiverseId\': 417944}, \'multiverseid\': 417944}, {\'name\': \'厚皮禍害\', \'text\': \'敏捷\', \'type\': \'生物～怪靈\', \'flavor\': \'在無法饜足的飢渴驅使下，怪靈總是吃個不停。他們能在眨眼間毀掉他人畢生心血。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cabcc3c9-1927-488b-b854-106a01c48b56\', \'multiverseId\': 418208}, \'multiverseid\': 418208}]', "[{'name': 'Druckpunkt', 'text': 'Tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\nZiehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Alles hat einen Ausschalter.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418388&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '425011b2-2a54-4bae-b99c-f332ac460d5a', 'multiverseId': 418388}, 'multiverseid': 418388}, {'name': 'Punto de presión', 'text': 'Gira la criatura objetivo.\\nRoba una carta.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Todo tiene un botón de apagado.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420236&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2b61845-0a9d-47d2-8d3b-9111d2106af4', 'multiverseId': 420236}, 'multiverseid': 420236}, {'name': 'Point de pression', 'text': 'Engagez la créature ciblée.\\nPiochez une carte.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Il y a toujours un interrupteur.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418652&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8bcf68e5-a214-4532-890a-8e8c6a0f73f8', 'multiverseId': 418652}, 'multiverseid': 418652}, {'name': 'Punto di Pressione', 'text': 'TAPpa una creatura bersaglio.\\nPesca una carta.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Ogni cosa può essere spenta.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418916&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '27b1e1d3-a96a-4bd0-b9c8-45559f88128d', 'multiverseId': 418916}, 'multiverseid': 418916}, {'name': '圧点', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。\\nカードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '停止ボタンは何にでもある。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419180&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8b13cf49-8137-47a2-ac40-204c4a55a2f6', 'multiverseId': 419180}, 'multiverseid': 419180}, {'name': '혈도', 'text': '생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 탭한다.\\n카드 한 장을 뽑는다.', 'type': '순간마법', 'flavor': '어떤 것이든 꺼지기 마련이다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419444&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4074786c-a3f2-4a25-a05b-04db3d795234', 'multiverseId': 419444}, 'multiverseid': 419444}, {'name': 'Ponto de Pressão', 'text': 'Vire a criatura alvo.\\nCompre um card.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Tudo tem um botão de desligar.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419708&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '52f0bf93-0658-4a28-8ef8-ce27d52d2987', 'multiverseId': 419708}, 'multiverseid': 419708}, {'name': 'Болевая Точка', 'text': 'Поверните целевое существо.\\nВозьмите карту.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': 'У всего на свете есть выключатель.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419972&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b3a5971-ca72-45c8-a8f6-f6ed2cb7c48f', 'multiverseId': 419972}, 'multiverseid': 419972}, {'name': '点穴手', 'text': '横置目标生物。\\n抓一张牌。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '万物皆有罩门。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417860&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b415165-796f-493b-94b0-6fee2bd8b228', 'multiverseId': 417860}, 'multiverseid': 417860}, {'name': '點穴手', 'text': '橫置目標生物。\\n抽一張牌。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': '萬物皆有罩門。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418124&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bfc55d2b-e9e5-4dcd-81ed-97647faae1f5', 'multiverseId': 418124}, 'multiverseid': 418124}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dukhara-Aasfresser\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Dukhara-Aasfresser ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Artefakt- oder Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof oben auf deine Bibliothek legen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Krokodil\', \'flavor\': \'Die Bissspuren sind ein Kunstwerk für sich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418442&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ce5c0fb-a1d7-459a-91a1-fc70a5794974\', \'multiverseId\': 418442}, \'multiverseid\': 418442}, {\'name\': \'Carroñero del Dukhara\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Carroñero del Dukhara entre al campo de batalla, puedes poner la carta de artefacto o de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio en la parte superior de tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cocodrilo\', \'flavor\': \'Las huellas de dientes imprimen carácter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7af410fd-0745-4ee9-88ef-a994e7de3759\', \'multiverseId\': 420290}, \'multiverseid\': 420290}, {\'name\': \'Charognard de Dukhara\', \'text\': "Quand le Charognard de Dukhara arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez mettre une carte d\'artefact ou de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière au-dessus de votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature : crocodile\', \'flavor\': \'Les marques de dents donnent du caractère.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418706&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1c6db7e-df2c-4938-8c5d-984b544bee69\', \'multiverseId\': 418706}, \'multiverseid\': 418706}, {\'name\': \'Saprofago del Dukhara\', \'text\': \'Quando il Saprofago del Dukhara entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi mettere una carta artefatto o creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero in cima al tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Coccodrillo\', \'flavor\': \'I segni dei morsi danno un tocco di carattere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a071b5f-f915-4bc0-a3a3-f5224d67c2d7\', \'multiverseId\': 418970}, \'multiverseid\': 418970}, {\'name\': \'ダッカラのゴミあさり\', \'text\': \'ダッカラのゴミあさりが戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地からアーティファクト・カード１枚かクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に置いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — クロコダイル\', \'flavor\': \'歯型もえくぼというものだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a72a8ff-a335-4f2b-8c22-0fe12c897044\', \'multiverseId\': 419234}, \'multiverseid\': 419234}, {\'name\': \'두크하라 청소부\', \'text\': \'두크하라 청소부가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 무덤에 있는 마법물체 또는 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 위에 놓을 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 악어\', \'flavor\': \'이빨 자국에 특징이 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5802af95-8c1a-4286-bf3c-6a4d16e96321\', \'multiverseId\': 419498}, \'multiverseid\': 419498}, {\'name\': \'Necrófago do Dukhara\', \'text\': \'Quando Necrófago do Dukhara entra no campo de batalha, você pode colocar o card de artefato ou criatura alvo de seu cemitério no topo de seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Crocodilo\', \'flavor\': \'As marcas dos dentes dão personalidade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9f1fb2d-1979-4ca1-8362-f5aa90a38d61\', \'multiverseId\': 419762}, \'multiverseid\': 419762}, {\'name\': \'Дакхарский Падальщик\', \'text\': \'Когда Дакхарский Падальщик выходит на поле битвы, вы можете положить целевую карту артефакта или существа из вашего кладбища на верх вашей библиотеки.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Крокодил\', \'flavor\': \'Отметины от зубов укрепляют характер.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14744462-7240-41e6-9ac7-b937b4505139\', \'multiverseId\': 420026}, \'multiverseid\': 420026}, {\'name\': \'杜克勒拾荒鳄\', \'text\': \'当杜克勒拾荒鳄进战场时，你可以将目标神器或生物牌从你的坟墓场置于你的牌库顶。\', \'type\': \'生物～鳄鱼\', \'flavor\': \'牙印更显个性。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8ef8311-e8dc-4c5d-8c83-150bc3de9b02\', \'multiverseId\': 417914}, \'multiverseid\': 417914}, {\'name\': \'杜克勒拾荒鱷\', \'text\': \'當杜克勒拾荒鱷進戰場時，你可以將目標神器或生物牌從你的墳墓場置於你的牌庫頂。\', \'type\': \'生物～鱷魚\', \'flavor\': \'牙印更顯個性。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdd703a9-6977-4550-8421-8aa53f8c93fa\', \'multiverseId\': 418178}, \'multiverseid\': 418178}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dukhara-Pfau\', \'text\': \'{U}: Der Dukhara-Pfau erhält Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': \'Elegante, filigrane Vögel säumen die elf Brücken, die über den Dukhara-Kanal führen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418572&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cc077f5-dc3c-4a28-8b4f-a6d6ec0393ac\', \'multiverseId\': 418572}, \'multiverseid\': 418572}, {\'name\': \'Pavo real de Dukhara\', \'text\': \'{U}: El Pavo real de Dukhara gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'Unas elegantes aves de filigrana observan desde los bordes de los once puentes del Canal Dukhara.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'259bdff3-eaf7-4824-a811-127c923d50ce\', \'multiverseId\': 420420}, \'multiverseid\': 420420}, {\'name\': \'Paon de Dukhara\', \'text\': "{U} : Le Paon de Dukhara acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : oiseau\', \'flavor\': "D\'élégants oiseaux de filigrane se perchent le long des onze ponts traversant le canal de Dukhara.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418836&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a1cf4dd-293e-461a-97eb-02ad71404a09\', \'multiverseId\': 418836}, \'multiverseid\': 418836}, {\'name\': \'Pavone del Dukhara\', \'text\': \'{U}: Il Pavone del Dukhara ha volare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'Lungo gli undici ponti che attraversano il Canale Dukhara sono appollaiati eleganti uccelli in filigrana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f01b3a2-e78a-4da5-8a66-5d64f71df665\', \'multiverseId\': 419100}, \'multiverseid\': 419100}, {\'name\': \'ダッカラの孔雀\', \'text\': \'{U}：ターン終了時まで、ダッカラの孔雀は飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': \'ダッカラ運河にかかる11基の橋に沿って、美しい金線条細工の鳥が何羽も止まっている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0a4f3b4-1d83-4bf6-b409-4a6b9f924290\', \'multiverseId\': 419364}, \'multiverseid\': 419364}, {\'name\': \'두크하라 공작새\', \'text\': \'{U}: 두크하라 공작새는 턴종료까지 비행을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 조류\', \'flavor\': \'우아하게 줄세공한 공작새들이 두크하라 운하를 가로지르는 열한개의 다리를 따라 앉아 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2339e573-2ad3-4bf8-bd5f-114c2bcdaf2e\', \'multiverseId\': 419628}, \'multiverseid\': 419628}, {\'name\': \'Pavão de Dukhara\', \'text\': \'{U}: Pavão de Dukhara ganha voar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'Elegantes aves filigranadas se empoleiram pelas onze pontes que cruzam o Canal Dukhara.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'935d785a-1244-4d38-b1f6-1a5a3c403690\', \'multiverseId\': 419892}, \'multiverseid\': 419892}, {\'name\': \'Дакхарский Павлин\', \'text\': \'{U}: Дакхарский Павлин получает Полет до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Птица\', \'flavor\': \'Одиннадцать мостов через канал Дакхара облюбовали изящные филигранные птицы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6254543c-c0bb-437a-88c8-6e18fb724a39\', \'multiverseId\': 420156}, \'multiverseid\': 420156}, {\'name\': \'杜克勒孔雀\', \'text\': \'{U}：杜克勒孔雀获得飞行异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～鸟\', \'flavor\': \'这种高雅丝金鸟类沿杜克勒运河上十一座桥而栖。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1c86b44-5c7e-4ec2-b0dd-b07a924b62f2\', \'multiverseId\': 418044}, \'multiverseid\': 418044}, {\'name\': \'杜克勒孔雀\', \'text\': \'{U}：杜克勒孔雀獲得飛行異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～鳥\', \'flavor\': \'這種高雅絲金鳥類沿杜克勒運河上十一座橋而棲。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e30369ff-38bd-4d3d-a03a-2b456993b790\', \'multiverseId\': 418308}, \'multiverseid\': 418308}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dynavolt-Turm\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, erhältst du {E}{E} (zwei Energiemarken).\\n{T}, bezahle {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}: Der Dynavolt-Turm fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich mag diesen Tezzeret. Er sieht Dinge, die andere Preisrichter nicht sehen. Er erkennt das Potenzial in dem, was wir hier tun." —Faiz, Erfinderin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418573&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4934ea3c-bc51-4f14-aa55-80fc3afd27a8\', \'multiverseId\': 418573}, \'multiverseid\': 418573}, {\'name\': \'Torre dinavoltaica\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, obtienes {E}{E} (dos contadores de energía).\\n{T}, pagar {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}: La Torre dinavoltaica hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Me gusta ese Tezzeret. Tiene una visión de la que los otros jueces carecen. Ve el potencial de lo que creamos aquí". —Faiz, inventora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d45d1237-f5fc-463c-9b05-3ba9e18420d1\', \'multiverseId\': 420421}, \'multiverseid\': 420421}, {\'name\': \'Tour dynavolt\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, vous gagnez {E}{E} (deux marqueurs « énergie »).\\n{T}, payez {E}{E}{E}{E}{E} : La Tour dynavolt inflige 3 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« J\'aime bien ce Tezzeret. Il est plus perspicace que les autres juges. Il comprend ce que nous cherchons à atteindre ici. » —Faiz, inventeur", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418837&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ace2a42-3052-4b93-89e3-f27c58b776b3\', \'multiverseId\': 418837}, \'multiverseid\': 418837}, {\'name\': \'Torre Dinavolt\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, ottieni {E}{E} (due segnalini energia).\\n{T}, Paga {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}: La Torre Dinavolt infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi piace questo Tezzeret. È lungimirante, a differenza degli altri giudici. Riesce a vedere il potenziale di quello che creiamo." —Faiz, inventrice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8e06ec8-e678-46aa-b6ce-fed27aa4af78\', \'multiverseId\': 419101}, \'multiverseid\': 419101}, {\'name\': \'電招の塔\', \'text\': \'あなたがインスタント・呪文かソーサリー・呪文を１つ唱えるたび、あなたは{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター２個）を得る。\\n{T}, {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}を支払う：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。電招の塔はそれに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「私はテゼレットを評価しているわよ。他の審判者と違って彼には洞察力がある。私たちがここでやっていることの将来性だって見抜いたわ。」 ――発明者、ファイズ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1df0aa3-9e75-40d4-ba61-68e5e7efb115\', \'multiverseId\': 419365}, \'multiverseid\': 419365}, {\'name\': \'전압발전 탑\', \'text\': \'당신이 순간마법 또는 집중마법 주문을 발동할 때마다, 당신은 {E}{E}(에너지 카운터 두 개)를 얻는다.\\n{T}, {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}를 지불한다: 생물이나 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 전압발전 탑은 그 목표에게 피해 3점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'"전 테제렛이 좋아요. 그는 다른 심사위원에게는 없는 통찰력을 가지고 있어요. 그는 우리가 만드는 발명품이 가진 잠재력을 꿰뚫어 봅니다." —발명가 파이즈\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77bc8314-a37c-4a65-be75-0163653ace2f\', \'multiverseId\': 419629}, \'multiverseid\': 419629}, {\'name\': \'Torre Dinavolt\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, você recebe {E}{E} (dois marcadores de energia).\\n{T}, Pague {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}: Torre Dinavolt causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Gosto desse Tezzeret. Ele tem uma visão que os outros jurados não têm. Ele vê o potencial do que fazemos aqui." — Faiz, inventora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a66c985-83d8-42cd-926b-28caafd8c85b\', \'multiverseId\': 419893}, \'multiverseid\': 419893}, {\'name\': \'Динальваническая Башня\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, вы получаете {E}{E} (два жетона энергии).\\n{T}, заплатите {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}: Динальваническая Башня наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу или игроку.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Мне нравится этот Теззерет. У него есть видение, которого не хватает другим судьям. Он видит потенциал в том, что мы делаем». — изобретатель Фаиз\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da5e723d-1c0e-40ba-bb68-602d56cb0e54\', \'multiverseId\': 420157}, \'multiverseid\': 420157}, {\'name\': \'涌电塔\', \'text\': \'每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，你得到{E}{E}（两个能量指示物）。\\n{T}，支付{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}：涌电塔对目标生物或牌手造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「我喜欢那个泰兹瑞。他比其他评审更有远见。他知道我们所做的一切价值何在。」 ～发明家菲姿\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b965fc2-ec6b-43f7-8ceb-045c568c5d92\', \'multiverseId\': 418045}, \'multiverseid\': 418045}, {\'name\': \'湧電塔\', \'text\': \'每當你施放瞬間或巫術咒語時，你得到{E}{E}（兩個能量指示物）。\\n{T}，支付{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}：湧電塔對目標生物或玩家造成3點傷害。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「我喜歡那個泰茲瑞。他比其他評審更有遠見。他知道我們所做的一切價值何在。」 ～發明家菲姿\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fbf3932-30ab-48dd-96b7-ae060853cc10\', \'multiverseId\': 418309}, \'multiverseid\': 418309}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämon der düsteren Intrigen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Dämon der düsteren Intrigen ins Spiel kommt, erhalten alle anderen Kreaturen -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nImmer wenn eine andere Kreatur stirbt, erhältst du {E} (eine Energiemarke).\\n{2}{B}, bezahle {E}{E}{E}{E}: Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof unter deiner Kontrolle getappt ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418438&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb703a71-8105-490e-8fd4-1e49ef93dffa\', \'multiverseId\': 418438}, \'multiverseid\': 418438}, {\'name\': \'Demonio de planes siniestros\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Demonio de planes siniestros entre al campo de batalla, todas las demás criaturas obtienen -2/-2 hasta el final del turno.\\nSiempre que otra criatura muera, obtienes {E} (un contador de energía).\\n{2}{B}, pagar {E}{E}{E}{E}: Pon en el campo de batalla girada y bajo tu control la carta de criatura objetivo de un cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cce19e75-9a66-430e-91f2-d7b84559a11f\', \'multiverseId\': 420286}, \'multiverseid\': 420286}, {\'name\': \'Démon aux noirs desseins\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Démon aux noirs desseins arrive sur le champ de bataille, toutes les autres créatures gagnent -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature meurt, vous gagnez {E} (un marqueur « énergie »).\\n{2}{B}, payez {E}{E}{E}{E} : Mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle et engagée, une carte de créature ciblée depuis un cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418702&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ce9fcdc-de56-4bcd-9ed1-c2ada66ce3e6\', \'multiverseId\': 418702}, \'multiverseid\': 418702}, {\'name\': \'Demone dalle Trame Oscure\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando il Demone dalle Trame Oscure entra nel campo di battaglia, tutte le altre creature prendono -2/-2 fino alla fine del turno.\\nOgniqualvolta un\'altra creatura muore, ottieni {E} (un segnalino energia).\\n{2}{B}, Paga {E}{E}{E}{E}: Metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo TAPpata una carta creatura bersaglio da un cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bce1185d-690a-43aa-ba52-78b639c721d2\', \'multiverseId\': 418966}, \'multiverseid\': 418966}, {\'name\': \'陰謀の悪魔\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n陰謀の悪魔が戦場に出たとき、ターン終了時まで、他のすべてのクリーチャーは－２/－２の修整を受ける。\\n他のクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、あなたは{E}（エネルギー・カウンター１個）を得る。\\n{2}{B}, {E}{E}{E}{E}を支払う：墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたのコントロール下でタップ状態で戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a51b0ac2-8c49-4cd1-9e00-9108dfddf223\', \'multiverseId\': 419230}, \'multiverseid\': 419230}, {\'name\': \'흉계를 꾸미는 악마\', \'text\': \'비행\\n흉계를 꾸미는 악마가 전장에 들어올 때, 다른 모든 생물은 턴종료까지 -2/-2를 받는다.\\n다른 생물이 죽을 때마다, 당신은 {E}(에너지 카운터 한 개)를 얻는다.\\n{2}{B}, {E}{E}{E}{E}를 지불한다: 무덤에 있는 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 조종하에 탭된 채로 전장에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 악마\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd55f1b2-9adc-4f85-b221-4fb7b6591ac1\', \'multiverseId\': 419494}, \'multiverseid\': 419494}, {\'name\': \'Demônio dos Esquemas Sombrios\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Demônio dos Esquemas Sombrios entra no campo de batalha, todas as outras criaturas recebem -2/-2 até o final do turno.\\nToda vez que outra criatura morre, você recebe {E} (um marcador de energia).\\n{2}{B}, Pague {E}{E}{E}{E}: Coloque o card de criatura alvo de um cemitério no campo de batalha sob seu controle virado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f42a8dcf-a93f-4329-836b-439a3ae41ff1\', \'multiverseId\': 419758}, \'multiverseid\': 419758}, {\'name\': \'Демон Темных Замыслов\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Демон Темных Замыслов выходит на поле битвы, все другие существа получают -2/-2 до конца хода.\\nКаждый раз, когда другое существо умирает, вы получаете {E} (один жетон энергии).\\n{2}{B}, заплатите {E}{E}{E}{E}: положите целевую карту существа из кладбища на поле битвы под вашим контролем повернутой.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Демон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b3b90a1-f5b1-4a30-99b7-df5809d0fc62\', \'multiverseId\': 420022}, \'multiverseid\': 420022}, {\'name\': \'暗谋恶魔\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当暗谋恶魔进战场时，所有其他生物得-2/-2直到回合结束。\\n每当另一个生物死去时，你得到{E}（一个能量指示物）。\\n{2}{B}，支付{E}{E}{E}{E}：将目标生物牌在你的操控下从坟墓场横置放进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e1a9db7-a4aa-41b0-a02d-1aa376ad65c6\', \'multiverseId\': 417910}, \'multiverseid\': 417910}, {\'name\': \'暗謀惡魔\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當暗謀惡魔進戰場時，所有其他生物得-2/-2直到回合結束。\\n每當另一個生物死去時，你得到{E}（一個能量指示物）。\\n{2}{B}，支付{E}{E}{E}{E}：將目標生物牌在你的操控下從墳墓場橫置放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物～惡魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab87da21-d4f8-4fd9-996d-f2ff91b9216e\', \'multiverseId\': 418174}, \'multiverseid\': 418174}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418615&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0add1619-f1f2-4bce-85f1-b15ca2bd1267', 'multiverseId': 418615}, 'multiverseid': 418615}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420463&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'add7a019-c936-4a4f-821d-8a646c11e681', 'multiverseId': 420463}, 'multiverseid': 420463}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418879&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d1a0776-859d-4dda-accf-53500fea19a8', 'multiverseId': 418879}, 'multiverseid': 418879}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419143&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b0a6f8bf-b094-4b2d-8a46-9175ab9c1b89', 'multiverseId': 419143}, 'multiverseid': 419143}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419407&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c20124db-70a3-4a35-a665-7e2c0560b0dc', 'multiverseId': 419407}, 'multiverseid': 419407}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419671&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '44b4b660-e398-4a25-888e-1ed289996199', 'multiverseId': 419671}, 'multiverseid': 419671}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419935&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ad1e9ab7-9a96-4c46-b282-6cf6f43eba6a', 'multiverseId': 419935}, 'multiverseid': 419935}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420199&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cab8afad-36d1-4cb2-862e-2e7d1884de50', 'multiverseId': 420199}, 'multiverseid': 420199}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418087&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '22a47b9b-5010-40f5-be52-103f5dc2e0fa', 'multiverseId': 418087}, 'multiverseid': 418087}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418351&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e5c6f5a-11ce-4258-b4ca-7f9d95531e81', 'multiverseId': 418351}, 'multiverseid': 418351}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418616&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9fc07d98-c6d7-4376-a967-5f6cfcb504fc', 'multiverseId': 418616}, 'multiverseid': 418616}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420464&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5533518a-9625-4221-8356-b22d7ba0e640', 'multiverseId': 420464}, 'multiverseid': 420464}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418880&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '518a65c0-5ffb-42f7-94ff-5fc42756e1a2', 'multiverseId': 418880}, 'multiverseid': 418880}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419144&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8a4ed19b-a52b-45c4-a645-bbe00f87031c', 'multiverseId': 419144}, 'multiverseid': 419144}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419408&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aee3975f-35b4-478a-a4a6-221f14cc8bf9', 'multiverseId': 419408}, 'multiverseid': 419408}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419672&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9cc42a82-c1b7-4043-bba1-72bdb7a31abe', 'multiverseId': 419672}, 'multiverseid': 419672}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419936&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '70047d67-3898-4b0d-af59-01cd13bb85c7', 'multiverseId': 419936}, 'multiverseid': 419936}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420200&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a3fd404-4244-408c-a659-4189d4740dbd', 'multiverseId': 420200}, 'multiverseid': 420200}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418088&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b00581c8-bd15-4039-a19b-373b2482e512', 'multiverseId': 418088}, 'multiverseid': 418088}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418352&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7545e8a7-96af-4041-9b78-6efc39abb0c6', 'multiverseId': 418352}, 'multiverseid': 418352}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418617&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '80810eca-4eb5-4530-af19-80cd67b592aa', 'multiverseId': 418617}, 'multiverseid': 418617}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420465&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2871c9ea-d9f2-4f47-90a0-bf257f804e3c', 'multiverseId': 420465}, 'multiverseid': 420465}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418881&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f4b38e48-2e4e-47e2-9ea7-9a895eb1f7b4', 'multiverseId': 418881}, 'multiverseid': 418881}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419145&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '32667236-089d-4298-b5fb-7e7751db8104', 'multiverseId': 419145}, 'multiverseid': 419145}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419409&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d14f0fc-7310-438d-81a0-88d6e3339454', 'multiverseId': 419409}, 'multiverseid': 419409}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419673&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d0d683b-8797-4677-9f53-f3154661eef7', 'multiverseId': 419673}, 'multiverseid': 419673}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419937&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f4882712-5241-44bb-bb8a-c85640ad2928', 'multiverseId': 419937}, 'multiverseid': 419937}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420201&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '572f67e5-e891-4552-b935-bce6f0c81f95', 'multiverseId': 420201}, 'multiverseid': 420201}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418089&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5a4b7813-f79c-447d-b5c6-621ba9be07ad', 'multiverseId': 418089}, 'multiverseid': 418089}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418353&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1156aee5-b37d-4824-a688-3174a4c53ab8', 'multiverseId': 418353}, 'multiverseid': 418353}]", '[{\'name\': \'Eifriges Konstrukt\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Eifrige Konstrukt ins Spiel kommt, kann jeder Spieler Hellsicht 1 anwenden. (Betrachte für Hellsicht 1 die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek, dann kannst du diese Karte unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'Treu ergeben erahnt es jedes Bedürfnis seines Meisters.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418574&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b7f3215-a285-4eef-b103-5c4e25302c67\', \'multiverseId\': 418574}, \'multiverseid\': 418574}, {\'name\': \'Constructo entusiasta\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Constructo entusiasta entre al campo de batalla, cada jugador puede adivinar 1. (Para adivinar 1, mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca, luego puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Leal hasta el extremo, anticipa cada necesidad de su amo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a41dd41f-ee13-4ed9-bd84-ee529c95efaf\', \'multiverseId\': 420422}, \'multiverseid\': 420422}, {\'name\': \'Construction impatiente\', \'text\': \'Quand la Construction impatiente arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque joueur peut appliquer regard 1. (Pour appliquer regard 1, regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre cette carte au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': "Loyale à l\'excès, elle anticipe tous les désirs de son maître.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418838&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bc2425e-18f6-4655-ae39-d9d149e2daaf\', \'multiverseId\': 418838}, \'multiverseid\': 418838}, {\'name\': \'Costrutto Impaziente\', \'text\': \'Quando il Costrutto Impaziente entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni giocatore può profetizzare 1. (Per profetizzare 1, guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio, poi puoi metterla in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': "Fedele fino all\'eccesso, anticipa ogni desiderio del suo padrone.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b255d147-b0d9-493b-96e5-f665d938a60c\', \'multiverseId\': 419102}, \'multiverseid\': 419102}, {\'name\': \'歓待する構築物\', \'text\': \'歓待する構築物が戦場に出たとき、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ占術１を行ってもよい。（占術１を行うとは、「あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。その後あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。」ということである。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'それは忠義心の塊であり、主人の要求を一挙一動から推察する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d7ea39b-4688-47fe-804d-00f52d9fc0c2\', \'multiverseId\': 419366}, \'multiverseid\': 419366}, {\'name\': \'의욕 넘치는 기계장치\', \'text\': \'의욕 넘치는 기계장치가 전장에 들어올 때, 각 플레이어는 점술 1을 할 수 있다. (점술 1을 하려면 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 한 장을 본다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 자동기계\', \'flavor\': \'단점일 정도로 충직한 이들 기계는 주인이 필요한 것을 미리 처리한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbff33b0-c91c-40f2-964a-5b0b9a5a2fdd\', \'multiverseId\': 419630}, \'multiverseid\': 419630}, {\'name\': \'Construto Ansioso\', \'text\': \'Quando Construto Ansioso entra no campo de batalha, cada jogador pode usar vidência 1. (Para usar vidência 1, olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Depois, você pode colocar aquele card no fundo de seu grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Totalmente leal, ele antecipa cada necessidade de seu mestre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53d3f2bf-769c-43fa-a2f2-af5d2ad61a8c\', \'multiverseId\': 419894}, \'multiverseid\': 419894}, {\'name\': \'Нетерпеливая Конструкция\', \'text\': \'Когда Нетерпеливая Конструкция выходит на поле битвы, каждый игрок может предсказать 1. (Чтобы предсказать 1, посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки, затем вы можете положить ту карту в низ вашей библиотеки.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': \'Она угадывает все приказы своего хозяина и будет верна ему, несмотря ни на что.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0e446e6-37eb-4218-8a4f-d18415caa1a7\', \'multiverseId\': 420158}, \'multiverseid\': 420158}, {\'name\': \'热切组构体\', \'text\': \'当热切组构体进战场时，每位牌手各可以占卜1。（占卜1的流程是检视你牌库顶的牌，然后你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'它绝对忠诚，甚至会预测主人的需要。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0894d5e4-8ff3-4cc5-91b0-1b9ce44ef756\', \'multiverseId\': 418046}, \'multiverseid\': 418046}, {\'name\': \'熱切組構體\', \'text\': \'當熱切組構體進戰場時，每位玩家各可以占卜1。（占卜1的流程是檢視你的牌庫頂牌，然後你可以將該牌置入你的牌庫底。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物～組構體\', \'flavor\': \'它絕對忠誠，甚至會預測主人的需要。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2ce6b0a-356b-4248-ad84-08df54c8f03f\', \'multiverseId\': 418310}, \'multiverseid\': 418310}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eisenliga-Reittier\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nFabrizieren 1 (Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie oder erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Servo-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Eisenliga stellt ihre Metallformtechniken stolz zur Schau.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418584&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'313c798c-9720-40b2-bb1e-7fd01916dec0\', \'multiverseId\': 418584}, \'multiverseid\': 418584}, {\'name\': \'Corcel de la Liga de Hierro\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nFabricar 1. (Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella o crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Servo incolora 1/1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'La Liga de Hierro se enorgullece de su habilidad para dar forma al metal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c68d2b01-2961-4eb9-bd4e-0d389e6961d3\', \'multiverseId\': 420432}, \'multiverseid\': 420432}, {\'name\': \'Destrier de la Ligue de fer\', \'text\': \'Célérité\\nFabrication 1 (Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle ou créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Servo.)\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': "La Ligue de fer s\'enorgueillit de ses techniques de forge de métal.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418848&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dda84bb-9d01-4c6d-9e11-edb9929fae9c\', \'multiverseId\': 418848}, \'multiverseid\': 418848}, {\'name\': \'Destriero della Lega di Ferro\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\nFabbrica 1 (Quando questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa o crea una pedina creatura artefatto Servomeccanismo 1/1 incolore.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'Le tecniche di lavorazione dei metalli sono il vanto della Lega di Ferro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47493e1a-1ff3-4a09-b407-fa4a6cfb642e\', \'multiverseId\': 419112}, \'multiverseid\': 419112}, {\'name\': \'鉄華会の馬\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n製造１（このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置くか、無色の１/１の霊気装置・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'鉄華会は金属の造形技術に誇りを持っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d23c245-ff1c-429e-a42d-f55d9d36918b\', \'multiverseId\': 419376}, \'multiverseid\': 419376}, {\'name\': \'강철 연맹 전투마\', \'text\': \'신속\\n제작 1 (이 생물이 전장에 들어올 때, 이 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓거나 1/1 무색 서보 마법물체 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 자동기계\', \'flavor\': \'강철 연맹은 금속 성형 기술에 대한 자부심이 대단하다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78aaf9c1-5870-492f-b0a0-c1981b733064\', \'multiverseId\': 419640}, \'multiverseid\': 419640}, {\'name\': \'Corcel da Liga de Ferro\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nFabricar 1 (Quando esta criatura entrar no campo de batalha, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nela ou crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Servus.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'A Liga de Ferro tem orgulho de suas técnicas de moldagem metálica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79add717-0d43-428c-932c-a87bdf4077f5\', \'multiverseId\': 419904}, \'multiverseid\': 419904}, {\'name\': \'Скакун Железной Лиги\', \'text\': \'Ускорение\\nПроизводство 1 (Когда это существо выходит на поле битвы, положите на него один жетон +1/+1 или создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Сервотрон.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': \'Железная Лига гордится своими технологиями работы с металлом.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffd74552-715d-4a30-9116-59d51bb8c5c3\', \'multiverseId\': 420168}, \'multiverseid\': 420168}, {\'name\': \'铁盟驹\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n装配1（当此生物进战场时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物或派出一个1/1无色自动机衍生神器生物。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'铁盟以其塑金技术为傲。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11886920-5dc4-408a-8379-2d07004a76f7\', \'multiverseId\': 418056}, \'multiverseid\': 418056}, {\'name\': \'鐵盟駒\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n裝配1（當此生物進戰場時，在其上放置一個+1/+1指示物或派出一個1/1無色自動機衍生神器生物。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物～組構體\', \'flavor\': \'鐵盟以其塑金技術為傲。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c3b2351-3557-441d-a2fa-e5386b32ea77\', \'multiverseId\': 418320}, \'multiverseid\': 418320}]', "[{'name': 'Elegante Klingenschleifer', 'text': 'Die Eleganten Klingenschleifer können von Kreaturen mit Stärke 2 oder weniger nicht geblockt werden.\\nFabrizieren 2 (Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf sie oder erzeuge zwei 1/1 farblose Servo-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elf, Handwerker', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418519&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fcd02b70-6914-4c99-b9bf-368bfb751332', 'multiverseId': 418519}, 'multiverseid': 418519}, {'name': 'Forjafilos sofisticados', 'text': 'Los Forjafilos sofisticados no pueden ser bloqueados por criaturas con fuerza de 2 o menos.\\nFabricar 2. (Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre ella o crea dos fichas de criatura artefacto Servo incoloras 1/1.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Artífice elfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420367&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c2456c25-1647-46f9-aa71-4a8439f3fc80', 'multiverseId': 420367}, 'multiverseid': 420367}, {'name': 'Façonneurs de lames élégants', 'text': 'Les Façonneurs de lames élégants ne peuvent pas être bloqués par les créatures de force inférieure ou égale à 2.\\nFabrication 2 (Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle ou créez deux jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Servo.)', 'type': 'Créature : elfe et artificier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418783&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2b5a382c-e6d7-4a9d-a6c9-32244d2e96ed', 'multiverseId': 418783}, 'multiverseid': 418783}, {'name': 'Forgiaspade Eleganti', 'text': 'I Forgiaspade Eleganti non possono essere bloccati da creature con forza pari o inferiore a 2.\\nFabbrica 2 (Quando questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, metti due segnalini +1/+1 su di essa o crea due pedine creatura artefatto Servomeccanismo 1/1 incolori.)', 'type': 'Creatura — Artefice Elfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419047&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '71f4bc92-7140-4e08-8af7-0c4413e3c195', 'multiverseId': 419047}, 'multiverseid': 419047}, {'name': '洗練された鍛刃士', 'text': '洗練された鍛刃士は、パワーが２以下のクリーチャーによってはブロックされない。\\n製造２（このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置くか、無色の１/１の霊気装置・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルフ・工匠', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419311&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8764338f-37d7-41d8-a32f-dc3e1f4ffc3d', 'multiverseId': 419311}, 'multiverseid': 419311}, {'name': '우아한 칼날 제작자', 'text': '우아한 칼날 제작자는 공격력이 2 이하인 생물에게 방어될 수 없다.\\n제작 2 (이 생물이 전장에 들어올 때, 이 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓거나 1/1 무색 서보 마법물체 생물 토큰 두 개를 만든다.)', 'type': '생물 — 엘프 기능공', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419575&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07750547-3010-4f24-bbd4-5e3f882d25e3', 'multiverseId': 419575}, 'multiverseid': 419575}, {'name': 'Fieiros Elegantes', 'text': 'Fieiros Elegantes não pode ser bloqueado por criaturas com poder igual ou inferior a 2.\\nFabricar 2 (Quando esta criatura entrar no campo de batalha, coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 nela ou crie duas fichas de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Servus.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Elfo Artesão', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419839&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb0fb48c-f9f3-428b-a806-63939ab47bfb', 'multiverseId': 419839}, 'multiverseid': 419839}, {'name': 'Элегантные Клинкоделы', 'text': 'Элегантные Клинкоделы не могут быть заблокированы существами с силой 2 или меньше.\\nПроизводство 2 (Когда это существо выходит на поле битвы, положите на него два жетона +1/+1 или создайте две фишки артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Сервотрон.)', 'type': 'Существо — Эльф Механик', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420103&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '23b6be0d-f14f-44ed-baf7-399997746a97', 'multiverseId': 420103}, 'multiverseid': 420103}, {'name': '优雅锋刃匠', 'text': '优雅锋刃匠不能被力量等于或小于2的生物阻挡。\\n装配2（当此生物进战场时，在其上放置两个+1/+1指示物或派出两个1/1无色自动机衍生神器生物。）', 'type': '生物～妖精／神器师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417991&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07f71894-d70e-4ee8-b84b-4605156a250b', 'multiverseId': 417991}, 'multiverseid': 417991}, {'name': '優雅鋒刃匠', 'text': '優雅鋒刃匠不能被力量等於或小於2的生物阻擋。\\n裝配2（當此生物進戰場時，在其上放置兩個+1/+1指示物或派出兩個1/1無色自動機衍生神器生物。）', 'type': '生物～妖精／神器師', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418255&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8f839df2-ac1d-4847-b23e-0030956c88e2', 'multiverseId': 418255}, 'multiverseid': 418255}]", '[{\'name\': \'Elektrostatischer Prügler\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Elektrostatische Prügler ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E}{E}{E} (drei Energiemarken).\\nBezahle {E}{E}{E}: Der Elektrostatische Prügler erhält +X/+X bis zum Ende des Zuges, wobei X gleich seiner Stärke ist.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418575&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'398fe190-c1d3-43ce-95fe-d9a4512fc88c\', \'multiverseId\': 418575}, \'multiverseid\': 418575}, {\'name\': \'Perforador electrostático\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Perforador electrostático entre al campo de batalla, obtienes {E}{E}{E} (tres contadores de energía).\\nPagar {E}{E}{E}: El Perforador electrostático obtiene +X/+X hasta el final del turno, donde X es su fuerza.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7ed51ce-07dd-48ba-901f-bba7cb57ad3e\', \'multiverseId\': 420423}, \'multiverseid\': 420423}, {\'name\': \'Marteleur électrostatique\', \'text\': "Quand le Marteleur électrostatique arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez {E}{E}{E} (trois marqueurs « énergie »).\\nPayez {E}{E}{E} : Le Marteleur électrostatique gagne +X/+X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant sa force.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418839&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b16f9a46-7bea-426b-8fff-f09249bc5a5c\', \'multiverseId\': 418839}, \'multiverseid\': 418839}, {\'name\': \'Assaltatore Elettrostatico\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Assaltatore Elettrostatico entra nel campo di battaglia, ottieni {E}{E}{E} (tre segnalini energia).\\nPaga {E}{E}{E}: L\'Assaltatore Elettrostatico prende +X/+X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è la sua forza.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa011a85-9640-4b21-b148-afdee269e799\', \'multiverseId\': 419103}, \'multiverseid\': 419103}, {\'name\': \'静電気式打撃体\', \'text\': \'静電気式打撃体が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{E}{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター３個）を得る。\\n{E}{E}{E}を支払う：ターン終了時まで、静電気式打撃体は＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはそれのパワーに等しい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef630208-acaa-44cb-b404-59e8c9b51a0e\', \'multiverseId\': 419367}, \'multiverseid\': 419367}, {\'name\': \'정전기 분쇄기\', \'text\': \'정전기 분쇄기가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 {E}{E}{E}(에너지 카운터 세 개)를 얻는다.\\n{E}{E}{E}를 지불한다: 정전기 분쇄기는 턴종료까지 +X/+X를 받는다. X는 정전기 분쇄기의 공격력이다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 자동기계\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d78b734-dccb-4ca7-a904-a2cf235c15dc\', \'multiverseId\': 419631}, \'multiverseid\': 419631}, {\'name\': \'Esmurrador Eletrostático\', \'text\': \'Quando Esmurrador Eletrostático entra no campo de batalha, você recebe {E}{E}{E} (três marcadores de energia).\\nPague {E}{E}{E}: Esmurrador Eletrostático recebe +X/+X até o final do turno, sendo X seu poder.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'519cdf9e-e142-4d21-ac2e-527879589a4b\', \'multiverseId\': 419895}, \'multiverseid\': 419895}, {\'name\': \'Электростатический Молотильщик\', \'text\': \'Когда Электростатический Молотильщик выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете {E}{E}{E} (три жетона энергии).\\nЗаплатите {E}{E}{E}: Электростатический Молотильщик получает +X/+X до конца хода, где X — значение его силы.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2b2b286-0834-435b-8421-e85146fdca18\', \'multiverseId\': 420159}, \'multiverseid\': 420159}, {\'name\': \'静电猛击手\', \'text\': \'当静电猛击手进战场时，你得到{E}{E}{E}（三个能量指示物）。\\n支付{E}{E}{E}：静电猛击手得+X/+X直到回合结束，X为其力量。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c26eccc-57d7-4e61-b177-01f314911735\', \'multiverseId\': 418047}, \'multiverseid\': 418047}, {\'name\': \'靜電猛擊手\', \'text\': \'當靜電猛擊手進戰場時，你得到{E}{E}{E}（三個能量指示物）。\\n支付{E}{E}{E}：靜電猛擊手得+X/+X直到回合結束，X為其力量。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～組構體\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9477de2-8565-4a3c-8f48-6014ba01e53d\', \'multiverseId\': 418311}, \'multiverseid\': 418311}]', '[{\'name\': \'Embraal-Scherge\', \'text\': \'Der Embraal-Scherge kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nDer Embraal-Scherge hat Bedrohlichkeit, solange du ein Artefakt kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'In Embraal verteidigen Erfinderbanden ihren Boden mit raffinierten Geräten und stumpfen Gegenständen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418444&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfeee7cc-9ddd-4ce0-b349-43bd545d9691\', \'multiverseId\': 418444}, \'multiverseid\': 418444}, {\'name\': \'Matón de Embraal\', \'text\': \'El Matón de Embraal entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nEl Matón de Embraal tiene la habilidad de amenaza mientras controles un artefacto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'En Embraal, las bandas de inventores defienden su territorio con dispositivos ingeniosos y objetos suficientemente contundentes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abd392b7-558e-445c-af11-4ca9f2e888d8\', \'multiverseId\': 420292}, \'multiverseid\': 420292}, {\'name\': "Cogneur d\'Embraal", \'text\': "Le Cogneur d\'Embraal arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nLe Cogneur d\'Embraal a la menace tant que vous contrôlez un artefact.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "À Embraal, les gangs d\'inventeurs défendent leur territoire grâce à des appareils ingénieux et des objets contondants.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418708&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68e2e3bd-2271-449b-98ae-bc9ee7188b13\', \'multiverseId\': 418708}, \'multiverseid\': 418708}, {\'name\': \'Picchiatore di Embraal\', \'text\': \'Il Picchiatore di Embraal entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nIl Picchiatore di Embraal ha minacciare fintanto che controlli un artefatto.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Ad Embraal, le bande di inventori difendono il proprio territorio con meccanismi ingegnosi e oggetti contundenti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'587e5f24-4381-4527-bf17-a12b3cdaa496\', \'multiverseId\': 418972}, \'multiverseid\': 418972}, {\'name\': \'エンブロールの暴れ者\', \'text\': \'エンブロールの暴れ者はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nあなたがアーティファクトをコントロールしているかぎり、エンブロールの暴れ者は威迫を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'エンブロールの発明者たちは、独創的な機器と鈍器で縄張りを守る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4abc89ac-1be9-4c36-8aac-c28502a9105c\', \'multiverseId\': 419236}, \'multiverseid\': 419236}, {\'name\': \'엠브라알 무뢰한\', \'text\': \'엠브라알 무뢰한은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n엠브라알 무뢰한은 당신이 마법물체를 조종하는 한 호전적을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': \'엠브라알에서 발명가 집단은 기발한 장치와 둔기로 자신의 영역을 지킨다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4282ffe9-e35d-4c8f-8757-51712fbba740\', \'multiverseId\': 419500}, \'multiverseid\': 419500}, {\'name\': \'Capanga de Embraal\', \'text\': \'Capanga de Embraal entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nCapanga de Embraal terá ameaçar enquanto você controlar um artefato.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Em Embraal, gangues de inventores defendem seus territórios com dispositivos criativos e objetos contundentes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68660633-6fb4-452d-8e12-09e014b68cdf\', \'multiverseId\': 419764}, \'multiverseid\': 419764}, {\'name\': \'Эмбраальский Громила\', \'text\': \'Эмбраальский Громила выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nЭмбраальский Громила имеет Угрозу, пока вы контролируете артефакт.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'В Эмбраале изобретатели объединяются в банды и защищают свои владения при помощи хитроумных устройств и тупых предметов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90f5476d-46a2-4775-b981-3816d1220490\', \'multiverseId\': 420028}, \'multiverseid\': 420028}, {\'name\': \'安布洛恶棍\', \'text\': \'安布洛恶棍须横置进战场。\\n只要你操控神器，安布洛恶棍便具有威慑异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'安布洛的发明家帮派在捍卫地盘时，精妙设备与粗钝武器并用。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61e488a7-51cc-460b-8450-e07d29879cd2\', \'multiverseId\': 417916}, \'multiverseid\': 417916}, {\'name\': \'安布洛惡棍\', \'text\': \'安布洛惡棍須橫置進戰場。\\n只要你操控神器，安布洛惡棍便具有威懾異能。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'安布洛的發明家幫派在捍衛地盤時，精妙設備與粗鈍武器並用。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a659bffe-14c8-4c8e-948f-0db98f74e27f\', \'multiverseId\': 418180}, \'multiverseid\': 418180}]', '[{\'name\': \'Emotionales Wiedersehen\', \'text\': \'Wirf als zusätzliche Kosten, um Emotionales Wiedersehen zu wirken, zwei Karten ab.\\nZiehe drei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Macht ihrer Umarmung überbrückt die Kluft der Jahre und der zerstörten Welten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418474&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad120790-89b9-4853-894f-9e19266cc629\', \'multiverseId\': 418474}, \'multiverseid\': 418474}, {\'name\': \'Reencuentro catártico\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar el Reencuentro catártico, descarta dos cartas.\\nRoba tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'El abismo en forma de años y mundos se hizo trizas frente al poder de su abrazo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bdabb8e-6aae-4e0c-b8ca-dc50b18a7d3c\', \'multiverseId\': 420322}, \'multiverseid\': 420322}, {\'name\': \'Retrouvailles cathartiques\', \'text\': \'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer les Retrouvailles cathartiques, défaussez-vous de deux cartes.\\nPiochez trois cartes.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Le gouffre des mondes et des années s\'estompa sous la force de leur étreinte.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418738&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87a1b07d-bc11-43e5-a50e-a3f022b7bc68\', \'multiverseId\': 418738}, \'multiverseid\': 418738}, {\'name\': \'Ricongiungimento Catartico\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare il Ricongiungimento Catartico, scarta due carte.\\nPesca tre carte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Una distanza abissale fatta di anni e mondi fu colmata dal potere del loro abbraccio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c79b44d-69a8-48e0-be9c-94d56408e046\', \'multiverseId\': 419002}, \'multiverseid\': 419002}, {\'name\': \'安堵の再会\', \'text\': \'安堵の再会を唱えるための追加コストとして、カード２枚を捨てる。\\nカードを３枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'長い年月も世界の隔たりも、抱き合う二人にとって障害にはならなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3000e29-a4d5-4134-b7a7-a26f57105535\', \'multiverseId\': 419266}, \'multiverseid\': 419266}, {\'name\': \'후련해지는 재회\', \'text\': \'후련해지는 재회를 발동하기 위한 추가비용으로, 카드 두 장을 버린다.\\n카드 세 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'엄청난 시공간의 간극이 한 번의 포옹으로 메워졌다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'809b0a4d-0811-4370-ba68-8afa71293d94\', \'multiverseId\': 419530}, \'multiverseid\': 419530}, {\'name\': \'Reunião Catártica\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar Reunião Catártica, descarte dois cards.\\nCompre três cards.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'O abismo de anos e mundos ruiu ante o poder de seu abraço.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5513dde9-174f-4c62-89a3-0063c6ec367f\', \'multiverseId\': 419794}, \'multiverseid\': 419794}, {\'name\': \'Трогательное Воссоединение\', \'text\': \'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания Трогательного Воссоединения сбросьте две карты.\\nВозьмите три карты.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Стена между годами и мирами обрушилась под силой их объятий.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1a79ad8-8550-4fd6-a230-11f787c936ca\', \'multiverseId\': 420058}, \'multiverseid\': 420058}, {\'name\': \'感人重逢\', \'text\': \'弃两张牌，以作为施放感人重逢的额外费用。\\n抓三张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'只消紧紧拥抱，多少岁月与世界的隔阂都会烟消云散。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4376671b-c4df-415a-bc6f-dbca0ef960c8\', \'multiverseId\': 417946}, \'multiverseid\': 417946}, {\'name\': \'感人重逢\', \'text\': \'棄兩張牌，以作為施放感人重逢的額外費用。\\n抽三張牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'只消緊緊擁抱，多少歲月與世界的隔閡都會煙消雲散。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ffdec9d-a55e-4b2d-bbc0-d45477e55b0e\', \'multiverseId\': 418210}, \'multiverseid\': 418210}]', '[{\'name\': \'Engel der Innovation\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit, Lebensverknüpfung\\nFabrizieren 2 (Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf sie oder erzeuge zwei 1/1 farblose Servo-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine.)\\nAndere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418369&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68333801-901c-48b7-a3da-6defe84351d0\', \'multiverseId\': 418369}, \'multiverseid\': 418369}, {\'name\': \'Ángel de la invención\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia, vínculo vital.\\nFabricar 2. (Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre ella o crea dos fichas de criatura artefacto Servo incoloras 1/1.)\\nLas otras criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a236894-b95e-4a2c-8b07-174391341b16\', \'multiverseId\': 420217}, \'multiverseid\': 420217}, {\'name\': "Ange de l\'inventivité", \'text\': \'Vol, vigilance, lien de vie\\nFabrication 2 (Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle ou créez deux jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Servo.)\\nLes autres créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418633&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'839c7633-d7f5-4f34-aeea-fc5b42170cb5\', \'multiverseId\': 418633}, \'multiverseid\': 418633}, {\'name\': "Angelo dell\'Invenzione", \'text\': \'Volare, cautela, legame vitale\\nFabbrica 2 (Quando questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, metti due segnalini +1/+1 su di essa o crea due pedine creatura artefatto Servomeccanismo 1/1 incolori.)\\nLe altre creature che controlli prendono +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44d04335-9a47-4ad9-b364-ae6dd6d2a9ca\', \'multiverseId\': 418897}, \'multiverseid\': 418897}, {\'name\': \'発明の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒、絆魂\\n製造２（このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置くか、無色の１/１の霊気装置・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。）\\nあなたがコントロールする他のクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39dc2187-1d65-4cf2-b3e0-46aadcf6ea99\', \'multiverseId\': 419161}, \'multiverseid\': 419161}, {\'name\': \'발명의 천사\', \'text\': \'비행, 경계, 생명연결\\n제작 2 (이 생물이 전장에 들어올 때, 이 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓거나 1/1 무색 서보 마법물체 생물 토큰 두 개를 만든다.)\\n당신이 조종하는 다른 생물들은 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 천사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b274a427-a22d-4559-bee1-95be469cc46f\', \'multiverseId\': 419425}, \'multiverseid\': 419425}, {\'name\': \'Anjo da Invenção\', \'text\': \'Voar, vigilância, vínculo com a vida\\nFabricar 2 (Quando esta criatura entrar no campo de batalha, coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 nela ou crie duas fichas de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Servus.)\\nAs outras criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0f9018f-fce3-447c-9d2b-3c2b46760ce9\', \'multiverseId\': 419689}, \'multiverseid\': 419689}, {\'name\': \'Ангел Изобретений\', \'text\': \'Полет, Бдительность, Цепь жизни\\nПроизводство 2 (Когда это существо выходит на поле битвы, положите на него два жетона +1/+1 или создайте две фишки артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Сервотрон.)\\nДругие существа под вашим контролем получают +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2a0affe-890a-4438-9890-86f850104581\', \'multiverseId\': 419953}, \'multiverseid\': 419953}, {\'name\': \'新创天使\', \'text\': \'飞行，警戒，系命\\n装配2（当此生物进战场时，在其上放置两个+1/+1指示物或派出两个1/1无色自动机衍生神器生物。）\\n由你操控的其他生物得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'169deb8e-3031-42ec-a637-f8d04ed632d4\', \'multiverseId\': 417841}, \'multiverseid\': 417841}, {\'name\': \'新創天使\', \'text\': \'飛行，警戒，繫命\\n裝配2（當此生物進戰場時，在其上放置兩個+1/+1指示物或派出兩個1/1無色自動機衍生神器生物。）\\n由你操控的其他生物得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e778f2c8-57c9-428e-9201-f0191a05beac\', \'multiverseId\': 418105}, \'multiverseid\': 418105}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erfahrener Rennfahrer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Erfahrene Rennfahrer ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 2 an.\\nImmer wenn der Erfahrene Rennfahrer ein Fahrzeug bemannt, erhält das Fahrzeug +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zwerg, Pilot\', \'flavor\': \'Bei der Messe tritt er zu jedem Rennen an und hat immer den Sieg vor Augen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418553&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bc7cf89-6d61-4f60-baef-78be6118c96e\', \'multiverseId\': 418553}, \'multiverseid\': 418553}, {\'name\': \'Piloto veterano\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Piloto veterano entre al campo de batalla, adivina 2.\\nSiempre que el Piloto veterano tripule un Vehículo, ese Vehículo obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Enano piloto\', \'flavor\': \'Se propuso competir en todas y cada una de las carreras de la feria, y planea ganarlas todas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86cd5cc6-1469-4721-ab4f-cfd7a6ec8f18\', \'multiverseId\': 420401}, \'multiverseid\': 420401}, {\'name\': \'Pilote vétéran\', \'text\': "Quand le Pilote vétéran arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 2.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Pilote vétéran pilote un véhicule, ce véhicule gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : nain et pilote\', \'flavor\': "Il est déterminé à participer à toutes les courses de la Foire, et a l\'intention de toutes les remporter.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418817&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1266abb-7f11-4048-aaa5-ea42b3b5a404\', \'multiverseId\': 418817}, \'multiverseid\': 418817}, {\'name\': \'Manovratore Veterano\', \'text\': \'Quando il Manovratore Veterano entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 2.\\nOgniqualvolta il Manovratore Veterano manovra un Veicolo, quel Veicolo prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pilota Nano\', \'flavor\': \'Si è iscritto a ognuna delle gare della Fiera e ha intenzione di vincerle tutte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d86df3b-5ca8-40bc-8535-c9ad650371db\', \'multiverseId\': 419081}, \'multiverseid\': 419081}, {\'name\': \'経験豊富な操縦者\', \'text\': \'経験豊富な操縦者が戦場に出たとき、占術２を行う。\\n経験豊富な操縦者が機体１つに搭乗するたび、ターン終了時まで、その機体は＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドワーフ・操縦士\', \'flavor\': \'この男は、博覧会の全競走に参加して、そのすべてに勝つ気でいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3a84f38-4355-434e-99ff-a09dc65ff567\', \'multiverseId\': 419345}, \'multiverseid\': 419345}, {\'name\': \'노련한 운전수\', \'text\': \'노련한 운전수가 전장에 들어올 때, 점술 2를 한다.\\n노련한 운전수가 탑승물에 탑승할 때마다, 그 탑승물은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 드워프 조종사\', \'flavor\': \'그는 박람회에서 열리는 모든 경주에 참가할 준비를 마쳤고, 전부 우승할 계획이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6faba1d3-b743-4593-8f22-eef428c9aebb\', \'multiverseId\': 419609}, \'multiverseid\': 419609}, {\'name\': \'Motorista Veterano\', \'text\': \'Quando Motorista Veterano entrar no campo de batalha, use vidência 2.\\nToda vez que Motorista Veterano tripula um Veículo, aquele Veículo recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anão Piloto\', \'flavor\': \'Ele está inscrito para competir em cada corrida da Feira, e pretende vencer todas elas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60b5bff3-4763-405e-9748-0d1d56742869\', \'multiverseId\': 419873}, \'multiverseid\': 419873}, {\'name\': \'Водитель-Ветеран\', \'text\': \'Когда Водитель-Ветеран выходит на поле битвы, предскажите 2.\\nКаждый раз, когда Водитель-Ветеран входит в Экипаж Машины, та Машина получает +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гном Пилот\', \'flavor\': \'Он собирается принять участие во всех гонках на Ярмарке и намерен выиграть каждую из них.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bad88eb-3cd2-42f4-a984-ebbc43a8a2f4\', \'multiverseId\': 420137}, \'multiverseid\': 420137}, {\'name\': \'老练车手\', \'text\': \'当老练车手进战场时，占卜2。\\n每当老练车手搭载载具时，该载具得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～矮人／驾手\', \'flavor\': \'他准备好参加博览会的每一场比赛，还打算囊括所有的冠军。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fac3bb6a-e9ff-458f-bc91-ea345026a688\', \'multiverseId\': 418025}, \'multiverseid\': 418025}, {\'name\': \'老練車手\', \'text\': \'當老練車手進戰場時，占卜2。\\n每當老練車手搭載載具時，該載具得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～矮人／駕手\', \'flavor\': \'他準備好參加博覽會的每一場比賽，還打算囊括所有的冠軍。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c93dd13-b478-4f15-a02b-40b99d9ac5e2\', \'multiverseId\': 418289}, \'multiverseid\': 418289}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erfindermesse\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls du drei oder mehr Artefakte kontrollierst, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {C}.\\n{4}, {T}, opfere die Erfindermesse: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Artefaktkarte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische dann deine Bibliothek. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du drei oder mehr Artefakte kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418612&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cede3163-f116-4213-8f92-992dfe11e51f\', \'multiverseId\': 418612}, \'multiverseid\': 418612}, {\'name\': \'Feria de Inventores\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si controlas tres artefactos o más, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {C} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{4}, {T}, sacrificar la Feria de Inventores: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de artefacto, muéstrala y ponla en tu mano. Luego, baraja tu biblioteca. Activa esta habilidad solo si controlas tres o más artefactos.\', \'type\': \'Tierra legendaria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de4ba902-6da2-456b-b260-d56b7c1653d2\', \'multiverseId\': 420460}, \'multiverseid\': 420460}, {\'name\': \'Foire des inventeurs\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, si vous contrôlez au moins trois artefacts, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C} à votre réserve.\\n{4}, {T}, sacrifiez la Foire des inventeurs : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte d\'artefact, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque. N\'activez cette capacité que si vous contrôlez au moins trois artefacts.", \'type\': \'Terrain légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418876&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87297fbb-980c-4043-9960-1ad33d23ce26\', \'multiverseId\': 418876}, \'multiverseid\': 418876}, {\'name\': \'Fiera degli Inventori\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se controlli tre o più artefatti, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{4}, {T}, Sacrifica la Fiera degli Inventori: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta artefatto, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio. Attiva questa abilità solo se controlli tre o più artefatti.", \'type\': \'Terra Leggendaria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9899dfbd-1705-4326-9c53-3ea193c76cc3\', \'multiverseId\': 419140}, \'multiverseid\': 419140}, {\'name\': \'発明博覧会\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたがアーティファクトを３つ以上コントロールしている場合、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{C}を加える。\\n{4}, {T}, 発明博覧会を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーからアーティファクト・カード１枚を探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。この能力は、あなたがアーティファクトを３つ以上コントロールしているときにのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'伝説の土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59e04bf5-eb64-4472-87e3-a35cb251fb01\', \'multiverseId\': 419404}, \'multiverseid\': 419404}, {\'name\': \'발명 박람회\', \'text\': \'당신의 유지단 시작에, 당신이 마법물체를 세 개 이상 조종한다면, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\\n{T}: {C}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\\n{4}, {T}, 발명 박람회를 희생한다: 당신의 서고에서 마법물체 카드 한 장을 찾아 공개한 후, 당신의 손으로 가져간다. 그 후 당신의 서고를 섞는다. 이 능력은 당신이 마법물체를 세 개 이상 조종할 때에만 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 대지\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90ee9530-0c01-4e5e-9b33-7ad55bc54eda\', \'multiverseId\': 419668}, \'multiverseid\': 419668}, {\'name\': \'Feira dos Inventores\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, se você controla três ou mais artefatos, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {C} à sua reserva de mana.\\n{4}, {T}, Sacrifique Feira dos Inventores: Procure um card de artefato em seu grimório, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e, em seguida, embaralhe seu grimório. Ative esta habilidade somente se você controlar três ou mais artefatos.\', \'type\': \'Terreno Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b8e6bfb-d6ba-437d-a5c0-51468b8c7380\', \'multiverseId\': 419932}, \'multiverseid\': 419932}, {\'name\': \'Ярмарка Изобретателей\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего шага поддержки, если вы контролируете не менее трех артефактов, вы получаете 1 жизнь.\\n{T}: добавьте {C} в ваше хранилище маны.\\n{4}, {T}, пожертвуйте Ярмарку Изобретателей: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту артефакта, покажите ее, положите ее в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку. Активируйте эту способность, только если вы контролируете не менее трех артефактов.\', \'type\': \'Легендарная Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'706f5b89-ec3f-4150-9031-5d869c43527e\', \'multiverseId\': 420196}, \'multiverseid\': 420196}, {\'name\': \'发明家博览会\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，若你操控三个或更多神器，你获得1点生命。\\n{T}：加{C}到你的法术力池中。\\n{4}，{T}，牺牲发明家博览会：从你的牌库中搜寻一张神器牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后将你的牌库洗牌。只能于你操控三个或更多神器时起动此异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a49eb76-5f53-434f-9670-a25953db23ab\', \'multiverseId\': 418084}, \'multiverseid\': 418084}, {\'name\': \'發明家博覽會\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，若你操控三個或更多神器，你獲得1點生命。\\n{T}：加{C}到你的魔法力池中。\\n{4}，{T}，犧牲發明家博覽會：從你的牌庫中搜尋一張神器牌，展示該牌，將它置於你手上，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。只能於你操控三個或更多神器時起動此異能。\', \'type\': \'傳奇地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f98d275-91a7-4da4-be5d-078cbdf2beea\', \'multiverseId\': 418348}, \'multiverseid\': 418348}]', '[{\'name\': \'Essenzextraktion\', \'text\': \'Essenzextraktion fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu und du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Besonders „begabte" unter den Äthergeborenen können die Lebensessenz anderer Lebewesen in sich aufsaugen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418445&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6cfe1da-0784-41a1-bf65-fa4b7f4389dc\', \'multiverseId\': 418445}, \'multiverseid\': 418445}, {\'name\': \'Extracción de esencia\', \'text\': \'La Extracción de esencia hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo y tú ganas 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los etergénitos más dotados pueden succionar la esencia vital de otros seres vivos en su beneficio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f261eb04-c618-43f3-bda8-659c995c97ca\', \'multiverseId\': 420293}, \'multiverseid\': 420293}, {\'name\': "Extraction d\'essence", \'text\': "L\'Extraction d\'essence inflige 3 blessures à la créature ciblée et vous gagnez 3 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les éthériens « doués » peuvent attirer à eux l\'essence vitale des autres êtres vivants.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418709&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8421a8ea-4561-4e81-b7c4-ede3ca626b2c\', \'multiverseId\': 418709}, \'multiverseid\': 418709}, {\'name\': \'Estrazione di Essenza\', \'text\': "L\'Estrazione di Essenza infligge 3 danni a una creatura bersaglio e tu guadagni 3 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'I più "abili" tra gli eteridi possono assorbire in sé l\\\'essenza vitale di altri esseri viventi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcae1f41-83f4-4608-85ee-65b1a78507a0\', \'multiverseId\': 418973}, \'multiverseid\': 418973}, {\'name\': \'本質の摘出\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。本質の摘出はそれに３点のダメージを与え、あなたは３点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'一部の霊基体には特別な能力があり、他の生き物から生命の本質を抜き出して自分のものにできる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9593e59d-8842-4977-809e-4cb7ab9f7cc7\', \'multiverseId\': 419237}, \'multiverseid\': 419237}, {\'name\': \'정수 추출\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 정수 추출은 그 생물에게 피해 3점을 입히고 당신은 생명 3점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'에테르붙이 중 "특별한" 자들은 다른 생명체로부터 생명의 정수를 가져올 수 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63834edd-4737-4c2b-beb0-7a6cd0b9af2d\', \'multiverseId\': 419501}, \'multiverseid\': 419501}, {\'name\': \'Extração de Essência\', \'text\': \'Extração de Essência causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura alvo e você ganha 3 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Os "dotados" entre os etergênitos conseguem drenar a essência vital de outros seres para si mesmos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6650c379-ab2f-4c3f-9396-fdd12c560746\', \'multiverseId\': 419765}, \'multiverseid\': 419765}, {\'name\': \'Извлечение Сущности\', \'text\': \'Извлечение Сущности наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу, а вы получаете 3 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Одаренные» эфириды могут вытягивать энергию жизни других существ, забирая ее себе.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02c82282-cd91-4987-953b-9e2d7b44b769\', \'multiverseId\': 420029}, \'multiverseid\': 420029}, {\'name\': \'萃取菁华\', \'text\': \'萃取菁华对目标生物造成3点伤害且你获得3点生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'乙太种当中的「具天赋者」可以吸取其他生物的生命菁华。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fbf34fc-f1ea-4c2e-9c32-d0ea3a8822b3\', \'multiverseId\': 417917}, \'multiverseid\': 417917}, {\'name\': \'萃取菁華\', \'text\': \'萃取菁華對目標生物造成3點傷害且你獲得3點生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'乙太種當中的「具天賦者」可以吸取其他生物的生命菁華。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c0362e0-b5a0-4ba2-bfab-a48ddf2dabf8\', \'multiverseId\': 418181}, \'multiverseid\': 418181}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ewiglaufende Uhr\', \'text\': \'{T}: Lege die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.\\n{2}, schicke die Ewiglaufende Uhr ins Exil: Mische eine beliebige Anzahl an Karten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof in deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn du immerzu die Zeit im Blick hast, vergiss nicht, sie auch zu nutzen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418592&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42ea0a6d-fd19-4afe-8f1f-5d16f69b87e2\', \'multiverseId\': 418592}, \'multiverseid\': 418592}, {\'name\': \'Reloj perpetuo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Pon las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.\\n{2}, exiliar el Reloj perpetuo: Baraja cualquier cantidad de cartas objetivo de tu cementerio en tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'No te preocupes tanto por registrar el paso del tiempo, o te olvidarás de aprovecharlo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4407263f-b94d-48cd-9e05-aa5dc2dde21e\', \'multiverseId\': 420440}, \'multiverseid\': 420440}, {\'name\': \'Sablier perpétuel\', \'text\': "{T} : Mettez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.\\n{2}, exilez le Sablier perpétuel : Mélangez n\'importe quel nombre de cartes ciblées depuis votre cimetière dans votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'À trop vouloir mesurer le temps, on oublie de faire usage de celui dont on dispose.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418856&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7db40c8-654a-44b8-a8bf-79b151f0820a\', \'multiverseId\': 418856}, \'multiverseid\': 418856}, {\'name\': \'Orologio Perpetuo\', \'text\': "{T}: Metti nel tuo cimitero le prime due carte del tuo grimorio.\\n{2}, Esilia l\'Orologio Perpetuo: Rimescola nel tuo grimorio un qualsiasi numero di carte bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Non concentrarti troppo a misurare lo scorrere del tempo o dimenticherai di metterlo a buon frutto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbe2029a-0180-4b06-bc3c-3ccc251a4a53\', \'multiverseId\': 419120}, \'multiverseid\': 419120}, {\'name\': \'終わりなき時計\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを２枚あなたの墓地に置く。\\n{2}, 終わりなき時計を追放する：あなたの墓地から望む枚数のカードを対象とし、それらをあなたのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'活用するのを忘れるような時間の記録にこだわる必要はない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e4b137e-6a02-41f0-bde8-0ba33c90d286\', \'multiverseId\': 419384}, \'multiverseid\': 419384}, {\'name\': \'무한동작 시계\', \'text\': \'{T}: 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 두 장을 당신의 무덤에 넣는다.\\n{2}, 무한동작 시계를 추방한다: 당신의 무덤에 있는 카드를 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 그 카드들을 당신의 서고에 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'시간을 지키는 것에만 너무 얽매이면 시간을 잘 쓰는 법을 잊는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a4ce3bf-62a7-49fb-a3db-7e55da937c7c\', \'multiverseId\': 419648}, \'multiverseid\': 419648}, {\'name\': \'Cronômetro Perpétuo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Coloque os dois cards do topo de seu grimório em seu cemitério.\\n{2}, Exile Cronômetro Perpétuo: Embaralhe qualquer número de cards alvo de seu cemitério em seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Não se preocupe com a marcação do tempo a ponto de esquecer de utilizá-lo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92797d28-a5a8-4205-bba9-b3ae25aa485a\', \'multiverseId\': 419912}, \'multiverseid\': 419912}, {\'name\': \'Вечные Часы\', \'text\': \'{T}: положите две верхние карты вашей библиотеки на ваше кладбище.\\n{2}, изгоните Вечные Часы: втасуйте любое количество целевых карт из вашего кладбища в вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Тот, кто слишком усердно следит за течением времени, забывает это время использовать.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'647b68af-89a3-463e-b4a2-1a6d9bcbfaf3\', \'multiverseId\': 420176}, \'multiverseid\': 420176}, {\'name\': \'永动时计\', \'text\': \'{T}：将你牌库顶的两张牌置入你的坟墓场。\\n{2}，放逐永动时计：将任意数量的目标牌从你的坟墓场洗回你的牌库。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'不要一心沉浸在记录时间里，反而忘了善用它。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a88ff2b-896a-4510-8d31-31ab9fbeb4ef\', \'multiverseId\': 418064}, \'multiverseid\': 418064}, {\'name\': \'永動時計\', \'text\': \'{T}：將你牌庫頂的兩張牌置入你的墳墓場。\\n{2}，放逐永動時計：將任意數量的目標牌從你的墳墓場洗回你的牌庫。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'不要一心沉浸在記錄時間裡，反而忘了善用它。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35afaba8-c04a-429c-984a-9c3a4e99325e\', \'multiverseId\': 418328}, \'multiverseid\': 418328}]', '[{\'name\': \'Experimentierfreudiger Flugkünstler\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Experimentierfreudige Flugkünstler ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei 1/1 farblose Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Die kleinen Thopter waren so einsam, ich dachte, ich schau mal nach ihnen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418411&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15809e09-43a9-4cb8-a6ee-64de580dc72b\', \'multiverseId\': 418411}, \'multiverseid\': 418411}, {\'name\': \'Aviador experimental\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Aviador experimental entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de criatura artefacto Tóptero incoloras 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Estos bichitos se debían de sentir solos aquí arriba, así que pensé en acompañarlos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8cbd61a-4e4d-461e-9e84-516a5d312053\', \'multiverseId\': 420259}, \'multiverseid\': 420259}, {\'name\': \'Aviateur expérimental\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Aviateur expérimental arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': "« Les petits mécanoptères avaient l\'air bien seuls ici, alors j\'ai décidé de monter les voir. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418675&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f37e0e51-4e8d-4c2d-a264-515c128e8cce\', \'multiverseId\': 418675}, \'multiverseid\': 418675}, {\'name\': \'Aviatore Sperimentale\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Aviatore Sperimentale entra nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolori con volare.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Questi piccoli totteri se ne stavano quassù tutti soli, così ho pensato di venire a far loro compagnia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e031890-b945-4430-bf0b-8f579f8baa9a\', \'multiverseId\': 418939}, \'multiverseid\': 418939}, {\'name\': \'試験飛行士\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n試験飛行士が戦場に出たとき、飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「ここらの飛行機械が寂しそうだったんで、仲間になってやろうと思ったのさ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55519481-c7a3-4495-b8be-430eb34652d9\', \'multiverseId\': 419203}, \'multiverseid\': 419203}, {\'name\': \'실험적인 비행사\', \'text\': \'비행\\n실험적인 비행사가 전장에 들어올 때, 비행을 가진 1/1 무색 날틀 마법물체 생물 토큰 두 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기능공\', \'flavor\': \'"날틀들이 위에서 외로워 보이길래, 나도 낄까 생각했지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'745b46e9-3336-4581-8cf9-59a7d47b7b1b\', \'multiverseId\': 419467}, \'multiverseid\': 419467}, {\'name\': \'Aviador Experimentalista\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Aviador Experimentalista entrar no campo de batalha, crie duas fichas de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Tóptero com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'"Os topterinhos pareciam solitários lá em cima, então eu pensei em me juntar a eles."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5793bfee-38b6-4ecb-99b2-7e4529e4d968\', \'multiverseId\': 419731}, \'multiverseid\': 419731}, {\'name\': \'Авиатор-Экспериментатор\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Авиатор-Экспериментатор выходит на поле битвы, создайте две фишки артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Топтер с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Механик\', \'flavor\': \'«Маленьким топтерам в небе было так одиноко... я решил присоединиться к ним».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7b9e8b5-3b28-4ae5-b6f9-d4b0332fef41\', \'multiverseId\': 419995}, \'multiverseid\': 419995}, {\'name\': \'试飞员\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当试飞员进战场时，派出两个1/1无色，具飞行异能的振翼机衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'「这些小振翼机在天上看来有些孤单，我就上来作个伴。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21404318-c919-4533-84d7-4abadcf65327\', \'multiverseId\': 417883}, \'multiverseid\': 417883}, {\'name\': \'試飛員\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當試飛員進戰場時，派出兩個1/1無色，具飛行異能的振翼機衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／神器師\', \'flavor\': \'「這些小振翼機在天上看來有些孤單，我就上來作個伴。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6886382c-77da-4b11-8e8b-f36a2e9cb473\', \'multiverseId\': 418147}, \'multiverseid\': 418147}]', '[{\'name\': \'Explosive Sabotage\', \'text\': \'Opfere ein Artefakt als zusätzliche Kosten, um die Explosive Sabotage zu wirken.\\nDie Explosive Sabotage fügt jeder Kreatur 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Alle Sicherheitsvorrichtungen des Konsulats deaktiviert mit einem kleinen Handgriff."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418484&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecfe65f6-4f1a-4397-84d5-c9a47456a47b\', \'multiverseId\': 418484}, \'multiverseid\': 418484}, {\'name\': \'Sabotaje incendiario\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar el Sabotaje incendiario, sacrifica un artefacto.\\nEl Sabotaje incendiario hace 3 puntos de daño a cada criatura.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Un simple toquecito. Con eso basta para acabar con todas las medidas de seguridad del Consulado".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f24501a-f6f8-438f-ad15-e0fdd0cae761\', \'multiverseId\': 420332}, \'multiverseid\': 420332}, {\'name\': \'Sabotage incendiaire\', \'text\': \'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer le Sabotage incendiaire, sacrifiez un artefact.\\nLe Sabotage incendiaire inflige 3 blessures à chaque créature.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Toutes les mesures de sécurité du Consulat anéanties par un simple ajustement. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418748&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7c3fbba-0639-46a4-b628-f01f15425f44\', \'multiverseId\': 418748}, \'multiverseid\': 418748}, {\'name\': \'Sabotaggio Incendiario\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare il Sabotaggio Incendiario, sacrifica un artefatto.\\nIl Sabotaggio Incendiario infligge 3 danni a ogni creatura.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tutti quei dispositivi di difesa consolari, liquidati con una modifica semplicissima."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64c5bff6-9e19-4923-b79c-48947e0a10ca\', \'multiverseId\': 419012}, \'multiverseid\': 419012}, {\'name\': \'焼夷式破壊工作\', \'text\': \'焼夷式破壊工作を唱えるための追加コストとして、アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる。\\n焼夷式破壊工作は各クリーチャーにそれぞれ３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「領事府が決めた安全装置なんて、簡単に無効にできるわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d08d4e2-b6ca-4079-b5c4-a787e747b3fd\', \'multiverseId\': 419276}, \'multiverseid\': 419276}, {\'name\': \'불태우는 방해 공작\', \'text\': \'불태우는 방해 공작을 발동하기 위한 추가비용으로, 마법물체 한 개를 희생한다.\\n불태우는 방해 공작은 각 생물에게 피해 3점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"영사관의 모든 안전 조치가 한 방에 수포로 돌아갔다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b04a7a0-9ca2-49ed-817c-dfd637e5779b\', \'multiverseId\': 419540}, \'multiverseid\': 419540}, {\'name\': \'Sabotagem Incendiária\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar Sabotagem Incendiária, sacrifique um artefato.\\nSabotagem Incendiária causa 3 pontos de dano a cada criatura.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Todas aquelas medidas de segurança do Consulado desfeitas com uma mexidinha simples."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b01399ab-7905-4c83-956b-540d8345d45b\', \'multiverseId\': 419804}, \'multiverseid\': 419804}, {\'name\': \'Огненная Диверсия\', \'text\': \'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания Огненной Диверсии пожертвуйте артефакт.\\nОгненная Диверсия наносит 3 повреждения каждому существу.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Все меры предосторожности, что принимало Консульство, сведены на нет одним небольшим вмешательством».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b8fb215-2861-40eb-80ed-40f5e2ac8fba\', \'multiverseId\': 420068}, \'multiverseid\': 420068}, {\'name\': \'烈焰破坏\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个神器，以作为施放烈焰破坏的额外费用。\\n烈焰破坏对每个生物各造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「只要动个手脚，执政院的安全措施就全毁了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9ec7791-bc9a-44ca-822e-31e2280cc9af\', \'multiverseId\': 417956}, \'multiverseid\': 417956}, {\'name\': \'烈焰破壞\', \'text\': \'犧牲一個神器，以作為施放烈焰破壞的額外費用。\\n烈焰破壞對每個生物各造成3點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「只要動個手腳，執政院的安全措施就全毀了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'408ae3f8-f3b2-4593-b2bb-4c833f5c6036\', \'multiverseId\': 418220}, \'multiverseid\': 418220}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fabrikationsmodul\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du eine oder mehrere {E} (Energiemarken) erhältst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\\n{4}, {T}: Du erhältst {E}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Inspiration führt zu Design.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418576&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0163b433-fc33-445b-8e7b-6839edbcf6c8\', \'multiverseId\': 418576}, \'multiverseid\': 418576}, {\'name\': \'Módulo de fabricación\', \'text\': \'Siempre que obtengas uno o más {E} (contadores de energía), pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo que controlas.\\n{4}, {T}: Obtienes {E}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'La inspiración lleva al diseño.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'442aca59-f6e6-4ce0-8707-fc74dee8f61c\', \'multiverseId\': 420424}, \'multiverseid\': 420424}, {\'name\': \'Module de fabrication\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous gagnez au moins {E} (un marqueur « énergie »), mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\n{4}, {T} : Vous gagnez {E}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "L\'inspiration mène à la conception.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418840&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'757604b8-feff-4ae9-bff8-6410942ef0f2\', \'multiverseId\': 418840}, \'multiverseid\': 418840}, {\'name\': \'Modulo di Fabbricazione\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta ottieni uno o più {E} (segnalini energia), metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio che controlli.\\n{4}, {T}: Ottieni {E}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "L\'ispirazione conduce alla creatività.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa7fc84d-e4b1-42d0-ad3b-26221fb9a860\', \'multiverseId\': 419104}, \'multiverseid\': 419104}, {\'name\': \'製造機構\', \'text\': \'あなたが{E}（エネルギー・カウンター）を１つ以上得るたび、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\\n{4}, {T}：あなたは{E}を得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'発想は様式を生む。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66388297-1fcc-4988-9dd6-394207569edf\', \'multiverseId\': 419368}, \'multiverseid\': 419368}, {\'name\': \'제작 모듈\', \'text\': \'당신이 한 개 이상의 {E}(에너지 카운터)를 얻을 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n{4}, {T}: 당신은 {E}를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'영감이 디자인을 낳는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9caf814c-810d-419a-849c-762cd92c909b\', \'multiverseId\': 419632}, \'multiverseid\': 419632}, {\'name\': \'Módulo de Fabricação\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você receber um ou mais {E} (marcadores de energia), coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo que você controla.\\n{4}, {T}: Você recebe {E}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'A inspiração leva ao projeto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8ee2de0-2c6b-4271-a105-32f5460084c5\', \'multiverseId\': 419896}, \'multiverseid\': 419896}, {\'name\': \'Модуль Производства\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы получаете один или несколько {E} (жетонов энергии), положите один жетон +1/+1 на целевое существо под вашим контролем.\\n{4}, {T}: вы получаете {E}.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Вдохновение ведет к разработке.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc9fca8a-4584-475a-9762-c9710345265d\', \'multiverseId\': 420160}, \'multiverseid\': 420160}, {\'name\': \'装配模块\', \'text\': \'每当你得到一个或数个{E}（能量指示物）时，在目标由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n{4}，{T}：你得到{E}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'灵感引设计。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'611c9d16-b797-4e87-b959-159e553b5c83\', \'multiverseId\': 418048}, \'multiverseid\': 418048}, {\'name\': \'裝配模塊\', \'text\': \'每當你得到一個或數個{E}（能量指示物）時，在目標由你操控的生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\\n{4}，{T}：你得到{E}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'靈感引設計。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f78e9bd-2cf8-4d28-8b32-1af5b5b4427a\', \'multiverseId\': 418312}, \'multiverseid\': 418312}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fehlfunktion\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert ein Artefakt oder eine Kreatur\\nWenn die Fehlfunktion ins Spiel kommt, tappe die verzauberte bleibende Karte.\\nDie verzauberte bleibende Karte enttappt nicht während des Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Früher haben die Dinger noch etwas ausgehalten."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418420&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'571f86da-5b8f-432d-8f5a-333411eb9d14\', \'multiverseId\': 418420}, \'multiverseid\': 418420}, {\'name\': \'Avería\', \'text\': \'Encantar artefacto o criatura.\\nCuando la Avería entre al campo de batalla, gira el permanente encantado.\\nEl permanente encantado no se endereza durante el paso de enderezar de su controlador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Ya no los fabrican como antes".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b010900f-eb34-4a36-b881-bbc6dcef0429\', \'multiverseId\': 420268}, \'multiverseid\': 420268}, {\'name\': \'Défaillance\', \'text\': "Enchanter : artefact ou créature\\nQuand la Défaillance arrive sur le champ de bataille, engagez le permanent enchanté.\\nLe permanent enchanté ne se dégage pas pendant l\'étape de dégagement de son contrôleur.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "« Ce n\'est plus la même qualité que dans le temps. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418684&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7de29009-d84d-4bf9-bf4c-7aadcebd91dd\', \'multiverseId\': 418684}, \'multiverseid\': 418684}, {\'name\': \'Avaria\', \'text\': "Incanta artefatto o creatura\\nQuando l\'Avaria entra nel campo di battaglia, TAPpa il permanente incantato.\\nIl permanente incantato non STAPpa durante lo STAP del suo controllore.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Non li fanno più come una volta."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acbab5fb-de05-4201-8cdc-b0bd93e15244\', \'multiverseId\': 418948}, \'multiverseid\': 418948}, {\'name\': \'誤動作\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（アーティファクトかクリーチャー）\\n誤動作が戦場に出たとき、エンチャントされているパーマネントをタップする。\\nエンチャントされているパーマネントは、それのコントローラーのアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「昔の方がちゃんとできていたな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5ee0167-42ed-4925-bd48-1aa32da67d5a\', \'multiverseId\': 419212}, \'multiverseid\': 419212}, {\'name\': \'오작동\', \'text\': \'마법물체나 생물에게 부여\\n오작동이 전장에 들어올 때, 부여된 지속물을 탭한다.\\n부여된 지속물은 조종자의 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'"예전처럼 잘 만들지 못하는군."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc98d00c-91c3-4f0a-aa9b-53dd4022dbe8\', \'multiverseId\': 419476}, \'multiverseid\': 419476}, {\'name\': \'Mau Funcionamento\', \'text\': \'Encantar artefato ou criatura\\nQuando Mau Funcionamento entrar no campo de batalha, vire a permanente encantada.\\nA permanente encantada não desvira durante a etapa de desvirar de seu controlador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Não fazem mais essas coisas como antigamente."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a86f70e8-0759-430c-bac8-4bd2f508ab30\', \'multiverseId\': 419740}, \'multiverseid\': 419740}, {\'name\': \'Поломка\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать артефакт или существо\\nКогда Поломка выходит на поле битвы, поверните зачарованный перманент.\\nЗачарованный перманент не разворачивается во время шага разворота контролирующего его игрока.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'«Сейчас таких уже больше не делают».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3027042-df75-4212-a033-40cc73610af2\', \'multiverseId\': 420004}, \'multiverseid\': 420004}, {\'name\': \'失灵\', \'text\': \'结附于神器或生物\\n当失灵进战场时，横置所结附的永久物。\\n所结附的永久物于其操控者的重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「他们的手艺大不如前了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b35649d-83da-4405-b566-e21fad796804\', \'multiverseId\': 417892}, \'multiverseid\': 417892}, {\'name\': \'失靈\', \'text\': \'結附於神器或生物\\n當失靈進戰場時，橫置所結附的永久物。\\n所結附的永久物於其操控者的重置步驟中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'「他們的手藝大不如前了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d54c8cf-4007-4e94-80ee-f7bd32d285f9\', \'multiverseId\': 418156}, \'multiverseid\': 418156}]', '[{\'name\': \'Festival-Eröffnung\', \'text\': \'Verhindere allen Kampfschaden, der Spielern in diesem Zug zugefügt würde.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Nie zuvor waren so viele Genies und wundersame Erfindungen an einem Ort versammelt. Bewohner von Kaladesh reisen aus allen Himmelsrichtungen zur einmaligen Erfindermesse an.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418513&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10bd9117-3d0b-44d3-b155-dac8a089ee93\', \'multiverseId\': 418513}, \'multiverseid\': 418513}, {\'name\': \'Comienzo de las celebraciones\', \'text\': \'Prevén todo el daño de combate que se fuera a hacer a los jugadores este turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Nunca antes se habían juntado tantas mentes excepcionales e inventos maravillosos en un solo lugar. Ciudadanos de todas partes de Kaladesh acudirán a la Feria de Inventores: es algo que solo se ve una vez en la vida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19622da9-e8ed-40ce-9b0d-da194a97ed4c\', \'multiverseId\': 420361}, \'multiverseid\': 420361}, {\'name\': \'Début des festivités\', \'text\': \'Prévenez toutes les blessures de combat qui devraient être infligées aux joueurs ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Nul n\'a jamais vu autant d\'esprits brillants et d\'inventions merveilleuses réunis en un même lieu. Les habitants des quatre coins de Kaladesh viendront découvrir la Foire des inventeurs.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418777&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76af9287-bfba-4765-96ee-55555eb06d9f\', \'multiverseId\': 418777}, \'multiverseid\': 418777}, {\'name\': \'Inaugurazione delle Festività\', \'text\': \'Previeni tutto il danno da combattimento che verrebbe inflitto ai giocatori in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Mai prima d\'ora si erano raccolte nello stesso luogo tante menti geniali e tante invenzioni sorprendenti. Gli abitanti di tutto Kaladesh accorreranno per partecipare all\'irripetibile Fiera degli Inventori.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8aaaab76-6649-4aa4-a5b8-622c66e9dd76\', \'multiverseId\': 419041}, \'multiverseid\': 419041}, {\'name\': \'祝祭の開幕\', \'text\': \'このターン、プレイヤーに与えられるすべての戦闘ダメージを軽減する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'いまだかつて、これほど多くの聡明な頭脳と驚異の発明品が一同に会したことはなかった。カラデシュ中の人々が、一生一度の発明展覧会に押し寄せている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b97d8924-fdee-4cbc-9239-f2838dbaa56d\', \'multiverseId\': 419305}, \'multiverseid\': 419305}, {\'name\': \'축제 시작\', \'text\': \'이 턴에 플레이어들에게 입혀지려 하는 모든 전투피해를 방지한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'이토록 많은 뛰어난 발명가와 놀라운 발명품이 한자리에 모인 적은 일찍이 없었다. 칼라데시 전역의 시민들이 일생에 단 한 번 있을 발명 박람회를 보기 위해 모여들 것이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71c28dcf-5eb2-4615-b509-bfb17700695b\', \'multiverseId\': 419569}, \'multiverseid\': 419569}, {\'name\': \'Início das Festividades\', \'text\': \'Previna todo o dano de combate que seria causado a jogadores neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Jamais houve tantas mentes brilhantes e invenções maravilhosas em um só lugar antes. Cidadãos de todos os cantos de Kaladesh afluirão para a Feira dos Inventores, algo que só se vê uma vez na vida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c6d4734-ce0c-490d-8455-fb016ef0a3a9\', \'multiverseId\': 419833}, \'multiverseid\': 419833}, {\'name\': \'Начало Праздника\', \'text\': \'Предотвратите все боевые повреждения, которые должны быть нанесены игрокам в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Никогда еще столько светлых умов и чудесных изобретений не собиралось в одном месте. На главную в своей жизни Ярмарку Изобретателей стекаются таланты со всего Каладеша.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0300fd6-abbe-403c-ae4a-337ea6170f15\', \'multiverseId\': 420097}, \'multiverseid\': 420097}, {\'name\': \'节庆开始\', \'text\': \'于本回合中，防止将对牌手造成的所有战斗伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'从未有如此多的聪明才俊和神奇发明齐聚一地。卡拉德许各个地方的居民都将涌入终身难忘的发明家博览会。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04c6a507-d5c5-4a95-abfd-5a6ee4fa6090\', \'multiverseId\': 417985}, \'multiverseid\': 417985}, {\'name\': \'節慶開始\', \'text\': \'於本回合中，防止將對玩家造成的所有戰鬥傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'從未有如此多的聰明才俊和神奇發明齊聚一地。卡拉德許各個地方的居民都將湧入終身難忘的發明家博覽會。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86aa058c-50d4-4148-8d39-263dcc3aa794\', \'multiverseId\': 418249}, \'multiverseid\': 418249}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feuerformer-Rätselknoten\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Feuerformer-Rätselknoten ins Spiel kommt, fügt er einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\n{2}{R}, opfere den Feuerformer-Rätselknoten: Er fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418578&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0959ff7-b15c-440a-aeed-77981156a0fa\', \'multiverseId\': 418578}, \'multiverseid\': 418578}, {\'name\': \'Enigma del forjafuego\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Enigma del forjafuego entre al campo de batalla, hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\\n{2}{R}, sacrificar el Enigma del forjafuego: Hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60e79982-a30e-45e5-9105-c613e36a63a1\', \'multiverseId\': 420426}, \'multiverseid\': 420426}, {\'name\': \'Casse-tête du forgeur de feu\', \'text\': \'Quand le Casse-tête du forgeur de feu arrive sur le champ de bataille, il inflige 1 blessure à une cible, créature ou joueur.\\n{2}{R}, sacrifiez le Casse-tête du forgeur de feu : Il inflige 1 blessure à une cible, créature ou joueur.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418842&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee7fd726-10a7-442d-bd20-6196a8c55b07\', \'multiverseId\': 418842}, \'multiverseid\': 418842}, {\'name\': \'Enigmatico del Forgiafuoco\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Enigmatico del Forgiafuoco entra nel campo di battaglia, infligge 1 danno a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\\n{2}{R}, Sacrifica l\'Enigmatico del Forgiafuoco: Infligge 1 danno a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0fab7a6-cb3d-4a0d-a65f-d8457343c591\', \'multiverseId\': 419106}, \'multiverseid\': 419106}, {\'name\': \'炎鍛冶の組細工\', \'text\': \'炎鍛冶の組細工が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。炎鍛冶の組細工はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\\n{2}{R}, 炎鍛冶の組細工を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。炎鍛冶の組細工はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea5f7a6c-456e-4384-98f6-808df025d19a\', \'multiverseId\': 419370}, \'multiverseid\': 419370}, {\'name\': \'화염주조공의 비밀 장치\', \'text\': \'화염주조공의 비밀 장치가 전장에 들어올 때, 생물이나 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 화염주조공의 비밀 장치는 그 목표에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\\n{2}{R}, 화염주조공의 비밀 장치를 희생한다: 생물이나 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 화염주조공의 비밀 장치는 그 목표에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b68102c4-524e-44c5-b823-a9077e653d70\', \'multiverseId\': 419634}, \'multiverseid\': 419634}, {\'name\': \'Quebra-cabeça do Flamiforjador\', \'text\': \'Quando Quebra-cabeça do Flamiforjador entra no campo de batalha, ele causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.\\n{2}{R}, Sacrifique Quebra-cabeça do Flamiforjador: Ele causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a485dba0-2110-41c0-9f10-d92678ea62b2\', \'multiverseId\': 419898}, \'multiverseid\': 419898}, {\'name\': \'Головоломка Огнекователя\', \'text\': \'Когда Головоломка Огнекователя выходит на поле битвы, она наносит 1 повреждение целевому существу или игроку.\\n{2}{R}, пожертвуйте Головоломку Огнекователя: она наносит 1 повреждение целевому существу или игроку.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f9ea829-02b5-4a5b-a52f-3dcc38411f0e\', \'multiverseId\': 420162}, \'multiverseid\': 420162}, {\'name\': \'熔火匠谜结\', \'text\': \'当熔火匠谜结进战场时，它对目标生物或牌手造成1点伤害。\\n{2}{R}，牺牲熔火匠谜结：它对目标生物或牌手造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1368ed45-7441-4d39-83c8-e2ee4bbe091a\', \'multiverseId\': 418050}, \'multiverseid\': 418050}, {\'name\': \'熔火匠謎結\', \'text\': \'當熔火匠謎結進戰場時，它對目標生物或玩家造成1點傷害。\\n{2}{R}，犧牲熔火匠謎結：它對目標生物或玩家造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'077aeb2c-bc17-4d66-9874-6522245a2ee7\', \'multiverseId\': 418314}, \'multiverseid\': 418314}]', '[{\'name\': \'Filigraner Vertrauter\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Filigrane Vertraute ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nWenn der Filigrane Vertraute stirbt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Fuchs\', \'flavor\': \'„Er ist DAS Geschenk für jeden auf deiner Liste. Und kaufe gleich einen für dich mit!" —Chammi, Kuriositätenhändlerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418577&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d9e3584-0fa4-438f-8c59-a1cb1d641fb7\', \'multiverseId\': 418577}, \'multiverseid\': 418577}, {\'name\': \'Mascota de filigrana\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Mascota de filigrana entre al campo de batalla, ganas 2 vidas.\\nCuando la Mascota de filigrana muera, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Zorro\', \'flavor\': \'"Es el regalo ideal para todo el mundo. ¡Llévate uno tú también!". —Chammi, vendedora de rarezas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df4e6ff0-c75b-4e62-accd-a6e18c859d3a\', \'multiverseId\': 420425}, \'multiverseid\': 420425}, {\'name\': \'Familier de filigrane\', \'text\': \'Quand le Familier de filigrane arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 2 points de vie.\\nQuand le Familier de filigrane meurt, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : renard\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est le cadeau indispensable à offrir à tous vos proches. Prenez-en un pour vous aussi ! » —Chammi, vendeuse de bibelots", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418841&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d90e6982-37d7-4b89-8365-8c1621bef8c8\', \'multiverseId\': 418841}, \'multiverseid\': 418841}, {\'name\': \'Famiglio di Filigrana\', \'text\': \'Quando il Famiglio di Filigrana entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 2 punti vita.\\nQuando il Famiglio di Filigrana muore, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Volpe\', \'flavor\': \'"È il regalo ideale per tutti i vostri conoscenti. E non dimenticate di comprarne uno per voi!" —Chammi, venditrice di curiosità\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01f10d00-286a-40d7-a223-5883d54b5f9d\', \'multiverseId\': 419105}, \'multiverseid\': 419105}, {\'name\': \'金線の使い魔\', \'text\': \'金線の使い魔が戦場に出たとき、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\\n金線の使い魔が死亡したとき、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 狐\', \'flavor\': \'「これはどなたにも喜ばれる贈り物になりますよ。ご自分用にもね！」 ――珍品売りのチャミー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b53ff369-3dbc-4d8d-b903-8661aa63c3bc\', \'multiverseId\': 419369}, \'multiverseid\': 419369}, {\'name\': \'줄세공 애완동물\', \'text\': \'줄세공 애완동물이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 생명 2점을 얻는다.\\n줄세공 애완동물이 죽을 때, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 여우\', \'flavor\': \'"누구에게나 꼭 필요한 선물입니다. 여러분 것도 잊지 말고 하나씩 챙기세요!" —골동품 장수 참미\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e0b701c-9937-48d1-84f5-dfbae4c482b3\', \'multiverseId\': 419633}, \'multiverseid\': 419633}, {\'name\': \'Familiar de Filigrana\', \'text\': \'Quando Familiar de Filigrana entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\\nQuando Familiar de Filigrana morrer, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Raposa\', \'flavor\': \'"É o presente obrigatório para todos em sua lista. Compre um para você também!" — Chammi, vendedora de raridades\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0f93df1-6ede-4f47-8bd8-6e40f787c60c\', \'multiverseId\': 419897}, \'multiverseid\': 419897}, {\'name\': \'Филигранный Питомец\', \'text\': \'Когда Филигранный Питомец выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете 2 жизни.\\nКогда Филигранный Питомец умирает, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Лиса\', \'flavor\': \'«Совершенно необходимый подарок для всех ваших родных и близких. И для себя такого не забудьте!» — Чамми, торговка редкостями\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b11f4af-7e9a-4c7f-afac-d822f3ba2adf\', \'multiverseId\': 420161}, \'multiverseid\': 420161}, {\'name\': \'丝金佣兽\', \'text\': \'当丝金佣兽进战场时，你获得2点生命。\\n当丝金佣兽死去时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～狐\', \'flavor\': \'「您该为要送礼的人都买一个。您自己也来一个吧！」 ～古物贩商恰米\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37532a7e-863d-4ec6-b413-4a6152b286ee\', \'multiverseId\': 418049}, \'multiverseid\': 418049}, {\'name\': \'絲金傭獸\', \'text\': \'當絲金傭獸進戰場時，你獲得2點生命。\\n當絲金傭獸死去時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～狐\', \'flavor\': \'「您該為要送禮的人都買一個。您自己也來一個吧！」 ～古物販商恰米\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0b65452-6176-4dec-9bc3-c188f66e0406\', \'multiverseId\': 418313}, \'multiverseid\': 418313}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flammenpeitsche\', \'text\': \'Die Flammenpeitsche fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich werde gerade erst warm."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420509&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0caa5ed9-0806-4f8f-847b-855a3e0a033b\', \'multiverseId\': 420509}, \'multiverseid\': 420509}, {\'name\': \'Latigazo ardiente\', \'text\': \'Latigazo ardiente hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Únicamente estoy calentando".d\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ad7f8df-7bdb-4f0d-9cdd-279b13ddde21\', \'multiverseId\': 420579}, \'multiverseid\': 420579}, {\'name\': \'Fouet de flamme\', \'text\': \'Le Fouet de flamme inflige 4 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est juste un échauffement. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420519&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02d53cf9-4d72-412b-a86a-ab2ce2c3018a\', \'multiverseId\': 420519}, \'multiverseid\': 420519}, {\'name\': \'Sferzata di Fiamma\', \'text\': \'La Sferzata di Fiamma infligge 4 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi sto appena scaldando."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'721e4597-d276-4daf-82a8-38023b7be0ed\', \'multiverseId\': 420529}, \'multiverseid\': 420529}, {\'name\': \'炎の鞭打ち\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。炎の鞭打ちはそれに４点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「単なるウォーミングアップに過ぎないわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ad6426e-b60f-4c8f-b4fe-bfd747ab03a3\', \'multiverseId\': 420539}, \'multiverseid\': 420539}, {\'name\': \'화염 채찍\', \'text\': \'생물이나 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 화염 채찍은 그 목표에게 피해 4점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"이건 시작일 뿐이야."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47bf92e7-0227-4311-9ca8-32957ddc04fd\', \'multiverseId\': 420549}, \'multiverseid\': 420549}, {\'name\': \'Chicote Ardente\', \'text\': \'Chicote Ardente causa 4 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu estou só me aquecendo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e4b77e0-584c-45ac-8a83-4b52184ff70f\', \'multiverseId\': 420559}, \'multiverseid\': 420559}, {\'name\': \'Огненный Хлыст\', \'text\': \'Огненный Хлыст наносит 4 повреждения целевому существу или игроку.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Я еще только разогреваюсь».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d195a19-dcf0-4b86-b0b0-1ab8eb5f038f\', \'multiverseId\': 420569}, \'multiverseid\': 420569}, {\'name\': \'炎鞭飞舞\', \'text\': \'炎鞭飞舞对目标生物或牌手造成4点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「这只是热身而已。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be32d09b-b649-4a4e-94c6-cb24c75d1087\', \'multiverseId\': 420489}, \'multiverseid\': 420489}, {\'name\': \'炎鞭飛舞\', \'text\': \'炎鞭飛舞對目標生物或玩家造成4點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「這只是熱身而已。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f4f003c-d3d0-4553-a5ac-3be6192ef4aa\', \'multiverseId\': 420499}, \'multiverseid\': 420499}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fliegender Ersthelfer\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit, Lebensverknüpfung\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zwerg, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Zwergen wird das Verständnis komplexer Mechaniken in die Wiege gelegt und das Reparieren liegt ihnen im Blut. Dies und ihr Ruf, furchtlos zu sein, macht sie zu perfekten Notfallhelfern bei der Messe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418367&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'327a9903-441a-4382-82d7-5184c0936fe8\', \'multiverseId\': 418367}, \'multiverseid\': 418367}, {\'name\': \'Servicio de intervención aérea\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia, vínculo vital.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Enano soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Los enanos tienen un instinto de reparación, entienden al instante el funcionamiento de un sistema y se dice que no conocen el miedo. Son los candidatos perfectos para el equipo de emergencias de la Feria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb4c4b0e-bda6-4611-897f-b912c6bb41b8\', \'multiverseId\': 420215}, \'multiverseid\': 420215}, {\'name\': \'Secoureur aérien\', \'text\': \'Vol, vigilance, lien de vie\', \'type\': \'Créature : nain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Les nains ont un don inné pour les réparations, une compréhension instinctive du fonctionnement des systèmes et un caractère intrépide. Ce sont des candidats idéaux pour l\'équipe de premiers secours de la Foire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418631&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b95b790e-87a2-4766-a70b-a655af319372\', \'multiverseId\': 418631}, \'multiverseid\': 418631}, {\'name\': \'Soccorritore Aereo\', \'text\': \'Volare, cautela, legame vitale\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Nano\', \'flavor\': \'I nani hanno un talento istintivo per le riparazioni, una comprensione innata del funzionamento dei sistemi e una fama di temerari. Sono i candidati perfetti per la squadra di pronto intervento della Fiera.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf0579a8-0315-47b4-bf2c-5b41ad39dc1d\', \'multiverseId\': 418895}, \'multiverseid\': 418895}, {\'name\': \'空中対応員\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒、絆魂\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドワーフ・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'ドワーフには修復の才能があり、組織の仕組みを理解しており、恐れ知らずとの評判も高い。博覧会の緊急対応要員に最適である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3839971f-c815-4a0b-8d61-87adf9e316c9\', \'multiverseId\': 419159}, \'multiverseid\': 419159}, {\'name\': \'공중 행동대원\', \'text\': \'비행, 경계, 생명연결\', \'type\': \'생물 — 드워프 병사\', \'flavor\': \'드워프는 기계의 수리와 작동 방식에 대한 타고난 이해력을 가지고 있으며 대담하기로 정평이 나 있다. 그들은 박람회의 비상 대응팀으로 가장 적합한 후보이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b72a930-07e4-40ac-a1ac-6a7b1d06029b\', \'multiverseId\': 419423}, \'multiverseid\': 419423}, {\'name\': \'Socorrista Aéreo\', \'text\': \'Voar, vigilância, vínculo com a vida\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anão Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Os anões são ótimos em reparações, entendem como os sistemas funcionam e possuem a reputação de serem destemidos. São os candidatos perfeitos para a equipe de atendimento de emergência da Feira.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65c253c0-0cf2-4fc1-a3d1-050a770dbc11\', \'multiverseId\': 419687}, \'multiverseid\': 419687}, {\'name\': \'Воздушный Спасатель\', \'text\': \'Полет, Бдительность, Цепь жизни\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гном Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'Гномы обладают природной склонностью к починке, с малых лет понимают, как работают механизмы, и славятся своим бесстрашием. Это идеальные кандидаты в спасательную команду Ярмарки.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d43c060-2c7b-47b7-a025-020634bb26e7\', \'multiverseId\': 419951}, \'multiverseid\': 419951}, {\'name\': \'翔空援兵\', \'text\': \'飞行，警戒，系命\', \'type\': \'生物～矮人／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'矮人一族生来便热衷机械维修，从小就了解系统运作，向来以胆大无畏著称。由他们来担任博览会的紧急应变小队再适合不过了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dade6592-ff4b-41de-ab10-c5cc87e50aab\', \'multiverseId\': 417839}, \'multiverseid\': 417839}, {\'name\': \'翔空援兵\', \'text\': \'飛行，警戒，繫命\', \'type\': \'生物～矮人／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'矮人一族生來便熱衷機械維修，從小便了解系統運作，向來以膽大無畏著稱。由他們來擔任博覽會的緊急應變小隊再適合不過了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d949f1fa-bd41-4c10-b55d-b132bf55f34d\', \'multiverseId\': 418103}, \'multiverseid\': 418103}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flinkschmied-Genie\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Artefakt unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Karte abwerfen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'Flinkschmiede springen gerne von einem Projekt zum nächsten und verlassen sich auf Geistesblitze statt auf gründliche Nachforschungen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418490&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d33b2fde-01e7-461e-9524-8801673f77c1\', \'multiverseId\': 418490}, \'multiverseid\': 418490}, {\'name\': \'Genio forjacélere\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un artefacto entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes descartar una carta. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los forjacéleres siempre están dispuestos a saltar de un proyecto a otro; confían en su inspiración más que en una investigación rigurosa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f3c92b5-9758-47b4-94ab-de81bc720b63\', \'multiverseId\': 420338}, \'multiverseid\': 420338}, {\'name\': \'Génie forgevif\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un artefact arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez vous défausser d\'une carte. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': "Les forgevifs ont tendance à passer d\'un projet à l\'autre, en se fiant à leurs éclairs de génie plutôt qu\'à des recherches consciencieuses.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418754&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbc6fd93-cc94-4f16-bf3a-fe25f37ba5fe\', \'multiverseId\': 418754}, \'multiverseid\': 418754}, {\'name\': \'Genio Tempralesto\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un artefatto entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi scartare una carta. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': \'I tempralesti passano avidamente da un progetto al seguente, affidandosi più a lampi di genio che a ricerche approfondite.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7373d42f-2f99-4737-b47c-70f00d6c7ead\', \'multiverseId\': 419018}, \'multiverseid\': 419018}, {\'name\': \'天才速製職人\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたはカード１枚を捨ててもよい。そうしたなら、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'速製職人は次々と別の作品を手掛けたがる。入念な研究よりも、その場の思いつきを重視するのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c76cc30-b6c6-4e65-9c1c-5332c2c8d323\', \'multiverseId\': 419282}, \'multiverseid\': 419282}, {\'name\': \'천재 숙련기술공\', \'text\': \'마법물체가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신은 카드 한 장을 버릴 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기능공\', \'flavor\': \'숙련기술공들은 빨리 다음 프로젝트로 넘어가고 싶어하며, 신중한 연구보다는 번득이는 영감에 의존하는 편이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5436c9ce-33a0-4496-9f74-80dfce2b58c8\', \'multiverseId\': 419546}, \'multiverseid\': 419546}, {\'name\': \'Gênio Veloferreiro\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um artefato entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode descartar um card. Se fizer isso, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'Os veloferreiros estão sempre prontos para pular de um projeto para o outro, seguindo seus lampejos de inspiração, em vez da pesquisa cuidadosa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccdff103-2c7e-45ff-bf2f-26255c678122\', \'multiverseId\': 419810}, \'multiverseid\': 419810}, {\'name\': \'Проворный Гений-Кузнец\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда артефакт выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы можете сбросить карту. Если вы это делаете, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Механик\', \'flavor\': \'Проворные кузнецы охотно бросают одну работу и берутся за другую, полагаясь на приступы вдохновения, а не на тщательные исследования.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d3435e1-fa5d-4d2e-bed2-105edda6535d\', \'multiverseId\': 420074}, \'multiverseid\': 420074}, {\'name\': \'迅匠天才\', \'text\': \'每当一个神器在你的操控下进战场时，你可以弃一张牌。若你如此作，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'迅匠总是迫不及待地想投入下一个计画，全凭灵感迸发而非审慎研究。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87d3555d-4235-4e23-9090-8295951f6cc5\', \'multiverseId\': 417962}, \'multiverseid\': 417962}, {\'name\': \'迅匠天才\', \'text\': \'每當一個神器在你的操控下進戰場時，你可以棄一張牌。若你如此作，則抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／神器師\', \'flavor\': \'迅匠總是迫不及待地想投入下一個計畫，全憑靈感迸發而非審慎研究。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42e89093-144b-4495-91b8-8e1d34444279\', \'multiverseId\': 418226}, \'multiverseid\': 418226}]', '[{\'name\': \'Frachtkahn des Bomat-Basars\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Frachtkahn des Bomat-Basars ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\\nBemannen 3 (Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 3 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418563&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b505d11a-72d8-4dc2-9161-ac70c2a748a9\', \'multiverseId\': 418563}, \'multiverseid\': 418563}, {\'name\': \'Barcaza comercial de Bomat\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Barcaza comercial de Bomat entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\\nTripular 3. (Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 3 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3412224-e734-47ac-b608-772afa6bf7ce\', \'multiverseId\': 420411}, \'multiverseid\': 420411}, {\'name\': \'Barge du bazar de Bomat\', \'text\': "Quand la Barge du bazar de Bomat arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\\nPilotage 3 (Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 3 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : véhicule\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418827&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'142c9355-f792-45b8-a3e4-859f389761c2\', \'multiverseId\': 418827}, \'multiverseid\': 418827}, {\'name\': \'Chiatta del Bazar di Bomat\', \'text\': \'Quando la Chiatta del Bazar di Bomat entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\\nManovrare 3 (TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 3: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab3978ec-2ac5-4658-88bf-517391a6d473\', \'multiverseId\': 419091}, \'multiverseid\': 419091}, {\'name\': \'ボーマットのバザール船\', \'text\': \'ボーマットのバザール船が戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引く。\\n搭乗３（あなたがコントロールする望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が３以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02e3ae65-0fdb-4428-b3c0-c6183d33db42\', \'multiverseId\': 419355}, \'multiverseid\': 419355}, {\'name\': \'보맷 상선\', \'text\': \'보맷 상선이 전장에 들어올 때, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\\n탑승 3 (당신이 조종하는 생물을 공격력 총합이 3 이상이 되도록 원하는 수만큼 탭한다: 이 탑승물은 턴종료까지 마법물체 생물이 된다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 탑승물\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fa426ed-34c3-4ccb-a52f-6058ff9852f2\', \'multiverseId\': 419619}, \'multiverseid\': 419619}, {\'name\': \'Barca do Bazar de Bomat\', \'text\': \'Quando Barca do Bazar de Bomat entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\\nTripular 3 (Vire qualquer número de criaturas que você controla com total de poder igual ou superior a 3: Este Veículo se torna uma criatura artefato até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Veículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2484813-b623-47e5-9b0f-bdcb898a2887\', \'multiverseId\': 419883}, \'multiverseid\': 419883}, {\'name\': \'Боматская Базарная Баржа\', \'text\': \'Когда Боматская Базарная Баржа выходит на поле битвы, возьмите карту.\\nЭкипаж 3 (Поверните любое количество существ под вашим контролем с суммарной силой 3 или более: эта Машина становится артефактом существом до конца хода.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Машина\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84013a03-15e6-4ae7-a6b8-dd75b45f0bfc\', \'multiverseId\': 420147}, \'multiverseid\': 420147}, {\'name\': \'博默市集驳船\', \'text\': \'当博默市集驳船进战场时，抓一张牌。\\n搭载3（横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于3的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'神器～载具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54374e97-c737-4f03-bb78-8dc4f5a4c272\', \'multiverseId\': 418035}, \'multiverseid\': 418035}, {\'name\': \'博默市集駁船\', \'text\': \'當博默市集駁船進戰場時，抽一張牌。\\n搭載3（橫置任意數量由你操控且力量總和等於或大於3的生物：此載具成為神器生物直到回合結束。）\', \'type\': \'神器～載具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'723fb6ff-92f6-4bd6-b646-3321567f3b2a\', \'multiverseId\': 418299}, \'multiverseid\': 418299}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fragmentieren\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 4 oder weniger.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Zu viel Reibung auf den Kugellagern, die Senkbohrungen sind nicht konsistent und Linien durchziehen das Gussstück. Entsorge es und beginne von neuem." —Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418379&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98cdda18-a699-4b91-8c70-65f649bfa24d\', \'multiverseId\': 418379}, \'multiverseid\': 418379}, {\'name\': \'Fragmentar\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo con coste de maná convertido de 4 o menos.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Demasiada fricción en los cojinetes, los tornillos no están bien ajustados y las piezas fundidas presentan rajaduras. Deshazte de ello y vuelve a empezar". —Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'091fb7a4-f16b-4054-a62d-558f276e9b92\', \'multiverseId\': 420227}, \'multiverseid\': 420227}, {\'name\': \'Fragmentation\', \'text\': "Détruisez l\'artefact ou l\'enchantement avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 4 ciblé.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Trop de frottements sur les appuis, fraisage approximatif et moulage strié. Jetez tout et recommencez. » —Dovin Baàn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418643&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3888589-cebd-4aec-8690-fce0b3a9f0b5\', \'multiverseId\': 418643}, \'multiverseid\': 418643}, {\'name\': \'Frammentare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 4.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Troppo attrito sui cuscinetti, svasature disuguali e imperfezioni nello stampaggio. Distruggilo e ricomincia da capo." —Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'767ef354-c749-4044-8542-1e2e079efd4a\', \'multiverseId\': 418907}, \'multiverseid\': 418907}, {\'name\': \'断片化\', \'text\': \'点数で見たマナ・コストが４以下の、アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「軸受は固すぎる、ネジ穴はばらばら、鋳込み痕のスジも出ている。廃棄して、最初からやり直しなさい。」 ――ドビン・バーン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da7448c2-23bd-4483-8004-6f51b4759645\', \'multiverseId\': 419171}, \'multiverseid\': 419171}, {\'name\': \'조각내기\', \'text\': \'전환마나비용이 4 이하인 마법물체 또는 부여마법을 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"베어링에 마찰이 너무 심하고, 접시형 구멍 형태가 일정하지 않고, 주물에서 선들이 보이는군. 폐기하고 다시 만들게." —도빈 반\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2de7c18e-6309-4068-bb94-b49d043f7135\', \'multiverseId\': 419435}, \'multiverseid\': 419435}, {\'name\': \'Fragmentalizar\', \'text\': \'Destrua o artefato ou encantamento alvo com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a 4.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Há fricção demais nos seus rolamentos, o seu escareamento é inconsistente e a sua moldagem deixa linhas. Jogue fora e comece de novo." — Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e72422f-be7b-43df-a578-cbe0bb651469\', \'multiverseId\': 419699}, \'multiverseid\': 419699}, {\'name\': \'Дробление\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевой артефакт или чары с конвертированной мана-стоимостью 4 или меньше.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Трение у подшипников слишком высокое, зенкование ты провел кое-как, а в отливке полно трещин. Выбрось эту дрянь и переделай все заново». — Довин Баан\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0201b91c-3cbf-4bd0-9ab5-7ce16b19b8b0\', \'multiverseId\': 419963}, \'multiverseid\': 419963}, {\'name\': \'化为碎片\', \'text\': \'消灭目标总法术力费用等于或小于4的神器或结界。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「轴承摩擦太大，钻孔没有对齐，铸件上还有条痕。处理掉，重做。」 ～多温班恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cdb63c0-53a6-488a-812e-c3859bf25b68\', \'multiverseId\': 417851}, \'multiverseid\': 417851}, {\'name\': \'化為碎片\', \'text\': \'消滅目標總魔法力費用等於或小於4的神器或結界。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「軸承摩擦太大，鑽孔沒有對齊，鑄件上還有條痕。處理掉，重做。」 ～多溫班恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f309ef9e-4ccb-4429-b5a4-fa43478a2352\', \'multiverseId\': 418115}, \'multiverseid\': 418115}]', '[{\'name\': \'Funke der Kreativität\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst den Funken der Kreativität jener Kreatur Schaden in Höhe der umgewandelten Manakosten der ins Exil geschickten Karte zufügen lassen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kannst du die Karte bis zum Ende des Zuges spielen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Erfinden heißt rebellieren." —Pia Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418496&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f81c3c0a-1c26-4d08-b272-ccc37bade739\', \'multiverseId\': 418496}, \'multiverseid\': 418496}, {\'name\': \'Chispa de creatividad\', \'text\': \'Elige una criatura objetivo. Exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes hacer que la Chispa de creatividad haga una cantidad de daño a esa criatura igual al coste de maná convertido de la carta exiliada. Si no lo haces, puedes jugar esa carta hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Inventar es rebelarse". —Pia Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29c65d80-33e9-4dd2-87af-a49fce887efd\', \'multiverseId\': 420344}, \'multiverseid\': 420344}, {\'name\': \'Étincelle de créativité\', \'text\': "Choisissez une créature ciblée. Exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez faire que l\'Étincelle de créativité inflige à cette créature un nombre de blessures égal au coût converti de mana de la carte exilée. Si vous ne le faites pas, vous pouvez jouer cette carte jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Inventer c\'est se rebeller. » —Pia Nalaàr", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418760&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03b6cbee-39af-43c6-b7b1-06d62c9a261c\', \'multiverseId\': 418760}, \'multiverseid\': 418760}, {\'name\': \'Scintilla di Creatività\', \'text\': \'Scegli una creatura bersaglio. Esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi far infliggere alla Scintilla di Creatività danno pari al costo di mana convertito della carta esiliata a quella creatura. Se non lo fai, puoi giocare quella carta fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ogni invenzione è una ribellione." —Pia Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'132e1790-cfef-454c-af4e-b10625892185\', \'multiverseId\': 419024}, \'multiverseid\': 419024}, {\'name\': \'独創の火花\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。あなたは「独創の火花はそのクリーチャーに、その追放したカードの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい点数のダメージを与える。」を選んでもよい。そうしないなら、ターン終了時まで、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「発明とは、覆すこと。」 ――ピア・ナラー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f21595ba-832d-4aad-969e-72e41b0cc299\', \'multiverseId\': 419288}, \'multiverseid\': 419288}, {\'name\': \'번뜩이는 창의력\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 추방한다. 당신은 번뜩이는 창의력이 추방된 카드의 전환마나비용만큼 그 생물에게 피해를 입히게 할 수 있다. 그러지 않으면, 당신은 턴종료까지 그 카드를 플레이할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"발명은 저항이다." —피아 날라르\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3d29bfd-624b-4737-967e-64d6d62451fa\', \'multiverseId\': 419552}, \'multiverseid\': 419552}, {\'name\': \'Centelha de Criatividade\', \'text\': \'Escolha uma criatura alvo. Exile o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode fazer com que Centelha de Criatividade cause àquela criatura uma quantidade de dano igual ao custo de mana convertido do card exilado. Se não fizer isso, você poderá jogar aquele card até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Inventar é rebelar-se." — Pia Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e3cf4be-bc06-4577-882a-3d5615877bb5\', \'multiverseId\': 419816}, \'multiverseid\': 419816}, {\'name\': \'Творческая Искра\', \'text\': \'Выберите целевое существо. Изгоните верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете заставить Творческую Искру нанести тому существу повреждения, равные конвертированной мана-стоимости изгнанной карты. Если вы этого не делаете, то вы можете разыграть ту карту до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Изобретать — это тоже бунт». — Пия Налаар\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b91ea3be-3ac6-48ae-87f5-0cac99fa1e87\', \'multiverseId\': 420080}, \'multiverseid\': 420080}, {\'name\': \'创意火花\', \'text\': \'选择目标生物。放逐你的牌库顶牌。你可以让创意火花对该生物造成伤害，其数量等同于所放逐牌的总法术力费用。如果你未如此作，则直到回合结束，你可以使用该牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「发明即反抗。」 ～琵雅纳拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb429f2f-fc8e-407f-9952-3094b1d1f9ac\', \'multiverseId\': 417968}, \'multiverseid\': 417968}, {\'name\': \'創意火花\', \'text\': \'選擇目標生物。放逐你的牌庫頂牌。你可以讓創意火花對該生物造成傷害，其數量等同於所放逐牌的總魔法力費用。如果你未如此作，則直到回合結束，你可以使用該牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「發明即反抗。」 ～琵雅納拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9288b0d9-96e8-4d86-aec5-fb63b56a5b4d\', \'multiverseId\': 418232}, \'multiverseid\': 418232}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gebaut für die Ewigkeit\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Falls es eine Artefaktkreatur ist, erhält sie Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Schaden und Effekte, die „zerstören", zerstören sie nicht.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Vom Konsulat hergestellte Maschinenwesen haben eine lebenslange Garantie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418372&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c83f3e8-e844-42c2-b75d-94d9793efef4\', \'multiverseId\': 418372}, \'multiverseid\': 418372}, {\'name\': \'Construido para perdurar\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno. Si es una criatura artefacto, gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno. (El daño y los efectos que dicen "destruir" no la destruyen.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los autómatas construidos por el Consulado vienen con garantía de por vida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00e56e6b-8d97-4959-a454-a37697679f1c\', \'multiverseId\': 420220}, \'multiverseid\': 420220}, {\'name\': \'Construit pour durer\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Si c\'est une créature-artefact, elle acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Les blessures et les effets qui disent « détruisez » ne la détruisent pas.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Les automates construits par le Consulat sont garantis à vie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418636&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1379874a-4909-4ae2-a9c6-409ea8cac8bf\', \'multiverseId\': 418636}, \'multiverseid\': 418636}, {\'name\': \'Costruito per Durare\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno. Se è una creatura artefatto, ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno. (Il danno e gli effetti che dicono "distruggi" non la distruggono.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Gli automi costruiti dal Consolato sono garantiti a vita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12ba827a-74af-4fcc-a079-3a877f2e6121\', \'multiverseId\': 418900}, \'multiverseid\': 418900}, {\'name\': \'永存確約\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。それがアーティファクト・クリーチャーであるなら、ターン終了時まで、それは破壊不能を得る。（ダメージや「破壊」と書かれた効果では、それは破壊されない。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'領事府製の自動機械には無期限の保証がついている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'296a1897-5da6-4df5-8671-6a09cc452b03\', \'multiverseId\': 419164}, \'multiverseid\': 419164}, {\'name\': \'튼튼하게 만들었습니다\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다. 그 생물이 마법물체 생물이라면, 그 생물은 턴종료까지 무적을 얻는다. (피해와 "파괴"라고 명시된 효과로 파괴되지 않는다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'영사관에서 제작한 자동장치는 평생 품질이 보증된다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80ae6bfa-15cd-44b4-98a3-27341d7d5091\', \'multiverseId\': 419428}, \'multiverseid\': 419428}, {\'name\': \'Feito para Durar\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno. Se for uma criatura artefato, ela ganha indestrutível até o final do turno. (O dano e os efeitos que dizem "destrua" não a destroem.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Os autômatos construídos pelo Consulado têm garantia vitalícia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e9e53b2-074c-4f32-a0a7-3961f4037973\', \'multiverseId\': 419692}, \'multiverseid\': 419692}, {\'name\': \'Запас Прочности\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +2/+2 до конца хода. Если это артефакт существо, оно получает Неразрушимость до конца хода. (Повреждения и эффекты с указанием «уничтожьте» не уничтожают его.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'У автоматов Консульства пожизненная гарантия.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b78afb0-dd4b-4ab6-bf90-7334505abed7\', \'multiverseId\': 419956}, \'multiverseid\': 419956}, {\'name\': \'造以恒久\', \'text\': \'目标生物得+2/+2直到回合结束。如果它是神器生物，则它获得不灭异能直到回合结束。（伤害与注明「消灭」的效应不会将它消灭。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'执政院打造的自动机械终身保固。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3885c69-5c62-4758-a183-1c2ded21f49d\', \'multiverseId\': 417844}, \'multiverseid\': 417844}, {\'name\': \'造以恆久\', \'text\': \'目標生物得+2/+2直到回合結束。如果它是神器生物，則它獲得不滅異能直到回合結束。（傷害與註明「消滅」的效應不會將它消滅。)\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'執政院打造的自動機械終身保固。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f5f11ae-52df-4021-8bb6-51fc9d47c723\', \'multiverseId\': 418108}, \'multiverseid\': 418108}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gebaut um zu zerschmettern\', \'text\': \'Eine angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +3/+3 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Falls es eine Artefaktkreatur ist, verursacht sie Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Ohne die einschränkenden Vorschriften des Konsulats gehen die Maschinen der Renegaten immer ans Limit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418473&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3d4d705-1797-45a8-9d84-3cc06df520b4\', \'multiverseId\': 418473}, \'multiverseid\': 418473}, {\'name\': \'Construido para aplastar\', \'text\': \'La criatura atacante objetivo obtiene +3/+3 hasta el final del turno. Si es una criatura artefacto, gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Libres de las regulaciones del Consulado, los autómatas construidos por los renegados potencian su rendimiento hasta el límite.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85eae3d9-ce5b-4ab8-b1ec-dbca9a46302a\', \'multiverseId\': 420321}, \'multiverseid\': 420321}, {\'name\': \'Construit pour détruire\', \'text\': "La créature attaquante ciblée gagne +3/+3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Si c\'est une créature-artefact, elle acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Affranchis des lois consulaires, les automates construits par les renégats repoussent les limites de la performance.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418737&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39cf62b3-e55f-4bd4-8c44-deb2a2855373\', \'multiverseId\': 418737}, \'multiverseid\': 418737}, {\'name\': \'Costruito per Distruggere\', \'text\': \'Una creatura attaccante bersaglio prende +3/+3 fino alla fine del turno. Se è una creatura artefatto, ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Liberi dalle restrizioni consolari, gli automi costruiti dai rinnegati spingono al limite le proprie potenzialità.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84bbd59f-f22d-4b62-aa88-1df87d668592\', \'multiverseId\': 419001}, \'multiverseid\': 419001}, {\'name\': \'撃砕確約\', \'text\': \'攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。それがアーティファクト・クリーチャーであるなら、ターン終了時まで、それはトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'領事府の規制に縛られていないため、改革派が製造した自動機械の性能は限界まで高められている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40ee97a5-60cc-473d-b35c-de3ae4735955\', \'multiverseId\': 419265}, \'multiverseid\': 419265}, {\'name\': \'강력하게 만들었습니다\', \'text\': \'공격생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +3/+3을 받는다. 그 생물이 마법물체 생물이라면, 그 생물은 턴종료까지 돌진을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'무법자가 만든 자동장치들은 영사관의 규정으로부터 자유로워서 성능의 제한이 없다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'370f7dda-304e-4d0b-8b4c-e4d94b3115d8\', \'multiverseId\': 419529}, \'multiverseid\': 419529}, {\'name\': \'Construído para Arrebentar\', \'text\': \'A criatura atacante alvo recebe +3/+3 até o final do turno. Se ela for uma criatura artefato, ganhará atropelar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Isentos dos regulamentos do Consulado, os autômatos construídos pelos renegados levam a performance ao limite.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91b8d810-eb2a-4de8-a506-6470c23949cf\', \'multiverseId\': 419793}, \'multiverseid\': 419793}, {\'name\': \'Запас Силы\', \'text\': \'Целевое атакующее существо получает +3/+3 до конца хода. Если это артефакт существо, оно получает Пробивной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Отступников не связывают ограничения Консульства, и производительность своих автоматов они повышают до предела.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0640b2a-9ea2-4bd1-8a81-08caca666adf\', \'multiverseId\': 420057}, \'multiverseid\': 420057}, {\'name\': \'造以破坏\', \'text\': \'目标进行攻击的生物得+3/+3直到回合结束。如果它是神器生物，则它获得践踏异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'乱匠制造的自动机械不受执政院的规定约束，可发挥极致性能。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2ee7636-1d70-4596-9c7b-29839fe685de\', \'multiverseId\': 417945}, \'multiverseid\': 417945}, {\'name\': \'造以破壞\', \'text\': \'目標進行攻擊的生物得+3/+3直到回合結束。如果它是神器生物，則它獲得踐踏異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'亂匠製造的自動機械不受執政院的規定約束，可發揮極致性能。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e5d8eb0-b068-4832-badd-f878e8cdc35f\', \'multiverseId\': 418209}, \'multiverseid\': 418209}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gebietstreuer Gierschlund\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn du eine oder mehrere {E} (Energiemarken) erhältst, erhält der Gebietstreue Gierschlund +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Gremlin\', \'flavor\': \'Man weiß von Erfindern, die Gremlins eingefangen haben, um sie in der Werkstatt eines Konkurrenten freizulassen. Öfter als man denkt geht so ein Plan nach hinten los.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418501&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50d6d541-ee71-4d22-ab5f-5f9e95949dc1\', \'multiverseId\': 418501}, \'multiverseid\': 418501}, {\'name\': \'Devorador territorial\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nSiempre que obtengas uno o más {E} (contadores de energía), el Devorador territorial obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gremlin\', \'flavor\': \'Se sabe que algunos inventores capturan gremlins con la intención de soltarlos en algún taller rival. A menudo, el plan les estalla en la cara.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74a3b3c6-2c6e-4715-a819-402477ac66f1\', \'multiverseId\': 420349}, \'multiverseid\': 420349}, {\'name\': \'Avaleur territorial\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que vous gagnez au moins un {E} (marqueur « énergie »), l\'Avaleur territorial gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : gremlin\', \'flavor\': "Certains inventeurs capturent parfois des gremlins pour les libérer dans l\'atelier d\'un rival. Le plus souvent, ce plan se retourne contre eux.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418765&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a489bc96-ffc6-46a2-8737-68ff776488ed\', \'multiverseId\': 418765}, \'multiverseid\': 418765}, {\'name\': \'Trangugiatore Territoriale\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta ottieni uno o più {E} (segnalini energia), il Trangugiatore Territoriale prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gremlin\', \'flavor\': "Molti inventori catturano i gremlin con l\'intenzione di liberarli nel laboratorio di un rivale. Nella maggioranza dei casi, il piano si ritorce contro l\'aspirante sabotatore.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d74ea41-0789-4516-986c-92f6cc05fd57\', \'multiverseId\': 419029}, \'multiverseid\': 419029}, {\'name\': \'縄張り持ちの大喰らい\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nあなたが{E}（エネルギー・カウンター）を１つ以上得るたび、ターン終了時まで、縄張り持ちの大喰らいは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — グレムリン\', \'flavor\': \'発明者たちはグレムリンを生きたまま捕獲したがる。ライバルの作業場に放つつもりなのだ。大抵はしっぺ返しを食らうのだが。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e20c6822-4191-4bc7-b77b-7a46c5d84459\', \'multiverseId\': 419293}, \'multiverseid\': 419293}, {\'name\': \'영역을 지키는 포식자\', \'text\': \'돌진\\n당신이 한 개 이상의 {E}(에너지 카운터)를 얻을 때마다, 영역을 지키는 포식자는 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 그렘린\', \'flavor\': \'발명가들은 그렘린을 포획해 맞수의 작업장에 풀어 놓는 것으로 알려져 있다. 하지만 이 계획은 대부분 역효과를 가져온다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d6cc6a9-f884-4dd9-80f1-1f2a3662219e\', \'multiverseId\': 419557}, \'multiverseid\': 419557}, {\'name\': \'Devorador Territorial\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nToda vez que você recebe um ou mais {E} (marcadores de energia), Devorador Territorial recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gremlin\', \'flavor\': \'Sabe-se que alguns inventores capturam gremlins com o intuito de soltá-los na oficina de um rival. É mais comum esse plano sair pela culatra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96523e2a-d64b-4c71-9b91-e0ac4090a959\', \'multiverseId\': 419821}, \'multiverseid\': 419821}, {\'name\': \'Территориальный Пожиратель\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nКаждый раз, когда вы получаете один или несколько {E} (жетонов энергии), Территориальный Пожиратель получает +2/+2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гремлин\', \'flavor\': \'Бывает, что изобретатели ловят гремлинов, чтобы запустить их в мастерскую соперника. Но обычно этот план заканчивается печально для самого горе-хитреца.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cea5922-8eb7-4d7f-acfe-f0a48942bfc0\', \'multiverseId\': 420085}, \'multiverseid\': 420085}, {\'name\': \'据地食客\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n每当你得到一个或数个{E}（能量指示物）时，据地食客得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～怪灵\', \'flavor\': \'一般皆知发明家会捕捉怪灵，将其送入对手的工作室。但他们的计策更常适得其反。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'044b1eba-8273-4999-9faf-144f5ad8cd8c\', \'multiverseId\': 417973}, \'multiverseid\': 417973}, {\'name\': \'據地食客\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n每當你得一個或數個{E}（能量指示物）時，據地食客得+2/+2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～怪靈\', \'flavor\': \'一般皆知發明家會捕捉怪靈，將其送入對手的工作室。但他們的計策更常適得其反。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94b4cfe3-9690-4261-b486-5e48f790152a\', \'multiverseId\': 418237}, \'multiverseid\': 418237}]', "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418624&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '306d10f5-facb-49e6-ad29-788bef7fc998', 'multiverseId': 418624}, 'multiverseid': 418624}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420472&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea7c64c0-c833-44d4-a5c5-46c4c6604134', 'multiverseId': 420472}, 'multiverseid': 420472}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418888&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a5affb42-c7af-4216-a3c3-35d261d4b4ea', 'multiverseId': 418888}, 'multiverseid': 418888}, {'name': 'Montagna', 'type': 'Terra Base — Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419152&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7f731479-4bdd-4012-a69b-eab239fc558e', 'multiverseId': 419152}, 'multiverseid': 419152}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419416&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2b1e79b5-cdfc-4c07-8b83-f50cff8f9001', 'multiverseId': 419416}, 'multiverseid': 419416}, {'name': '산', 'type': '기본 대지 — 산', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419680&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3f644497-baac-4c7e-b81e-cc8bffcbe70c', 'multiver