ype=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3dfae0c0-416f-4f72-80ff-8288162f0c3d', 'multiverseId': 420477}, 'multiverseid': 420477}, {'name': 'Forêt', 'type': 'Terrain de base : forêt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418893&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '80e17fd8-816b-433b-ba5a-821b116d4c53', 'multiverseId': 418893}, 'multiverseid': 418893}, {'name': 'Foresta', 'type': 'Terra Base — Foresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419157&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '313b6d6f-73d4-42d3-a6c5-c61fdbd4d1f2', 'multiverseId': 419157}, 'multiverseid': 419157}, {'name': '森', 'type': '基本土地 — 森', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419421&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82e5f34d-6a31-416e-9953-a88bc3d9556a', 'multiverseId': 419421}, 'multiverseid': 419421}, {'name': '숲', 'type': '기본 대지 — 숲', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419685&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c50039a-502a-4018-be6e-6d9d2b5a0387', 'multiverseId': 419685}, 'multiverseid': 419685}, {'name': 'Floresta', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Floresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419949&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dcf2d616-a13e-40bc-9b51-4cd6f57e96d5', 'multiverseId': 419949}, 'multiverseid': 419949}, {'name': 'Лес', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Лес', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420213&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b85628b7-1322-45b0-834d-10eab09b6826', 'multiverseId': 420213}, 'multiverseid': 420213}, {'name': '树林', 'type': '基本地～树林', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418101&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '14036979-e169-4804-acbb-93da242e1e65', 'multiverseId': 418101}, 'multiverseid': 418101}, {'name': '樹林', 'type': '基本地～樹林', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418365&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '70001b61-9cfb-405e-a264-27d5a9551c74', 'multiverseId': 418365}, 'multiverseid': 418365}]", '[{\'name\': \'Waldlandstrom\', \'text\': \'Der Waldlandstrom kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {G} oder {U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Die Wege, die sich das Wasser durch das Land bahnt, reflektieren die Wege, auf denen Ätherströme die Wolken durchdringen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420517&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0afa2117-39f9-47f6-8874-7df5a7cead53\', \'multiverseId\': 420517}, \'multiverseid\': 420517}, {\'name\': \'Arroyo forestal\', \'text\': \'El Arroyo forestal entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {U} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'El agua esculpe su camino por la tierra para reflejar el curso del éter que surca las nubes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37e1a141-42e3-4472-a2cc-a602b5928bf0\', \'multiverseId\': 420587}, \'multiverseid\': 420587}, {\'name\': \'Ruisseau des sylves\', \'text\': \'Le Ruisseau des sylves arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U} à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Les cours d\'eau creusent leur lit dans la terre pour refléter les chemins que prennent les flux d\'Éther dans les nuages.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420527&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23a6542e-0181-4abb-a9d6-359ba0dd3fab\', \'multiverseId\': 420527}, \'multiverseid\': 420527}, {\'name\': \'Ruscello nel Bosco\', \'text\': \'Il Ruscello nel Bosco entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {U} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "I corsi d\'acqua scavano nel terreno percorsi paralleli a quelli tracciati dai flussi d\'etere tra le nuvole.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f5c6b47-5c93-4556-9496-5b7babbca6f9\', \'multiverseId\': 420537}, \'multiverseid\': 420537}, {\'name\': \'森林地の小川\', \'text\': \'森林地の小川はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}か{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'霊気の流れが雲を通り抜ける道を映し出すかのように、小川もその経路を形作る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'943c3d1d-1271-4801-b839-cbf5dd607732\', \'multiverseId\': 420547}, \'multiverseid\': 420547}, {\'name\': \'삼림지 개울\', \'text\': \'삼림지 개울은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{T}: {G} 또는 {U}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': \'대지를 뚫고 흐르는 물길은 마치 구름을 뚫고 흐르는 에테르 강을 연상시킨다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8de91c05-347c-4350-8639-368c46849d83\', \'multiverseId\': 420557}, \'multiverseid\': 420557}, {\'name\': \'Riacho da Floresta\', \'text\': \'Riacho da Floresta entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {U} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': "Os cursos d\'água traçam no terreno percursos paralelos aos desenhados pelos fluxos de éter entre as nuvens.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a4187bd-75bf-4e18-bddc-471ebabade41\', \'multiverseId\': 420567}, \'multiverseid\': 420567}, {\'name\': \'Лесной Ручей\', \'text\': \'Лесной Ручей выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {G} или {U} в ваше хранилище маны.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Ручьи и реки промывают себе путь в земле, повторяя узоры, что эфирные потоки рисуют в облаках.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b524909b-8a7d-41a7-bb6f-2ae2e4e29f26\', \'multiverseId\': 420577}, \'multiverseid\': 420577}, {\'name\': \'林地溪流\', \'text\': \'林地溪流须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{G}或{U}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'溪流自大地穿行而过，照映出乙太流穿越云间的路径。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04f5eb64-2aca-41b3-8a6b-39d93a383960\', \'multiverseId\': 420497}, \'multiverseid\': 420497}, {\'name\': \'林地溪流\', \'text\': \'林地溪流須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{G}或{U}到你的魔法力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'溪流自大地穿行而過，照映出乙太流穿越雲間的路徑。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5981eea-3f6a-4a4f-ab07-cf88dce22b7c\', \'multiverseId\': 420507}, \'multiverseid\': 420507}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wanderin der Wildnis\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Wanderin der Wildnis ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie getappt ins Spiel bringen und dann deine Bibliothek mischen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Alles hat seinen Ursprung in der Natur und zur Natur gehören wir."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418538&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c28e60cc-b839-4a7d-a593-6b8d3898453b\', \'multiverseId\': 418538}, \'multiverseid\': 418538}, {\'name\': \'Errante de lo agreste\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Errante de lo agreste entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponerla en el campo de batalla girada y luego barajar tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Todos venimos de la naturaleza, y a ella pertenecemos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5dbcd67-bb07-4039-b21e-45d112b31d1a\', \'multiverseId\': 420386}, \'multiverseid\': 420386}, {\'name\': \'Vagabonde sauvage\', \'text\': \'Quand la Vagabonde sauvage arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélanger votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': "« Nous venons tous de la nature, et c\'est à elle que nous appartenons. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418802&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3013a905-a957-4984-be1e-2d5ac73681b7\', \'multiverseId\': 418802}, \'multiverseid\': 418802}, {\'name\': \'Girovaga delle Terre Selvagge\', \'text\': \'Quando la Girovaga delle Terre Selvagge entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescolare il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tutti abbiamo origine nella natura ed è a essa che apparteniamo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'beb72b89-41d7-43a6-8844-68c837e41df3\', \'multiverseId\': 419066}, \'multiverseid\': 419066}, {\'name\': \'野生の放浪者\', \'text\': \'野生の放浪者が戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探してもよい。そうしたなら、それをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「私たちは自然から生まれた。自然が私たちの居場所。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5d806c6-c4a8-4833-9991-44414dbaac59\', \'multiverseId\': 419330}, \'multiverseid\': 419330}, {\'name\': \'야생 방랑자\', \'text\': \'야생 방랑자가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 당신의 서고에서 기본 대지 카드 한 장을 찾아 탭된 상태로 전장에 놓을 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 드루이드\', \'flavor\': \'"우리 모두는 자연에서 시작하고 자연에 속해 있지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d871ec4f-fd65-4351-97c2-b12bdba54fb2\', \'multiverseId\': 419594}, \'multiverseid\': 419594}, {\'name\': \'Errante Selvagem\', \'text\': \'Quando Errante Selvagem entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, colocá-lo no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhar seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"Todos começamos na natureza, e a natureza é o nosso lugar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b405953a-be8d-418b-a6fa-8dd44fafbd3c\', \'multiverseId\': 419858}, \'multiverseid\': 419858}, {\'name\': \'Дикая Странница\', \'text\': \'Когда Дикая Странница выходит на поле битвы, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, положить ее на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасовать вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Друид\', \'flavor\': \'«Все мы вышли из дикой природы и природе принадлежим».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'792322de-e06a-4b82-bb31-8cc2d9c6711b\', \'multiverseId\': 420122}, \'multiverseid\': 420122}, {\'name\': \'荒野漫游人\', \'text\': \'当荒野漫游人进战场时，你可以从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之横置放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「我们生于自然，也属于自然。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc4ce3bf-85d0-4742-b537-0d3afcf8387c\', \'multiverseId\': 418010}, \'multiverseid\': 418010}, {\'name\': \'荒野漫遊人\', \'text\': \'當荒野漫遊人進戰場時，你可以從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，將之橫置放進戰場，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'「我們生於自然，也屬於自然。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1c55657-e5e0-4c9e-9eff-99e0a6df64da\', \'multiverseId\': 418274}, \'multiverseid\': 418274}]', '[{\'name\': \'Weiser aus Shailas Areal\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Weise aus Shailas Areal ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E}{E}{E} (drei Energiemarken).\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'Noch immer besetzen ihre Nachfahren stolz den Flecken Grün, den Shaila dem Konsulat nicht abgetreten hat.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418533&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82d589f0-8675-4bbd-9a8f-dd8a1b1a44be\', \'multiverseId\': 418533}, \'multiverseid\': 418533}, {\'name\': \'Sabio de la Franja de Shaila\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Sabio de la Franja de Shaila entre al campo de batalla, obtienes {E}{E}{E} (tres contadores de energía).\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Incluso ahora, los descendientes de Shaila ocupan con orgullo el sendero verde que ella rehusó rendir ante el Consulado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'656120bf-e582-4a0f-a300-13342dd94c9a\', \'multiverseId\': 420381}, \'multiverseid\': 420381}, {\'name\': \'Sage du Maquis de Shaila\', \'text\': \'Quand le Sage du Maquis de Shaila arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez {E}{E}{E} (trois marqueurs « énergie »).\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': "Aujourd\'hui encore, les descendants de Shaila occupent fièrement l\'artère boisée qu\'elle a refusé de céder au Consulat.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418797&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9dec18c-7a4e-48f0-a80d-4f600fb54e06\', \'multiverseId\': 418797}, \'multiverseid\': 418797}, {\'name\': \'Saggio del Diritto di Shaila\', \'text\': \'Quando il Saggio del Diritto di Shaila entra nel campo di battaglia, ottieni {E}{E}{E} (tre segnalini energia).\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': "I discendenti di Shaila vivono ancora con orgoglio nell\'area verde che la loro antenata rifiutò di cedere al Consolato.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb406bd9-78ee-404c-9422-c927e694b765\', \'multiverseId\': 419061}, \'multiverseid\': 419061}, {\'name\': \'シャイラ専有地の賢者\', \'text\': \'シャイラ専有地の賢者が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{E}{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター３個）を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'今も、シャイラの子孫たちがその緑の一帯を専有し誇りとしている。そこはかつて、シャイラが領事府への明け渡しを拒否した地だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f37f0fd-10a6-46e2-b304-64559db01c60\', \'multiverseId\': 419325}, \'multiverseid\': 419325}, {\'name\': \'샤일라 영역의 현자\', \'text\': \'샤일라 영역의 현자가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 {E}{E}{E}(에너지 카운터 세 개)를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 드루이드\', \'flavor\': \'샤일라가 영사관에 넘기지 않았던 이 산책로는 지금까지도 그녀의 자손들이 자랑스럽게 소유하고 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73f83fba-5012-40f0-b6a0-1318edbc5d01\', \'multiverseId\': 419589}, \'multiverseid\': 419589}, {\'name\': \'Sábio da Reivindicação de Shaila\', \'text\': \'Quando Sábio da Reivindicação de Shaila entra no campo de batalha, você recebe {E}{E}{E} (três marcadores de energia).\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'Até hoje, os descendentes de Shaila ocupam orgulhosamente a área verde que ela se recusou a entregar ao Consulado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88dcf0de-60cd-4024-bf71-d49e8ce1c0d6\', \'multiverseId\': 419853}, \'multiverseid\': 419853}, {\'name\': \'Мудрец из Владений Шейлы\', \'text\': \'Когда Мудрец из Владений Шейлы выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете {E}{E}{E} (три жетона энергии).\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Друид\', \'flavor\': \'До сих пор потомки Шейлы живут в зеленых угодьях, которые она отказалась уступить Консульству.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11cc0dfc-1644-4f94-9e0d-ec85685437f7\', \'multiverseId\': 420117}, \'multiverseid\': 420117}, {\'name\': \'莎伊勒域智者\', \'text\': \'当莎伊勒域智者进战场时，你得到{E}{E}{E}（三个能量指示物）。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'时至今日，莎伊勒的后人仍雄据这片她不愿让给执政院的绿色地带。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'089c2453-6b22-4779-8b31-9f4f9e03bd9f\', \'multiverseId\': 418005}, \'multiverseid\': 418005}, {\'name\': \'莎伊勒域智者\', \'text\': \'當莎伊勒域智者進戰場時，你得到{E}{E}{E}（三個能量指示物）。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'時至今日，莎伊勒的後人仍雄據這片她不願讓給執政院的綠色地帶。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'146fab85-c466-4ccf-8cf6-717f9c3b028a\', \'multiverseId\': 418269}, \'multiverseid\': 418269}]', '[{\'name\': \'Werkstatt-Assistent\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Werkstatt-Assistent stirbt, bringe eine andere Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'Manchmal machen die kleinsten Dinge den größten Unterschied.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418606&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'726d1c24-0bac-4478-8046-30b03f8fb623\', \'multiverseId\': 418606}, \'multiverseid\': 418606}, {\'name\': \'Ayudante del taller\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Ayudante del taller muera, regresa otra carta de artefacto objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'A veces las cosas más pequeñas son las que causan la mayor diferencia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51253342-66a3-4c1a-ac7e-2bb10c4c7ac9\', \'multiverseId\': 420454}, \'multiverseid\': 420454}, {\'name\': "Assistant d\'atelier", \'text\': "Quand l\'Assistant d\'atelier meurt, renvoyez une autre carte d\'artefact ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': \'Parfois, une petite chose fait toute la différence.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418870&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ae11785-6dd9-470f-b00c-439e55acef4c\', \'multiverseId\': 418870}, \'multiverseid\': 418870}, {\'name\': \'Assistente di Laboratorio\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Assistente di Laboratorio muore, riprendi in mano un\'altra carta artefatto bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'A volte, i dettagli più piccoli fanno una grande differenza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6186af15-bb7c-4373-8284-e5c09b7a6078\', \'multiverseId\': 419134}, \'multiverseid\': 419134}, {\'name\': \'作業場の助手\', \'text\': \'作業場の助手が死亡したとき、あなたの墓地から他のアーティファクト・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'些細なことから最大の違いが生まれることもある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa0155c4-9440-4721-a064-e58055f4c3d8\', \'multiverseId\': 419398}, \'multiverseid\': 419398}, {\'name\': \'작업장 조수\', \'text\': \'작업장 조수가 죽을 때, 당신의 무덤에 있는 다른 마법물체 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 자동기계\', \'flavor\': \'가끔은 작은 것이 큰 차이를 만든다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38c1e08e-aa31-494e-a564-ee943059fcdd\', \'multiverseId\': 419662}, \'multiverseid\': 419662}, {\'name\': \'Assistente de Oficina\', \'text\': \'Quando Assistente de Oficina morrer, devolva outro card de artefato alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Às vezes, as menores coisas fazem a maior diferença.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f0e28c3-3712-46ad-ab35-e2d5e8e8b5e8\', \'multiverseId\': 419926}, \'multiverseid\': 419926}, {\'name\': \'Помощник из Мастерской\', \'text\': \'Когда Помощник из Мастерской умирает, верните другую целевую карту артефакта из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': \'Иногда самые маленькие детали приводят к колоссальной разнице.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9534483-32be-474a-a33a-3c1fea52dec2\', \'multiverseId\': 420190}, \'multiverseid\': 420190}, {\'name\': \'车间助手\', \'text\': \'当车间助手死去时，将另一张目标神器牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'有时最渺小的东西能产生最深远的影响。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c91f570-0705-436a-97fe-526c250e3098\', \'multiverseId\': 418078}, \'multiverseid\': 418078}, {\'name\': \'車間助手\', \'text\': \'當車間助手死去時，將另一張目標神器牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～組構體\', \'flavor\': \'有時最渺小的東西能產生最深遠的影響。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0546487-d4da-4806-8f65-6e335962d8f0\', \'multiverseId\': 418342}, \'multiverseid\': 418342}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wildeste Träume\', \'text\': \'Bringe X Karten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück. Schicke die Wildesten Träume ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich öffnete meinen Geist für die unbeschreiblichen Wunder um mich herum. Erst dann nahm ich die Große Verbindung wahr." —Rashmi, Äther-Seherin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418539&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9359e236-72c4-49fe-8411-085845f8079f\', \'multiverseId\': 418539}, \'multiverseid\': 418539}, {\'name\': \'Sueños desenfrenados\', \'text\': \'Regresa X cartas objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano. Exilia los Sueños desenfrenados.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Abrí mi mente a la inmensidad de las maravillas que me rodeaban. Solo entonces fui consciente de la Panconexión". —Rashmi, adivina del éter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bab8bf8d-f871-45b8-8fc3-79078ac4922d\', \'multiverseId\': 420387}, \'multiverseid\': 420387}, {\'name\': \'Les rêves les plus fous\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez X cartes ciblées depuis votre cimetière dans votre main. Exilez Les rêves les plus fous.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai ouvert mon esprit à l\'immensité des merveilles qui m\'entourent. Ce n\'est qu\'à ce moment-là que j\'ai vu le Grand conduit. » —Rashmi, voyante de l\'Éther", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418803&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c72adae4-5186-4602-909d-370215c9e6b6\', \'multiverseId\': 418803}, \'multiverseid\': 418803}, {\'name\': \'Sogni Più Sfrenati\', \'text\': \'Riprendi in mano X carte bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Esilia i Sogni Più Sfrenati.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho aperto la mente all\\\'immensità delle meraviglie che mi circondavano. Solo allora sono riuscita a vedere il Grande Flusso." —Rashmi, veggente dell\\\'etere\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f85deba-60f2-49af-875c-0a459fb0bbf4\', \'multiverseId\': 419067}, \'multiverseid\': 419067}, {\'name\': \'途方もない夢\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地からカードＸ枚を対象とし、それらをあなたの手札に戻す。途方もない夢を追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「身の回りの途方もない驚異に心を開きました。その時から、私は大導路が見えるようになったのです。」 ――霊気予見者、ラシュミ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fef00a4-2337-43ce-bd4d-c9a84f66c038\', \'multiverseId\': 419331}, \'multiverseid\': 419331}, {\'name\': \'야생의 꿈\', \'text\': \'당신의 무덤에 있는 카드 X장을 목표로 정한다. 그 카드들을 당신의 손으로 되돌린다. 야생의 꿈을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"나를 둘러싼 엄청난 경이로움에 대해 마음을 열었다네. 그제야 찬란한 수로를 볼 수 있었지." —에테르 예언자 라시미\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'016c5aed-119e-4294-b8ff-a3ed87aaf831\', \'multiverseId\': 419595}, \'multiverseid\': 419595}, {\'name\': \'Sonhos Desvairados\', \'text\': \'Devolva X cards alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão. Exile Sonhos Desvairados.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu abri minha mente para a imensidão das maravilhas a minha volta. Somente então eu consegui ver o Grande Conduíte." — Rashmi, vidente do éter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daeb8336-1058-437a-9ed9-2e05b1ccdb22\', \'multiverseId\': 419859}, \'multiverseid\': 419859}, {\'name\': \'Предел Мечтаний\', \'text\': \'Верните X целевых карт из вашего кладбища в вашу руку. Изгоните Предел Мечтаний.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Я открыла разум бесчисленному множеству окружающих меня чудес. Лишь тогда я смогла увидеть Великий Канал». — Рашми, эфирная провидица\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f0adee8-d8ce-478e-854d-b4cebd48a5a3\', \'multiverseId\': 420123}, \'multiverseid\': 420123}, {\'name\': \'狂野梦想\', \'text\': \'将X张目标牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。放逐狂野梦想。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我向周遭的无限奇观敞开心房。唯有此时，我才得见大通联。」 ～乙太预言师列施蜜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd3e6da1-f1ae-43a1-89bf-df8019715049\', \'multiverseId\': 418011}, \'multiverseid\': 418011}, {\'name\': \'狂野夢想\', \'text\': \'將X張目標牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。放逐狂野夢想。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「我向周遭的無限奇觀敞開心房。唯有此時，我才得見大通聯。」 ～乙太預言師列施蜜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13a2ef6b-c8d5-4cf7-86c6-1a8882a31b5d\', \'multiverseId\': 418275}, \'multiverseid\': 418275}]', '[{\'name\': \'Windhauchweber-Engel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Windhauchweber-Engel ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil schicken und ihre Karte dann unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418400&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21156d03-20cd-4ea6-b822-0350d5dc37b0\', \'multiverseId\': 418400}, \'multiverseid\': 418400}, {\'name\': \'Ángel tejenubes\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Ángel tejenubes entre al campo de batalla, puedes exiliar otra criatura objetivo que controlas. Luego, regresa esa carta al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81ba1953-c1a2-467e-87e5-54e036c1b418\', \'multiverseId\': 420248}, \'multiverseid\': 420248}, {\'name\': \'Ange tisseur de nuages\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Ange tisseur de nuages arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez exiler une autre créature ciblée que vous contrôlez, puis renvoyer cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418664&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32d548ec-4f6a-40df-ac6d-7e0bcc8198f5\', \'multiverseId\': 418664}, \'multiverseid\': 418664}, {\'name\': \'Angelo Tessinuvole\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Angelo Tessinuvole entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi esiliare un\'altra creatura bersaglio che controlli, poi rimettere quella carta sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1cf24cb-5f39-45d4-a78a-548e77406cd8\', \'multiverseId\': 418928}, \'multiverseid\': 418928}, {\'name\': \'たなびき織りの天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nたなびき織りの天使が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールする他のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれを追放してもよい。そうしたなら、その後そのカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4baf14b-55d7-47a2-afff-cf5e87e9df62\', \'multiverseId\': 419192}, \'multiverseid\': 419192}, {\'name\': \'구름조각을 엮는 천사\', \'text\': \'비행\\n구름조각을 엮는 천사가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종하는 다른 생물을 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 생물을 추방한 후 소유자의 조종하에 전장에 되돌릴 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 천사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419456&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a56fc9bd-4734-4ead-afe9-e1832394bf70\', \'multiverseId\': 419456}, \'multiverseid\': 419456}, {\'name\': \'Anjo Tecelão de Nuvens\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Anjo Tecelão de Nuvens entra no campo de batalha, você pode exilar outra criatura alvo que você controla. Depois, devolva-a ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7db886fb-2c69-4ecd-bac9-42cb06492a43\', \'multiverseId\': 419720}, \'multiverseid\': 419720}, {\'name\': \'Ангел Облачной Дымки\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Ангел Облачной Дымки выходит на поле битвы, вы можете изгнать другое целевое существо под вашим контролем, затем вернуть ту карту на поле битвы под контролем ее владельца.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49570665-fac3-4d59-a478-a35070a89cf1\', \'multiverseId\': 419984}, \'multiverseid\': 419984}, {\'name\': \'编缕天使\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当编缕天使进战场时，你可以放逐另一个目标由你操控的生物，然后将该牌在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417872&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'147919d2-6279-4488-9c46-7c42fcca2624\', \'multiverseId\': 417872}, \'multiverseid\': 417872}, {\'name\': \'編縷天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當編縷天使進戰場時，你可以放逐另一個目標由你操控的生物，然後將該牌在其擁有者的操控下移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22ac7929-bafa-4564-aa2d-d1ecb531df4d\', \'multiverseId\': 418136}, \'multiverseid\': 418136}]', '[{\'name\': \'Windsceada\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sceada\', \'flavor\': \'Sceadas ziehen am Himmel Kaladeshs entlang und warten auf den perfekten Moment zuzuschlagen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418435&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c53b971-93c0-4106-9d2e-0d94db909253\', \'multiverseId\': 418435}, \'multiverseid\': 418435}, {\'name\': \'Draco del viento\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Draco\', \'flavor\': \'Los dracos rondan los cielos de Kaladesh, esperando el momento perfecto para atacar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c81ac9dc-7e17-43a1-9010-83892ffbfbda\', \'multiverseId\': 420283}, \'multiverseid\': 420283}, {\'name\': \'Drakôn des vents\', \'text\': \'Vol\', \'type\': \'Créature : drakôn\', \'flavor\': "Les drakôns rôdent dans les cieux de Kaladesh, attendant le bon moment pour passer à l\'attaque.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418699&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac8e8eca-63a3-4b60-bfbe-5841fc950de0\', \'multiverseId\': 418699}, \'multiverseid\': 418699}, {\'name\': \'Draghetto del Vento\', \'text\': \'Volare\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Draghetto\', \'flavor\': \'I draghetti affollano i cieli di Kaladesh, in attesa del momento perfetto per colpire.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3241384f-4e34-4322-a622-8bf7c9b1cd98\', \'multiverseId\': 418963}, \'multiverseid\': 418963}, {\'name\': \'風のドレイク\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドレイク\', \'flavor\': \'襲い掛かる最高の瞬間を待ちながら、ドレイクはカラデシュの空を徘徊する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6c39e1e-5dbd-4f6b-bb59-7c1a1db172a7\', \'multiverseId\': 419227}, \'multiverseid\': 419227}, {\'name\': \'바람의 드레이크\', \'text\': \'비행\', \'type\': \'생물 — 드레이크\', \'flavor\': \'드레이크는 칼라데시 상공을 누비며 공격할 절호의 순간을 기다린다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc536161-e944-461e-90cb-695cad1728cd\', \'multiverseId\': 419491}, \'multiverseid\': 419491}, {\'name\': \'Dragonete do Vento\', \'text\': \'Voar\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragonete\', \'flavor\': \'Os dragonetes espreitam nos céus de Kaladesh, esperando o momento perfeito para atacar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'821bdf81-646c-426d-b660-fe4b422c4f33\', \'multiverseId\': 419755}, \'multiverseid\': 419755}, {\'name\': \'Ветряной Дрейк\', \'text\': \'Полет\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дрейк\', \'flavor\': \'Дрейки кружат в небесах Каладеша, выжидая подходящего момента для удара.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3d012dd-023d-4343-8d84-74831501906c\', \'multiverseId\': 420019}, \'multiverseid\': 420019}, {\'name\': \'风龙兽\', \'text\': \'飞行\', \'type\': \'生物～龙兽\', \'flavor\': \'龙兽在卡拉德许的空中盘旋，等候出击的最佳时机。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'130ef250-328e-48ff-a8b3-00adc3cac51b\', \'multiverseId\': 417907}, \'multiverseid\': 417907}, {\'name\': \'風龍獸\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'生物～龍獸\', \'flavor\': \'龍獸在卡拉德許的空中盤旋，等候出擊的最佳時機。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2656197-49a6-4c34-b9cb-4cdcfbd6eab1\', \'multiverseId\': 418171}, \'multiverseid\': 418171}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wirbelspurfalke\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Wirbelspurfalke ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E}{E} (zwei Energiemarken).\\nImmer wenn der Wirbelspurfalke angreift, kannst du {E} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erhält eine andere angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418377&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05fcf22b-f321-4fba-809d-090dec199479\', \'multiverseId\': 418377}, \'multiverseid\': 418377}, {\'name\': \'Halcón labraestelas\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Halcón labraestelas entre al campo de batalla, obtienes {E}{E} (dos contadores de energía).\\nSiempre que el Halcón labraestelas ataque, puedes pagar {E}. Si lo haces, otra criatura atacante objetivo gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ada05c5-8256-43d9-beaf-d6496ff93036\', \'multiverseId\': 420225}, \'multiverseid\': 420225}, {\'name\': \'Faucon des courants\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Faucon des courants arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez {E}{E} (deux marqueurs « énergie »).\\nÀ chaque fois que le Faucon des courants attaque, vous pouvez payer {E}. Si vous faites ainsi, une autre créature attaquante ciblée acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418641&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f22a2f10-3735-43cb-83a6-8f0841800df2\', \'multiverseId\': 418641}, \'multiverseid\': 418641}, {\'name\': \'Falco Traccianubi\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando il Falco Traccianubi entra nel campo di battaglia, ottieni {E}{E} (due segnalini energia).\\nOgniqualvolta il Falco Traccianubi attacca, puoi pagare {E}. Se lo fai, un\'altra creatura attaccante bersaglio ha volare fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f26ed15-e81a-45a5-a8be-6d309779c36a\', \'multiverseId\': 418905}, \'multiverseid\': 418905}, {\'name\': \'渦跡の鷹\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n渦跡の鷹が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター２個）を得る。\\n渦跡の鷹が攻撃するたび、他の攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたは{E}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、ターン終了時まで、それは飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1503b2eb-6d0d-43e2-82f2-a6459d8be272\', \'multiverseId\': 419169}, \'multiverseid\': 419169}, {\'name\': \'소용돌이자취 매\', \'text\': \'비행\\n소용돌이자취 매가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 {E}{E}(에너지 카운터 두 개)를 얻는다.\\n소용돌이자취 매가 공격할 때마다, 당신은 {E}를 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 다른 공격생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 비행을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 조류\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'162e672e-003f-41d5-96a1-9b29c08bd3b1\', \'multiverseId\': 419433}, \'multiverseid\': 419433}, {\'name\': \'Falcão Turbilhonante\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Falcão Turbilhonante entra no campo de batalha, você recebe {E}{E} (dois marcadores de energia).\\nToda vez que Falcão Turbilhonante ataca, você pode pagar {E}. Se fizer isso, outra criatura atacante alvo ganha voar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31e5f74e-ebbc-455a-96d3-c42812ac5a8b\', \'multiverseId\': 419697}, \'multiverseid\': 419697}, {\'name\': \'Ястреб Вихревого Следа\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Ястреб Вихревого Следа выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете {E}{E} (два жетона энергии).\\nКаждый раз, когда Ястреб Вихревого Следа атакует, вы можете заплатить {E}. Если вы это делаете, другое целевое атакующее существо получает Полет до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419961&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c995359-abb1-4620-bb64-38ebffed6df4\', \'multiverseId\': 419961}, \'multiverseid\': 419961}, {\'name\': \'漩迹鹰\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当漩迹鹰进战场时，你得到{E}{E}（两个能量指示物）。\\n每当漩迹鹰攻击时，你可以支付{E}。若你如此作，则另一个目标进行攻击的生物获得飞行异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～鸟\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db391c02-bfa3-4ea1-b430-d3bbc5c40391\', \'multiverseId\': 417849}, \'multiverseid\': 417849}, {\'name\': \'漩跡鷹\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當漩跡鷹進戰場時，你得到{E}{E}（兩個能量指示物）。\\n每當漩跡鷹攻擊時，你可以支付{E}。若你如此作，則另一個目標進行攻擊的生物獲得飛行異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～鳥\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d14aad95-7b94-4397-93f3-31e0f0b9de1e\', \'multiverseId\': 418113}, \'multiverseid\': 418113}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wirbler-Virtuose\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Wirbler-Virtuose ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E}{E}{E} (drei Energiemarken).\\nBezahle {E}{E}{E}: Erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vedalken, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'Die ersten zaghaften Flügelschläge sind wie Musik in seinen Ohren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418555&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71af31a5-0f5e-40cd-8b02-96dae7b556e2\', \'multiverseId\': 418555}, \'multiverseid\': 418555}, {\'name\': \'Virtuoso de los zumbones\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Virtuoso de los zumbones entre al campo de batalla, obtienes {E}{E}{E} (tres contadores de energía).\\nPagar {E}{E}{E}: Crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Tóptero incolora 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice vedalken\', \'flavor\': \'Los primeros revoloteos le alegran el alma como muy pocas cosas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9777ded-02af-43a2-ade9-67c4c9ca90c1\', \'multiverseId\': 420403}, \'multiverseid\': 420403}, {\'name\': \'Virtuose des voltigeurs\', \'text\': \'Quand le Virtuose des voltigeurs arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez {E}{E}{E} (trois marqueurs « énergie »).\\nPayez {E}{E}{E} : Créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vedalken et artificier\', \'flavor\': "Les premiers battements d\'ailes sont une douce musique à ses oreilles.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418819&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3b6ad0a-e7f8-4b1d-8a47-bf96a1d6db85\', \'multiverseId\': 418819}, \'multiverseid\': 418819}, {\'name\': \'Virtuoso dei Turbinanti\', \'text\': \'Quando il Virtuoso dei Turbinanti entra nel campo di battaglia, ottieni {E}{E}{E} (tre segnalini energia).\\nPaga {E}{E}{E}: Crea una pedina creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolore con volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Vedalken\', \'flavor\': "I primi battiti d\'ala incerti sono musica per la sua anima.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5d8b0ee-146d-4b26-a704-c8d8e600b004\', \'multiverseId\': 419083}, \'multiverseid\': 419083}, {\'name\': \'つむじ風の巨匠\', \'text\': \'つむじ風の巨匠が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{E}{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター３個）を得る。\\n{E}{E}{E}を支払う：飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ヴィダルケン・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'ゆっくりと羽ばたきが始まる音色は、歌声のように魂に響く。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'483ed068-74d3-46ce-ad25-a53fa9352df9\', \'multiverseId\': 419347}, \'multiverseid\': 419347}, {\'name\': \'돌개제작술 명인\', \'text\': \'돌개제작술 명인이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 {E}{E}{E}(에너지 카운터 세 개)를 얻는다.\\n{E}{E}{E}를 지불한다: 비행을 가진 1/1 무색 날틀 마법물체 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 베달켄 기능공\', \'flavor\': \'최초의 시험적인 날갯짓은 그의 영혼을 위한 노래와 같다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b38e8692-e337-4952-b31e-4672b6c896a9\', \'multiverseId\': 419611}, \'multiverseid\': 419611}, {\'name\': \'Virtuose dos Turbilinos\', \'text\': \'Quando Virtuose dos Turbilinos entra no campo de batalha, você recebe {E}{E}{E} (três marcadores de energia).\\nPague {E}{E}{E}: Crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Tóptero com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vedalkeano Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'As primeiras batidas hesitantes das asas são como música para sua alma.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f363456e-7bd7-4872-8a15-1346a55aa7c4\', \'multiverseId\': 419875}, \'multiverseid\': 419875}, {\'name\': \'Виртуоз Махолетов\', \'text\': \'Когда Виртуоз Махолетов выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете {E}{E}{E} (три жетона энергии).\\nЗаплатите {E}{E}{E}: создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Топтер с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ведалкен Механик\', \'flavor\': \'Первые неуверенные взмахи крыльев — словно музыка для его сердца.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a347e36-b54d-48f0-b6ac-cd7376f788af\', \'multiverseId\': 420139}, \'multiverseid\': 420139}, {\'name\': \'旋翼专家\', \'text\': \'当旋翼专家进战场时，你得到{E}{E}{E}（三个能量指示物）。\\n支付{E}{E}{E}：派出一个1/1无色，具飞行异能的振翼机衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～维多肯／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'首次试验的几下振翅如同曼妙乐曲萦绕他的灵魂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d119104-cec4-42c2-95cc-c4bddf94bd49\', \'multiverseId\': 418027}, \'multiverseid\': 418027}, {\'name\': \'旋翼專家\', \'text\': \'當旋翼專家進戰場時，你得到{E}{E}{E}（三個能量指示物）。\\n支付{E}{E}{E}：派出一個1/1無色，具飛行異能的振翼機衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～維多肯／神器師\', \'flavor\': \'首次試驗的幾下振翅如同曼妙樂曲縈繞他的靈魂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbcc1415-389c-4727-9cac-659826e5105a\', \'multiverseId\': 418291}, \'multiverseid\': 418291}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wirblermacher\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Unsere Geschöpfe sind mehr als nur Dinge. Ihnen wohnt Leben inne, ein kleiner Teil von uns selbst." —Saheeli Rai\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418604&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2868c3d-48a2-4f69-b18e-c0c30e0eb3db\', \'multiverseId\': 418604}, \'multiverseid\': 418604}, {\'name\': \'Fabricaingenios\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Tóptero incolora 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Nuestras creaciones son más que simples objetos. Tienen vida propia, pequeños fragmentos de nosotros mismos". —Saheeli Rai\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eeec87be-71df-4487-877b-56ba21b21b36\', \'multiverseId\': 420452}, \'multiverseid\': 420452}, {\'name\': \'Concepteur de voltigeurs\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T} : Créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Nos créations ne sont pas de simples objets. Nous leur insufflons la vie, une partie de nous-mêmes. » —Saheeli Rai\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418868&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b87b3575-dd5c-4f08-8f98-97e0a270849a\', \'multiverseId\': 418868}, \'multiverseid\': 418868}, {\'name\': \'Creaturbinanti\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Crea una pedina creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolore con volare.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Le nostre creazioni sono ben più di semplici oggetti. Sono infuse di vita, racchiudono frammenti di noi stessi." —Saheeli Raji\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9ddd296-3f53-4d6e-9e23-92ce18e49c99\', \'multiverseId\': 419132}, \'multiverseid\': 419132}, {\'name\': \'つむじ風製造機\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}：飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「私たちの創作は単なる物ではありません。そこには生命が、私たち自身の一部が宿っているのです。」 ――サヒーリ・ライ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e893351c-0031-402c-bbc5-0f22f47fa990\', \'multiverseId\': 419396}, \'multiverseid\': 419396}, {\'name\': \'돌개제작기\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: 비행을 가진 1/1 무색 날틀 마법물체 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'"우리의 창조물은 단순한 물건이 아닙니다. 그것은 살아 있으며 우리의 일부입니다." —사힐리 라이\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9d913d9-7baf-4091-9a3e-4df472a4aad9\', \'multiverseId\': 419660}, \'multiverseid\': 419660}, {\'name\': \'Turbilinador\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Tóptero com voar.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Nossas criações são mais do que simples objetos. Há vida nelas, pequenos fragmentos de nós mesmos." — Saheeli Rai\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e002cb4-d279-460c-a96b-86572fcbeaf0\', \'multiverseId\': 419924}, \'multiverseid\': 419924}, {\'name\': \'Махолетодел\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Топтер с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Наши творения — это не просто вещи. В них есть жизнь, в них — небольшая частичка нас самих». — Сахили Рей\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63518f1a-a5ff-40e0-a594-96900676c6d9\', \'multiverseId\': 420188}, \'multiverseid\': 420188}, {\'name\': \'制桨机\', \'text\': \'{4}，{T}：派出一个1/1无色，具飞行异能的振翼机衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「我们的造物不只是物。我们将自身的一部分托付其中，蕴含着生命的灵动。」 ～莎希莉莱伊\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61429218-fead-4a70-88ce-3e59a8ea7941\', \'multiverseId\': 418076}, \'multiverseid\': 418076}, {\'name\': \'製槳機\', \'text\': \'{4}，{T}：派出一個1/1無色，具飛行異能的振翼機衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「我們的造物不只是物。我們將自身的一部分託付其中，蘊含著生命的靈動。」 ～莎希莉萊伊\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c14788f-82dc-4a28-b354-767fc9771127\', \'multiverseId\': 418340}, \'multiverseid\': 418340}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wohnwagen des Züchters\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\nBemannen 3 (Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 3 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418568&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'081f67d5-97f1-4307-a8d1-2488489f4aea\', \'multiverseId\': 418568}, \'multiverseid\': 418568}, {\'name\': \'Caravana del cultivador\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color a tu reserva de maná.\\nTripular 3. (Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 3 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f95fbe7-ab10-4671-83c7-0cec317b1412\', \'multiverseId\': 420416}, \'multiverseid\': 420416}, {\'name\': \'Caravane de cultivateur\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix à votre réserve.\\nPilotage 3 (Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 3 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : véhicule\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418832&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2be48a1-f6da-425a-b996-6f12a2a89667\', \'multiverseId\': 418832}, \'multiverseid\': 418832}, {\'name\': \'Carovana della Coltivatrice\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore alla tua riserva di mana.\\nManovrare 3 (TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 3: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b778e97a-e64f-4f56-bc13-0edebdfa16f7\', \'multiverseId\': 419096}, \'multiverseid\': 419096}, {\'name\': \'耕作者の荷馬車\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに、好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n搭乗３（あなたがコントロールする望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が３以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5503dbc-bf13-4515-9499-2fc3f10568c7\', \'multiverseId\': 419360}, \'multiverseid\': 419360}, {\'name\': \'재배자의 이동주택\', \'text\': \'{T}: 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\\n탑승 3 (당신이 조종하는 생물을 공격력 총합이 3 이상이 되도록 원하는 수만큼 탭한다: 이 탑승물은 턴종료까지 마법물체 생물이 된다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 탑승물\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f5539a3-1933-47c0-96e6-0274b8f55653\', \'multiverseId\': 419624}, \'multiverseid\': 419624}, {\'name\': \'Carruagem do Agricultor\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor à sua reserva de mana.\\nTripular 3 (Vire qualquer número de criaturas que você controla com total de poder igual ou superior a 3: Este Veículo se torna uma criatura artefato até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Veículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb473e57-a238-4aa5-b10a-7810b7dd82c9\', \'multiverseId\': 419888}, \'multiverseid\': 419888}, {\'name\': \'Караван Культиватора\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета в ваше хранилище маны.\\nЭкипаж 3 (Поверните любое количество существ под вашим контролем с суммарной силой 3 или более: эта Машина становится артефактом существом до конца хода.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Машина\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43208dd5-a0ad-4bd2-8ff7-3e3181963fa2\', \'multiverseId\': 420152}, \'multiverseid\': 420152}, {\'name\': \'培育师篷车\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力到你的法术力池中。\\n搭载3（横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于3的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'神器～载具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a362db4a-0e66-46fb-8495-5c3c003859d1\', \'multiverseId\': 418040}, \'multiverseid\': 418040}, {\'name\': \'培育師篷車\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一點任意顏色的魔法力到你的魔法力池中。\\n搭載3（橫置任意數量由你操控且力量總和等於或大於3的生物：此載具成為神器生物直到回合結束。）\', \'type\': \'神器～載具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5430ed3f-2bda-48aa-b680-c1caa2a80b54\', \'multiverseId\': 418304}, \'multiverseid\': 418304}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wolken-Wegbereiterin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Wolken-Wegbereiterin ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 2 Lebenspunkte dazu und ziehst zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'Alle Äther-Karten der Welt können nicht mit dem geschulten Auge einer talentierten Späherin mithalten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418541&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48c30a09-9bce-4f98-93fa-82c11bdb8bde\', \'multiverseId\': 418541}, \'multiverseid\': 418541}, {\'name\': \'Lustranimbos\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Lustranimbos entre al campo de batalla, ganas 2 vidas y robas dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador humano\', \'flavor\': \'Todas las cartografías de éter del mundo no pueden competir con el ojo entrenado de un explorador con talento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6664f8c-8a16-4a44-a934-f91d08f87ce2\', \'multiverseId\': 420389}, \'multiverseid\': 420389}, {\'name\': \'Défricheuse des nuages\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nQuand la Défricheuse des nuages arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 2 points de vie et vous piochez deux cartes.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': "Toutes les cartes éthériques du monde ne valent pas l\'œil expert d\'un éclaireur de talent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418805&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b490a1da-a9a6-47da-ad42-79c57e842c99\', \'multiverseId\': 418805}, \'multiverseid\': 418805}, {\'name\': \'Scrutanembi\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando la Scrutanembi entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 2 punti vita e peschi due carte.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Umano\', \'flavor\': "Tutte le mappe eteriche del mondo non reggono il confronto con l\'occhio esperto di un abile esploratore.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d9b250b-524e-4d8b-9482-eb1cdf038647\', \'multiverseId\': 419069}, \'multiverseid\': 419069}, {\'name\': \'雲先案内人\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n雲先案内人が戦場に出たとき、あなたは２点のライフを得て、カードを２枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'世界中の霊気図を集めても、才能ある案内人の熟練した目にはかなわない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8626b51d-3ed7-4567-880f-27233ae21375\', \'multiverseId\': 419333}, \'multiverseid\': 419333}, {\'name\': \'구름활공자\', \'text\': \'비행\\n구름활공자가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 생명 2점을 얻고 카드 두 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 정찰병\', \'flavor\': \'세상의 어떤 에테르 지도도 타고난 정찰병의 날카로운 눈에 비견될 수 없다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4f90a5d-12df-4d1f-a06b-2108bea8cce7\', \'multiverseId\': 419597}, \'multiverseid\': 419597}, {\'name\': \'Desbravadora das Nuvens\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Desbravadora das Nuvens entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 2 pontos de vida e compra dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Batedor\', \'flavor\': \'Nenhum mapa etéreo do mundo consegue superar o olho treinado de um batedor talentoso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31880740-792d-4ca0-b137-e01ee7c890c6\', \'multiverseId\': 419861}, \'multiverseid\': 419861}, {\'name\': \'Облачная Разведчица\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Облачная Разведчица выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете 2 жизни и берете две карты.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Разведчик\', \'flavor\': \'Ни одна эфирная карта в мире не сравнится с опытным глазом талантливой разведчицы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94ec0614-cdfe-4359-96f1-359f2d95f6de\', \'multiverseId\': 420125}, \'multiverseid\': 420125}, {\'name\': \'云间辟道者\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当云间辟道者进战场时，你获得2点生命且抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'世上所有的乙太分布图都比不上高超斥候训练有素的眼力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e75138a-e9a2-4e65-88f4-4b3c0df2b10f\', \'multiverseId\': 418013}, \'multiverseid\': 418013}, {\'name\': \'雲間闢道者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當雲間闢道者進戰場時，你獲得2點生命且抽兩張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'世上所有的乙太分佈圖都比不上高超斥候訓練有素的眼力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6680fa64-5399-406f-b8a0-b44da2df24f1\', \'multiverseId\': 418277}, \'multiverseid\': 418277}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wuchernder Mechakoloss\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn der Wuchernde Mechakoloss ins Spiel kommt, verteile vier +1/+1-Marken auf eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418537&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3be16dc1-c920-49d9-95ad-3a9d5a3e1f40\', \'multiverseId\': 418537}, \'multiverseid\': 418537}, {\'name\': \'Mecatitán verdeante\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nCuando el Mecatitán verdeante entre al campo de batalla, distribuye cuatro contadores +1/+1 entre cualquier cantidad de criaturas objetivo que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbb5ac34-c058-4b37-a25b-42de3da7d84c\', \'multiverseId\': 420385}, \'multiverseid\': 420385}, {\'name\': \'Carcasse mécanique de verdure\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nQuand la Carcasse mécanique de verdure arrive sur le champ de bataille, répartissez quatre marqueurs +1/+1 entre n\'importe quel nombre de créatures ciblées que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418801&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ee4d8a4-e7cf-4ba7-bb7b-3917c1bf15e4\', \'multiverseId\': 418801}, \'multiverseid\': 418801}, {\'name\': \'Meccatitano Rigoglioso\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nQuando il Meccatitano Rigoglioso entra nel campo di battaglia, distribuisci quattro segnalini +1/+1 tra un qualsiasi numero di creature bersaglio che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'315d5b2d-82d9-4881-84a6-2ba2187f3edd\', \'multiverseId\': 419065}, \'multiverseid\': 419065}, {\'name\': \'新緑の機械巨人\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n新緑の機械巨人が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールする望む数のクリーチャーを対象とし、それらの上に４個の＋１/＋１カウンターを望むように割り振って置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdaa6385-6974-4509-9649-6dc5439f01b7\', \'multiverseId\': 419329}, \'multiverseid\': 419329}, {\'name\': \'신록의 톱니거신병\', \'text\': \'돌진\\n신록의 톱니거신병이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종하는 생물을 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들에 +1/+1 카운터 네 개를 분배한다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 자동기계\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96d5592d-d972-4aea-a4ab-e96c8e1025a3\', \'multiverseId\': 419593}, \'multiverseid\': 419593}, {\'name\': \'Mecanotitã Verdejante\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nQuando Mecanotitã Verdejante entrar no campo de batalha, distribua quatro marcadores +1/+1 entre qualquer número de criaturas alvo que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4af9cc2-9d56-4f69-a97b-7c780165311f\', \'multiverseId\': 419857}, \'multiverseid\': 419857}, {\'name\': \'Мехагигант Зарослей\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nКогда Мехагигант Зарослей выходит на поле битвы, распределите четыре жетона +1/+1 между любым количеством целевых существ под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f6bcb40-1933-4b34-afbe-808820ffba72\', \'multiverseId\': 420121}, \'multiverseid\': 420121}, {\'name\': \'生机巨械\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n当生机巨械进战场时，将四个+1/+1指示物分配给任意数量目标由你操控的生物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6695e36f-8bc7-4272-a43b-a6b13f65aa00\', \'multiverseId\': 418009}, \'multiverseid\': 418009}, {\'name\': \'生機巨械\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n當生機巨械進戰場時，將四個+1/+1指示物分配給任意數量目標由你操控的生物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～組構體\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d271e218-a016-415a-b6b2-fdeac95a223f\', \'multiverseId\': 418273}, \'multiverseid\': 418273}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wunder des Ätherwerks\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn das Wunder des Ätherwerks oder eine andere bleibende Karte, die du kontrollierst, auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, erhältst du {E} (eine Energiemarke).\\n{T}, bezahle {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}: Schaue dir die obersten sechs Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418558&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80985cef-6992-4675-a493-6500d9e12c61\', \'multiverseId\': 418558}, \'multiverseid\': 418558}, {\'name\': \'Maravilla depuradora de éter\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un permanente que controlas vaya a un cementerio, obtienes {E} (un contador de energía).\\n{T}, pagar {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}: Mira las seis primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes lanzar una carta que se encuentre entre ellas sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bfb6c0a-e2a9-400f-941f-7f90296dfc71\', \'multiverseId\': 420406}, \'multiverseid\': 420406}, {\'name\': \'Pompe éthérique modèle\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un permanent que vous contrôlez est mis dans un cimetière, vous gagnez {E} (un marqueur « énergie »).\\n{T}, payez {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E} : Regardez les six cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez lancer une carte parmi elles sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418822&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d2c1d74-42f2-47eb-88fa-9a057fc8be86\', \'multiverseId\': 418822}, \'multiverseid\': 418822}, {\'name\': "Prodigio dell\'Eterurgia", \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un permanente che controlli viene messo in un cimitero, ottieni {E} (un segnalino energia).\\n{T}, Paga {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}: Guarda le prime sei carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi lanciare una carta scelta tra esse senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03dcb67f-71b9-4fcf-b2a6-d603478d4645\', \'multiverseId\': 419086}, \'multiverseid\': 419086}, {\'name\': \'霊気池の驚異\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするパーマネントが１つ墓地に置かれるたび、あなたは{E}（エネルギー・カウンター１個）を得る。\\n{T}, {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}を支払う：あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを６枚見る。あなたはその中からカード１枚を、そのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8627a621-44ae-48a1-b410-cb7f813988c0\', \'multiverseId\': 419350}, \'multiverseid\': 419350}, {\'name\': \'경이로운 에테르 급수장\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 지속물이 무덤에 들어갈 때마다, 당신은 {E}(에너지 카운터 한 개)를 얻는다.\\n{T}, {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}를 지불한다: 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 여섯 장을 본다. 당신은 그 카드들 중 한 장을 마나 비용을 지불하지 않고 발동할 수 있다. 나머지 카드들은 무작위 순서로 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 넣는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bacd0588-0373-4172-9afa-38be7e7f674e\', \'multiverseId\': 419614}, \'multiverseid\': 419614}, {\'name\': \'Maravilha do Sistema Eteráulico\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma permanente que você controla é colocada em um cemitério, você recebe {E} (um marcador de energia).\\n{T}, Pague {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}: Olhe os seis cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode conjurar um card dentre eles sem pagar seu custo de mana. Coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2195f286-cd1b-4bc5-99fa-e7a0e23846d9\', \'multiverseId\': 419878}, \'multiverseid\': 419878}, {\'name\': \'Чудо Эфироснабжения\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда перманент под вашим контролем попадает на кладбище, вы получаете {E} (один жетон энергии).\\n{T}, заплатите {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}: посмотрите шесть верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Вы можете разыграть находящуюся среди них карту, не являющуюся землей, без уплаты ее мана-стоимости. Положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44b060a7-11a5-480b-bac5-969d39ded6b5\', \'multiverseId\': 420142}, \'multiverseid\': 420142}, {\'name\': \'乙太厂奇械\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的永久物进入坟墓场时，你得到{E}（一个能量指示物）。\\n{T}，支付{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}：检视你牌库顶的六张牌。你可以施放其中一张牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e86d1b5-15d9-42b6-9424-0d76afe00c85\', \'multiverseId\': 418030}, \'multiverseid\': 418030}, {\'name\': \'乙太廠奇械\', \'text\': \'每當一個由你操控的永久物進入墳墓場時，你得到{E}（一個能量指示物）。\\n{T}，支付{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}：檢視你牌庫頂的六張牌。你可以施放其中一張牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。將其餘的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed39573b-7df0-4bd1-b063-8771686cfc0c\', \'multiverseId\': 418294}, \'multiverseid\': 418294}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wutentbrannter Vergeltungsschlag\', \'text\': \'Der Wutentbrannte Vergeltungsschlag fügt zwei Kreaturen und/oder Spielern deiner Wahl je 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Das ist die Chandra, auf die ich gewartet habe." —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418480&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34a767fb-86c1-41e4-a464-9f6fda6071d5\', \'multiverseId\': 418480}, \'multiverseid\': 418480}, {\'name\': \'Represalia colérica\', \'text\': \'La Represalia colérica hace 2 puntos de daño a cada una de dos criaturas y/o jugadores objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Esa es la Chandra que yo quería ver". —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50f0e88b-9aa4-4521-b9f0-d1f27c5c0e3b\', \'multiverseId\': 420328}, \'multiverseid\': 420328}, {\'name\': \'Représailles furieuses\', \'text\': \'Ciblez deux cibles, créatures et/ou joueurs. Les Représailles furieuses leur infligent 2 blessures à chacune.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Voilà enfin la Chandra que je voulais voir. » —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418744&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb24e36c-ffb2-4ab2-84c6-894fc4e26f59\', \'multiverseId\': 418744}, \'multiverseid\': 418744}, {\'name\': \'Rappresaglia Furiosa\', \'text\': \'Scegli due creature e/o giocatori bersaglio. La Rappresaglia Furiosa infligge 2 danni a ciascuno di essi.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Questa è la Chandra che volevo vedere." —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8e02114-ba7b-4752-b134-912cb19c77f9\', \'multiverseId\': 419008}, \'multiverseid\': 419008}, {\'name\': \'猛然たる報復\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやプレイヤー、合計２つを対象とする。猛然たる報復はそれらに、それぞれ２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「これこそ、私が見たかったチャンドラだわ。」 ――リリアナ・ヴェス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2b2feb7-25db-40b8-9fe0-0d3e09da6803\', \'multiverseId\': 419272}, \'multiverseid\': 419272}, {\'name\': \'맹렬한 보복\', \'text\': \'생물 및/또는 플레이어 두 개를 목표로 정한다. 맹렬한 보복은 각 목표에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"이게 바로 내가 보고 싶었던 찬드라야." —릴리아나 베스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aba7d06b-750a-4032-8e88-8d8812f4eb23\', \'multiverseId\': 419536}, \'multiverseid\': 419536}, {\'name\': \'Represália Furiosa\', \'text\': \'Represália Furiosa causa 2 pontos de dano a cada uma de duas criaturas e/ou jogadores alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Agora sim, essa é a Chandra que eu estava esperando." — Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81c2d693-28ee-4024-abd2-43121c014acc\', \'multiverseId\': 419800}, \'multiverseid\': 419800}, {\'name\': \'Яростный Отпор\', \'text\': \'Яростный Отпор наносит 2 повреждения каждому из двух целевых существ и (или) игроков.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Вот теперь это Чандра, которую я столько ждала!» — Лилиана Весс\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b8254d1-cfc0-4a07-be11-35a13305fa5b\', \'multiverseId\': 420064}, \'multiverseid\': 420064}, {\'name\': \'怒火报复\', \'text\': \'怒火报复对两个目标生物和／或牌手各造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「这才是我一直想见到的茜卓。」 ～莉莲娜维斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27e6371e-6028-4bb7-bc58-abc4d2b5939a\', \'multiverseId\': 417952}, \'multiverseid\': 417952}, {\'name\': \'怒火報復\', \'text\': \'怒火報復對兩個目標生物和／或玩家各造成2點傷害。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「這才是我一直想見到的茜卓。」 ～莉蓮娜維斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'488ca8d8-4154-405f-a799-a4c8b04b8294\', \'multiverseId\': 418216}, \'multiverseid\': 418216}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wächter der Großen Verbindung\', \'text\': \'Reichweite (Diese Kreatur kann fliegende Kreaturen blocken.)\\nSolange du eine Nissa-Planeswalkerin kontrollierst, erhält der Wächter der Großen Verbindung +2/+0 und hat Wachsamkeit. (Er wird beim Angreifen nicht getappt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420514&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a05ef95-c1df-4309-84c2-4fa9e7285f0f\', \'multiverseId\': 420514}, \'multiverseid\': 420514}, {\'name\': \'Guardián de la Panconexión\', \'text\': \'Alcance. (Esta criatura puede bloquear criaturas con la habilidad de volar.)\\nMientras controles una planeswalker Nissa, el Guardián de la Panconexión obtiene +2/+0 y la habilidad de vigilancia. (Esta criatura no se gira al atacar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d49ba67-f840-4bdf-95d5-23b592ed21cb\', \'multiverseId\': 420584}, \'multiverseid\': 420584}, {\'name\': \'Gardien du Grand conduit\', \'text\': "Portée (Cette créature peut bloquer les créatures avec le vol.)\\nTant que vous contrôlez un planeswalker Nissa, le Gardien du Grand conduit gagne +2/+0 et a la vigilance. (Attaquer avec cette créature ne la fait pas s\'engager.)", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420524&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfc0b71b-49fb-4442-a019-46804937f30d\', \'multiverseId\': 420524}, \'multiverseid\': 420524}, {\'name\': \'Guardiano del Grande Flusso\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere (Questa creatura può bloccare le creature con volare.)\\nFintanto che controlli un planeswalker Nissa, il Guardiano del Grande Flusso prende +2/+0 e ha cautela. (Attacca senza TAPpare.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3975c72-8718-42af-99fb-2708cdc17f16\', \'multiverseId\': 420534}, \'multiverseid\': 420534}, {\'name\': \'大導路の守護者\', \'text\': \'到達（このクリーチャーは飛行を持つクリーチャーをブロックできる。）\\nあなたがニッサ・プレインズウォーカーをコントロールしているかぎり、大導路の守護者は＋２/＋０の修整を受けるとともに警戒を持つ。（これは攻撃してもタップしない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'784fe654-9561-45bc-87f7-36f59b43f59a\', \'multiverseId\': 420544}, \'multiverseid\': 420544}, {\'name\': \'찬란한 수로의 수호자\', \'text\': \'대공 (이 생물은 비행을 가진 생물을 방어할 수 있다.)\\n당신이 니사 플레인즈워커를 조종하는 한, 찬란한 수로의 수호자는 +2/+0을 받고 경계를 가진다. (이 생물은 공격해도 탭되지 않는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 정령\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7144cc6-d166-4199-932c-133758725734\', \'multiverseId\': 420554}, \'multiverseid\': 420554}, {\'name\': \'Guardião do Grande Conduíte\', \'text\': \'Alcance (Esta criatura pode bloquear criaturas com voar.)\\nEnquanto você controlar uma planeswalker do tipo Nissa, Guardião do Grande Conduíte receberá +2/+0 e terá vigilância. (Atacar não faz com que ele seja virado.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11b742e8-7ffb-4736-adde-c83cadc68ada\', \'multiverseId\': 420564}, \'multiverseid\': 420564}, {\'name\': \'Страж Великого Канала\', \'text\': \'Захват (Это существо может блокировать существа с Полетом.)\\nПока вы контролируете planeswalker-а Ниссу, Страж Великого Канала получает +2/+0 и имеет Бдительность. (Атакуя, он не поворачивается.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbf75461-2034-47a2-bf4b-b6b081fc9c19\', \'multiverseId\': 420574}, \'multiverseid\': 420574}, {\'name\': \'大通联守卫\', \'text\': \'延势（此生物能阻挡具飞行异能的生物。）\\n只要你操控妮莎鹏洛客，大通联守卫便得+2/+0且具有警戒异能。（它攻击时不需横置。）\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9a48023-1629-440b-95c0-508e5e9b72cc\', \'multiverseId\': 420494}, \'multiverseid\': 420494}, {\'name\': \'大通聯守衛\', \'text\': \'延勢（此生物能阻擋具飛行異能的生物。）\\n只要你操控妮莎鵬洛客，大通聯守衛便得+2/+0且具有警戒異能。（它攻擊時不需橫置。）\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adba004d-38f9-4fc0-892a-7c7117586bd4\', \'multiverseId\': 420504}, \'multiverseid\': 420504}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zahnradmacher-Rätselknoten\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Zahnradmacher-Rätselknoten ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Servo-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\\n{1}{W}, opfere den Zahnradmacher-Rätselknoten: Erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Servo-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418566&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a680dad-818f-4c1f-ab3c-fbcbb8bd9c3d\', \'multiverseId\': 418566}, \'multiverseid\': 418566}, {\'name\': \'Enigma del engranador\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Enigma del engranador entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Servo incolora 1/1.\\n{1}{W}, sacrificar el Enigma del engranador: Crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Servo incolora 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fa4557a-c47a-44d0-8c65-e5f5f110da7e\', \'multiverseId\': 420414}, \'multiverseid\': 420414}, {\'name\': \'Casse-tête du rouagier\', \'text\': \'Quand le Casse-tête du rouagier arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Servo.\\n{1}{W}, sacrifiez le Casse-tête du rouagier : Créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Servo.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418830&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'278240ad-6acc-424e-b388-3b6e406060a3\', \'multiverseId\': 418830}, \'multiverseid\': 418830}, {\'name\': "Enigmatico dell\'Ingranaggiere", \'text\': "Quando l\'Enigmatico dell\'Ingranaggiere entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Servomeccanismo 1/1 incolore.\\n{1}{W}, Sacrifica l\'Enigmatico dell\'Ingranaggiere: Crea una pedina creatura artefatto Servomeccanismo 1/1 incolore.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e410bda-6152-477e-9f53-848ed4a585b0\', \'multiverseId\': 419094}, \'multiverseid\': 419094}, {\'name\': \'歯車工の組細工\', \'text\': \'歯車工の組細工が戦場に出たとき、無色の１/１の霊気装置・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n{1}{W}, 歯車工の組細工を生け贄に捧げる：無色の１/１の霊気装置・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5eb91bd2-5ee6-4bac-a4ca-b1de3950d2ce\', \'multiverseId\': 419358}, \'multiverseid\': 419358}, {\'name\': \'톱니기술자의 비밀 장치\', \'text\': \'톱니기술자의 비밀 장치가 전장에 들어올 때, 1/1 무색 서보 마법물체 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n{1}{W}, 톱니기술자의 비밀 장치를 희생한다: 1/1 무색 서보 마법물체 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'875b138a-7eb2-4df5-891f-47774375d215\', \'multiverseId\': 419622}, \'multiverseid\': 419622}, {\'name\': \'Quebra-cabeça do Engreneiro\', \'text\': \'Quando Quebra-cabeça do Engreneiro entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Servus.\\n{1}{W}, Sacrifique Quebra-cabeça do Engreneiro: Crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Servus.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0847f4d5-996e-4127-b7e7-21375188875a\', \'multiverseId\': 419886}, \'multiverseid\': 419886}, {\'name\': \'Головоломка Часовщика\', \'text\': \'Когда Головоломка Часовщика выходит на поле битвы, создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Сервотрон.\\n{1}{W}, пожертвуйте Головоломку Часовщика: создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Сервотрон.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3165b50d-2f82-4e21-b23d-29e9ab69aacc\', \'multiverseId\': 420150}, \'multiverseid\': 420150}, {\'name\': \'齿轮工谜结\', \'text\': \'当齿轮工谜结进战场时，派出一个1/1无色自动机衍生神器生物。\\n{1}{W}，牺牲齿轮工谜结：派出一个1/1无色自动机衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc5053e1-072c-441f-83f7-3b6fbebcc6f0\', \'multiverseId\': 418038}, \'multiverseid\': 418038}, {\'name\': \'齒輪工謎結\', \'text\': \'當齒輪工謎結進戰場時，派出一個1/1無色自動機衍生神器生物。\\n{1}{W}，犧牲齒輪工謎結：派出一個1/1無色自動機衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cc155c4-f82c-4865-ba9c-d70735aa5dd9\', \'multiverseId\': 418302}, \'multiverseid\': 418302}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zeremoniöse Ablehnung\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen farblosen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Messe-Preisrichter sind derart angesehen, dass ein wohlwollendes Nicken einen Erfinder lebenslang inspirieren kann. Eine abschätzige Geste hingegen kann eine Karriere sofort beenden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418405&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35ccec55-8a2a-42ff-acb9-b6242581404f\', \'multiverseId\': 418405}, \'multiverseid\': 418405}, {\'name\': \'Rechazo ceremonial\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo incoloro objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los jueces de la Feria son tan respetados que una señal de reconocimiento puede inspirar a un inventor durante toda su vida... igual que un simple gesto de desdén puede arruinar su carrera.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'133b62ff-1222-426c-aa68-5670a5417d32\', \'multiverseId\': 420253}, \'multiverseid\': 420253}, {\'name\': \'Rejet solennel\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort incolore ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les juges de la Foire ont une telle influence qu\'un hochement de tête peut inspirer un inventeur pour plusieurs décennies... et un geste de rejet peut mettre fin à une carrière.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418669&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bae3ede-604f-4857-a9f6-81afd3133df3\', \'multiverseId\': 418669}, \'multiverseid\': 418669}, {\'name\': \'Rifiuto Cerimonioso\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia incolore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'I giudici della Fiera sono talmente stimati che un cenno di elogio basta a ispirare un inventore per il resto della vita, mentre un gesto di congedo può stroncare una carriera.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd1018ad-52f8-4f0a-833d-09dea29a873a\', \'multiverseId\': 418933}, \'multiverseid\': 418933}, {\'name\': \'儀礼的拒否\', \'text\': \'無色の呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'博覧会の審判者は極めて重んじられている。作品を見てうなずけば発明者は生涯鼓舞されるが、失望して手を振れば発明者の経歴はそこで終わる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03ba1639-a5db-4039-8f18-ba4cd7b97e6a\', \'multiverseId\': 419197}, \'multiverseid\': 419197}, {\'name\': \'형식적인 거절\', \'text\': \'무색 주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'박람회 심사위원들은 매우 존경받는다. 그들이 보여주는 긍정적인 끄덕임은 발명가에게 일생일대의 영감이 되지만, 그들이 보내는 무시의 손짓은 발명 경력의 마감을 의미할 수도 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'385fadd8-99c7-4096-908c-bb7651f9d7df\', \'multiverseId\': 419461}, \'multiverseid\': 419461}, {\'name\': \'Rejeição Cerimoniosa\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica incolor alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Os jurados da Feira são tão respeitados que um meneio de reconhecimento pode inspirar um inventor por toda a vida — e um gesto de rejeição pode acabar com uma carreira.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2b7a8be-13e3-4b59-b5e6-bcaedf49642d\', \'multiverseId\': 419725}, \'multiverseid\': 419725}, {\'name\': \'Церемониальный Отказ\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое бесцветное заклинание.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Судьи на Ярмарке пользуются таким авторитетом, что простой кивок одобрения может всю жизнь вдохновлять изобретателя, а пренебрежительная отмашка — разрушить карьеру.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c5b9789-99d6-4171-9201-38b685ad8aec\', \'multiverseId\': 419989}, \'multiverseid\': 419989}, {\'name\': \'隆重拒斥\', \'text\': \'反击目标无色咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'博览会的评审备受敬重，点头赞许就能让发明家终生受用；而挥手打发则会断送他们的职业生涯。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58fd2897-e233-4710-a979-964901b32c39\', \'multiverseId\': 417877}, \'multiverseid\': 417877}, {\'name\': \'隆重拒斥\', \'text\': \'反擊目標無色咒語。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'博覽會的評審備受敬重，點頭讚許就能讓發明家終生受用；而揮手打發則會斷送他們的職業生涯。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5409e5a9-6783-49ba-96ed-180bfe5512ab\', \'multiverseId\': 418141}, \'multiverseid\': 418141}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zierende Tapferkeit\', \'text\': \'Enttappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Sie erhält +1/+3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Elfische Rüstungen haben die Dornen und Ranken der ungezähmten Wildnis zum Vorbild, was sie schön und schrecklich zugleich macht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418529&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32c5012e-35eb-4756-89fd-2f7cacaff42f\', \'multiverseId\': 418529}, \'multiverseid\': 418529}, {\'name\': \'Valentía ornamental\', \'text\': \'Endereza la criatura objetivo. Obtiene +1/+3 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Las armaduras élficas, inspiradas en las zarzas y espinos que crecen en la espesura del bosque, son tan hermosas como formidables.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6baed1ab-9cd7-4163-8d30-5a12076408b8\', \'multiverseId\': 420377}, \'multiverseid\': 420377}, {\'name\': \'Courage ornemental\', \'text\': "Dégagez la créature ciblée. Elle gagne +1/+3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Inspirée des épines et des ronces de la nature sauvage, l\'armure elfe est à la fois belle et redoutable.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418793&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'152872a9-0ba1-4719-b0e8-971a6d6a5aa9\', \'multiverseId\': 418793}, \'multiverseid\': 418793}, {\'name\': \'Coraggio Ornamentale\', \'text\': \'STAPpa una creatura bersaglio. Prende +1/+3 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Le corazze elfiche, ispirate alle spine e ai rovi delle terre selvagge, sono tanto splendide quanto temibili.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c155e7ef-4605-457d-8aaa-f3d32d5fce51\', \'multiverseId\': 419057}, \'multiverseid\': 419057}, {\'name\': \'飾りの勇気\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋３の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'野生の棘や茨に着想を得たエルフの鎧は美しい上に手強い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f889ac9d-33a6-4432-86fd-f9aa362b824e\', \'multiverseId\': 419321}, \'multiverseid\': 419321}, {\'name\': \'화려한 용기\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 언탭한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+3을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'야생의 가시와 덤불에서 영감을 받아 만든 엘프 갑옷은 아름다우면서 엄청나게 강력하다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a72b4b2a-3cfb-4bc9-a105-71d270cd2996\', \'multiverseId\': 419585}, \'multiverseid\': 419585}, {\'name\': \'Coragem Ornamental\', \'text\': \'Desvire a criatura alvo. Ela recebe +1/+3 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Inspirada pelos esporões e espinheiros das terras selvagens e indomadas, a armadura élfica é tanto bela quanto formidável.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c803d9d-e0b4-4978-9969-a422e424658f\', \'multiverseId\': 419849}, \'multiverseid\': 419849}, {\'name\': \'Красочная Смелость\', \'text\': \'Разверните целевое существо. Оно получает +1/+3 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Творец эльфийской брони черпал вдохновение в шипах и колючках диких зарослей. Она одновременно и прекрасная, и грозная на вид.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ced0999d-a812-42a8-b458-04ac0f9891ea\', \'multiverseId\': 420113}, \'multiverseid\': 420113}, {\'name\': \'华饰之威\', \'text\': \'重置目标生物。它得+1/+3直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'妖精铠甲的灵感源于荒蛮野地的荆棘，不但美观大方，还极具威慑力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38f2e0ab-7abe-4d3d-b01e-72cbeec8e073\', \'multiverseId\': 418001}, \'multiverseid\': 418001}, {\'name\': \'華飾之威\', \'text\': \'重置目標生物。它得+1/+3直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'妖精鎧甲的靈感源於荒蠻野地的荊棘，不但美觀大方，還極具威懾力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d36e1a4-d3aa-4d62-9300-7f9a8d4fea7b\', \'multiverseId\': 418265}, \'multiverseid\': 418265}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zufallsfund\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines oder beides —\\n• Bringe eine Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\n• Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Äthergeborener verschwendet weder Zeit noch Geld.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418446&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'365b03f2-9a4c-4b65-bce1-a9c0c635f51f\', \'multiverseId\': 418446}, \'multiverseid\': 418446}, {\'name\': \'Hallazgo casual\', \'text\': \'Elige uno o ambos:\\n• Regresa la carta de artefacto objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\n• Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Un etergénito no pierde el tiempo ni sus artilugios.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6437ce55-36f9-4268-8961-5af2734c0f3f\', \'multiverseId\': 420294}, \'multiverseid\': 420294}, {\'name\': \'Découverte fortuite\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un ou les deux —\\n• Renvoyez une carte d\'artefact ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\\n• Renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Un éthérien ne perd ni temps ni trésor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418710&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1442851-3585-4e9d-81c4-d7531146ba6f\', \'multiverseId\': 418710}, \'multiverseid\': 418710}, {\'name\': \'Ritrovamento Fortuito\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno o entrambi —\\n• Riprendi in mano una carta artefatto bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\n• Riprendi in mano una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Gli eteridi non sprecano né tempo né tesori.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e848df2c-e796-47e0-bea2-5cb68808e28f\', \'multiverseId\': 418974}, \'multiverseid\': 418974}, {\'name\': \'偶然の発見\', \'text\': \'以下から１つまたは両方を選ぶ。\\n• あなたの墓地からアーティファクト・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\\n• あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'霊基体は時間もお宝も無駄にしない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffe6ab23-7e5c-4e69-8598-ed58ad2fad06\', \'multiverseId\': 419238}, \'multiverseid\': 419238}, {\'name\': \'우연한 발견\', \'text\': \'하나 혹은 둘 다를 선택한다 —\\n• 당신의 무덤에 있는 마법물체 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\\n• 당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'에테르붙이는 시간도 보물도 허비하지 않는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5144c840-103d-4d2b-996b-b10534fa0b88\', \'multiverseId\': 419502}, \'multiverseid\': 419502}, {\'name\': \'Descoberta Fortuita\', \'text\': \'Escolha um ou ambos —\\n• Devolva o card de artefato alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\\n• Devolva o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para a sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Um etergênito não perde tempo nem tesouros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1391d107-d025-4b76-8d40-783591707027\', \'multiverseId\': 419766}, \'multiverseid\': 419766}, {\'name\': \'Удачная Находка\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно или оба —\\n• Верните целевую карту артефакта из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\\n• Верните целевую карту существа из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Эфириды не тратят зря ни время, ни сокровища.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b58e1b5-3414-4df7-b94f-f9133793fd14\', \'multiverseId\': 420030}, \'multiverseid\': 420030}, {\'name\': \'意外发现\', \'text\': \'选择一项或都选～\\n•将目标神器牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\\n•将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'乙太种不浪费时间，也不浪费宝藏。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71e0e50a-e563-486f-8d26-feac8c79c4eb\', \'multiverseId\': 417918}, \'multiverseid\': 417918}, {\'name\': \'意外發現\', \'text\': \'選擇一項或都選～\\n•將目標神器牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\\n•將目標生物牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'乙太種不浪費時間，也不浪費寶藏。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ff62bd3-7dfe-402e-8d8d-859cc3204c23\', \'multiverseId\': 418182}, \'multiverseid\': 418182}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zweifelhafte Herausforderung\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten zehn Karten deiner Bibliothek an, schicke davon bis zu zwei Kreaturenkarten ins Exil und mische dann deine Bibliothek. Ein Gegner deiner Wahl kann eine der ins Exil geschickten Karten bestimmen und sie unter seiner Kontrolle ins Spiel bringen. Bringe den Rest unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418517&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d9059b1-a565-47c8-84f3-4870e7ccb47c\', \'multiverseId\': 418517}, \'multiverseid\': 418517}, {\'name\': \'Desafío incierto\', \'text\': \'Mira las diez primeras cartas de tu biblioteca y exilia hasta dos cartas de criatura de entre ellas. Luego, baraja tu biblioteca. El oponente objetivo puede elegir una de las cartas exiliadas y ponerla en el campo de batalla bajo su control. Pon el resto en el campo de batalla bajo tu control.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39d3f902-6320-462c-b45b-170272b2c0cd\', \'multiverseId\': 420365}, \'multiverseid\': 420365}, {\'name\': \'Défi douteux\', \'text\': "Regardez les dix cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, exilez jusqu\'à deux cartes de créature parmi elles, puis mélangez votre bibliothèque. L\'adversaire ciblé peut choisir une de ces cartes exilées et la mettre sur le champ de bataille sous son contrôle. Mettez le reste sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418781&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aad44ed0-6b94-4f44-9d8e-481a0c56b377\', \'multiverseId\': 418781}, \'multiverseid\': 418781}, {\'name\': \'Sfida Incerta\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime dieci carte del tuo grimorio, esilia fino a due carte creatura scelte tra esse, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio. Un avversario bersaglio può scegliere una delle carte esiliate e metterla sul campo di battaglia sotto il suo controllo. Metti le altre sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c6fb592-151b-42f1-93b6-a90e0f77a11f\', \'multiverseId\': 419045}, \'multiverseid\': 419045}, {\'name\': \'怪しげな挑戦\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを10枚見て、その中からクリーチャー・カード最大２枚を追放し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。そのプレイヤーは、それらの追放されたカードの中から１枚を選び、それを自分のコントロール下で戦場に出してもよい。残りをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fe2e47b-2fbd-42c5-abee-f14143e19345\', \'multiverseId\': 419309}, \'multiverseid\': 419309}, {\'name\': \'의문의 도전\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 열 장을 보고, 그중 최대 두 장까지 생물 카드를 추방한 후, 당신의 서고를 섞는다. 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대는 추방된 카드 중 하나를 선택해 자신의 조종하에 전장에 놓을 수 있다. 나머지 카드는 당신의 조종하에 전장에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a93ee218-a329-447a-8e05-727fbeb13563\', \'multiverseId\': 419573}, \'multiverseid\': 419573}, {\'name\': \'Desafio Dúbio\', \'text\': \'Olhe os dez cards do topo de seu grimório, exile até dois cards de criatura dentre eles e, em seguida, embaralhe seu grimório. O oponente alvo pode escolher um dos cards exilados e colocá-lo no campo de batalha sob seu próprio controle. Coloque o restante no campo de batalha sob seu controle.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eca58a2a-0af9-4bb3-9278-b601086fcdf9\', \'multiverseId\': 419837}, \'multiverseid\': 419837}, {\'name\': \'Сомнительный Вызов\', \'text\': \'Посмотрите десять верхних карт вашей библиотеки, изгоните не более двух находящихся среди них карт существ, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку. Целевой оппонент может выбрать одну из изгнанных карт и положить ее на поле битвы под своим контролем. Положите оставшиеся карты на поле битвы под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ef6cb28-6832-45f1-9c51-792f533de068\', \'multiverseId\': 420101}, \'multiverseid\': 420101}, {\'name\': \'存疑挑战\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的十张牌，放逐其中至多两张生物牌，然后将你的牌库洗牌。目标对手可以从所放逐牌中选择一张，并将该牌在其操控下放进战场。将其余的牌在你的操控下放进战场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cef4948-e834-439f-824c-825e20caba9a\', \'multiverseId\': 417989}, \'multiverseid\': 417989}, {\'name\': \'存疑挑戰\', \'text\': \'檢視你牌庫頂的十張牌，放逐其中至多兩張生物牌，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。目標對手可以從所放逐牌中選擇一張，並將該牌在其操控下放進戰場。將其餘的牌在你的操控下放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7891a3dd-c104-4e38-ac87-e9453efd7552\', \'multiverseId\': 418253}, \'multiverseid\': 418253}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ära der Innovationen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Artefakt oder ein Handwerker unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du {1} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erhältst du {E}{E} (zwei Energiemarken).\\nBezahle {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}, opfere die Ära der Innovationen: Ziehe drei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418410&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7656fd17-791b-48bc-8402-a0fb577a6aea\', \'multiverseId\': 418410}, \'multiverseid\': 418410}, {\'name\': \'Era de innovación\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un artefacto o un Artífice entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes pagar {1}. Si lo haces, obtienes {E}{E} (dos contadores de energía).\\nPagar {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}, sacrificar la Era de innovación: Roba tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ba786c1-2427-4b6e-8551-6a004a320ccc\', \'multiverseId\': 420258}, \'multiverseid\': 420258}, {\'name\': "Ère de l\'innovation", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un artefact ou un artificier arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez payer {1}. Si vous faites ainsi, vous gagnez {E}{E} (deux marqueurs « énergie »).\\nPayez {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}, sacrifiez l\'Ère de l\'innovation : Piochez trois cartes.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418674&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'242aadf9-7fa6-4995-84b3-9bce05f7632a\', \'multiverseId\': 418674}, \'multiverseid\': 418674}, {\'name\': "Era dell\'Innovazione", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un artefatto o un Artefice entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi pagare {1}. Se lo fai, ottieni {E}{E} (due segnalini energia).\\nPaga {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}, Sacrifica l\'Era dell\'Innovazione: Pesca tre carte.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'081e7e38-96a0-4214-8f1a-aa1c8d41da9f\', \'multiverseId\': 418938}, \'multiverseid\': 418938}, {\'name\': \'革新の時代\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトか工匠が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは{1}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、あなたは{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター２個）を得る。\\n{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}を支払う, 革新の時代を生け贄に捧げる：カードを３枚引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ed3e4bf-f10c-49f2-968e-a77ec6698570\', \'multiverseId\': 419202}, \'multiverseid\': 419202}, {\'name\': \'혁신의 시대\', \'text\': \'마법물체 또는 기능공이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신은 {1}을 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 당신은 {E}{E}(에너지 카운터 두 개)를 얻는다.\\n{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}를 지불한다, 혁신의 시대를 희생한다: 카드 세 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36d445c3-2bf0-447c-a4df-62161b1db40e\', \'multiverseId\': 419466}, \'multiverseid\': 419466}, {\'name\': \'Era da Inovação\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um artefato ou Artesão entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode pagar {1}. Se fizer isso, você recebe {E}{E} (dois marcadores de energia).\\nPague {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}, sacrifique Era da Inovação: Compre três cards.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afb03d0e-6567-411e-a1dd-3b4549b0b806\', \'multiverseId\': 419730}, \'multiverseid\': 419730}, {\'name\': \'Эпоха Изобретений\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда артефакт или Механик выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы можете заплатить {1}. Если вы это делаете, вы получаете {E}{E} (два жетона энергии).\\nЗаплатите {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}, пожертвуйте Эпоху Изобретений: возьмите три карты.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db24184f-5d50-41af-8d9d-ba95478a825c\', \'multiverseId\': 419994}, \'multiverseid\': 419994}, {\'name\': \'创新时代\', \'text\': \'每当一个神器或神器师在你的操控下进战场时，你可以支付{1}。若你如此作，则你得到{E}{E}（两个能量指示物）。\\n支付{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}，牺牲创新时代：抓三张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b69af8eb-b747-4bbc-bf6b-744e9bcf16e4\', \'multiverseId\': 417882}, \'multiverseid\': 417882}, {\'name\': \'創新時代\', \'text\': \'每當一個神器或神器師在你的操控下進戰場時，你可以支付{1}。若你如此作，則你得到{E}{E}（兩個能量指示物）。\\n支付{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}，犧牲創新時代：抽三張牌。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1961041f-fdaf-43f5-9fbe-8bed3b065465\', \'multiverseId\': 418146}, \'multiverseid\': 418146}]', '[{\'name\': \'Äther-Knotenpunkt\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Äther-Knotenpunkt ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E} (eine Energiemarke).\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {C}.\\n{T}, bezahle {E}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Er hält die Träume von Ghirapur am Leben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418607&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8adc9abf-3a6a-4199-a0dc-75cb793fd9d8\', \'multiverseId\': 418607}, \'multiverseid\': 418607}, {\'name\': \'Planta de éter central\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Planta de éter central entre al campo de batalla, obtienes {E} (un contador de energía).\\n{T}: Agrega {C} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{T}, pagar {E}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Suministra energía a los sueños de Ghirapur.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcb9bd8a-6c00-499f-98cb-b996bd338f58\', \'multiverseId\': 420455}, \'multiverseid\': 420455}, {\'name\': "Centre d\'Éther", \'text\': "Quand le Centre d\'Éther arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez {E} (un marqueur « énergie »).\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C} à votre réserve.\\n{T}, payez {E} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix à votre réserve.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Il alimente les rêves de Ghirapur.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418871&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70d02800-6df0-47d0-8b91-bc33a0fb3f8a\', \'multiverseId\': 418871}, \'multiverseid\': 418871}, {\'name\': "Centro dell\'Etere", \'text\': "Quando il Centro dell\'Etere entra nel campo di battaglia, ottieni {E} (un segnalino energia).\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{T}, Paga {E}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore alla tua riserva di mana.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Tiene accesi i sogni di Ghirapur.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c988b23a-06ef-4286-b60e-5d17dda70251\', \'multiverseId\': 419135}, \'multiverseid\': 419135}, {\'name\': \'霊気拠点\', \'text\': \'霊気拠点が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{E}（エネルギー・カウンター１個）を得る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{C}を加える。\\n{T}, {E}を支払う：あなたのマナ・プールに、好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'ギラプールの夢を支えている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b01d7ccc-7df2-4abf-bf75-f45e7f46e613\', \'multiverseId\': 419399}, \'multiverseid\': 419399}, {\'name\': \'에테르 허브\', \'text\': \'에테르 허브가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 {E}(에너지 카운터 한 개)를 얻는다.\\n{T}: {C}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\\n{T}, {E}를 지불한다: 당신의 마나풀에 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 담는다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': \'이것은 기라푸르의 꿈의 원동력이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'643751f3-734c-4fd4-a92f-39d8178a0b0a\', \'multiverseId\': 419663}, \'multiverseid\': 419663}, {\'name\': \'Núcleo do Éter\', \'text\': \'Quando Núcleo do Éter entra no campo de batalha, você recebe {E} (um marcador de energia).\\n{T}: Adicione {C} à sua reserva de mana.\\n{T}, Pague {E}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Ele alimenta os sonhos de Ghirapur.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ab752a1-43dd-448c-9a0d-d3bbe1860b7d\', \'multiverseId\': 419927}, \'multiverseid\': 419927}, {\'name\': \'Эфирный Узел\', \'text\': \'Когда Эфирный Узел выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете {E} (один жетон энергии).\\n{T}: добавьте {C} в ваше хранилище маны.\\n{T}, заплатите {E}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета в ваше хранилище маны.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Он питает энергией мечты Гирапура.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0848ca8-5578-4ff9-b376-66fd9acf41e5\', \'multiverseId\': 420191}, \'multiverseid\': 420191}, {\'name\': \'乙太枢纽\', \'text\': \'当乙太枢纽进战场时，你得到{E}（一个能量指示物）。\\n{T}：加{C}到你的法术力池中。\\n{T}，支付{E}：加一点任意颜色的法术力到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'它为吉拉波的梦想提供能量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1e0353f-0a0f-4ca4-833a-3b71538dd115\', \'multiverseId\': 418079}, \'multiverseid\': 418079}, {\'name\': \'乙太樞紐\', \'text\': \'當乙太樞紐進戰場時，你得到{E}（一個能量指示物）。\\n{T}：加{C}到你的魔法力池中。\\n{T}，支付{E}：加一點任意顏色的魔法力到你的魔法力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'它為吉拉波的夢想提供能量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6fe0cf0-b601-4f07-b0a5-51207bf1fd88\', \'multiverseId\': 418343}, \'multiverseid\': 418343}]', '[{\'name\': \'Äther-Passat\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, und eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst, auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Ingenieure des Konsulats haben sichere Methoden entwickelt, den Äther zu sammeln. Renegaten hingegen sind weniger vorsichtig.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418403&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca281e46-d99d-4461-9e71-63c2178605ef\', \'multiverseId\': 418403}, \'multiverseid\': 418403}, {\'name\': \'Vientos alisios del éter\', \'text\': \'Regresa el permanente objetivo que controlas y el permanente objetivo que no controlas a las manos de sus propietarios.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los ingenieros del Consulado han ideado métodos seguros de extraer éter, pero los renegados no siempre son tan cuidadosos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0ac6ac0-6b36-40ad-91a6-dd1b0ed67879\', \'multiverseId\': 420251}, \'multiverseid\': 420251}, {\'name\': "Alizés d\'Éther", \'text\': \'Renvoyez un permanent ciblé que vous contrôlez et un permanent ciblé que vous ne contrôlez pas dans les mains de leurs propriétaires.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les ingénieurs du Consulat ont développé des méthodes sûres pour récolter l\'Éther, mais les renégats ne se montrent pas toujours aussi prudents.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418667&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1520faaf-fc5f-47a4-b848-d2a77117c982\', \'multiverseId\': 418667}, \'multiverseid\': 418667}, {\'name\': "Alisei d\'Etere", \'text\': \'Fai tornare un permanente bersaglio che controlli e un permanente bersaglio che non controlli in mano ai rispettivi proprietari.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Gli ingegneri del Consolato hanno sviluppato metodi sicuri per la raccolta dell\'etere. I rinnegati, invece, non sempre sono tanto cauti.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b5d00d4-3ab4-448a-be02-e5ac6038c993\', \'multiverseId\': 418931}, \'multiverseid\': 418931}, {\'name\': \'上天の貿易風\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするパーマネント１つと、あなたがコントロールしていないパーマネント１つを対象とし、それらをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'領事府の技師たちが安全な霊気収集手段を開発したが、改革派は常に注意深いというわけではない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1136b8f-5438-4f8e-a338-cf866d80aa4c\', \'multiverseId\': 419195}, \'multiverseid\': 419195}, {\'name\': \'에테르 무역풍\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 지속물과 당신이 조종하지 않는 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물들을 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'영사관 엔지니어들이 에테르를 안전하게 수집하는 방법을 개발했지만, 무법자들은 조심성이 없을 때가 많다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c9474ca-9df0-43f0-b767-e54a3038ad5f\', \'multiverseId\': 419459}, \'multiverseid\': 419459}, {\'name\': \'Ventos Alísios de Éter\', \'text\': \'Devolva a permanente alvo que você controla e a permanente alvo que você não controla para as mãos de seus donos.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Os engenheiros do consulado desenvolveram métodos seguros para coletar o éter, mas os renegados nem sempre têm o mesmo cuidado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419723&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07221c08-3572-409c-ba52-63f83443d0f0\', \'multiverseId\': 419723}, \'multiverseid\': 419723}, {\'name\': \'Эфирный Пассат\', \'text\': \'Верните целевой перманент под вашим контролем и целевой перманент не под вашим контролем в руки их владельцев.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Инженеры Консульства разработали методы безопасного сбора эфира, но отступники не отличаются такой осторожностью.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'020f0d79-7a55-4155-b592-94c4f25ee46b\', \'multiverseId\': 419987}, \'multiverseid\': 419987}, {\'name\': \'乙太贸易风\', \'text\': \'将目标由你操控的永久物与目标不由你操控的永久物各移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'执政院的工程师早已开发出了采集乙太的安全方法，但乱匠并不太在意安全这事。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8510d30f-2912-419c-943f-63e6fa9eac65\', \'multiverseId\': 417875}, \'multiverseid\': 417875}, {\'name\': \'乙太貿易風\', \'text\': \'將目標由你操控的永久物與目標不由你操控的永久物各移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'執政院的工程師早已開發出了採集乙太的安全方法，但亂匠並不太在意安全這事。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c977a5f2-9d16-407c-8d9c-0a48a8da9d4a\', \'multiverseId\': 418139}, \'multiverseid\': 418139}]', '[{\'name\': \'Äther-Resonanz\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische dann deine Bibliothek. Du erhältst {E}{E} (zwei Energiemarken).\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Nie zuvor habe ich eine Welt gesehen, wo der Äther jeden Aspekt der Natur durchdringt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418510&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43e3267f-b2b4-4b2c-81da-c12090c293ab\', \'multiverseId\': 418510}, \'multiverseid\': 418510}, {\'name\': \'Armonía con el éter\', \'text\': \'Busca una carta de tierra básica en tu biblioteca, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja tu biblioteca. Obtienes {E}{E} (dos contadores de energía).\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Nunca he visto un mundo donde el éter florezca a través de todos los aspectos de la naturaleza".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c946a332-0bb2-4d33-a9cd-9bbe20b60a9c\', \'multiverseId\': 420358}, \'multiverseid\': 420358}, {\'name\': "Harmonie avec l\'Éther", \'text\': \'Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque. Vous gagnez {E}{E} (deux marqueurs « énergie »).\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Je n\'avais jamais vu un monde où l\'Éther s\'insinue dans tous les aspects de la nature. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418774&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e599d91-1efb-48a3-bb62-89b78318ff1b\', \'multiverseId\': 418774}, \'multiverseid\': 418774}, {\'name\': "Armonizzarsi con l\'Etere", \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio. Ottieni {E}{E} (due segnalini energia).\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Non ho mai visto un mondo in cui l\\\'etere è intessuto in ogni aspetto della natura."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c31541b-2cfc-40cc-8141-d48964e30818\', \'multiverseId\': 419038}, \'multiverseid\': 419038}, {\'name\': \'霊気との調和\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。あなたは{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター２個）を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「自然のいたるところに霊気が流れている。こんな世界は初めてだわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89996e89-b63f-4344-8960-54f45918e189\', \'multiverseId\': 419302}, \'multiverseid\': 419302}, {\'name\': \'에테르 조율\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고에서 기본 대지 카드 한 장을 찾아 공개한 다음 당신의 손으로 가져간다. 그 후 당신의 서고를 섞는다. 당신은 {E}{E}(에너지 카운터 두 개)를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"나는 이제까지 에테르가 자연 곳곳을 굽이치며 나아가는 세계를 본 적이 없어."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e142a39-3eba-43c5-a23b-b45b179cba5a\', \'multiverseId\': 419566}, \'multiverseid\': 419566}, {\'name\': \'Harmonizar-se com o Éter\', \'text\': \'Procure um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e, depois, embaralhe seu grimório. Você recebe {E}{E} (dois marcadores de energia).\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Jamais vi um mundo em que o éter entremeasse todos os aspectos da natureza."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb9f506d-1ac0-4488-bcda-acdf546c3c75\', \'multiverseId\': 419830}, \'multiverseid\': 419830}, {\'name\': \'Эфирная Подстройка\', \'text\': \'Найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, покажите ее, положите ее в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку. Вы получаете {E}{E} (два жетона энергии).\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Я еще не встречала миров, где эфир пронизывал бы всю живую природу».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8048c49-b8e7-440f-8154-c3ecee15db72\', \'multiverseId\': 420094}, \'multiverseid\': 420094}, {\'name\': \'乙太同调\', \'text\': \'从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后将你的牌库洗牌。你得到{E}{E}（两个能量指示物）。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我从没见过大自然各个角落都有乙太穿流而过的世界。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f894149-cd93-4eee-814d-6435a856c123\', \'multiverseId\': 417982}, \'multiverseid\': 417982}, {\'name\': \'乙太同調\', \'text\': \'從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，展示該牌，將它置於你手上，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。你得到{E}{E}（兩個能量指示物）。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「我從沒見過大自然各個角落都有乙太穿流而過的世界。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcee2d24-4f01-49f5-bfbe-d2b232b244ca\', \'multiverseId\': 418246}, \'multiverseid\': 418246}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ätherbrenner-Renegat\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Ätherbrenner-Renegat ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E}{E}{E}{E} (vier Energiemarken).\\n{T}, bezahle {E}{E}: Der Ätherbrenner-Renegat fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\n{T}, bezahle {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}: Der Ätherbrenner-Renegat fügt einem Spieler deiner Wahl 6 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418471&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3793fce-e64a-47ca-abf8-d78ceafb6f98\', \'multiverseId\': 418471}, \'multiverseid\': 418471}, {\'name\': \'Renegado sueldaéter\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Renegado sueldaéter entre al campo de batalla, obtienes {E}{E}{E}{E} (cuatro contadores de energía).\\n{T}, pagar {E}{E}: El Renegado sueldaéter hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\n{T}, pagar {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}: El Renegado sueldaéter hace 6 puntos de daño al jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b73529c0-e69d-4838-9280-b3a9c59f422b\', \'multiverseId\': 420319}, \'multiverseid\': 420319}, {\'name\': "Renégat à la torche d\'Éther", \'text\': "Quand le Renégat à la torche d\'Éther arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez {E}{E}{E}{E} (quatre marqueurs « énergie »).\\n{T}, payez {E}{E} : Le Renégat à la torche d\'Éther inflige 1 blessure à la créature ciblée.\\n{T}, payez {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E} : Le Renégat à la torche d\'Éther inflige 6 blessures au joueur ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418735&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c842aca-f84b-45b1-8737-b91ebe346488\', \'multiverseId\': 418735}, \'multiverseid\': 418735}, {\'name\': \'Rinnegato Eterfiamma\', \'text\': \'Quando il Rinnegato Eterfiamma entra nel campo di battaglia, ottieni {E}{E}{E}{E} (quattro segnalini energia).\\n{T}, Paga {E}{E}: Il Rinnegato Eterfiamma infligge 1 danno a una creatura bersaglio.\\n{T}, Paga {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}: Il Rinnegato Eterfiamma infligge 6 danni a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46303d50-1547-421e-ae3c-8c516209720e\', \'multiverseId\': 418999}, \'multiverseid\': 418999}, {\'name\': \'改革派の霊気砲手\', \'text\': \'改革派の霊気砲手が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{E}{E}{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター４個）を得る。\\n{T}, {E}{E}を支払う：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。改革派の霊気砲手はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\\n{T}, {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}を支払う：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。改革派の霊気砲手はそのプレイヤーに６点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb8fd2b3-6b27-4f39-9e0a-256afb6f11c2\', \'multiverseId\': 419263}, \'multiverseid\': 419263}, {\'name\': \'에테르토치 무법자\', \'text\': \'에테르토치 무법자가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 {E}{E}{E}{E}(에너지 카운터 네 개)를 얻는다.\\n{T}, {E}{E}를 지불한다: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 에테르토치 무법자는 그 생물에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\\n{T}, {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}를 지불한다: 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 에테르토치 무법자는 그 플레이어에게 피해 6점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 도적\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31fd9a88-1827-4bef-ad70-223233a9adc9\', \'multiverseId\': 419527}, \'multiverseid\': 419527}, {\'name\': \'Renegado da Tocha de Éter\', \'text\': \'Quando Renegado da Tocha de Éter entra no campo de batalha, você recebe {E}{E}{E}{E} (quatro marcadores de energia).\\n{T}, Pague {E}{E}: Renegado da Tocha de Éter causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura alvo.\\n{T}, Pague {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}: Renegado da Tocha de Éter causa 6 pontos de dano ao jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b85d9fc6-1a24-4da8-a136-7b3b20dabed0\', \'multiverseId\': 419791}, \'multiverseid\': 419791}, {\'name\': \'Отступник с Эфирной Горелкой\', \'text\': \'Когда Отступник с Эфирной Горелкой выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете {E}{E}{E}{E} (четыре жетона энергии).\\n{T}, заплатите {E}{E}: Отступник с Эфирной Горелкой наносит 1 повреждение целевому существу.\\n{T}, заплатите {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}: Отступник с Эфирной Горелкой наносит 6 повреждений целевому игроку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Бродяга\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a394826-104a-4953-a19c-2c35e3c8e701\', \'multiverseId\': 420055}, \'multiverseid\': 420055}, {\'name\': \'乙太炬乱匠\', \'text\': \'当乙太炬乱匠进战场时，你得到{E}{E}{E}{E}（四个能量指示物）。\\n{T}，支付{E}{E}：乙太炬乱匠对目标生物造成1点伤害。\\n{T}，支付 {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}：乙太炬乱匠对目标牌手造成6点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e628d91-3dbf-4e12-a034-22fd1d38f708\', \'multiverseId\': 417943}, \'multiverseid\': 417943}, {\'name\': \'乙太炬亂匠\', \'text\': \'當乙太炬亂匠進戰場時，你得到{E}{E}{E}{E}（四個能量指示物）。\\n{T}，支付{E}{E}：乙太炬亂匠對目標生物造成1點傷害。\\n{T}，支付{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}：乙太炬亂匠對目標玩家造成6點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48334cf5-deac-4d9f-a6f0-36b971a95074\', \'multiverseId\': 418207}, \'multiverseid\': 418207}]', '[{\'name\': \'Äthergeborener Marodeur\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Lebensverknüpfung\\nWenn der Äthergeborene Marodeur ins Spiel kommt, bewege eine beliebige Anzahl an +1/+1-Marken von anderen bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst, auf den Äthergeborenen Marodeur.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Äthergeborener, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Keine Ahnung, was das ist oder wem es gehört, aber es glänzt und ich will es haben."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418436&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da5479b6-efde-4b7d-a701-0044faf5702e\', \'multiverseId\': 418436}, \'multiverseid\': 418436}, {\'name\': \'Merodeador etergénito\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vínculo vital.\\nCuando el Merodeador etergénito entre al campo de batalla, mueve cualquier cantidad de contadores +1/+1 de otros permanentes que controlas al Merodeador etergénito.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón etergénito\', \'flavor\': \'"No sé lo que es ni a quién pertenece, pero es brillante. Lo quiero".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e38f0a5-0b0b-49f0-8b78-be3b9761749f\', \'multiverseId\': 420284}, \'multiverseid\': 420284}, {\'name\': \'Maraudeur éthérien\', \'text\': "Vol, lien de vie\\nQuand le Maraudeur éthérien arrive sur le champ de bataille, déplacez n\'importe quel nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 d\'autres permanents que vous contrôlez sur le Maraudeur éthérien.", \'type\': \'Créature : éthérien et gredin\', \'flavor\': "« Je ne sais pas ce que c\'est, ni à qui ça appartient, mais ça brille et je le veux. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418700&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62f7fe45-ee4a-4b34-bc0f-52bff81713ea\', \'multiverseId\': 418700}, \'multiverseid\': 418700}, {\'name\': \'Predatore Eteride\', \'text\': \'Volare, legame vitale\\nQuando il Predatore Eteride entra nel campo di battaglia, sposta su di esso un qualsiasi numero di segnalini +1/+1 dagli altri permanenti che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Eteride\', \'flavor\': \'"Non so cosa sia o di chi sia, ma splende come l\\\'oro, quindi lo voglio."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dbf3143-7000-458b-8972-66d9eca95409\', \'multiverseId\': 418964}, \'multiverseid\': 418964}, {\'name\': \'霊基体の匪賊\', \'text\': \'飛行、絆魂\\n霊基体の匪賊が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールする他のパーマネントの上から望む数の＋１/＋１カウンターを霊基体の匪賊の上に移動する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 霊基体・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「何なのか誰の物かわからないけど、あの輝く物が欲しい。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6df249c8-7ecf-4e1b-972c-556a4b1aecfc\', \'multiverseId\': 419228}, \'multiverseid\': 419228}, {\'name\': \'에테르붙이 약탈자\', \'text\': \'비행, 생명연결\\n에테르붙이 약탈자가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종하는 다른 지속물들의 +1/+1 카운터를 원하는 수만큼 에테르붙이 약탈자에게 옮긴다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 에테르붙이 도적\', \'flavor\': \'"반짝이는 것이라면 뭐든지, 주인이 누구인지 상관없이 다 훔치고 싶어."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2615f101-9c5b-41c2-8269-4939eb3399c9\', \'multiverseId\': 419492}, \'multiverseid\': 419492}, {\'name\': \'Saqueador Etergênito\', \'text\': \'Voar, vínculo com a vida\\nQuando Saqueador Etergênito entrar no campo de batalha, mova qualquer número de marcadores +1/+1 de outras permanentes que você controla para Saqueador Etergênito.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Etergênito Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'"Não sei o que é nem a quem pertence, mas é reluzente e eu quero."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'546ca82b-8909-4754-97b1-5a0d8a1c3f1b\', \'multiverseId\': 419756}, \'multiverseid\': 419756}, {\'name\': \'Эфирид-Мародер\', \'text\': \'Полет, Цепь жизни\\nКогда Эфирид-Мародер выходит на поле битвы, переместите любое количество жетонов +1/+1 с других перманентов под вашим контролем на Эфирида-Мародера.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эфирид Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'«Я не знаю, что это и чье, но оно блестящее, и я хочу его себе».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24e10435-12bc-4b60-b007-273d358af051\', \'multiverseId\': 420020}, \'multiverseid\': 420020}, {\'name\': \'乙太种劫掠者\', \'text\': \'飞行，系命\\n当乙太种劫掠者进战场时，将其他由你操控之永久物上任意数量的+1/+1指示物移到乙太种劫掠者上。\', \'type\': \'生物～乙太种／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「我不知道那是什么又属于谁，但它闪着耀眼光芒，我很想要。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e69112fe-4c0b-4300-aad2-cdc6179ee33c\', \'multiverseId\': 417908}, \'multiverseid\': 417908}, {\'name\': \'乙太種劫掠者\', \'text\': \'飛行，繫命\\n當乙太種劫掠者進戰場時，將其他由你操控之永久物上任意數量的+1/+1指示物移到乙太種劫掠者上。\', \'type\': \'生物～乙太種／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「我不知道那是什麼又屬於誰，但它閃著耀眼光芒，我很想要。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1842ab04-298d-4838-805f-f422f5455707\', \'multiverseId\': 418172}, \'multiverseid\': 418172}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ätherkollaps\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch zu jedem Zeitpunkt wirken, zu dem du einen Spontanzauber wirken könntest.)\\nVerzaubert eine Kreatur oder ein Fahrzeug\\nWenn der Ätherkollaps ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E}{E} (zwei Energiemarken).\\nDie verzauberte bleibende Karte erhält -4/-0.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418401&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56462dd1-1959-468e-a649-e54c0e4b20e6\', \'multiverseId\': 418401}, \'multiverseid\': 418401}, {\'name\': \'Colapso del éter\', \'text\': \'Destello. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo en cualquier momento en que pudieras lanzar un instantáneo.)\\nEncantar criatura o vehículo.\\nCuando el Colapso del éter entre al campo de batalla, obtienes {E}{E} (dos contadores de energía).\\nEl permanente encantado obtiene -4/-0.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45ab2402-369f-4049-a761-ff1fa3da7d41\', \'multiverseId\': 420249}, \'multiverseid\': 420249}, {\'name\': "Fusion de l\'Éther", \'text\': "Flash (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort à tout moment où vous pourriez lancer un éphémère.)\\nEnchanter : créature ou véhicule\\nQuand la Fusion de l\'Éther arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez {E}{E} (deux marqueurs « énergie »).\\nLe permanent enchanté gagne -4/-0.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418665&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd25378c-2807-4c3b-b3e4-036b8e72b3a8\', \'multiverseId\': 418665}, \'multiverseid\': 418665}, {\'name\': "Collasso dell\'Etere", \'text\': "Lampo (Puoi lanciare questa magia in ogni momento in cui potresti lanciare un istantaneo.)\\nIncanta creatura o Veicolo\\nQuando il Collasso dell\'Etere entra nel campo di battaglia, ottieni {E}{E} (due segnalini energia).\\nIl permanente incantato prende -4/-0.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4cd79d2-6f81-454d-a85b-c08488b38e54\', \'multiverseId\': 418929}, \'multiverseid\': 418929}, {\'name\': \'霊気溶融\', \'text\': \'瞬速（あなたはこの呪文を、あなたがインスタントを唱えられるときならいつでも唱えてよい。）\\nエンチャント（クリーチャーか機体）\\n霊気溶融が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター２個）を得る。\\nエンチャントされているパーマネントは－４/－０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8945992-1ebe-4052-9ee7-ca265afe7c0d\', \'multiverseId\': 419193}, \'multiverseid\': 419193}, {\'name\': \'에테르 붕괴\', \'text\': \'섬광 (순간마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기라면 당신은 이 주문을 언제든지 발동할 수 있다.)\\n생물 또는 탑승물에 부여\\n에테르 붕괴가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 {E}{E}(에너지 카운터 두 개)를 얻는다.\\n부여된 지속물은 -4/-0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e709e0cf-eb3b-445f-95b1-dc72f900e2e7\', \'multiverseId\': 419457}, \'multiverseid\': 419457}, {\'name\': \'Derretimento Etéreo\', \'text\': \'Lampejo (Você poderá conjurar esta mágica a qualquer momento em que puder conjurar uma mágica instantânea.)\\nEncantar criatura ou Veículo\\nQuando Derretimento Etéreo entra no campo de batalha, você recebe {E}{E} (dois marcadores de energia).\\nA permanente encantada recebe -4/-0.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef567371-f5fd-489a-8189-f51bc5f42024\', \'multiverseId\': 419721}, \'multiverseid\': 419721}, {\'name\': \'Эфирный Расплав\', \'text\': \'Миг (Вы можете разыграть это заклинание при любой возможности разыгрывать мгновенные заклинания.)\\nЗачаровать существо или Машину\\nКогда Эфирный Расплав выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете {E}{E} (два жетона энергии).\\nЗачарованный перманент получает -4/-0.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a23e496-f3c3-4264-a551-d275a35d102e\', \'multiverseId\': 419985}, \'multiverseid\': 419985}, {\'name\': \'乙太熔毁\', \'text\': \'闪现（你可以于你能够施放瞬间的时机下施放此咒语。）\\n结附于生物或载具\\n当乙太熔毁进战场时，你得到{E}{E}（两个能量指示物）。\\n所结附的永久物得-4/-0。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3da5514-c90d-4860-8cfb-f48f0f1191b5\', \'multiverseId\': 417873}, \'multiverseid\': 417873}, {\'name\': \'乙太熔毀\', \'text\': \'閃現（你可以於你能夠施放瞬間的時機下施放此咒語。）\\n結附於生物或載具\\n當乙太熔毀進戰場時，你得到{E}{E}（兩個能量指示物）。\\n所結附的永久物得-4/-0。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98d00628-79d1-48e7-a4af-8796c0da0117\', \'multiverseId\': 418137}, \'multiverseid\': 418137}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ätherstrom-Reservoir\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, erhältst du für jeden Zauberspruch, den du in diesem Zug gewirkt hast, 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\nBezahle 50 Lebenspunkte: Das Ätherstrom-Reservoir fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 50 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Viel Energie wird für Gewöhnliches gebraucht, aber das Potenzial, Ungewöhnliches damit zu tun, ist immer da.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418557&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19417a14-166e-4050-90a4-17a3ced4826d\', \'multiverseId\': 418557}, \'multiverseid\': 418557}, {\'name\': \'Depósito de flujo etéreo\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo, ganas 1 vida por cada hechizo que hayas lanzado este turno.\\nPagar 50 vidas: El Depósito de flujo etéreo hace 50 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Aunque la mayor parte de la energía se emplee en tareas simples y cotidianas, no se debe subestimar su potencial para lo extraordinario.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf8c914a-cab8-4d91-b675-47827f4eb0dd\', \'multiverseId\': 420405}, \'multiverseid\': 420405}, {\'name\': \'Réservoir de flux éthérique\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort, vous gagnez 1 point de vie pour chaque sort que vous avez lancé ce tour-ci.\\nPayez 50 points de vie : Le Réservoir de flux éthérique inflige 50 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "S\'il est essentiellement utilisé pour les tâches quotidiennes ordinaires, il ne faut pas sous-estimer son extraordinaire potentiel.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418821&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f40fb17d-ce13-4fe9-b887-79062d8c8c3c\', \'multiverseId\': 418821}, \'multiverseid\': 418821}, {\'name\': \'Serbatoio di Eterflusso\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia, guadagni 1 punto vita per ogni magia che hai lanciato in questo turno.\\nPaga 50 punti vita: Il Serbatoio di Eterflusso infligge 50 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Per quanto la maggior parte dell\'energia sia impiegata in modo comune e ordinario, sarebbe sbagliato sottovalutarne il potenziale per imprese straordinarie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc727d97-8756-4d41-a4f4-38243c605131\', \'multiverseId\': 419085}, \'multiverseid\': 419085}, {\'name\': \'霊気貯蔵器\', \'text\': \'あなたが呪文を１つ唱えるたび、あなたは、このターンにあなたが唱えた呪文１つにつき１点のライフを得る。\\n50点のライフを支払う：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。霊気貯蔵器はそれに50点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'霊気力は日々当たり前のように使われているが、その途方もない可能性を過小評価するべきではない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b25a6270-297a-44b7-b7db-4e5f0beab465\', \'multiverseId\': 419349}, \'multiverseid\': 419349}, {\'name\': \'에테르유동체 저장소\', \'text\': \'당신이 주문을 발동할 때마다, 당신은 이 턴에 발동한 주문 한 개당 생명 1점을 얻는다.\\n생명 50점을 지불한다: 생물 또는 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 에테르유동체 저장소는 그 목표에 피해 50점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'대부분의 힘은 일반적이고 일상적인 일에 사용되지만, 특별한 일에 사용될 가능성을 배제해서는 안 된다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bb9ae9d-68dd-497d-96a3-04f661ab4836\', \'multiverseId\': 419613}, \'multiverseid\': 419613}, {\'name\': \'Reservatório do Fluxo de Éter\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica, você ganha 1 ponto de vida para cada mágica que você conjurou neste turno.\\nPague 50 pontos de vida: Reservatório do Fluxo de Éter causa 50 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Embora a maior parte do poder seja usada para tarefas ordinárias e quotidianas, não se deve subestimar seu potencial para o extraordinário.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b33a3c51-4479-44fc-9c1b-c4d887b98803\', \'multiverseId\': 419877}, \'multiverseid\': 419877}, {\'name\': \'Резервуар Эфирного Потока\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание, вы получаете 1 жизнь за каждое заклинание, разыгранное вами в этом ходу.\\nЗаплатите 50 жизней: Резервуар Эфирного Потока наносит 50 повреждений целевому существу или игроку.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Большая часть его энергии используется для обычных, повседневных задач, но не стоит недооценивать его возможности сотворить невероятное.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3077ca55-55a4-409f-8311-a4479a60bbbe\', \'multiverseId\': 420141}, \'multiverseid\': 420141}, {\'name\': \'乙太流贮库\', \'text\': \'每当你施放咒语时，本回合中你每施放过一个咒语，便获得1点生命。\\n支付50点生命：乙太流贮库对目标生物或牌手造成50点伤害。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'虽然大部分的能量都用在了普通的日常事务上，但绝不应低估它在特殊应用方面的潜在威力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cb9afce-a2ac-4338-b38a-23ee2b2e5c96\', \'multiverseId\': 418029}, \'multiverseid\': 418029}, {\'name\': \'乙太流貯庫\', \'text\': \'每當你施放咒語時，本回合中你每施放過一個咒語，便獲得1點生命。\\n支付50點生命：乙太流貯庫對目標生物或玩家造成50點傷害。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'雖然大部分的能量都用在了普通的日常事務上，但絕不應低估它在特殊應用方面的潛在威力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea5a7ada-28b1-4b54-9197-00fb600a232e\', \'multiverseId\': 418293}, \'multiverseid\': 418293}]', '[{\'name\': \'Äthersturm-Roc\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Äthersturm-Roc oder eine andere Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E} (eine Energiemarke).\\nImmer wenn der Äthersturm-Roc angreift, kannst du {E}{E} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf ihn und tappe bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die der verteidigende Spieler kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418368&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24b06b98-17bb-4657-8d31-ad019c5ae8d4\', \'multiverseId\': 418368}, \'multiverseid\': 418368}, {\'name\': \'Roc de vendaval etéreo\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Roc de vendaval etéreo u otra criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, obtienes {E} (un contador de energía).\\nSiempre que el Roc de vendaval etéreo ataque, puedes pagar {E}{E}. Si lo haces, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre él y gira hasta una criatura objetivo que controla el jugador defensor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87345bb9-4e53-49ca-8dd2-9f31171eaa02\', \'multiverseId\': 420216}, \'multiverseid\': 420216}, {\'name\': \'Rokh tempéther\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Rokh tempéther ou une autre créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous gagnez {E} (un marqueur « énergie »).\\nÀ chaque fois que le Rokh tempéther attaque, vous pouvez payer {E}{E}. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui et engagez jusqu\'à une créature ciblée que le joueur défenseur contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418632&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bc96c1f-de8c-491b-b7d2-d2f63b62376a\', \'multiverseId\': 418632}, \'multiverseid\': 418632}, {\'name\': "Roc dell\'Etertormenta", \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta il Roc dell\'Etertormenta o un\'altra creatura entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, ottieni {E} (un segnalino energia).\\nOgniqualvolta il Roc dell\'Etertormenta attacca, puoi pagare {E}{E}. Se lo fai, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di esso e TAPpa fino a una creatura bersaglio controllata dal giocatore in difesa.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9043bce-4eac-40a3-b44c-a7252b62936d\', \'multiverseId\': 418896}, \'multiverseid\': 418896}, {\'name\': \'霊気嵐のロック\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n霊気嵐のロックか他のクリーチャーが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは{E}（エネルギー・カウンター１個）を得る。\\n霊気嵐のロックが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーがコントロールするクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。あなたは{E}{E}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、霊気嵐のロックの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置き、そのクリーチャーをタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdf18d49-2aaa-462e-9621-0db5a4efd248\', \'multiverseId\': 419160}, \'multiverseid\': 419160}, {\'name\': \'에테르폭풍 로크\', \'text\': \'비행\\n에테르폭풍 로크 또는 다른 생물이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신은 {E}(에너지 카운터 한 개)를 얻는다.\\n에테르폭풍 로크가 공격할 때마다, 당신은 {E}{E}를 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 에테르폭풍 로크에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려 놓고 수비플레이어가 조종하는 생물을 최대 한 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 탭한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 조류\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'388b86a7-0c6b-4365-8b02-c9c9ed407712\', \'multiverseId\': 419424}, \'multiverseid\': 419424}, {\'name\': \'Roca da Tempestade Etérea\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Roca da Tempestade Etérea ou outra criatura entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você recebe {E} (um marcador de energia).\\nToda vez que Roca da Tempestade Etérea ataca, você pode pagar {E}{E}. Se fizer isso, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nela e vire até uma criatura alvo que o jogador defensor controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc9c79c3-cd97-4c6d-b805-ebd921950958\', \'multiverseId\': 419688}, \'multiverseid\': 419688}, {\'name\': \'Рух Эфирных Вихрей\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда Рух Эфирных Вихрей или другое существо выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы получаете {E} (один жетон энергии).\\nКаждый раз, когда Рух Эфирных Вихрей атакует, вы можете заплатить {E}{E}. Если вы это делаете, положите на него один жетон +1/+1 и поверните не более одного целевого существа под контролем защищающегося игрока.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afe65e60-69bd-47f9-b303-f0c596b89e2c\', \'multiverseId\': 419952}, \'multiverseid\': 419952}, {\'name\': \'乙太暴洛克鸟\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当乙太暴洛克鸟或另一个生物在你的操控下进战场时，你得到{E}（一个能量指示物）。\\n每当乙太暴洛克鸟攻击时，你可以支付{E}{E}。若你如此作，则在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物，并横置至多一个目标由防御牌手操控的生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～鸟\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b79a028-1261-470f-9533-4a75f9c8f8bb\', \'multiverseId\': 417840}, \'multiverseid\': 417840}, {\'name\': \'乙太暴洛克鳥\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當乙太暴洛克鳥或另一個生物在你的操控下進戰場時，你得到{E}（一個能量指示物）。\\n每當乙太暴洛克鳥攻擊時，你可以支付{E}{E}。若你如此作，則在其上放置一個+1/+1指示物，並橫置至多一個目標由防禦玩家操控的生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～鳥\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00f7a6a4-3e45-4da3-9d9d-aac821ee3db2\', \'multiverseId\': 418104}, \'multiverseid\': 418104}]', '[{\'name\': \'Äthertheoretiker\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Äthertheoretiker ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E}{E}{E} (drei Energiemarken).\\n{T}, bezahle {E}: Hellsicht 1. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vedalken, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418402&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13492ca5-7f32-4f03-9cc6-28771e71d449\', \'multiverseId\': 418402}, \'multiverseid\': 418402}, {\'name\': \'Teórico del éter\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Teórico del éter entre al campo de batalla, obtienes {E}{E}{E} (tres contadores de energía).\\n{T}, pagar {E}: Adivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón vedalken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48b0ab96-563d-4768-bbc9-9b353d9ac7d6\', \'multiverseId\': 420250}, \'multiverseid\': 420250}, {\'name\': "Théoricien de l\'Éther", \'text\': "Quand le Théoricien de l\'Éther arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez {E}{E}{E} (trois marqueurs « énergie »).\\n{T}, payez {E} : Regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la mettre au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)", \'type\': \'Créature : vedalken et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418666&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'295a9bbf-f885-410c-8461-c9b69b7dfd30\', \'multiverseId\': 418666}, \'multiverseid\': 418666}, {\'name\': "Teorico dell\'Etere", \'text\': "Quando il Teorico dell\'Etere entra nel campo di battaglia, ottieni {E}{E}{E} (tre segnalini energia).\\n{T}, Paga {E}: Profetizza 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere quella carta in fondo al tuo grimorio.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Vedalken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5d225c4-3cdd-4ae2-8851-0b0ad67a125d\', \'multiverseId\': 418930}, \'multiverseid\': 418930}, {\'name\': \'理論霊気学者\', \'text\': \'理論霊気学者が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{E}{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター３個）を得る。\\n{T}, {E}を支払う：占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ヴィダルケン・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e580ef68-3f50-49cd-8405-f055d1935b85\', \'multiverseId\': 419194}, \'multiverseid\': 419194}, {\'name\': \'에테르 이론가\', \'text\': \'에테르 이론가가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 {E}{E}{E}(에너지 카운터 세 개)를 얻는다.\\n{T}, {E}를 지불한다: 점술 1을 한다. (당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 한 장을 본다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 베달켄 도적\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc7df7bc-47f4-4130-aae4-9c8638532f16\', \'multiverseId\': 419458}, \'multiverseid\': 419458}, {\'name\': \'Teórico do Éter\', \'text\': \'Quando Teórico do Éter entra no campo de batalha, você recebe {E}{E}{E} (três marcadores de energia).\\n{T}, Pague {E}: Use vidência 1. (Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar aquele card no fundo de seu grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vedalkeano Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f25cd77-b2ce-4343-a6b9-489fd61d43d9\', \'multiverseId\': 419722}, \'multiverseid\': 419722}, {\'name\': \'Теоретик Эфира\', \'text\': \'Когда Теоретик Эфира выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете {E}{E}{E} (три жетона энергии).\\n{T}, заплатите {E}: предскажите 1. (Посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить ту карту в низ вашей библиотеки.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ведалкен Бродяга\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0aa88cfe-9e73-4845-a54b-54c22ef5435b\', \'multiverseId\': 419986}, \'multiverseid\': 419986}, {\'name\': \'乙太理论师\', \'text\': \'当乙太理论师进战场时，你得到{E}{E}{E}（三个能量指示物）。\\n{T}，支付{E}：占卜1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）\', \'type\': \'生物～维多肯／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa14c513-69fb-424c-82fb-db338afdeef7\', \'multiverseId\': 417874}, \'multiverseid\': 417874}, {\'name\': \'乙太理論師\', \'text\': \'當乙太理論師進戰場時，你得到{E}{E}{E}（三個能量指示物）。\\n{T}，支付{E}：占卜1。（檢視你牌庫頂的牌。你可以將該牌置於你的牌庫底。）\', \'type\': \'生物～維多肯／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb808817-686a-49f3-9701-466dca445296\', \'multiverseId\': 418138}, \'multiverseid\': 418138}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ätherwind-Urwesen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments erhältst du {E}{E}{E} (drei Energiemarken).\\nBezahle {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}: Bringe alle anderen Kreaturen auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur zu einem Zeitpunkt, zu dem du auch eine Hexerei wirken könntest.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Leviathan\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418404&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc926afd-425a-46a2-8571-6f1bc98b7ddc\', \'multiverseId\': 418404}, \'multiverseid\': 418404}, {\'name\': \'Eterbullidor antiguo\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, obtienes {E}{E}{E} (tres contadores de energía).\\nPagar {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}: Regresa todas las otras criaturas a las manos de sus propietarios. Activa esta habilidad solo cuando puedas lanzar un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Leviatán\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1100c095-0fda-4e94-b5c4-b2c55b589a7d\', \'multiverseId\': 420252}, \'multiverseid\': 420252}, {\'name\': \'Ancêtre souffléther\', \'text\': "Vol\\nAu début de votre entretien, vous gagnez {E}{E}{E} (trois marqueurs « énergie »).\\nPayez {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E} : Renvoyez toutes les autres créatures dans les mains de leurs propriétaires. N\'activez cette capacité que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature : léviathan\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418668&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab43d978-7aa5-4e55-9e87-ed5c286acbfe\', \'multiverseId\': 418668}, \'multiverseid\': 418668}, {\'name\': \'Antico Eternauta\', \'text\': "Volare\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, ottieni {E}{E}{E} (tre segnalini energia).\\nPaga {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}: Fai tornare tutte le altre creature in mano ai rispettivi proprietari. Attiva questa abilità solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Leviatano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae0a23eb-0773-48de-b000-20e14cbbbb0a\', \'multiverseId\': 418932}, \'multiverseid\': 418932}, {\'name\': \'霊気烈風の古きもの\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたは{E}{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター３個）を得る。\\n{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}を支払う：他のすべてのクリーチャーをオーナーの手札に戻す。この能力は、あなたがソーサリーを唱えられるときにのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — リバイアサン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbbaa0fc-df0b-40d3-922a-fd3229003a15\', \'multiverseId\': 419196}, \'multiverseid\': 419196}, {\'name\': \'에테르돌풍 고대생물\', \'text\': \'비행\\n당신의 유지단 시작에, 당신은 {E}{E}{E}(에너지 카운터 세 개)를 얻는다.\\n{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}를 지불한다: 다른 모든 생물을 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 이 능력을 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 리바이어던\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db023c7c-bcd0-48c6-8618-6285cbcb3421\', \'multiverseId\': 419460}, \'multiverseid\': 419460}, {\'name\': \'Ancião da Borrasca Etérea\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nNo início de sua manutenção você recebe {E}{E}{E} (três marcadores de energia).\\nPague {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}: Devolva todas as outras criaturas para as mãos de seus donos. Ative esta habilidade somente nos momentos em que poderia conjurar um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Leviatã\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f525f0e5-b584-4b4f-b68b-b1933da1db27\', \'multiverseId\': 419724}, \'multiverseid\': 419724}, {\'name\': \'Пращур Эфирных Бурь\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки вы получаете {E}{E}{E} (три жетона энергии).\\nЗаплатите {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}: верните все другие существа в руки их владельцев. Активируйте эту способность только при возможности разыгрывать волшебство.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Левиафан\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bd5f689-307f-40c8-87a0-e56311128508\', \'multiverseId\': 419988}, \'multiverseid\': 419988}, {\'name\': \'乙太风祖怪\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n在你的维持开始时，你得到{E}{E}{E}（三个能量指示物）。\\n支付{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}：将所有其他生物移回其拥有者手上。只可以于你能施放法术的时机下起动此异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～海怪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ea98090-adfa-49ff-b758-e4b54bb2e143\', \'multiverseId\': 417876}, \'multiverseid\': 417876}, {\'name\': \'乙太風祖怪\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n在你的維持開始時，你得到{E}{E}{E}（三個能量指示物）。\\n支付{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}：將所有其他生物移回其擁有者手上。只可以於你能施放巫術的時機下起動此異能。\', \'type\': \'生物～海怪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ca3190a-e2a4-4bad-bdcf-38666c267edf\', \'multiverseId\': 418140}, \'multiverseid\': 418140}]', '[{\'name\': \'Überlebensgroß\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +4/+4 und verursacht Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Angeblich begutachtet der Oberste Preisrichter Tezzeret jede Erfindung auf der Messe. Ich wollte sichergehen, dass er meine bemerkt." —Jehvani, Vahadar-Handwerker\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418525&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71765fce-1134-464d-b9f6-13f0adc3bfe9\', \'multiverseId\': 418525}, \'multiverseid\': 418525}, {\'name\': \'Desmesura inusitada\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +4/+4 y gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Dicen que el juez principal Tezzeret va a evaluar todos los inventos de la feria, así que me aseguré de construir algo que destacase sobre los demás". —Jehvani, artífice Vahadar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b7bb206-2e34-4312-8bee-e368c5479859\', \'multiverseId\': 420373}, \'multiverseid\': 420373}, {\'name\': \'Hors du commun\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +4/+4 et acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« On raconte que le grand juge Tezzeret passera en revue chaque invention. Je me suis assuré de construire quelque chose qui sorte du lot. » —Jehvani, artificier vahadar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418789&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0122fd59-7893-4b34-80cc-0636db2c0a4a\', \'multiverseId\': 418789}, \'multiverseid\': 418789}, {\'name\': \'Grandiose Proporzioni\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +4/+4 e ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho saputo che il giudice capo Tezzeret esaminerà tutte le invenzioni della Fiera. Mi sono impegnato per costruire qualcosa che sapesse distinguersi." —Jehvani, artefice Vahadar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'841bba4a-f77e-446f-9d5c-40f293af1c62\', \'multiverseId\': 419053}, \'multiverseid\': 419053}, {\'name\': \'気宇壮大\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋４/＋４の修整を受けるとともにトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「テゼレット審判長は博覧会の発明品すべてを自分で確かめるらしいんだ。だから目立つ物を作ったんだ。」 ――バハダールの工匠、ジェバニー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a594b51-4cf3-4544-9170-dd707a7bac1d\', \'multiverseId\': 419317}, \'multiverseid\': 419317}, {\'name\': \'심한 허풍\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +4/+4을 받고 돌진을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"주심 테제렛이 박람회에 출품된 모든 발명품을 심사한다고 하더군요. 가장 눈에 띄는 멋진 발명품을 만들겠어요." —바하다르 기능공 제바니\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47867d38-83d5-4508-a067-917df0305f89\', \'multiverseId\': 419581}, \'multiverseid\': 419581}, {\'name\': \'Maior que a Vida\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +4/+4 e ganha atropelar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Dizem que o Jurado Mor Tezzeret avaliará todas as invenções da Feira. Eu me certifiquei de construir algo que vá se destacar." — Jehvani, artesão Vahadar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=419845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d413917d-ea47-47bf-9d33-92dfc5c3f069\', \'multiverseId\': 419845}, \'multiverseid\': 419845}, {\'name\': \'Больше Чем Жизнь\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +4/+4 и Пробивной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Говорят, что главный судья Теззерет лично осмотрит все изобретения на Ярмарке. Что ж, на мою работу он точно обратит внимание». — Джевани, вахадарский механик\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9514949e-6c04-4ee5-8dd0-3cea85e568e3\', \'multiverseId\': 420109}, \'multiverseid\': 420109}, {\'name\': \'超越生灵\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标生物得+4/+4且获得践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「他们说主审泰兹瑞会审查博览会上的每一项发明。所以我务必要建造脱颖出众的作品。」 ～沃赫达神器师杰文尼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=417997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3e44526-7e38-4bcf-b021-240b6caf5d7f\', \'multiverseId\': 417997}, \'multiverseid\': 417997}, {\'name\': \'超越生靈\', \'text\': \'直到回合結束，目標生物得+4/+4且獲得踐踏異能。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「他們說主審泰茲瑞會審查博覽會上的每一項發明。所以我務必要建造脫穎出眾的作品。」 ～沃赫達神器師傑文尼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=418261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27e36793-a2ce-43a2-a5a9-fa6c07a6ceeb\', \'multiverseId\': 418261}, \'multiverseid\': 418261}]']
printings: ['10E', '2ED', '2X2', '2XM', '30A', '3ED', '40K', '4BB', '4ED', '5ED', '6ED', '7ED', '8ED', '9ED', 'A25', 'AFC', 'AFR', 'AKH', 'AKR', 'ALA', 'ANA', 'ANB', 'ARC', 'ARN', 'ATH', 'AVR', 'BBD', 'BFZ', 'BLB', 'BRB', 'BRC', 'BRO', 'BRR', 'BTD', 'C13', 'C14', 'C15', 'C16', 'C17', 'C18', 'C19', 'C20', 'C21', 'CED', 'CEI', 'CHK', 'CLB', 'CLU', 'CM2', 'CMA', 'CMD', 'CMM', 'CMR', 'CN2', 'CNS', 'CST', 'DD1', 'DD2', 'DDC', 'DDD', 'DDE', 'DDF', 'DDG', 'DDH', 'DDI', 'DDJ', 'DDK', 'DDL', 'DDM', 'DDN', 'DDO', 'DDP', 'DDQ', 'DDR', 'DDS', 'DDT', 'DDU', 'DGM', 'DKM', 'DMC', 'DMR', 'DMU', 'DOM', 'DPA', 'DTK', 'DVD', 'E01', 'ELD', 'EVG', 'F17', 'FBB', 'FRF', 'G17', 'GK1', 'GK2', 'GN2', 'GN3', 'GNT', 'GRN', 'GS1', 'GTC', 'GVL', 'H09', 'HBG', 'HOP', 'HOU', 'ICE', 'IKO', 'IMA', 'INV', 'ISD', 'ITP', 'J14', 'J21', 'J22', 'JMP', 'JVC', 'KHC', 'KHM', 'KLD', 'KLR', 'KTK', 'LCI', 'LEA', 'LEB', 'LRW', 'LTC', 'LTR', 'M10', 'M11', 'M12', 'M13', 'M14', 'M15', 'M19', 'M20', 'M21', 'MBS', 'MD1', 'ME1', 'ME3', 'MH2', 'MH3', 'MIC', 'MID', 'MIR', 'MKC', 'MKM', 'MMQ', 'MOC', 'MOM', 'MPS', 'MRD', 'NCC', 'NEC', 'NEO', 'NPH', 'ODY', 'OLEP', 'ONC', 'ONE', 'ONS', 'ORI', 'OTC', 'OTJ', 'P02', 'P23', 'P30A', 'PAL00', 'PAL01', 'PAL02', 'PAL03', 'PAL04', 'PAL05', 'PAL06', 'PAL99', 'PALP', 'PANA', 'PARL', 'PC2', 'PCA', 'PD2', 'PD3', 'PDGM', 'PELP', 'PF19', 'PF20', 'PGPX', 'PGRU', 'PHUK', 'PIP', 'PKLD', 'PL24', 'PLST', 'PMPS', 'PMPS06', 'PMPS07', 'PMPS08', 'PMPS09', 'PMPS10', 'PMPS11', 'POR', 'POTJ', 'PPP1', 'PRES', 'PRM', 'PRW2', 'PRWK', 'PS11', 'PS17', 'PS18', 'PSAL', 'PSS2', 'PSS3', 'PSS4', 'PTC', 'PTK', 'PW24', 'PZ2', 'Q06', 'RAV', 'REX', 'RIX', 'RNA', 'ROE', 'RQS', 'RTR', 'RVR', 'S99', 'SCD', 'SHM', 'SIR', 'SLD', 'SNC', 'SOI', 'SOM', 'SS3', 'STX', 'SUM', 'TD0', 'TD2', 'THB', 'THS', 'TMP', 'TPR', 'TSP', 'TSR', 'UGL', 'UMA', 'UND', 'UNF', 'UNH', 'USG', 'UST', 'VIS', 'VOW', 'W16', 'WAR', 'WC00', 'WC01', 'WC02', 'WC03', 'WC04', 'WC97', 'WC98', 'WC99', 'WHO', 'WOE', 'WWK', 'XANA', 'XLN', 'ZEN', 'ZNC', 'ZNR']
original_text: ['+1: Exile the top card of your library. You may cast that card. If you don\'t, Chandra, Torch of Defiance deals 2 damage to each opponent.\\n+1: Add {R}{R} to your mana pool.\\n−3: Chandra, Torch of Defiance deals 4 damage to target creature.\\n−7: You get an emblem with "Whenever you cast a spell, this emblem deals 5 damage to target creature or player."', "+1: Scry 1. Saheeli Rai deals 1 damage to each opponent.\\n−2: Create a token that's a copy of target artifact or creature you control, except it's an artifact in addition to its other types. That token gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step.\\n−7: Search your library for up to three artifact cards with different names, put them onto the battlefield, then shuffle your library.", '+1: Untap target land you control. Until your next turn, it becomes a 5/5 Elemental creature with haste. It\'s still a land.\\n−3: Return target permanent card from your graveyard to your hand.\\n−6: You get an emblem with "Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may draw a card."', '+1: Until your next turn, up to one target creature gets -3/-0 and its activated abilities can\'t be activated.\\n−1: You gain 2 life and draw a card.\\n−7: You get an emblem with "Your opponents can\'t untap more than two permanents during their untap steps."', '+2: Chandra, Pyrogenius deals 2 damage to each opponent.\\n−3: Chandra, Pyrogenius deals 4 damage to target creature.\\n−10: Chandra, Pyrogenius deals 6 damage to target player and each creature he or she controls.', '+3: You gain 3 life.\\n−4: Reveal the top two cards of your library. Put all land cards from among them onto the battlefield and the rest into your hand.\\n−12: Creatures you control get +5/+5 and gain trample until end of turn.', 'Artifact spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.', 'Artifacts you control have hexproof.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if you control the artifact with the highest converted mana cost or tied for the highest converted mana cost, draw a card.', 'As an additional cost to cast Cathartic Reunion, discard two cards.\\nDraw three cards.', "As an additional cost to cast Disappearing Act, return a permanent you control to its owner's hand.\\nCounter target spell.", 'As an additional cost to cast Eliminate the Competition, sacrifice X creatures.\\nDestroy X target creatures.', 'As an additional cost to cast Incendiary Sabotage, sacrifice an artifact.\\nIncendiary Sabotage deals 3 damage to each creature.', 'As an additional cost to cast Morbid Curiosity, sacrifice an artifact or creature.\\nDraw cards equal to the converted mana cost of the sacrificed permanent.', 'As long as you control a Chandra planeswalker, Renegade Firebrand gets +1/+0 and has first strike. (It deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', 'As long as you control an artifact, Dhund Operative gets +1/+0 and has deathtouch. (Any amount of damage it deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'At the beginning of combat on your turn, if you control an artifact, Toolcraft Exemplar gets +2/+1 until end of turn. If you control three or more artifacts, it also gains first strike until end of turn.', 'At the beginning of each end step, if a +1/+1 counter was placed on a permanent under your control this turn, put a +1/+1 counter on Fairgrounds Trumpeter.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, if you control three or more artifacts, you gain 1 life.\\n{T}: Add {C} to your mana pool.\\n{4}, {T}, Sacrifice Inventors' Fair: Search your library for an artifact card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library. Activate this ability only if you control three or more artifacts.", 'B', 'Blooming Marsh enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or fewer other lands.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {G} to your mana pool.', 'Botanical Sanctum enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or fewer other lands.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {U} to your mana pool.', "Chandra's Pyrohelix deals 2 damage divided as you choose among one or two target creatures and/or players.", "Choose one or both —\\n• Create a token that's a copy of target artifact.\\n• Create a token that's a copy of target creature, except it's an artifact in addition to its other types.", 'Choose one or both —\\n• Return target artifact card from your graveyard to your hand.\\n• Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Choose one or both —\\n• Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.\\n• Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', 'Choose one —\\n• Counter target spell.\\n• You may choose new targets for target spell.\\n• Copy target instant or sorcery spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.', 'Choose one —\\n• Take Down deals 4 damage to target creature with flying.\\n• Take Down deals 1 damage to each creature with flying.', 'Choose one —\\n• Target creature gets +5/+5 and gains trample until end of turn.\\n• Creatures you control get +2/+2 and gain vigilance until end of turn.', "Choose target artifact or creature. You get {E}{E}{E}{E} (four energy counters), then you may pay an amount of {E} equal to that permanent's converted mana cost. If you do, gain control of it.", "Choose target creature. Exile the top card of your library. You may have Spark of Creativity deal damage to that creature equal to the exiled card's converted mana cost. If you don't, you may play that card until end of turn.", 'Choose target creature. You get {E}{E} (two energy counters), then you may pay any amount of {E}. The creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn for each {E} paid this way.', 'Choose target creature. You get {E}{E}{E} (three energy counters), then you may pay any amount of {E}. Harnessed Lightning deals that much damage to that creature.', 'Concealed Courtyard enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or fewer other lands.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {B} to your mana pool.', 'Counter target colorless spell.', 'Counter target nonartifact spell unless its controller pays {2}.', 'Counter target spell. Draw a card, then discard a card.', 'Create two 1/1 colorless Servo artifact creature tokens.', 'Creatures with no counters on them get -2/-2 until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control get +2/+1 until end of turn.', "Creatures your opponents control enter the battlefield tapped.\\nWhenever a creature enters the battlefield under an opponent's control, you gain 1 life.", 'Creatures your opponents control get -1/-1 until end of turn.', "Deadlock Trap enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Deadlock Trap enters the battlefield, you get {E}{E} (two energy counters).\\n{T}, Pay {E}: Tap target creature or planeswalker. Its activated abilities can't be activated this turn.", "Deathtouch\\nWhen Gonti, Lord of Luxury enters the battlefield, look at the top four cards of target opponent's library, exile one of them face down, then put the rest on the bottom of that library in a random order. For as long as that card remains exiled, you may look at it, you may cast it, and you may spend mana as though it were mana of any type to cast it.", 'Defender\\nReach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', "Defender\\nWhen Hightide Hermit enters the battlefield, you get {E}{E}{E}{E} (four energy counters).\\nPay {E}{E}: Hightide Hermit can attack this turn as though it didn't have defender.", "Demolition Stomper can't be blocked by creatures with power 2 or less.\\nCrew 5 (Tap any number of creatures you control with total power 5 or more: This Vehicle becomes an artifact creature until end of turn.)", 'Destroy all creatures. You gain 1 life for each creature destroyed this way.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment with converted mana cost 4 or less.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment. You gain 2 life.', 'Destroy target artifact or land.', 'Destroy target artifact, enchantment, or land.', 'Destroy target creature with power 3 or greater. Scry 1.', "Destroy target creature. If you control an artifact, Unlicensed Disintegration deals 3 damage to that creature's controller.", 'Destroy target creature. You gain 1 life for each artifact you control.', 'Draw three cards. If you control no artifacts, discard a card.', "Each player may play an additional land on each of his or her turns.\\nAt the beginning of each player's upkeep, if that player has no cards in hand, that player draws three cards.", "Elegant Edgecrafters can't be blocked by creatures with power 2 or less.\\nFabricate 2 (When this creature enters the battlefield, put two +1/+1 counters on it or create two 1/1 colorless Servo artifact creature tokens.)", 'Embraal Bruiser enters the battlefield tapped.\\nEmbraal Bruiser has menace as long as you control an artifact.', "Enchant artifact or creature\\nWhen Malfunction enters the battlefield, tap enchanted permanent.\\nEnchanted permanent doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", "Enchant creature you don't control\\nEnchanted creature can't attack.\\nWhenever an opponent casts a spell, if it has a single target, change the target to enchanted creature if able.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature can't attack, block, or crew Vehicles.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+1 and has menace.', "Equipped creature gets +1/+2.\\nWhenever an Artificer enters the battlefield under your control, you may attach Inventor's Goggles to it.\\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", 'Equipped creature gets +2/+0.\\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'Essence Extraction deals 3 damage to target creature and you gain 3 life.', "Exchange control of target artifact you control and target artifact or creature you don't control.", "Exile target creature you control, then return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control.\\nDraw a card.", 'Fabricate 1 (When this creature enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on it or create a 1/1 colorless Servo artifact creature tok